export const legacyMarketCopyTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"የኖርዌይ የበዓል ክፍያ ማስያ","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"የኖርዌይ የበዓል ክፍያ ማስያ - ነፃ ጠቅላላ ግምት","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"የኖርዌይ የበዓል ክፍያን በበዓል-ክፍያ መሰረት ይገምቱ። ለመደበኛ ዕረፍት፣ ለአምስተኛ ሳምንት እና ለ 60 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ለሆኑ ሰራተኞች የተለመዱ ተመኖችን ያወዳድሩ።","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"በክፍያ ደብተርዎ ላይ የሚታየውን feriepengegrunnlag ያስገቡ። ለእድሜዎ የተለመዱትን የኖርዌይ አጠቃላይ የበዓል ክፍያ ተመኖችን እና የተስማሙበትን የበዓል ጊዜ ያወዳድሩ።","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"የበዓል ክፍያ መሰረት (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"እኔ 60 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ነኝ በበዓል ዓመት","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"የእኔ ስምምነት አምስተኛውን የበዓል ሳምንት ያካትታል","Estimated holiday pay":"የተገመተው የበዓል ክፍያ","Rate used":"ተመን ጥቅም ላይ ውሏል","Basis used":"መሠረት ጥቅም ላይ ውሏል","Reset choices":"ምርጫዎችን ዳግም አስጀምር","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"ጠቅላላ ግምት ብቻ። የበዓል ክፍያ ግብር የሚከፈልበት ገቢ ነው; የግብር ተቀናሽ በግለሰብ እና በደመወዝ ሊለያይ ይችላል.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"በ NOK 500,000 መሠረት, 10.2% ከማንኛውም የደመወዝ ማስተካከያ በፊት NOK 51,000 ይሰጣል.","Which rate should I use?":"የትኛውን መጠን ልጠቀም?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"ግምቱ የጋራ ዝቅተኛ ተመኖች ይጠቀማል: 10.2% ወይም 12% ከአምስተኛ ሳምንት ጋር; 12.5% ወይም 14.3% እድሜያቸው 60 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ለሆኑ ሰራተኞች. የእርስዎ ስምምነት የበለጠ ሊሰጥ ይችላል.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"ይህ ከታክስ በኋላ የሚከፈለው መጠን ነው?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"አይደለም ይህ አጠቃላይ ግምት ነው። የበዓል ክፍያ ግብር የሚከፈልበት ገቢ ነው; ተቀናሽ እንደ ሁኔታዎ እና የደመወዝ ክፍያዎ ይወሰናል.","What belongs in the basis?":"በመሠረት ውስጥ ያለው ምንድን ነው?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"በእርስዎ የክፍያ ደብተር ወይም ዓመታዊ መግለጫ ላይ feriepengegrunnlag ይጠቀሙ. አንዳንድ ማካካሻዎች እና ሌሎች ክፍያዎች በህጎቹ አይካተቱም።","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"የኖርዌይ የገቢ ግብር ማስያ","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"የኖርዌይ ታክስ ማስያ 2026 - የነጻ ደመወዝ እና የጡረታ ግምት","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"የ 2026 የኖርዌይ የገቢ ግብር በመደበኛ ደመወዝ ወይም ሙሉ ዓመት ዕድሜ ጡረታ ላይ ይገምቱ። ዓመታዊ እና ወርሃዊ የተጣራ ክፍያን፣ የታክስ ክፍሎችን ይመልከቱ እና ሁለት ሁኔታዎችን ያወዳድሩ።","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"የ 2026 የኖርዌይ የገቢ ግብር ለመደበኛ ነዋሪ ደሞዝ ወይም ሙሉ አመት እድሜ ላለው ጡረታ ይገምቱ። ዋና ዋና የግብር ክፍሎችን ይመልከቱ እና ሁለት አጠቃላይ የገቢ ሁኔታዎችን ያወዳድሩ።","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"ካልኩሌተሩ የ 2026 መደበኛ ተቀናሾች፣ አምስቱ ተራማጅ ቅንፍ-ታክስ ባንዶች እና የብሔራዊ ኢንሹራንስ መዋጮዎችን ይተገበራል። የጡረታ ሁነታ የጡረታ ታክስ ክሬዲት ለአንድ ሙሉ አመት, 100% ብቁ የእርጅና ጡረታ ወይም ብቁ የሆነ AFP ያካትታል. በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ሙሉ በሙሉ ይሰራል።","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"ለ NOK 600,000 ደሞዝ የሚገመተውን ዓመታዊ ግብር እና የተጣራ ክፍያ ከሌላ ደሞዝ ወይም ከሙሉ አመት የጡረታ መጠን ጋር ያወዳድሩ።","Tax year":"የግብር ዓመት","Scenario":"ሁኔታ","Salary":"ደሞዝ","Full-year old-age pension":"የሙሉ ዓመት የእርጅና ጡረታ","Gross annual income (NOK)":"ጠቅላላ አመታዊ ገቢ (NOK)","Tax zone":"የግብር ዞን","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"መደበኛ ተመን (አብዛኛው ኖርዌይ)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"ፊንማርክ/የተዘረዘሩ መለኪያዎች-ዞን ማዘጋጃ ቤቶች","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"የጡረታ ግምት ብቁ የሆነ የእርጅና ጡረታ ወይም AFP በ 100% ለሁሉም 12 ወሮች ያለ ምንም ገቢ ያስባል።","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"የደመወዝ ግምት ተራ የኖርዌይ ታክስ ነዋሪነት፣ ​​ዕድሜ 17–69 እና ሌላ ገቢ የለውም።","Compare two scenarios":"ሁለት ሁኔታዎችን ያወዳድሩ","Scenario 1":"ሁኔታ 1","Scenario 2":"ሁኔታ 2","Calculate estimate":"ግምት አስላ","Estimated tax per year":"በዓመት የሚገመተው ግብር","Average tax per month":"አማካይ ታክስ በወር","Estimated net per year":"በዓመት የሚገመተው የተጣራ","Average net per month":"በወር አማካይ የተጣራ","Tax on ordinary income":"በተራ ገቢ ላይ ግብር","Bracket tax":"የቅንፍ ግብር","National insurance contribution":"ብሔራዊ ኢንሹራንስ መዋጮ","Pension tax credit":"የጡረታ ታክስ ክሬዲት።","Estimated effective rate":"የተገመተው ውጤታማ ተመን","Standard deduction base":"መደበኛ ተቀናሽ መሠረት","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"ዋጋዎች እና ገደቦች ለ 2026 የገቢ ዓመት ናቸው።","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"ግምት ብቻ፣ ይፋዊ የታክስ ስሌት ወይም የታክስ ካርድ አይደለም። ሌሎች ገቢዎች፣ ተቀናሾች፣ ዕድሜ፣ የመኖሪያ ፈቃድ፣ የጡረታ ደረጃ እና የግል ሁኔታዎች ውጤቱን ሊለውጡ ይችላሉ።","Reset values":"ዋጋዎችን ዳግም አስጀምር","Example":"ምሳሌ","How the estimate works":"ግምቱ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"ይህ የእኔ ትክክለኛ የታክስ ሂሳብ ነው ወይስ የታክስ ካርድ ተቀናሽ?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"ቁ. መደበኛ የ 2026 ዓመታዊ ግብር ይገመታል. ሙሉ ገቢዎ፣ ተቀናሾችዎ እና ሁኔታዎችዎ ምክንያት የታክስ ካርድ፣ የመጨረሻ ግምገማ እና የተቀናሽ ክፍያ ሊለያዩ ይችላሉ።","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"ደሞዝ እና ጡረታ እዚህ ጋር ማዋሃድ እችላለሁ?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"ይህ ስሪት በአንድ ጊዜ አንድ የገቢ አይነት ይገመታል። የደሞዝ እና የጡረታ ጉዳይን አይሰላም።","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"የጡረታ ሁነታ እያንዳንዱን ጡረታ ይሸፍናል?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"ቁ. የጡረታ ክሬዲቱ በዓመቱ ውስጥ በ 100% ለተወሰደ ብቁ የእርጅና ጡረታ ወይም ብቁ የሆነ AFP ተመስሏል። ከፊል ዓመት ወይም ደረጃ የተሰጣቸው የጡረታ አበል እና ሌሎች የጡረታ ዓይነቶች ከአቅም ውጭ ናቸው።","What is the measures-zone option?":"የመለኪያ-ዞን አማራጭ ምንድነው?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"የታተመውን 18.5% ተራ የገቢ መጠን እና NOK 45,000 ልዩ ቅናሽ ለፊንማርክ እና ለተዘረዘሩት ማዘጋጃ ቤቶች ይተገበራል። ማዘጋጃ ቤትዎ ብቁ መሆኑን ያረጋግጡ።","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"የኖርዌይ ሀብት ታክስ ማስያ","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"የኖርዌይ ሀብት ታክስ ማስያ 2026 — ነፃ ግምት","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"2026 የኖርዌይ የሀብት ግብር ከቤቶች፣ አክሲዮኖች፣ የንግድ ንብረቶች፣ ጥሬ ገንዘብ እና ዕዳ ይገምቱ። የግዛት እና የማዘጋጃ ቤት ክፍፍልን፣ የግምገማ ቅናሾችን እና የእሴት ስሜትን መጠን ይመልከቱ።","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"ለ2026 የግል የኖርዌይ ሀብት ግብር ይገምቱ። ለቤቶች ግምታዊ የገበያ ዋጋዎችን ያስገቡ እና ለአክሲዮኖች እና ለንግድ ንብረቶች ቅድመ-ቅናሽ የታክስ መሰረቶችን ያስገቡ። የግምገማ ቅናሾችን፣ የዕዳ ማስተካከያዎችን እና የግዛት እና የማዘጋጃ ቤት ግምቶችን ይመልከቱ።","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"ግምቱ ዝቅተኛ ተመን ካላስገቡ በስተቀር የ 2026 የግምገማ ደንቦችን እና ከፍተኛውን የማዘጋጃ ቤት ዋጋን ይመለከታል። ዕዳ ከቅናሾች በፊት በሙሉ የንብረት ዋጋዎች ይመደባል; ለቅናሽ አክሲዮኖች ወይም ለንግድ ንብረቶች የተሰጠው ዕዳ በተመሳሳይ ቅናሽ ይቀንሳል። የንብረት ምዘና፣ ብቁነት እና የግል የታክስ እውነታዎች ኦፊሴላዊውን ውጤት ሊለውጡ ይችላሉ።","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"በ NOK 10 ሚሊዮን የገበያ ዋጋ ያለው ቀዳሚ ቤት በ 2026 የመጀመሪያ ደረጃ የቤት ህግ መሰረት የ NOK 2.5 ሚሊዮን የሃብት ዋጋ ከዕዳ እና ከግል አበል በፊት.","2026 tax year":"2026 የግብር ዓመት","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"ዋና የቤት ግምት የገበያ ዋጋ (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"የሁለተኛ ደረጃ ቤቶች የሚገመተው የገበያ ዋጋ (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"ከዋጋ ቅናሽ በፊት ገንዘብ ያካፍላል እና ያካፍላል (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"ከዋጋ ቅናሽ በፊት ብቁ የሆኑ የንግድ ንብረቶች (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"የባንክ ተቀማጭ ገንዘብ እና ሌሎች ንብረቶች (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"ጠቅላላ ዕዳ (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"ለሀብት በጋራ እንከፍላለን","Municipal rate (%)":"የማዘጋጃ ቤት ተመን (%)","Home-value comparison":"የቤት-ዋጋ ንጽጽር","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"የሀብት ግብር ግምት","Export CSV":"CSV ወደ ውጪ ላክ","Print estimate":"የህትመት ግምት","Assets before discounts":"ከዋጋ ቅናሾች በፊት ያሉ ንብረቶች","Taxable asset value after discounts":"ከቅናሾች በኋላ የሚከፈል የንብረት ዋጋ","Debt reduction from discounts":"ከቅናሾች የዕዳ ቅነሳ","Deductible debt estimate":"የሚቀነስ የዕዳ ግምት","Estimated net wealth":"የተገመተው የተጣራ ሀብት","Personal allowance":"የግል አበል","Taxable net wealth":"ታክስ የሚከፈል የተጣራ ሀብት","Municipal wealth tax":"የማዘጋጃ ቤት ሀብት ግብር","State wealth tax":"የግዛት ሀብት ግብር","State tax, first band":"የግዛት ግብር፣የመጀመሪያ ባንድ","State tax, upper band":"የግዛት ግብር፣ከፍተኛ ባንድ","Estimated total wealth tax":"የተገመተው ጠቅላላ የሀብት ግብር","Lower home-value estimate":"የቤት-ዋጋ ዝቅተኛ ግምት","Current-value estimate":"የአሁኑ ዋጋ ግምት","Higher home-value estimate":"ከፍተኛ የቤት-ዋጋ ግምት","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 ህጎች እና ግምቶች","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"ግምት ብቻ። ይህ ይፋዊ የግብር ግምገማ ወይም የታክስ ምክር አይደለም። የግብር ተመላሽ ዋጋዎችዎን በሚገኙበት ቦታ ይጠቀሙ; ተመኖች፣ ብቁነት፣ የዕዳ ድልድል እና የንብረት ዋጋዎች በእርስዎ ጉዳይ ላይ ሊለያዩ ይችላሉ።","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"ቤቶች፡ በዓመቱ መጨረሻ የሚገመተውን የገበያ ዋጋ ያስገቡ። ማጋራቶች እና ብቁ የሆኑ የንግድ ንብረቶች፡ ዋጋውን ከ 2026 ቅናሽ በፊት ያስገቡ እንጂ ትክክለኛው የግብር መሠረት ካልሆነ በስተቀር የገበያ ዋጋ አይደለም።","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"አበል እና የግዛት ከፍተኛ ደረጃ በእጥፍ የሚተዳደር ለትዳር አጋሮች፣ የተመዘገቡ አጋሮች ወይም ብቁ የሆኑ አብረው የሚኖሩ ሰዎች ለጋራ ሀብታቸው በጋራ ይገመገማሉ።","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"የማዘጋጃ ቤቱ ስሌት የተመረጠውን መጠን ይጠቀማል, በነባሪነት ወደ 2026 ከፍተኛው 0.35% ነው. አንዳንድ ማዘጋጃ ቤቶች ዝቅተኛ ተመን ሊጠቀሙ ይችላሉ።","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"ትብነት የሚለወጠው የአንደኛ እና ሁለተኛ ደረጃ ቤቶች የገቡትን እሴቶች ብቻ ነው። እሱ ንጽጽር ነው, ኦፊሴላዊ ግምገማ አይደለም.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 የሀብት-ታክስ አበል ምንድን ነው?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"የደረጃው ገደብ NOK 1.9 ሚሊዮን ለአንድ ሰው እና NOK 3.8 ሚሊዮን ለትዳር አጋሮች ወይም ብቁ ለሆኑ አጋሮች በጋራ የተገመገመ ነው።","How is my primary home valued?":"የመጀመሪያ ቤቴ እንዴት ነው የሚከበረው?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"ለ 2026, የተገመተው የሃብት ዋጋ እስከ NOK 14 ሚሊዮን የሚደርስ የገበያ ዋጋ 25%, በተጨማሪም 70% ከ NOK 14 ሚሊዮን በላይ ነው.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"ይህ ለሁለተኛ ደረጃ ቤት ቅናሽ ይሠራል?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"ቁ. የ 2026 ሰንጠረዥ ለሁለተኛ ደረጃ ቤቶች የ 0% ዋጋ ቅናሽ ይሰጣል. የገባውን የገበያ ዋጋ እንደ ግምት ይጠቀማል; ኦፊሴላዊ የተገመገሙ ዋጋዎች ሊለያዩ ይችላሉ.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"የአክሲዮን ወይም የንግድ ሥራ ንብረት ስሆን ተቀናሽ ዕዳ ለምን ይቀየራል?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"የኖርዌይ ህጎች ዕዳን በተመጣጣኝ መጠን በሙሉ የንብረት እሴቶች ይመድባሉ። በግምገማ ቅናሾች ለንብረቶች የተመደበው ክፍል በተመሳሳይ የዋጋ ቅናሽ መጠን ይቀንሳል።","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"የማዘጋጃ ቤቱ ተመን ሁልጊዜ 0.35% ነው?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"ቁ. 0.35% በነባሪነት ጥቅም ላይ የዋለው ከፍተኛው 2026 ነው። አንድ ማዘጋጃ ቤት ዝቅተኛ ዋጋ ሊያዘጋጅ ይችላል, ይህም ማስገባት ይችላሉ.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"ካልኩሌተሩ እያንዳንዱን የንብረት ወይም የግብር ጉዳይ ይሸፍናል?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"ቁ. ቤቶችን፣ አክሲዮኖችን፣ የተመረጡ የንግድ ንብረቶችን፣ ጥሬ ገንዘቦችን እና አጠቃላይ ዕዳን ይገምታል። የውጭ ንብረቶች፣ ጡረታዎች፣ ውስብስብ ባለቤትነት፣ ነፃነቶች እና ሌሎች ልዩ ህጎች ግምገማዎን ሊለውጡ ይችላሉ።","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"የስዊስ QR-ቢል ጄኔሬተር","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"የስዊስ QR-ቢል ጀነሬተር - ነፃ የQR ደረሰኝ ሰሪ","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"የስዊስ QR-ቢልን በአገር ውስጥ ይፍጠሩ እና ያረጋግጡ። IBANን፣ QR-IBANን፣ QRR እና SCOR ማጣቀሻዎችን አረጋግጥ፤ የክፍያ መጠየቂያ ዳታ ሳይጭኑ የA6 ክፍያ ክፍሉን እና ደረሰኝ ያትሙ።","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"የስዊስ መክፈያ ወረቀት ከስዊስ QR ኮድ ጋር ይፍጠሩ። የክፍያ መጠየቂያ ዝርዝሮችዎ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ; ምንም ክፍያ አይጀመርም እና የባንክ መዝገብ አይጠየቅም.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"መሣሪያው የስድስት የስዊዝ የክፍያ ኮድ (ኤስፒሲ) መረጃን ይገነባል እና መስኮቹን፣ የመለያ/የማጣቀሻ ጥምርን፣ IBAN አሃዞችን እና የሚደገፉ ቁምፊዎችን ይፈትሻል። የክፍያውን ክፍል እና የህትመት ደረሰኝ በሚፈለገው አካላዊ መጠን ይቀርፃል።","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"ስድስት ምሳሌ፡- QR-IBAN፣ CHF 50.00፣ የ27-አሃዝ QRR ማጣቀሻ እና የተዋቀሩ የአበዳሪ/ተበዳሪ አድራሻዎች።","How it works":"እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Frequently asked questions":"በተደጋጋሚ የሚጠየቁ ጥያቄዎች","Limits and accuracy":"ገደቦች እና ትክክለኛነት","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"ይህ የአገር ውስጥ ሰነድ መሳሪያ እንጂ የባንክ አገልግሎት ወይም የምስክር ወረቀት አይደለም። የ IBAN ባለቤት ማን እንደሆነ፣ አካውንት መከፈቱን ወይም ክፍያ መቀበሉን ማረጋገጥ አይችልም። የወረቀት ክፍያ ማዘዣ ከመጠቀምዎ በፊት በ 100% / ትክክለኛው መጠን ያትሙ እና የ 100 ሚሜ ቼክ መስመርን ይለኩ።","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"አበዳሪ IBAN ወይም QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"ለአበዳሪው የሚከፈል","Account holder / creditor name":"የመለያ ባለቤት/የአበዳሪ ስም","Street or P.O. box":"ጎዳና ወይም ፒ.ኦ. ሳጥን","Building number":"የግንባታ ቁጥር","Postal code":"የፖስታ ኮድ","Town / city":"ከተማ/ከተማ","2-letter country code":"2-ፊደል የአገር ኮድ","Amount (optional)":"መጠን (አማራጭ)","Currency":"ምንዛሪ","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"ኢሮ","Payable by · optional debtor":"በአማራጭ ተበዳሪ የሚከፈል","Debtor name":"የተበዳሪው ስም","Reference type":"የማጣቀሻ አይነት","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR ማጣቀሻ · QR-IBAN ብቻ","Creditor reference · IBAN":"የአበዳሪ ማጣቀሻ · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"ምንም የተዋቀረ ማጣቀሻ የለም · IBAN","Reference":"ማጣቀሻ","Unstructured message":"ያልተደራጀ መልእክት","Billing information (optional)":"የሂሳብ አከፋፈል መረጃ (አማራጭ)","Create QR-bill":"QR-ቢል ፍጠር","Load SIX sample":"ስድስት ናሙና ጫን","Clear form":"ቅጽ አጽዳ","Check QR payload":"የQR ጭነትን ያረጋግጡ","Download payment data":"የክፍያ ውሂብ አውርድ","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG አውርድ","Print / save as PDF":"አትም/እንደ ፒዲኤፍ ያስቀምጡ","Read a QR Code image":"የQR ኮድ ምስል አንብብ","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG ወይም JPEG ይምረጡ","Read image locally":"ምስሉን በአገር ውስጥ አንብብ","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"የስዊስ QR ኮድ ክፍያ ውሂብ ለጥፍ","Invoice details":"የክፍያ መጠየቂያ ዝርዝሮች","QR-bill preview":"QR-ቢል ቅድመ እይታ","Receipt":"ደረሰኝ","Payment part":"የክፍያ ክፍል","Payable to":"የሚከፈልበት","Payable by":"የሚከፈለው በ","Account":"መለያ","Additional information":"ተጨማሪ መረጃ","Currency / amount":"ገንዘብ/መጠን","Print scale check · 100 mm":"የህትመት ልኬት ቼክ · 100 ሚሜ","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"ስድስት · የስዊስ QR-ቢል ደረጃ","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-ቢል ተዘጋጅቷል። ዝርዝሮች በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ቀርተዋል።","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"አንዳንድ መስኮች መፈተሽ ያስፈልጋቸዋል። የደመቀውን መረጃ ይገምግሙ።","Reading this image on your device…":"ይህንን ምስል በመሳሪያዎ ላይ በማንበብ…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"የስዊስ QR ኮድ በአገር ውስጥ ተነቧል እና ተረጋግጧል።","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"በምስሉ ላይ ምንም የሚነበብ የQR ኮድ አልተገኘም።","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"የስዊስ QR ኮድ ውሂብ ለሚደገፉ መስኮች የሚሰራ ነው።","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"መረጃው የሚሰራ የስዊስ QR ኮድ ክፍያ ክፍያ አይደለም።","Form and preview cleared.":"ቅጽ እና ቅድመ እይታ ጸድቷል።","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ስድስት ናሙና ተጭኗል። ከእውነተኛ አጠቃቀም በፊት የናሙና ዝርዝሮቹን ይተኩ።","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"የሚሰራ የQR-ቢል መጀመሪያ ይፍጠሩ ወይም ያንብቡ።","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"የ10 MiB ወይም ከዚያ ያነሰ PNG ወይም JPEG ይምረጡ።","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"የአካባቢው QR አንባቢ መጫን አልቻለም። በምትኩ የክፍያውን ውሂብ መለጠፍ ይችላሉ።","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"የትኞቹ IBAN እና የማጣቀሻ ጥምረት ተፈቅዶላቸዋል?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN የQRR ማጣቀሻ ይጠቀማል። መደበኛ የስዊስ አይባን SCOR ይጠቀማል ወይም ምንም የተዋቀረ ማጣቀሻ (NON) የለም። QRR ለ CHF ደረሰኞች ብቻ ነው።","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"ይህ መለያው መኖሩን ወይም የአበዳሪው መሆኑን ያረጋግጣል?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"ቁ. ቅርጸቱን እና IBAN ቼክ ድምርን ብቻ ይፈትሻል። የባንክ ወይም የሂሳብ መዝገብ ቤት አያነጋግርም።","Can I print this at any scale?":"ይህንን በማንኛውም ሚዛን ማተም እችላለሁ?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"ለወረቀት ክፍያ ማዘዣ በ100%/ ትክክለኛ መጠን ያትሙ። የክፍያው ክፍል A6 የመሬት አቀማመጥ (148 × 105 ሚሜ) መሆን አለበት; የ 100 ሚሜ መስመርን ከአንድ መሪ ​​ጋር ያረጋግጡ.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"መሣሪያው የክፍያ መጠየቂያ ዳታ ወደ የትኛውም ቦታ ይልካል?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"ቁ. የትውልድ እና የምስል ንባብ በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይከናወናሉ። ምንም መለያ ወይም የክፍያ አገልግሎት ጥቅም ላይ አይውልም።","Grade Scale Generator":"የደረጃ ልኬት አመንጪ","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"የደረጃ ልኬት አመንጪ - ነፃ ነጥብ-ደረጃ መሣሪያ","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"ነጥቦችን በራስዎ ገደቦች ወደ መቶኛ እና ደረጃዎች ይለውጡ። ሙሉውን ሚዛን አስቀድመው ይመልከቱ፣ ይቅዱት ወይም ይላኩት፣ እና የውጤት መስጫ ሉህ ያትሙ።","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"ለፈተና ወይም ለምደባ ግልፅ የሆነ የውጤት መለኪያ ይገንቡ። ለእያንዳንዱ ክፍል ከፍተኛውን ነጥቦች እና ዝቅተኛውን መቶኛ ያዘጋጁ; ልኬቱ የትምህርት ቤት ወይም የብሄራዊ የውጤት አሰጣጥ ህግን አይወስድም።","Points earned":"የተገኙ ነጥቦች","Maximum points":"ከፍተኛ ነጥቦች","Top grade label":"ከፍተኛ ደረጃ መለያ","Top grade starts at (%)":"ከፍተኛ ደረጃ በ(%) ይጀምራል","Middle grade label":"የመካከለኛ ክፍል መለያ","Middle grade starts at (%)":"መካከለኛ ክፍል በ (%) ይጀምራል","Lowest grade label":"ዝቅተኛው ክፍል መለያ","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"ዝቅተኛው ክፍል በ(%) ይጀምራል","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"በ 50-ነጥብ ከፍተኛ፣ 45 ነጥቦች ከ 90% ጋር እኩል ነው። የእርስዎ ብጁ ገደቦች የውጤት መለያውን ይወስናሉ።","Does this use an official grading policy?":"ይህ ይፋዊ የውጤት አሰጣጥ ፖሊሲ ይጠቀማል?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"ቁ. ጣራዎችን አዘጋጅተሃል. የውጤት አሰጣጥ ስርዓቶች በትምህርት ቤት, ኮርስ እና ሀገር ይለያያሉ; መጠቀም የሚጠበቅብዎትን ልኬት ያረጋግጡ።","Can I export the grading bands?":"የደረጃ አሰጣጥ ባንዶችን ወደ ውጭ መላክ እችላለሁ?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"አዎ። የሚታዩትን ባንዶች እንደ CSV ፋይል ወደ ውጭ ይላኩ ወይም ሚዛኑን ያትሙ።"},"ar":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"حاسبة دفع إجازة النرويج","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"حاسبة أجور العطلات في النرويج — تقدير إجمالي مجاني","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"تقدير أجر الإجازة النرويجية على أساس أجر الإجازة الخاص بك. قارن الأسعار الشائعة للإجازة القياسية والأسبوع الخامس والموظفين الذين تتراوح أعمارهم بين 60 أو أكثر.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"أدخل Feriepengegrunnlag الموضح في قسيمة الراتب الخاصة بك. قارن معدلات أجور الإجازة الإجمالية النرويجية الشائعة بالنسبة لعمرك ومدة الإجازة المتفق عليها.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"أساس الأجر أثناء الإجازة (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"أنا 60 أو أكبر في سنة العطلة","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"اتفاقيتي تتضمن أسبوع عطلة خامس","Estimated holiday pay":"أجر الإجازة المقدر","Rate used":"المعدل المستخدم","Basis used":"الأساس المستخدم","Reset choices":"إعادة تعيين الخيارات","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"التقدير الإجمالي فقط. أجر الإجازة هو دخل خاضع للضريبة؛ يمكن أن يختلف الاستقطاع الضريبي حسب الشخص وكشوف المرتبات.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"بأساس NOK 500,000، يمنح 10.2% NOK 51,000 قبل أي تعديلات على كشوف المرتبات.","Which rate should I use?":"ما هو المعدل الذي يجب أن أستخدمه؟","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"يستخدم التقدير الحد الأدنى المشترك للمعدلات: 10.2% أو 12% مع أسبوع خامس؛ 12.5% أو 14.3% للموظفين الذين تبلغ أعمارهم 60 أو أكثر. اتفاقيتك قد تعطي المزيد.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"هل هذا هو المبلغ المدفوع بعد الضريبة؟","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"رقم. هذا تقدير إجمالي. أجر الإجازة هو دخل خاضع للضريبة؛ يعتمد الاستقطاع على ظروفك ورواتبك.","What belongs in the basis?":"ما الذي ينتمي إلى الأساس؟","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"استخدم Feriepengegrunnlag في قسيمة الراتب أو كشف الحساب السنوي. يتم استبعاد بعض المبالغ المستردة والمدفوعات الأخرى بموجب القواعد.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"حاسبة ضريبة الدخل في النرويج","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"حاسبة الضرائب في النرويج 2026 — تقدير مجاني للرواتب والمعاشات التقاعدية","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"تقدير 2026 ضريبة الدخل النرويجية على الراتب القياسي أو معاش الشيخوخة لمدة عام كامل. راجع صافي الأجر السنوي والشهري ومكونات الضرائب وقارن بين السيناريوهين.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"تقدير 2026 ضريبة الدخل النرويجية لراتب مقيم قياسي أو معاش الشيخوخة لمدة عام كامل. راجع المكونات الضريبية الرئيسية وقارن بين سيناريوهين لإجمالي الدخل.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"تطبق الآلة الحاسبة الخصومات القياسية 2026 ونطاقات الضريبة التصاعدية الخمسة ومساهمات التأمين الوطني. يشتمل وضع المعاش التقاعدي على الائتمان الضريبي للمعاش التقاعدي فقط لمدة عام كامل، 100% معاش الشيخوخة المؤهل أو AFP المؤهل. يتم تشغيله بالكامل في هذا المتصفح.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"للحصول على راتب قدره NOK 600,000، قارن الضريبة السنوية المقدرة وصافي الراتب مع راتب آخر أو مبلغ معاش تقاعدي لسنة كاملة.","Tax year":"السنة الضريبية","Scenario":"السيناريو","Salary":"الراتب","Full-year old-age pension":"معاش الشيخوخة لمدة عام كامل","Gross annual income (NOK)":"إجمالي الدخل السنوي (NOK)","Tax zone":"المنطقة الضريبية","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"السعر القياسي (معظم النرويج)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"فينمارك / بلديات منطقة التدابير المدرجة","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"يفترض تقدير المعاش التقاعدي معاش الشيخوخة المؤهل أو AFP بنسبة 100% لجميع أشهر 12، بدون أي دخل آخر.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"يفترض تقدير الراتب الإقامة الضريبية النرويجية العادية، والعمر 17 – 69 وعدم وجود دخل آخر.","Compare two scenarios":"قارن بين سيناريوهين","Scenario 1":"السيناريو 1","Scenario 2":"السيناريو 2","Calculate estimate":"حساب التقدير","Estimated tax per year":"الضريبة المقدرة سنويًا","Average tax per month":"متوسط الضريبة شهريًا","Estimated net per year":"الصافي المقدر سنويًا","Average net per month":"متوسط صافي شهريًا","Tax on ordinary income":"الضريبة على الدخل العادي","Bracket tax":"ضريبة القوس","National insurance contribution":"مساهمة التأمين الوطني","Pension tax credit":"الائتمان الضريبي للمعاشات التقاعدية","Estimated effective rate":"المعدل الفعال المقدر","Standard deduction base":"قاعدة الخصم القياسية","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"المعدلات والحدود تخص سنة الدخل 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"تقدير فقط، وليس حساب ضريبي رسمي أو بطاقة ضريبية. الدخل الآخر والخصومات والعمر والإقامة ودرجة التقاعد والظروف الشخصية يمكن أن تغير النتيجة.","Reset values":"إعادة ضبط القيم","Example":"مثال","How the estimate works":"كيفية عمل التقدير","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"هل هذا هو بالضبط فاتورتي الضريبية أو الاستقطاع الضريبي من البطاقة الضريبية؟","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"رقم. وتقدر الضريبة السنوية القياسية 2026. يمكن أن تختلف البطاقة الضريبية والتقييم النهائي والخصم بسبب دخلك الكامل والخصومات والظروف.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"هل يمكنني الجمع بين الراتب والمعاش التقاعدي هنا؟","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"يقوم هذا الإصدار بتقدير نوع دخل واحد في كل مرة. ولا تحسب حالة الراتب والمعاش المختلط.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"هل يغطي وضع المعاش التقاعدي كل معاش تقاعدي؟","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"رقم. تم تصميم ائتمان المعاش التقاعدي فقط لمعاش الشيخوخة المؤهل أو AFP المؤهل الذي يتم الحصول عليه بنسبة 100% على مدار العام. تعتبر المعاشات التقاعدية الجزئية أو المتدرجة وأنواع المعاشات التقاعدية الأخرى خارج النطاق.","What is the measures-zone option?":"ما هو خيار منطقة القياس؟","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"يطبق معدل الدخل العادي 18.5% المنشور والخصم الخاص 45,000 NOK لـ Finnmark والبلديات المدرجة. تأكد من أن بلديتك مؤهلة.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"حاسبة ضريبة الثروة في النرويج","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"حاسبة ضريبة الثروة في النرويج 2026 — تقدير مجاني","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"تقدير 2026 ضريبة الثروة النرويجية من المنازل والأسهم والأصول التجارية والنقد والديون. اطلع على تقسيم الولاية والبلدية وخصومات التقييم ونطاق حساسية القيمة.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"تقدير ضريبة الثروة الشخصية النرويجية لـ 2026. أدخل القيم السوقية المقدرة للمنازل والقواعد الضريبية قبل الخصم للأسهم والأصول التجارية. راجع خصومات التقييم وتسوية الديون والتقديرات المنفصلة للدولة والبلدية.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"يطبق التقدير قواعد تقييم 2026 والحد الأقصى لسعر البلدية ما لم تقم بإدخال سعر أقل. يتم تخصيص الدين بقيم الأصول الكاملة قبل الخصومات؛ ويتم تخفيض الديون المخصصة للأسهم المخصومة أو الأصول التجارية بنفس الخصم. يمكن لتقييمات الممتلكات والأهلية والحقائق الضريبية الشخصية تغيير النتيجة الرسمية.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"المنزل الأساسي الذي تبلغ قيمته السوقية 10 مليون كرونة نرويجية له قيمة ثروة تقديرية تبلغ 2.5 مليون كرونة نرويجية بموجب قاعدة المنزل الأساسي 2026، قبل الديون والبدل الشخصي.","2026 tax year":"2026 السنة الضريبية","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"القيمة السوقية المقدرة للمنزل الأساسي (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"القيمة السوقية المقدرة للمنازل الثانوية (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"الأسهم وأموال المشاركة قبل الخصم (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"أصول الأعمال المؤهلة قبل الخصم (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"الودائع المصرفية والأصول الأخرى (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"إجمالي الدين (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"نحن نخضع للضريبة بشكل مشترك على الثروة","Municipal rate (%)":"السعر البلدي (%)","Home-value comparison":"مقارنة قيمة المنزل","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"تقدير ضريبة الثروة","Export CSV":"تصدير ملف CSV","Print estimate":"طباعة تقديرية","Assets before discounts":"الأصول قبل الخصومات","Taxable asset value after discounts":"قيمة الأصول الخاضعة للضريبة بعد الخصومات","Debt reduction from discounts":"تخفيض الديون من الخصومات","Deductible debt estimate":"تقدير الديون القابلة للخصم","Estimated net wealth":"صافي الثروة المقدرة","Personal allowance":"بدل شخصي","Taxable net wealth":"صافي الثروة الخاضعة للضريبة","Municipal wealth tax":"ضريبة الثروة البلدية","State wealth tax":"ضريبة ثروة الدولة","State tax, first band":"ضريبة الولاية، النطاق الأول","State tax, upper band":"ضريبة الولاية، النطاق العلوي","Estimated total wealth tax":"ضريبة الثروة الإجمالية المقدرة","Lower home-value estimate":"تقدير أقل لقيمة المنزل","Current-value estimate":"تقدير القيمة الحالية","Higher home-value estimate":"تقدير أعلى لقيمة المنزل\nقواعد وافتراضات","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"تقدير فقط. هذا ليس تقييمًا ضريبيًا رسميًا أو نصيحة ضريبية. استخدم قيم الإقرار الضريبي الخاصة بك حيثما كان ذلك متاحًا؛ قد تختلف الأسعار والأهلية وتخصيص الديون وقيم الممتلكات في حالتك.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"المنازل: أدخل القيمة السوقية المقدرة في نهاية العام. الأسهم وأصول الأعمال المؤهلة: أدخل القيمة قبل خصم 2026، وليس القيمة السوقية ما لم يكن هذا هو الأساس الضريبي الصحيح.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"يتضاعف البدل والحد الأعلى للولاية فقط للأزواج أو الشركاء المسجلين أو المتعايشين المؤهلين الذين يتم تقييمهم بشكل مشترك لثرواتهم المجمعة.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"يستخدم حساب البلدية المعدل المحدد، افتراضيًا إلى الحد الأقصى 2026 وهو 0.35%. قد تستخدم بعض البلديات سعرًا أقل.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"تغير الحساسية فقط القيم المدخلة للمنازل الأولية والثانوية. إنها مقارنة وليست توقعًا للتقييم الرسمي.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"ما هو بدل ضريبة الثروة 2026؟","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"الحد القياسي هو 1.9 مليون كرونة نرويجية لشخص واحد و3.8 مليون كرونة نرويجية للأزواج أو الشركاء المؤهلين الذين يتم تقييمهم بشكل مشترك.","How is my primary home valued?":"كيف يتم تقييم منزلي الأساسي؟","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"بالنسبة إلى 2026، تبلغ قيمة الثروة المقدرة 25% من القيمة السوقية حتى 14 مليون كرونة نرويجية، بالإضافة إلى 70% من المبلغ الذي يزيد عن 14 مليون كرونة نرويجية.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"هل ينطبق هذا على خصم على منزل ثانوي؟","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"لا. يمنح جدول 2026 المنازل الثانوية خصمًا على التقييم بنسبة 0%. ويستخدم القيمة السوقية المدخلة كتقدير؛ يمكن أن تختلف القيم المقدرة الرسمية.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"لماذا يتغير الدين القابل للخصم عندما أمتلك أسهمًا أو أصولًا تجارية؟","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"تقوم القواعد النرويجية بتخصيص الديون بشكل متناسب حسب قيم الأصول الكاملة. يتم تخفيض الجزء المخصص للأصول ذات خصومات التقييم بنفس معدل الخصم.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"هل معدل البلدية دائمًا 0.35%؟","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"رقم. 0.35% هو الحد الأقصى 2026 المستخدم بشكل افتراضي. قد تحدد البلدية سعرًا أقل، والذي يمكنك إدخاله.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"هل تغطي الآلة الحاسبة كل الأصول أو الحالات الضريبية؟","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"لا. ويقدر المنازل والأسهم والأصول التجارية المؤهلة المختارة والنقد وإجمالي الديون. الأصول الأجنبية والمعاشات التقاعدية والملكية المعقدة والإعفاءات والقواعد الخاصة الأخرى قد تغير تقييمك.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"مولد فاتورة QR السويسرية","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"مولد فاتورة QR السويسرية - صانع فاتورة QR مجاني","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"إنشاء فاتورة QR سويسرية والتحقق منها محليًا. التحقق من صحة مراجع IBAN وQR-IBAN وQRR وSCOR؛ قم بطباعة جزء الدفع والإيصال A6 دون تحميل بيانات الفاتورة.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"قم بإنشاء قسيمة دفع سويسرية باستخدام رمز الاستجابة السريعة السويسري. تبقى تفاصيل فاتورتك في هذا المتصفح؛ لم يتم بدء أي دفع ولم يتم الاستعلام عن أي سجل مصرفي.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"تقوم الأداة بإنشاء بيانات SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) وتتحقق من حقولها ومجموعة الحساب/المرجع وأرقام التحقق من IBAN والأحرف المدعومة. يقوم بتنسيق جزء الدفع والإيصال للطباعة بالحجم الفعلي المطلوب.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX مثال: QR-IBAN، CHF 50.00، ومرجع QRR المكون من أرقام 27 وعناوين الدائن/المدين المنظمة.","How it works":"كيف يعمل","Frequently asked questions":"الأسئلة المتداولة","Limits and accuracy":"الحدود والدقة","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"هذه أداة مستند محلية، وليست خدمة بنكية أو شهادة. ولا يمكنها تأكيد من يملك رقم IBAN، أو ما إذا كان الحساب مفتوحًا، أو ما إذا كان سيتم قبول الدفع. قم بالطباعة بنسبة 100% / الحجم الفعلي وقياس خط الاختيار 100 مم قبل استخدام أمر الدفع الورقي.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"رقم IBAN للدائن أو QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"مستحق الدفع إلى الدائن","Account holder / creditor name":"اسم صاحب الحساب/الدائن","Street or P.O. box":"الشارع أو ص.ب. مربع","Building number":"رقم المبنى","Postal code":"الرمز البريدي","Town / city":"البلدة / المدينة","2-letter country code":"2 رمز البلد المكون من حرفين","Amount (optional)":"المبلغ (اختياري)","Currency":"العملة","CHF":"الفرنك السويسري","EUR":"يورو","Payable by · optional debtor":"يتم الدفع عن طريق المدين الاختياري","Debtor name":"اسم المدين","Reference type":"النوع المرجعي","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"مرجع QR · QR-IBAN فقط","Creditor reference · IBAN":"مرجع الدائن · رقم IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"لا يوجد مرجع منظم · رقم IBAN","Reference":"المرجع","Unstructured message":"رسالة غير منظمة","Billing information (optional)":"معلومات الفوترة (اختياري)","Create QR-bill":"إنشاء فاتورة QR","Load SIX sample":"تحميل ستة عينة","Clear form":"شكل واضح","Check QR payload":"التحقق من حمولة QR","Download payment data":"تنزيل بيانات الدفع","Download QR SVG":"تنزيل QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"طباعة / حفظ بصيغة PDF","Read a QR Code image":"اقرأ صورة رمز QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"اختر PNG أو JPEG","Read image locally":"اقرأ الصورة محليًا","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"الصق بيانات الدفع برمز QR السويسري","Invoice details":"تفاصيل الفاتورة","QR-bill preview":"معاينة فاتورة QR","Receipt":"الاستلام","Payment part":"جزء الدفع","Payable to":"الدفع إلى","Payable by":"يتم الدفع بواسطة","Account":"الحساب","Additional information":"معلومات إضافية","Currency / amount":"العملة / المبلغ","Print scale check · 100 mm":"فحص مقياس الطباعة · 100 مم","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · معيار فاتورة QR السويسري","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"فاتورة QR جاهزة. بقيت التفاصيل على هذا الجهاز.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"تحتاج بعض الحقول إلى التدقيق. قم بمراجعة المعلومات المميزة.","Reading this image on your device…":"قراءة هذه الصورة على جهازك...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"قراءة رمز الاستجابة السريعة السويسري والتحقق منه محليًا.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"لم يتم العثور على رمز QR قابل للقراءة في تلك الصورة.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"بيانات رمز QR السويسري صالحة للحقول المدعومة.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"البيانات ليست حمولة دفع برمز QR سويسري صالح.","Form and preview cleared.":"تم مسح النموذج والمعاينة.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"تم تحميل ستة عينة. استبدل تفاصيل العينة قبل الاستخدام الحقيقي.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"قم بإنشاء أو قراءة فاتورة QR صالحة أولاً.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"اختر PNG أو JPEG لـ 10 MiB أو أقل.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"تعذر تحميل قارئ QR المحلي. يمكنك لصق بيانات الدفع بدلاً من ذلك.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"ما هي مجموعات IBAN والمراجع المسموح بها؟","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"يستخدم QR-IBAN مرجع QRR. يستخدم رقم IBAN السويسري العادي SCOR أو لا يوجد مرجع منظم (NON). QRR مخصص لفواتير الفرنك السويسري فقط.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"هل هذا يتحقق من وجود الحساب أو ملكيته للدائن؟","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"رقم. فهو يتحقق من التنسيق والمجموع الاختباري لـ IBAN فقط. لا يتصل بالبنك أو تسجيل الحساب.","Can I print this at any scale?":"هل يمكنني طباعة هذا بأي مقياس؟","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"بالنسبة لأمر دفع ورقي، قم بالطباعة بنسبة 100% / الحجم الفعلي. يجب أن يكون جزء الدفع A6 أفقيًا (148 × 105 مم)؛ تحقق من خط 100 مم باستخدام المسطرة.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"هل تقوم الأداة بإرسال بيانات الفاتورة إلى أي مكان؟","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"رقم. يتم إنشاء وقراءة الصور في متصفحك. لا يتم استخدام أي حساب أو خدمة الدفع.","Grade Scale Generator":"مولد مقياس الدرجة","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"مولد مقياس الدرجات — أداة مجانية للتحويل من النقاط إلى الدرجات","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"حوّل النقاط إلى نسب مئوية ودرجات باستخدام الحدود الخاصة بك. قم بمعاينة المقياس الكامل، ونسخه أو تصديره، وطباعة ورقة التقدير.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"إنشاء مقياس درجات شفاف لامتحان أو واجب. تحديد الحد الأقصى للنقاط والحد الأدنى للنسبة المئوية لكل درجة؛ لا يفترض المقياس قاعدة تقدير مدرسية أو وطنية.","Points earned":"النقاط المكتسبة","Maximum points":"الحد الأقصى للنقاط","Top grade label":"ملصق من الدرجة الأولى","Top grade starts at (%)":"تبدأ الدرجة العليا عند (%)","Middle grade label":"ملصق الدرجة المتوسطة","Middle grade starts at (%)":"تبدأ الدرجة المتوسطة عند (%)","Lowest grade label":"ملصق الدرجة الأدنى","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"أدنى درجة تبدأ عند (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"بحد أقصى 50 نقطة، ونقاط 45 تساوي 90%. تحدد الحدود المخصصة الخاصة بك تسمية التقدير.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"هل يستخدم هذا سياسة تصنيف رسمية؟","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"رقم. قمت بتعيين العتبات. تختلف أنظمة الدرجات حسب المدرسة والدورة والبلد؛ قم بتأكيد المقياس الذي من المتوقع أن تستخدمه.","Can I export the grading bands?":"هل يمكنني تصدير نطاقات التصنيف؟","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"نعم. قم بتصدير النطاقات المعروضة كملف CSV أو قم بطباعة المقياس."},"bg":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Калкулатор за заплащане на почивка в Норвегия","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Калкулатор за заплащане на ваканция в Норвегия — Безплатна брутна оценка","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Оценете норвежкото възнаграждение за отпуск въз основа на вашето възнаграждение за отпуск. Сравнете общите тарифи за стандартен отпуск, пета седмица и служители на възраст 60 или повече.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Въведете feriepengegrunnlag, показан на вашия фиш за заплати. Сравнете обичайните норвежки ставки за брутен отпуск за вашата възраст и договорената продължителност на отпуска.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"База за заплащане на отпуск (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Аз съм 60 или по-възрастен през празничната година","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Моето споразумение включва пета празнична седмица","Estimated holiday pay":"Прогнозно заплащане за почивка","Rate used":"Използван курс","Basis used":"Използвана основа","Reset choices":"Нулирайте изборите","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Само брутна оценка. Плащането за почивка е облагаем доход; данъчното удържане може да варира според лицето и ведомостта.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"С база NOK 500,000, 10.2% дава NOK 51,000 преди всякакви корекции на заплатите.","Which rate should I use?":"Коя тарифа да използвам?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Прогнозата използва общи минимални ставки: 10.2% или 12% с пета седмица; 12.5% или 14.3% за служители на възраст 60 или повече. Вашето съгласие може да даде повече.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Това ли е платената сума след облагане?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Бр. Това е груба оценка. Плащането за почивка е облагаем доход; удържането зависи от вашите обстоятелства и заплати.","What belongs in the basis?":"Какво принадлежи към основата?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Използвайте feriepengegrunnlag на вашия фиш за заплати или годишно извлечение. Някои възстановявания и други плащания са изключени от правилата.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Калкулатор за данък общ доход в Норвегия","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Норвежки данъчен калкулатор 2026 — Безплатна оценка на заплатата и пенсията","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Оценка на 2026 Норвежки данък върху доходите върху стандартна заплата или пенсия за възраст за цяла година. Вижте годишно и месечно нетно заплащане, данъчни компоненти и сравнете два сценария.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Прогноза 2026 Норвежки данък върху доходите за стандартна резидентна заплата или пенсия за възраст за цяла година. Вижте основните данъчни компоненти и сравнете два сценария за брутен доход.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Калкулаторът прилага 2026 стандартни удръжки, петте прогресивни данъчни групи и национални осигурителни вноски. Пенсионният режим включва пенсионен данъчен кредит само за цяла година, 100% квалифицирана пенсия за старост или отговаряща на условията AFP. Работи изцяло в този браузър.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"За заплата от 600,000 NOK, сравнете прогнозния годишен данък и нетно заплащане с друга заплата или сума на пенсия за цяла година.","Tax year":"Данъчна година","Scenario":"Сценарий","Salary":"Заплата","Full-year old-age pension":"Пенсия за възраст за цяла година","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Брутен годишен доход (NOK)","Tax zone":"Данъчна зона","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Стандартна ставка (по-голямата част от Норвегия)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Финмарк / изброени общини на зони за мерки","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Прогнозата за пенсия предполага отговаряща на условията пенсия за старост или AFP на 100% за всички 12 месеца, без други доходи.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Прогнозата за заплатата предполага обикновено норвежко данъчно пребиваване, възраст 17–69 и никакви други доходи.","Compare two scenarios":"Сравнете два сценария","Scenario 1":"Сценарий 1","Scenario 2":"Сценарий 2","Calculate estimate":"Изчисляване на оценка","Estimated tax per year":"Приблизителен данък на година","Average tax per month":"Среден данък на месец","Estimated net per year":"Прогнозна нетна стойност на година","Average net per month":"Средно нето на месец","Tax on ordinary income":"Данък върху обикновения доход","Bracket tax":"Данъчна група","National insurance contribution":"Национална осигурителна вноска","Pension tax credit":"Данъчен кредит за пенсия","Estimated effective rate":"Прогнозна ефективна ставка","Standard deduction base":"Стандартна база за приспадане","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Тарифите и праговете са за годината на приходите 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Само прогноза, а не официално изчисление на данъка или данъчна карта. Други доходи, удръжки, възраст, пребиваване, степен на пенсия и лични обстоятелства могат да променят резултата.","Reset values":"Нулирайте стойностите","Example":"Пример","How the estimate works":"Как работи оценката","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Това ли е моята точна данъчна сметка или данъчна карта?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Бр. Той изчислява стандартния годишен данък 2026. Данъчната карта, окончателната оценка и удържането могат да се различават в зависимост от пълния ви доход, удръжки и обстоятелства.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Мога ли да комбинирам заплата и пенсия тук?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Тази версия оценява един вид доход наведнъж. Не изчислява смесен случай на заплата и пенсия.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Пенсионният режим покрива ли всяка пенсия?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Бр. Пенсионният кредит е моделиран само за квалифицирана пенсия за старост или отговарящ на условията AFP, взет на 100% през цялата година. Частична годишна или пенсионна пенсия и други видове пенсии са извън обхвата.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Какво представлява опцията за измервателна зона?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Прилага публикуваната 18.5% обикновена ставка на дохода и NOK 45,000 специално приспадане за Финмарк и изброените общини. Потвърдете, че вашата община отговаря на условията.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Норвежки калкулатор за данък върху богатството","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Норвежки калкулатор за данък върху богатството 2026 — Безплатна оценка","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Оценка на 2026 Норвежки данък върху богатството от домове, акции, бизнес активи, пари и дългове. Вижте разделянето на държавата и общината, отстъпки за оценка и диапазон на чувствителност на стойността.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Определете личния норвежки данък върху богатството за 2026. Въведете приблизителни пазарни стойности за жилища и данъчни основи преди отстъпка за акции и бизнес активи. Вижте отстъпки за оценка, корекция на дълга и отделни държавни и общински оценки.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Прогнозата прилага правилата за оценка на 2026 и максималната общинска ставка, освен ако не въведете по-ниска ставка. Дългът се разпределя по пълна стойност на активите преди отстъпки; дългът, присвоен на акции с отстъпка или бизнес активи, се намалява със същата отстъпка. Оценките на имотите, допустимостта и личните данъчни факти могат да променят официалния резултат.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Основно жилище с пазарна стойност 10 милиона норвежки крони има приблизителна стойност на богатството от 2.5 милиона норвежки крони съгласно правилото за първичен дом 2026 преди дълга и личната надбавка.","2026 tax year":"2026 данъчна година","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Прогнозна пазарна стойност на първичен дом (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Прогнозна пазарна стойност на вторични жилища (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Акции и дялови фондове преди отстъпка (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Отговарящи на условията бизнес активи преди отстъпка (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Банкови депозити и други активи (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Общ дълг (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Ние сме обложени съвместно с данъци за богатство","Municipal rate (%)":"Общинска ставка (%)","Home-value comparison":"Сравнение на стойността на дома","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Приблизителен данък върху богатството","Export CSV":"Експортиране на CSV","Print estimate":"Отпечатайте оценка","Assets before discounts":"Активи преди отстъпки","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Облагаема стойност на актива след отстъпки","Debt reduction from discounts":"Намаляване на дълга от отстъпки","Deductible debt estimate":"Оценка на подлежащия на приспадане дълг","Estimated net wealth":"Приблизително нетно богатство","Personal allowance":"Лична надбавка","Taxable net wealth":"Облагаемо нетно богатство","Municipal wealth tax":"Общински данък върху имуществото","State wealth tax":"Държавен данък върху богатството","State tax, first band":"Държавна такса, първа лента","State tax, upper band":"Държавна такса, горна лента","Estimated total wealth tax":"Приблизителен общ данък върху богатството","Lower home-value estimate":"По-ниска оценка на стойността на дома","Current-value estimate":"Оценка на текущата стойност","Higher home-value estimate":"По-висока оценка на жилището","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 правила и предположения","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Само приблизителна оценка. Това не е официална данъчна оценка или данъчен съвет. Използвайте стойностите на данъчната си декларация, когато има такива; ставките, допустимостта, разпределението на дълга и стойността на имуществото може да се различават във вашия случай.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Къщи: въведете прогнозната пазарна стойност в края на годината. Акции и допустими бизнес активи: въведете стойността преди отстъпката 2026, а не пазарната стойност, освен ако това не е правилната данъчна основа.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Обезщетението и държавният горен праг се удвояват само за съпрузи, регистрирани партньори или отговарящи на условията съжителстващи лица, оценени съвместно за общото им богатство.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Общинското изчисление използва избраната ставка, като по подразбиране е 2026 максимум от 0.35%. Някои общини може да използват по-ниска ставка.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Чувствителността променя само въведените стойности на основните и вторичните домове. Това е сравнение, а не прогноза на официална оценка.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Каква е надбавката за данък богатство 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Стандартният праг е 1.9 милиона норвежки крони за едно лице и 3.8 милиона норвежки крони за съпрузи или квалифицирани партньори, оценени съвместно.","How is my primary home valued?":"Как се оценява основното ми жилище?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"За 2026 прогнозната стойност на богатството е 25% от пазарната стойност до 14 милиона NOK, плюс 70% от сумата над 14 милиона NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Това прилага ли отстъпка за второ жилище?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Бр. Таблицата 2026 дава на вторичните жилища 0% отстъпка от оценката. Той използва въведената пазарна стойност като оценка; официалните оценени стойности могат да се различават.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Защо подлежащият на приспадане дълг се променя, когато притежавам акции или бизнес активи?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Норвежките правила разпределят дълга пропорционално на пълната стойност на активите. Частта, определена за активи с отстъпки за оценка, се намалява със същия дисконтов процент.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Общинската ставка винаги ли е 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Бр. 0.35% е максимумът 2026, използван по подразбиране. Общината може да определи по-ниска ставка, която можете да въведете.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Калкулаторът покрива ли всеки случай на актив или данък?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Бр. Той оценява домове, акции, избрани допустими бизнес активи, парични средства и общ дълг. Чуждестранни активи, пенсии, сложна собственост, изключения и други специални правила може да променят оценката ви.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Швейцарски генератор на QR сметки","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Генератор на швейцарски QR сметки — Безплатно създаване на QR фактури","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Създайте и проверете швейцарска QR-сметка локално. Валидирайте IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR и SCOR справки; отпечатайте частта за плащане A6 и разписката, без да качвате данни за фактура.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Създайте швейцарски фиш за плащане с швейцарски QR код. Данните за вашата фактура остават в този браузър; не се инициира плащане и не се извършва запитване към банков регистър.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Инструментът изгражда данни от SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) и проверява полетата, комбинацията сметка/референтна сметка, контролните цифри на IBAN и поддържаните знаци. Той форматира частта за плащане и разписката за печат в необходимия им физически размер.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX пример: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27-цифрен QRR референтен адрес и структурирани адреси на кредитори/длъжници.","How it works":"Как работи","Frequently asked questions":"Често задавани въпроси","Limits and accuracy":"Ограничения и точност","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Това е инструмент за местни документи, а не банкова услуга или сертификация. Не може да потвърди кой притежава IBAN, дали има открита сметка или дали ще бъде прието плащане. Отпечатайте на 100% / действителен размер и измерете контролната линия 100 mm, преди да използвате хартиено платежно нареждане.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN или QR-IBAN на кредитора","Payable to · creditor":"Платим на · кредитор","Account holder / creditor name":"Име на титуляр/кредитор","Street or P.O. box":"Улица или P.O. кутия","Building number":"Номер на сградата","Postal code":"Пощенски код","Town / city":"Град","2-letter country code":"2-буквен код на държавата","Amount (optional)":"Сума (по избор)","Currency":"Валута","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Платим от · незадължителен длъжник","Debtor name":"Име на длъжника","Reference type":"Референтен тип","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR справка · Само QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Референция на кредитора · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Няма структурирана справка · IBAN","Reference":"Справка","Unstructured message":"Неструктурирано съобщение","Billing information (optional)":"Информация за плащане (по избор)","Create QR-bill":"Създаване на QR-фактура","Load SIX sample":"Заредете ШЕСТ проба","Clear form":"Изчистен формуляр","Check QR payload":"Проверете QR полезния товар","Download payment data":"Изтегляне на данни за плащане","Download QR SVG":"Изтеглете QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Отпечатайте / запазете като PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Прочетете изображение на QR код","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Изберете PNG или JPEG","Read image locally":"Прочетете изображението локално","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Поставяне на данни за плащане с QR код на Швейцария","Invoice details":"Подробности за фактурата","QR-bill preview":"Визуализация на QR банкнота","Receipt":"Разписка","Payment part":"Разплащателна част","Payable to":"Плаща се на","Payable by":"Плаща се от","Account":"Акаунт","Additional information":"Допълнителна информация","Currency / amount":"Валута/сума","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Отпечатайте проверка на мащаба · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Швейцарски стандарт за банкноти QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"Готов QR банкнота. Подробностите останаха на това устройство.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Някои полета се нуждаят от проверка. Прегледайте маркираната информация.","Reading this image on your device…":"Четене на това изображение на вашето устройство…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Швейцарският QR код се чете и проверява локално.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"В това изображение не беше намерен четлив QR код.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Данните за швейцарския QR код са валидни за поддържаните полета.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Данните не са валиден полезен товар за плащане с QR код в Швейцария.","Form and preview cleared.":"Формулярът и прегледът са изчистени.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ШЕСТ проба е заредена. Сменете неговите примерни детайли преди реална употреба.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Първо създайте или прочетете валидна QR-сметка.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Изберете PNG или JPEG от 10 MiB или по-малко.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Локалният QR четец не можа да се зареди. Вместо това можете да поставите данните за плащане.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Кои IBAN и референтни комбинации са разрешени?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"QR-IBAN използва QRR справка. Нормалният швейцарски IBAN използва SCOR или без структурирана референция (NON). QRR е само за фактури в CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Това проверява ли дали сметката съществува или принадлежи на кредитора?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Бр. Той проверява само формата и контролната сума на IBAN. Не се свързва с банка или регистър на сметки.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Мога ли да отпечатам това във всякакъв мащаб?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"За платежно нареждане на хартиен носител отпечатайте 100% / действителен размер. Частта за плащане трябва да бъде A6 пейзаж (148 × 105 mm); проверете линията 100 mm с линийка.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Инструментът изпраща ли някъде данни за фактури?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Бр. Генерирането и четенето на изображения стават във вашия браузър. Не се използва акаунт или платежна услуга.","Grade Scale Generator":"Генератор на скала за оценки","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Генератор на скала за оценка — безплатен инструмент за точки до оценка","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Превърнете точките в проценти и оценки с вашите собствени прагове. Прегледайте пълния мащаб, копирайте го или го експортирайте и отпечатайте лист за оценка.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Изградете прозрачна скала за оценяване за изпит или задание. Задайте максималния брой точки и минималния процент за всяка оценка; скалата не предполага училищно или национално правило за оценяване.","Points earned":"Спечелени точки","Maximum points":"Максимален брой точки","Top grade label":"Етикет от най-висок клас","Top grade starts at (%)":"Най-високата оценка започва от (%)","Middle grade label":"Среден клас етикет","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Средната степен започва от (%)","Lowest grade label":"Етикет с най-нисък клас","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Най-ниската оценка започва от (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"С максимум 50 точки 45 точки се равнява на 90%. Вашите персонализирани прагове определят етикета на оценката.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Това използва ли официална политика за оценяване?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Бр. Вие определяте праговете. Системите за оценяване се различават в зависимост от училище, курс и държава; потвърдете скалата, която се очаква да използвате.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Мога ли да експортирам лентите за оценка?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Да. Експортирайте показаните ленти като CSV файл или отпечатайте скалата."},"bn":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"নরওয়ে হলিডে পে ক্যালকুলেটর","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"নরওয়ে হলিডে পে ক্যালকুলেটর — বিনামূল্যে মোট অনুমান","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"আপনার ছুটির বেতনের ভিত্তিতে নরওয়েজিয়ান ছুটির বেতন অনুমান করুন। সাধারণ ছুটি, পঞ্চম সপ্তাহ এবং 60 বা তার বেশি বয়সী কর্মচারীদের জন্য সাধারণ হারের তুলনা করুন।","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"আপনার পেস্লিপে দেখানো ফেরিপেনজেগ্রুনল্যাগটি লিখুন। আপনার বয়স এবং সম্মত ছুটির দৈর্ঘ্যের জন্য সাধারণ নরওয়েজিয়ান গ্রস ছুটি-বেতনের হার তুলনা করুন।","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"ছুটি-বেতনের ভিত্তিতে (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"আমি ছুটির বছরে 60 বা তার বেশি বয়সী","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"আমার চুক্তিতে একটি পঞ্চম ছুটির সপ্তাহ রয়েছে","Estimated holiday pay":"আনুমানিক ছুটির বেতন","Rate used":"হার ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","Basis used":"বেসিস ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","Reset choices":"পছন্দ রিসেট করুন","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"শুধুমাত্র মোট অনুমান। ছুটির বেতন করযোগ্য আয়; ট্যাক্স আটকানো ব্যক্তি এবং বেতনের ভিত্তিতে পরিবর্তিত হতে পারে।","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 ভিত্তিতে, 10.2% যেকোন বেতনের সমন্বয়ের আগে NOK 51,000 দেয়।","Which rate should I use?":"আমি কোন হার ব্যবহার করব?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"অনুমানটি সাধারণ ন্যূনতম হার ব্যবহার করে: 10.2% বা 12% পঞ্চম সপ্তাহের সাথে; 12.5% বা 60 বা তার বেশি বয়সী কর্মচারীদের জন্য 14.3%। আপনার চুক্তি আরো দিতে পারে.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"এটি কি ট্যাক্সের পরে প্রদত্ত পরিমাণ?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"না। এটি একটি স্থূল অনুমান। ছুটির বেতন করযোগ্য আয়; আটকে রাখা আপনার পরিস্থিতি এবং বেতনের উপর নির্ভর করে।","What belongs in the basis?":"ভিত্তিতে কী আছে?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"আপনার পেস্লিপ বা বার্ষিক বিবৃতিতে ফেরিপেনজেগ্রুনল্যাগ ব্যবহার করুন। কিছু প্রতিদান এবং অন্যান্য অর্থপ্রদান নিয়ম দ্বারা বাদ দেওয়া হয়।","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"নরওয়ে আয়কর ক্যালকুলেটর","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"নরওয়ে ট্যাক্স ক্যালকুলেটর 2026 — বিনামূল্যে বেতন এবং পেনশন অনুমান","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"আনুমানিক 2026 নরওয়েজিয়ান আয়কর স্ট্যান্ডার্ড বেতন বা পুরো বছরের বার্ধক্য পেনশনের উপর। বার্ষিক এবং মাসিক নেট বেতন, ট্যাক্স উপাদান দেখুন এবং দুটি পরিস্থিতির তুলনা করুন।","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"মানক আবাসিক বেতন বা পুরো বছরের বৃদ্ধ বয়সের পেনশনের জন্য আনুমানিক 2026 নরওয়েজিয়ান আয়কর। প্রধান করের উপাদানগুলি দেখুন এবং দুটি মোট আয়ের পরিস্থিতি তুলনা করুন।","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"ক্যালকুলেটরটি 2026 স্ট্যান্ডার্ড ডিডাকশন, পাঁচটি প্রগতিশীল বন্ধনী-ট্যাক্স ব্যান্ড এবং জাতীয় বীমা অবদান প্রয়োগ করে। পেনশন মোড শুধুমাত্র একটি পূর্ণ-বছরের জন্য পেনশন ট্যাক্স ক্রেডিট অন্তর্ভুক্ত করে, 100% যোগ্য বার্ধক্য পেনশন বা যোগ্য AFP। এটি সম্পূর্ণরূপে এই ব্রাউজারে চলে।","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 এর বেতনের জন্য, আনুমানিক বার্ষিক কর এবং নেট বেতনের অন্য বেতন বা পুরো বছরের পেনশন পরিমাণের সাথে তুলনা করুন।","Tax year":"কর বছর","Scenario":"দৃশ্যকল্প","Salary":"বেতন","Full-year old-age pension":"পুরো বছরের বার্ধক্য পেনশন","Gross annual income (NOK)":"মোট বার্ষিক আয় (NOK)","Tax zone":"কর অঞ্চল","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"স্ট্যান্ডার্ড রেট (বেশিরভাগ নরওয়ে)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"ফিনমার্ক / তালিকাভুক্ত ব্যবস্থা-জোন পৌরসভা","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"পেনশন অনুমান সমস্ত 12 মাসের জন্য 100%-এ যোগ্য বার্ধক্য পেনশন বা AFP অনুমান করে, অন্য কোন আয় ছাড়াই।","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"বেতনের অনুমান সাধারণ নরওয়েজিয়ান ট্যাক্স রেসিডেন্সি, বয়স 17–69 এবং অন্য কোনও আয় নয়।","Compare two scenarios":"দুটি পরিস্থিতির তুলনা করুন","Scenario 1":"দৃশ্যপট 1","Scenario 2":"দৃশ্যপট 2","Calculate estimate":"আনুমানিক হিসাব করুন","Estimated tax per year":"প্রতি বছর আনুমানিক ট্যাক্স","Average tax per month":"প্রতি মাসে গড় কর","Estimated net per year":"প্রতি বছর আনুমানিক নেট","Average net per month":"প্রতি মাসে গড় নেট","Tax on ordinary income":"সাধারণ আয়ের উপর কর","Bracket tax":"বন্ধনী ট্যাক্স","National insurance contribution":"জাতীয় বীমা অবদান","Pension tax credit":"পেনশন ট্যাক্স ক্রেডিট","Estimated effective rate":"আনুমানিক কার্যকর হার","Standard deduction base":"স্ট্যান্ডার্ড ডিডাকশন বেস","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"দর এবং থ্রেশহোল্ডগুলি 2026 আয় বছরের জন্য।","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"শুধুমাত্র অনুমান, একটি অফিসিয়াল ট্যাক্স গণনা বা ট্যাক্স কার্ড নয়। অন্যান্য আয়, ছাড়, বয়স, বাসস্থান, পেনশন গ্রেড এবং ব্যক্তিগত পরিস্থিতি ফলাফল পরিবর্তন করতে পারে।","Reset values":"মান রিসেট করুন","Example":"উদাহরণ","How the estimate works":"কিভাবে অনুমান কাজ করে","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"এটা কি আমার সঠিক ট্যাক্স বিল নাকি ট্যাক্স-কার্ড উইথহোল্ডিং?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"না। এটি মান 2026 বার্ষিক কর অনুমান করে। একটি ট্যাক্স কার্ড, চূড়ান্ত মূল্যায়ন এবং আপনার সম্পূর্ণ আয়, কর্তন এবং পরিস্থিতির কারণে আলাদা হতে পারে।","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"আমি কি এখানে বেতন এবং পেনশন একত্রিত করতে পারি?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"এই সংস্করণটি একবারে একটি আয়ের ধরন অনুমান করে। এটি একটি মিশ্র বেতন-এবং-পেনশন কেস গণনা করে না।","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"পেনশন মোড কি প্রতিটি পেনশন কভার করে?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"না। পেনশন ক্রেডিট শুধুমাত্র একটি যোগ্য বার্ধক্য পেনশন বা সারা বছর 100% এ নেওয়া যোগ্য AFP-এর জন্য মডেল করা হয়েছে। আংশিক-বছর বা গ্রেডেড পেনশন এবং অন্যান্য পেনশনের ধরন সুযোগের বাইরে।","What is the measures-zone option?":"পরিমাপ-জোন বিকল্প কি?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"এটি ফিনমার্ক এবং তালিকাভুক্ত পৌরসভার জন্য প্রকাশিত 18.5% সাধারণ-আয়ের হার এবং NOK 45,000 বিশেষ ছাড় প্রযোজ্য। নিশ্চিত করুন যে আপনার পৌরসভা যোগ্য।","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"নরওয়ে ওয়েলথ ট্যাক্স ক্যালকুলেটর","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"নরওয়ে ওয়েলথ ট্যাক্স ক্যালকুলেটর 2026 — বিনামূল্যে অনুমান","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"বাড়ি, শেয়ার, ব্যবসায়িক সম্পদ, নগদ এবং ঋণ থেকে 2026 নরওয়েজিয়ান সম্পদ কর। রাজ্য এবং পৌরসভা বিভাজন, মূল্যায়ন ডিসকাউন্ট এবং একটি মান সংবেদনশীলতা পরিসীমা দেখুন।","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026-এর জন্য ব্যক্তিগত নরওয়েজিয়ান সম্পদ কর অনুমান করুন। বাড়ির জন্য আনুমানিক বাজার মূল্য এবং শেয়ার এবং ব্যবসা সম্পদের জন্য প্রাক-ডিসকাউন্ট ট্যাক্স বেস লিখুন। মূল্যায়ন ডিসকাউন্ট, ঋণ সমন্বয় এবং পৃথক রাষ্ট্র ও পৌর অনুমান দেখুন।","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"অনুমানটি 2026 মূল্যায়নের নিয়ম এবং সর্বোচ্চ পৌর হার প্রযোজ্য যদি না আপনি একটি নিম্ন হার লিখুন। ডিসকাউন্টের আগে সম্পূর্ণ সম্পদ মূল্য দ্বারা ঋণ বরাদ্দ করা হয়; ডিসকাউন্ট করা শেয়ার বা ব্যবসায়িক সম্পদের জন্য নির্ধারিত ঋণ একই ডিসকাউন্ট দ্বারা হ্রাস করা হয়। সম্পত্তি মূল্যায়ন, যোগ্যতা এবং ব্যক্তিগত করের তথ্য অফিসিয়াল ফলাফল পরিবর্তন করতে পারে।","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"একটি NOK 10 মিলিয়ন বাজার মূল্যের একটি প্রাথমিক বাড়িতে ঋণ এবং ব্যক্তিগত ভাতার আগে 2026 প্রাথমিক-বাড়ির নিয়মের অধীনে NOK 2.5 মিলিয়নের আনুমানিক সম্পদ মূল্য রয়েছে।","2026 tax year":"2026 কর বছর","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"প্রাথমিক বাড়ির আনুমানিক বাজার মূল্য (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"সেকেন্ডারি বাড়ির আনুমানিক বাজার মূল্য (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"ডিসকাউন্টের আগে ফান্ড শেয়ার এবং শেয়ার করুন (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"ছাড়ের আগে যোগ্য ব্যবসায়িক সম্পদ (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"ব্যাঙ্ক আমানত এবং অন্যান্য সম্পদ (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"মোট ঋণ (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"সম্পদের জন্য আমরা যৌথভাবে কর আরোপ করি","Municipal rate (%)":"পৌরসভার হার (%)","Home-value comparison":"বাড়ি-মূল্যের তুলনা","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"সম্পদ কর আনুমানিক","Export CSV":"CSV রপ্তানি করুন","Print estimate":"প্রিন্ট অনুমান","Assets before discounts":"ছাড়ের আগে সম্পদ","Taxable asset value after discounts":"ছাড়ের পর করযোগ্য সম্পদ মূল্য","Debt reduction from discounts":"ডিসকাউন্ট থেকে ঋণ হ্রাস","Deductible debt estimate":"কর্তনযোগ্য ঋণ অনুমান","Estimated net wealth":"আনুমানিক নেট সম্পদ","Personal allowance":"ব্যক্তিগত ভাতা","Taxable net wealth":"করযোগ্য নেট সম্পদ","Municipal wealth tax":"পৌরসভা সম্পদ কর","State wealth tax":"রাষ্ট্রীয় সম্পদ কর","State tax, first band":"রাষ্ট্রীয় কর, প্রথম ব্যান্ড","State tax, upper band":"রাষ্ট্রীয় কর, উপরের ব্যান্ড","Estimated total wealth tax":"আনুমানিক মোট সম্পদ কর","Lower home-value estimate":"নিম্ন হোম-মূল্য অনুমান","Current-value estimate":"বর্তমান-মূল্য অনুমান","Higher home-value estimate":"উচ্চ গৃহ-মূল্য অনুমান","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 নিয়ম এবং অনুমান","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"শুধুমাত্র অনুমান। এটি একটি অফিসিয়াল ট্যাক্স মূল্যায়ন বা ট্যাক্স পরামর্শ নয়। যেখানে উপলব্ধ আপনার ট্যাক্স রিটার্ন মান ব্যবহার করুন; আপনার ক্ষেত্রে হার, যোগ্যতা, ঋণ বরাদ্দ এবং সম্পত্তির মূল্য ভিন্ন হতে পারে।","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"বাড়ি: বছরের শেষে আনুমানিক বাজার মূল্য লিখুন। শেয়ার এবং যোগ্য ব্যবসায়িক সম্পদ: 2026 ছাড়ের আগে মান লিখুন, বাজার মূল্য নয় যদি না তা সঠিক করের ভিত্তিতে হয়।","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"ভাতা এবং রাষ্ট্রের উপরের থ্রেশহোল্ড শুধুমাত্র স্বামী/স্ত্রী, নিবন্ধিত অংশীদার বা যোগ্যতা সম্পন্ন সহবাসীদের জন্য তাদের সম্মিলিত সম্পদের জন্য যৌথভাবে মূল্যায়ন করা হয়েছে।","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"পৌরসভার গণনা নির্বাচিত হার ব্যবহার করে, 2026 সর্বাধিক 0.35% পর্যন্ত ডিফল্ট করে। কিছু পৌরসভা কম হার ব্যবহার করতে পারে।","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"সংবেদনশীলতা শুধুমাত্র প্রাথমিক এবং মাধ্যমিক বাড়ির প্রবেশ করা মান পরিবর্তন করে। এটি একটি তুলনা, একটি সরকারী মূল্যায়ন একটি ভবিষ্যদ্বাণী নয়.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 সম্পদ-কর ভাতা কি?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"স্ট্যান্ডার্ড থ্রেশহোল্ড হল এক ব্যক্তির জন্য NOK 1.9 মিলিয়ন এবং স্বামী বা স্ত্রী বা যোগ্য অংশীদারদের জন্য NOK 3.8 মিলিয়ন যৌথভাবে মূল্যায়ন করা হয়েছে।","How is my primary home valued?":"আমার প্রাথমিক বাড়ির মূল্য কেমন?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026-এর জন্য, আনুমানিক সম্পদের মূল্য হল বাজার মূল্যের 25% NOK 14 মিলিয়ন পর্যন্ত, সাথে NOK 14 মিলিয়নের বেশি পরিমাণের 70%।","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"এটি কি সেকেন্ডারি হোমের জন্য ডিসকাউন্ট প্রযোজ্য?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"না। 2026 টেবিল সেকেন্ডারি হোমগুলিকে 0% মূল্যায়ন ছাড় দেয়। এটি অনুমান হিসাবে প্রবেশ করা বাজার মূল্য ব্যবহার করে; সরকারী মূল্যায়ন মান ভিন্ন হতে পারে.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"যখন আমি শেয়ার বা ব্যবসায়িক সম্পদের মালিক হই তখন কর্তনযোগ্য ঋণ কেন পরিবর্তিত হয়?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়মগুলি সম্পূর্ণ সম্পদের মান দ্বারা আনুপাতিকভাবে ঋণ বরাদ্দ করে। মূল্যায়ন ডিসকাউন্ট সহ সম্পদের জন্য নির্ধারিত অংশ একই ডিসকাউন্ট হার দ্বারা হ্রাস করা হয়।","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"পুরসভার হার কি সবসময় 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"না। 0.35% হল 2026 ডিফল্টভাবে ব্যবহৃত সর্বাধিক। একটি পৌরসভা একটি কম হার নির্ধারণ করতে পারে, যা আপনি প্রবেশ করতে পারেন।","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"ক্যালকুলেটর কি প্রতিটি সম্পদ বা ট্যাক্স কেস কভার করে?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"না। এটি বাড়ি, শেয়ার, নির্বাচিত যোগ্য ব্যবসায়িক সম্পদ, নগদ এবং মোট ঋণ অনুমান করে। বিদেশী সম্পদ, পেনশন, জটিল মালিকানা, ছাড় এবং অন্যান্য বিশেষ নিয়ম আপনার মূল্যায়ন পরিবর্তন করতে পারে।","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"সুইস QR-বিল জেনারেটর","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"সুইস QR-বিল জেনারেটর - বিনামূল্যে QR চালান মেকার","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"স্থানীয়ভাবে একটি সুইস QR-বিল তৈরি করুন এবং পরীক্ষা করুন। IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR এবং SCOR রেফারেন্স যাচাই করুন; চালান ডেটা আপলোড না করে A6 পেমেন্ট অংশ এবং রসিদ প্রিন্ট করুন।","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"একটি সুইস QR কোড সহ একটি সুইস পেমেন্ট স্লিপ তৈরি করুন৷ আপনার চালানের বিবরণ এই ব্রাউজারে থাকবে; কোন অর্থপ্রদান শুরু হয় না এবং কোন ব্যাঙ্ক রেজিস্টার জিজ্ঞাসা করা হয় না।","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"টুলটি ছয় সুইস পেমেন্ট কোড (SPC) ডেটা তৈরি করে এবং এর ক্ষেত্র, অ্যাকাউন্ট/রেফারেন্স সমন্বয়, IBAN চেক ডিজিট এবং সমর্থিত অক্ষরগুলি পরীক্ষা করে। এটি তাদের প্রয়োজনীয় শারীরিক আকারে প্রিন্ট করার জন্য অর্থপ্রদানের অংশ এবং রসিদ ফর্ম্যাট করে।","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"ছয় উদাহরণ: একটি QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, একটি 27-সংখ্যার QRR রেফারেন্স এবং কাঠামোবদ্ধ পাওনাদার/দেনাদার ঠিকানা৷","How it works":"এটি কিভাবে কাজ করে","Frequently asked questions":"প্রায়শই জিজ্ঞাসিত প্রশ্ন","Limits and accuracy":"সীমা এবং নির্ভুলতা","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"এটি একটি স্থানীয় ডকুমেন্ট টুল, ব্যাঙ্ক পরিষেবা বা সার্টিফিকেশন নয়৷ এটি নিশ্চিত করতে পারে না যে কে একটি IBAN এর মালিক, একটি অ্যাকাউন্ট খোলা আছে কিনা, বা একটি অর্থপ্রদান গ্রহণ করা হবে কিনা। 100% / প্রকৃত আকারে প্রিন্ট করুন এবং একটি পেপার পেমেন্ট অর্ডার ব্যবহার করার আগে 100 মিমি চেক লাইন পরিমাপ করুন।","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"ক্রেডিটর IBAN বা QR-IBAN৷","Payable to · creditor":"ঋণদাতাকে প্রদেয়","Account holder / creditor name":"অ্যাকাউন্ট হোল্ডার/পাওনাদারের নাম","Street or P.O. box":"রাস্তা বা P.O. বাক্স","Building number":"বিল্ডিং নম্বর","Postal code":"পোস্টাল কোড","Town / city":"শহর/শহর","2-letter country code":"2-অক্ষরের দেশের কোড","Amount (optional)":"অ্যামাউন্ট (ঐচ্ছিক)","Currency":"মুদ্রা","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"ঐচ্ছিক দেনাদার দ্বারা প্রদেয়","Debtor name":"দেনাদারের নাম","Reference type":"রেফারেন্স টাইপ","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR রেফারেন্স · শুধুমাত্র QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"ক্রেডিটর রেফারেন্স · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"কোন কাঠামোগত রেফারেন্স নেই · IBAN","Reference":"রেফারেন্স","Unstructured message":"অসংগঠিত বার্তা","Billing information (optional)":"বিলিং তথ্য (ঐচ্ছিক)","Create QR-bill":"QR-বিল তৈরি করুন","Load SIX sample":"ছয় নমুনা লোড করুন","Clear form":"ফর্ম পরিষ্কার করুন","Check QR payload":"QR পেলোড চেক করুন","Download payment data":"পেমেন্ট ডেটা ডাউনলোড করুন","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG ডাউনলোড করুন","Print / save as PDF":"পিডিএফ হিসাবে মুদ্রণ/সংরক্ষণ করুন","Read a QR Code image":"একটি QR কোড ছবি পড়ুন","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG বা JPEG বেছে নিন","Read image locally":"স্থানীয়ভাবে ছবি পড়ুন","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"সুইস QR কোড পেমেন্ট ডেটা পেস্ট করুন","Invoice details":"চালানের বিশদ বিবরণ","QR-bill preview":"QR-বিলের পূর্বরূপ","Receipt":"রসিদ","Payment part":"পেমেন্ট অংশ","Payable to":"প্রদেয়","Payable by":"প্রদেয়","Account":"অ্যাকাউন্ট","Additional information":"অতিরিক্ত তথ্য","Currency / amount":"মুদ্রা / পরিমাণ","Print scale check · 100 mm":"প্রিন্ট স্কেল চেক · 100 মিমি","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · সুইস QR-বিল স্ট্যান্ডার্ড","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-বিল প্রস্তুত। বিস্তারিত এই ডিভাইসে থেকে গেছে.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"কিছু ক্ষেত্র চেক করা প্রয়োজন। হাইলাইট করা তথ্য পর্যালোচনা করুন।","Reading this image on your device…":"আপনার ডিভাইসে এই ছবিটি পড়া হচ্ছে...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"সুইস QR কোড স্থানীয়ভাবে পড়া এবং পরীক্ষা করা হয়েছে৷","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"সেই ছবিতে কোনো পাঠযোগ্য QR কোড পাওয়া যায়নি।","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"সুইস QR কোড ডেটা সমর্থিত ক্ষেত্রগুলির জন্য বৈধ।","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"ডেটা একটি বৈধ সুইস QR কোড পেমেন্ট পেলোড নয়।","Form and preview cleared.":"ফর্ম এবং পূর্বরূপ সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ছয় নমুনা লোড হয়েছে৷ বাস্তব ব্যবহারের আগে এর নমুনার বিবরণ প্রতিস্থাপন করুন।","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"প্রথমে একটি বৈধ QR-বিল তৈরি করুন বা পড়ুন।","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB বা তার কম PNG বা JPEG বেছে নিন।","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"স্থানীয় QR রিডার লোড করা যায়নি। আপনি পরিবর্তে পেমেন্ট ডেটা পেস্ট করতে পারেন।","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"কোন IBAN এবং রেফারেন্স সমন্বয় অনুমোদিত?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"একটি QR-IBAN একটি QRR রেফারেন্স ব্যবহার করে। একটি সাধারণ সুইস IBAN SCOR বা নো স্ট্রাকচার্ড রেফারেন্স (NON) ব্যবহার করে। QRR শুধুমাত্র CHF চালানের জন্য।","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"এটি কি চেক করে যে অ্যাকাউন্টটি বিদ্যমান বা পাওনাদারের অন্তর্গত?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"না। এটি শুধুমাত্র বিন্যাস এবং IBAN চেকসাম পরীক্ষা করে। এটি একটি ব্যাঙ্ক বা অ্যাকাউন্ট রেজিস্ট্রির সাথে যোগাযোগ করে না।","Can I print this at any scale?":"আমি কি এটিকে কোনো স্কেলে প্রিন্ট করতে পারি?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"পেপার পেমেন্ট অর্ডারের জন্য, 100% / প্রকৃত আকারে প্রিন্ট করুন। অর্থপ্রদানের অংশটি অবশ্যই A6 ল্যান্ডস্কেপ হতে হবে (148 × 105 মিমি); একটি শাসক দিয়ে 100 মিমি লাইন পরীক্ষা করুন।","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"টুলটি কি কোথাও চালান ডেটা পাঠায়?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"না। জেনারেশন এবং ইমেজ রিডিং আপনার ব্রাউজারে ঘটবে। কোন অ্যাকাউন্ট বা পেমেন্ট পরিষেবা ব্যবহার করা হয় না.","Grade Scale Generator":"গ্রেড স্কেল জেনারেটর","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"গ্রেড স্কেল জেনারেটর — ফ্রি পয়েন্ট-টু-গ্রেড টুল","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"পয়েন্টগুলিকে আপনার নিজস্ব থ্রেশহোল্ড সহ শতাংশ এবং গ্রেডে পরিণত করুন৷ সম্পূর্ণ স্কেলটির পূর্বরূপ দেখুন, এটি অনুলিপি করুন বা রপ্তানি করুন এবং একটি গ্রেডিং শীট মুদ্রণ করুন।","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"পরীক্ষা বা অ্যাসাইনমেন্টের জন্য একটি স্বচ্ছ গ্রেডিং স্কেল তৈরি করুন। প্রতিটি গ্রেডের জন্য সর্বাধিক পয়েন্ট এবং সর্বনিম্ন শতাংশ সেট করুন; স্কেল একটি স্কুল বা জাতীয় গ্রেডিং নিয়ম অনুমান করে না।","Points earned":"পয়েন্ট অর্জিত হয়েছে","Maximum points":"সর্বোচ্চ পয়েন্ট","Top grade label":"শীর্ষ গ্রেড লেবেল","Top grade starts at (%)":"শীর্ষ গ্রেড (%) থেকে শুরু হয়","Middle grade label":"মিডল গ্রেড লেবেল","Middle grade starts at (%)":"মিডল গ্রেড (%) এ শুরু হয়","Lowest grade label":"সর্বনিম্ন গ্রেড লেবেল","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"সর্বনিম্ন গ্রেড (%) এ শুরু হয়","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"50-পয়েন্ট সর্বাধিক হলে, 45 পয়েন্ট সমান 90%। আপনার কাস্টম থ্রেশহোল্ড গ্রেড লেবেল নির্ধারণ করে।","Does this use an official grading policy?":"এটি কি একটি অফিসিয়াল গ্রেডিং নীতি ব্যবহার করে?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"না। আপনি থ্রেশহোল্ড সেট. গ্রেডিং সিস্টেম স্কুল, কোর্স এবং দেশ অনুসারে আলাদা; আপনি যে স্কেলটি ব্যবহার করবেন তা নিশ্চিত করুন।","Can I export the grading bands?":"আমি কি গ্রেডিং ব্যান্ড রপ্তানি করতে পারি?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"হ্যাঁ। একটি CSV ফাইল হিসাবে প্রদর্শিত ব্যান্ডগুলি রপ্তানি করুন বা স্কেলটি মুদ্রণ করুন৷"},"ca":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Calculadora de pagament per vacances a Noruega","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Calculadora de pagament per vacances de Noruega — Estimació bruta gratuïta","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Calculeu el pagament de vacances noruecs a partir de la vostra base de pagament de vacances. Compareu les tarifes habituals per al permís estàndard, una cinquena setmana i els empleats de 60 o més.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Introduïu el feriepengegrunnlag que apareix a la vostra nòmina. Compareu les tarifes de pagament brut de vacances habituals de Noruega per a la vostra edat i la durada de vacances acordada.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Base de pagament de vacances (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Sóc 60 o més durant l'any de vacances","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"El meu acord inclou una cinquena setmana de vacances","Estimated holiday pay":"Paga de vacances estimada","Rate used":"Taxa utilitzada","Basis used":"Base utilitzada","Reset choices":"Restableix les opcions","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Només estimació bruta. La paga de vacances és una renda imposable; la retenció fiscal pot variar segons la persona i la nòmina.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Amb una base NOK 500,000, 10.2% ofereix NOK 51,000 abans de qualsevol ajust de nòmina.","Which rate should I use?":"Quina tarifa he d'utilitzar?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"L'estimació utilitza tarifes mínimes comunes: 10.2% o 12% amb una cinquena setmana; 12.5% o 14.3% per als empleats de 60 o més. El vostre acord pot donar més.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"És l'import pagat després d'impostos?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Núm. Aquesta és una estimació bruta. La paga de vacances és una renda imposable; la retenció depèn de les vostres circumstàncies i de la nòmina.","What belongs in the basis?":"Què pertany a la base?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Utilitzeu el feriepengegrunnlag a la vostra nòmina o extracte anual. Alguns reemborsaments i altres pagaments estan exclosos per les normes.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Calculadora de l'impost sobre la renda de Noruega","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Calculadora d'impostos de Noruega 2026 — Estimació gratuïta de salaris i pensions","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Calculació de 2026 Impost sobre la renda noruec sobre el sou estàndard o la pensió de vellesa d'un any complet. Consulteu el pagament net anual i mensual, els components fiscals i compareu dos escenaris.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Calculeu 2026 impost sobre la renda noruec per a un sou estàndard de resident o una pensió de vellesa d'un any complet. Consulteu els principals components fiscals i compareu dos escenaris d'ingressos bruts.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"La calculadora aplica les deduccions estàndard 2026, les cinc franges d'impostos progressius i les contribucions a l'assegurança nacional. El mode de pensió inclou el crèdit fiscal de la pensió només per a una pensió de vellesa qualificada d'un any complet, 100% o AFP elegible. S'executa completament en aquest navegador.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Per a un sou de NOK 600,000, compareu l'impost anual estimat i el sou net amb un altre sou o l'import de la pensió per a tot l'any.","Tax year":"Any fiscal","Scenario":"Escenari","Salary":"Salari","Full-year old-age pension":"Pensió de vellesa a l'any complet","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Ingressos anuals bruts (NOK)","Tax zone":"Zona fiscal","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Tarifa estàndard (la majoria de Noruega)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Municipis de la zona de mesures de Finnmark / llistats","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"L'estimació de la pensió suposa una pensió de vellesa o AFP elegible a 100% per a tots els 12 mesos, sense cap altre ingrés.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"L'estimació salarial suposa la residència fiscal noruega normal, l'edat 17–69 i cap altre ingrés.","Compare two scenarios":"Compareu dos escenaris","Scenario 1":"Escenari 1","Scenario 2":"Escenari 2","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimació","Estimated tax per year":"Impost estimat anual","Average tax per month":"Impost mitjà al mes","Estimated net per year":"Net estimat per any","Average net per month":"Mitjana net al mes","Tax on ordinary income":"Impost sobre la renda ordinària","Bracket tax":"Impost de suport","National insurance contribution":"Aportació d'assegurança nacional","Pension tax credit":"Crèdit fiscal per pensions","Estimated effective rate":"Taxa efectiva estimada","Standard deduction base":"Base estàndard de deducció","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Les tarifes i els llindars corresponen a l'any d'ingressos 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Només un pressupost, no un càlcul fiscal oficial ni una targeta fiscal. Altres ingressos, deduccions, edat, residència, grau de pensió i circumstàncies personals poden modificar el resultat.","Reset values":"Restablir valors","Example":"Exemple","How the estimate works":"Com funciona el pressupost","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"És aquesta la meva factura d'impostos exacta o la meva retenció de targeta fiscal?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Núm. Estima l'impost anual estàndard 2026. Una targeta fiscal, una liquidació final i una retenció poden diferir a causa dels vostres ingressos, deduccions i circumstàncies completes.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Puc combinar aquí el sou i la pensió?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Aquesta versió estima un tipus d'ingressos alhora. No calcula un cas mixt de sou i pensions.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"La modalitat de pensió cobreix totes les pensions?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Núm. El crèdit de pensió només es modela per a una pensió de vellesa qualificada o una AFP elegible presa a 100% durant tot l'any. Les pensions parcials o graduades i altres tipus de pensions queden fora de l'àmbit.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Quina és l'opció de la zona de mesures?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Aplica la taxa d'ingressos ordinari 18.5% publicada i la deducció especial NOK 45,000 per a Finnmark i els municipis enumerats. Confirmeu que el vostre municipi compleix els requisits.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Calculadora de l'impost sobre el patrimoni de Noruega","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Calculadora d'impostos sobre la riquesa de Noruega 2026 — Estimació gratuïta","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Calculeu 2026 l'impost sobre el patrimoni noruec d'habitatges, accions, actius empresarials, efectiu i deute. Consulteu el repartiment estatal i municipal, descomptes de valoració i un rang de sensibilitat al valor.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Estimació de l'impost sobre el patrimoni personal noruec per a 2026. Introduïu valors de mercat estimats per a habitatges i bases fiscals prèvies al descompte per a accions i actius empresarials. Consulteu els descomptes de valoració, l'ajust del deute i les estimacions estatals i municipals separades.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"L'estimació aplica les normes de valoració 2026 i la taxa municipal màxima tret que introduïu una tarifa més baixa. El deute s'assigna pel valor total dels actius abans dels descomptes; el deute assignat a accions descomptes o actius empresarials es redueix amb el mateix descompte. Les valoracions de la propietat, l'elegibilitat i els fets fiscals personals poden canviar el resultat oficial.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Una casa principal amb un valor de mercat de 10 milions de NOK té un valor de riquesa estimat de 2.5 milions de NOK segons la regla d'habitatge principal 2026, abans del deute i la prestació personal.","2026 tax year":"2026 any fiscal","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Valor de mercat estimat de l'habitatge principal (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Valor de mercat estimat d'habitatges secundaris (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Accions i fons compartits abans del descompte (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Actius empresarials elegibles abans del descompte (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Dipòsits bancaris i altres actius (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Deute total (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Estem gravats conjuntament per la riquesa","Municipal rate (%)":"Taxa municipal (%)","Home-value comparison":"Comparació del valor de la casa","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Impost sobre el patrimoni estimat","Export CSV":"Exporta CSV","Print estimate":"Imprimir pressupost","Assets before discounts":"Actius abans de descomptes","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Valor de l'actiu imposable després dels descomptes","Debt reduction from discounts":"Reducció de deute per descomptes","Deductible debt estimate":"Estimació del deute deduïble","Estimated net wealth":"Riquesa neta estimada","Personal allowance":"Subsidio personal","Taxable net wealth":"Patrimoni net imposable","Municipal wealth tax":"Impost municipal sobre el patrimoni","State wealth tax":"Impost estatal sobre el patrimoni","State tax, first band":"Impost estatal, primera banda","State tax, upper band":"Impost estatal, banda superior","Estimated total wealth tax":"Impost sobre el patrimoni total estimat","Lower home-value estimate":"Valor estimat de l'habitatge més baix","Current-value estimate":"Estimació del valor actual","Higher home-value estimate":"Valor estimat de l'habitatge més alt","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 regles i supòsits","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Només estimació. Aquesta no és una liquidació fiscal oficial ni un assessorament fiscal. Utilitzeu els valors de la vostra declaració d'impostos quan estiguin disponibles; les tarifes, l'elegibilitat, l'assignació del deute i els valors de la propietat poden diferir en el vostre cas.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Llotges: introduïu el valor de mercat estimat al final de l'any. Accions i actius comercials elegibles: introduïu el valor abans del descompte de 2026, no el valor de mercat tret que aquesta sigui la base fiscal correcta.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"La prestació i el llindar superior estatal es duplican només per als cònjuges, parelles registrades o convivents qualificats avaluats conjuntament pel seu patrimoni conjunt.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"El càlcul municipal utilitza la taxa seleccionada, per defecte al 2026 màxim de 0.35%. Alguns municipis poden utilitzar una tarifa més baixa.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"La sensibilitat només canvia els valors introduïts de les residències primàries i secundàries. És una comparació, no una predicció d'una valoració oficial.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Què és la bonificació de l'impost sobre el patrimoni 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"El llindar estàndard és de 1.9 milions de NOK per a una persona i de 3.8 milions de NOK per a cònjuges o socis qualificats avaluats conjuntament.","How is my primary home valued?":"Com es valora la meva casa principal?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Per a 2026, el valor estimat de la riquesa és de 25% del valor de mercat fins a 14 milions de NOK, més 70% de l'import superior a 14 milions de NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Això s'aplica un descompte a un habitatge secundari?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Núm. La taula 2026 ofereix a les cases secundàries un descompte de valoració de 0%. Utilitza el valor de mercat introduït com a estimació; els valors avaluats oficials poden diferir.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Per què canvia el deute deduïble quan tinc accions o actius empresarials?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Les regles noruegues assignen el deute proporcionalment segons els valors totals dels actius. La part assignada als actius amb descomptes per valoració es redueix amb la mateixa taxa de descompte.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"La tarifa municipal és sempre 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Núm. 0.35% és el 2026 màxim utilitzat per defecte. Un municipi pot establir una tarifa més baixa, que podeu introduir.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"La calculadora cobreix tots els actius o casos fiscals?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Núm. Estima habitatges, accions, actius comercials elegibles seleccionats, efectiu i deute total. Els actius estrangers, les pensions, la propietat complexa, les exempcions i altres normes especials poden canviar la vostra avaluació.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Generador de factures QR suís","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Generador de factures QR suïssa — Creador de factures QR gratuït","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Creeu i comproveu localment una factura QR suïssa. Validar les referències IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR i SCOR; imprimiu la part de pagament i el rebut A6 sense carregar les dades de la factura.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Creeu un resguard de pagament suís amb un codi QR suís. Els detalls de la factura es mantenen en aquest navegador; no s'inicia cap pagament i no es consulta cap registre bancari.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"L'eina crea les dades del SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) i en verifica els camps, la combinació de compte/referència, els dígits de verificació IBAN i els caràcters admesos. Formata la part de pagament i el rebut per a la impressió a la mida física requerida.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIS exemple: un QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, una referència QRR de 27 dígits i adreces de creditor/deutor estructurades.","How it works":"Com funciona","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntes freqüents","Limits and accuracy":"Límits i precisió","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Aquesta és una eina de documentació local, no un servei bancari ni una certificació. No pot confirmar qui és el propietari d'un IBAN, si un compte està obert o si s'acceptarà un pagament. Imprimiu a 100% / Mida real i mesureu la línia de comprovació 100 mm abans d'utilitzar una ordre de pagament en paper.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN del creditor o QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"A pagar a · creditor","Account holder / creditor name":"Nom del titular del compte/del creditor","Street or P.O. box":"Carrer o P.O. caixa","Building number":"Número d'edifici","Postal code":"Codi postal","Town / city":"Poble / ciutat","2-letter country code":"Codi de país amb lletra 2","Amount (optional)":"Quant (opcional)","Currency":"Moneda","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"A pagar per · deutor facultatiu","Debtor name":"Nom del deutor","Reference type":"Tipus de referència","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Referència QR · Només QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Referència del creditor · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Sense referència estructurada · IBAN","Reference":"Referència","Unstructured message":"Missatge no estructurat","Billing information (optional)":"Informació de facturació (opcional)","Create QR-bill":"Crea una factura QR","Load SIX sample":"Carrega SIS mostres","Clear form":"Formulari clar","Check QR payload":"Comprova la càrrega útil QR","Download payment data":"Baixa dades de pagament","Download QR SVG":"Descarregueu QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Imprimir/desar com a PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Llegeix una imatge de codi QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Trieu PNG o JPEG","Read image locally":"Llegeix la imatge localment","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Enganxa les dades de pagament del codi QR suís","Invoice details":"Detalls de la factura","QR-bill preview":"Previsualització de la factura QR","Receipt":"Rebut","Payment part":"Peça de pagament","Payable to":"A pagar a","Payable by":"A pagar per","Account":"Compte","Additional information":"Informació addicional","Currency / amount":"Moneda/import","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Comprovació d'escala d'impressió · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIS · Estàndard suís de factura QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-factura llest. Els detalls es van quedar en aquest dispositiu.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Alguns camps s'han de comprovar. Revisa la informació destacada.","Reading this image on your device…":"Llegint aquesta imatge al dispositiu...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Codi QR suís llegit i comprovat localment.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"No s'ha trobat cap codi QR llegible en aquesta imatge.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Les dades del codi QR suís són vàlides per als camps admesos.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Les dades no són una càrrega útil de pagament de codi QR suís vàlida.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formulari i vista prèvia esborrats.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"S'han carregat SIS mostres. Substituïu els detalls de la mostra abans de l'ús real.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Creeu o llegiu primer una factura QR vàlida.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Trieu un PNG o JPEG de 10 MiB o menys.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"No s'ha pogut carregar el lector QR local. En el seu lloc, podeu enganxar les dades de pagament.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Quines combinacions d'IBAN i de referència es permeten?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Un QR-IBAN utilitza una referència QRR. Un IBAN suís normal utilitza SCOR o cap referència estructurada (NON). QRR només és per a factures de CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Això comprova que el compte existeix o pertany al creditor?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Núm. Comprova només el format i la suma de comprovació IBAN. No es posa en contacte amb un banc o registre de comptes.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Puc imprimir això a qualsevol escala?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Per a una comanda de pagament en paper, imprimiu a 100% / Mida real. La part de pagament ha de ser A6 horitzontal (148 × 105 mm); comproveu la línia 100 mm amb un regle.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"L'eina envia dades de factura a qualsevol lloc?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Núm. La generació i la lectura d'imatges es produeixen al vostre navegador. No s'utilitza cap compte ni servei de pagament.","Grade Scale Generator":"Generador d'escala de graus","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Generador d'escala de graus — Eina gratuïta de punts a qualificació","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Converteix els punts en percentatges i qualificacions amb els teus propis llindars. Previsualitzeu l'escala completa, copieu-la o exporteu-la i imprimiu un full de qualificació.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Crea una escala de qualificació transparent per a un examen o tasca. Establir els punts màxims i el percentatge mínim per a cada nota; l'escala no assumeix una norma de qualificació escolar o nacional.","Points earned":"Punts guanyats","Maximum points":"Màxim de punts","Top grade label":"Etiqueta de grau superior","Top grade starts at (%)":"El grau superior comença a (%)","Middle grade label":"Etiqueta de grau mitjà","Middle grade starts at (%)":"El grau mitjà comença a (%)","Lowest grade label":"Etiqueta de grau més baix","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"La nota més baixa comença a (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Amb un màxim de punts 50, 45 punts són iguals a 90%. Els vostres llindars personalitzats decideixen l'etiqueta de qualificació.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Utilitza una política de qualificació oficial?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Núm. Tu estableixes els llindars. Els sistemes de qualificació difereixen segons l'escola, el curs i el país; confirmeu l'escala que s'espera que utilitzeu.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Puc exportar les bandes de classificació?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Sí. Exporteu les bandes mostrades com a fitxer CSV o imprimiu l'escala."},"de":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Norwegen-Urlaubsgeldrechner","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Urlaubsgeldrechner für Norwegen – Kostenlose Bruttoschätzung","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Schätzen Sie das norwegische Urlaubsgeld anhand Ihrer Urlaubsgeldbasis. Vergleichen Sie gängige Tarife für Standardurlaub, eine fünfte Woche und Mitarbeiter im Alter von 60 oder älter.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Geben Sie die auf Ihrer Gehaltsabrechnung angegebene Ferienpauschale ein. Vergleichen Sie die üblichen norwegischen Bruttourlaubsentgeltsätze für Ihr Alter und die vereinbarte Urlaubsdauer.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Urlaubsgeldbasis (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Ich bin im Ferienjahr 60 oder älter","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Mein Vertrag beinhaltet eine fünfte Urlaubswoche","Estimated holiday pay":"Geschätztes Urlaubsgeld","Rate used":"Verwendeter Tarif","Basis used":"Verwendete Basis","Reset choices":"Auswahl zurücksetzen","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Nur Bruttoschätzung. Urlaubsgeld ist steuerpflichtiges Einkommen; Der Steuereinbehalt kann je nach Person und Gehaltsabrechnung variieren.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Bei einer NOK 500,000-Basis ergibt 10.2 % NOK 51,000 vor etwaigen Gehaltsabrechnungsanpassungen.","Which rate should I use?":"Welchen Tarif soll ich verwenden?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Die Schätzung verwendet gemeinsame Mindestsätze: 10.2 % oder 12 % mit einer fünften Woche; 12.5% oder 14.3% für Mitarbeiter im Alter von 60 oder älter. Ihre Vereinbarung kann mehr bringen.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Ist das der gezahlte Betrag nach Steuern?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Nr. Dies ist eine grobe Schätzung. Urlaubsgeld ist steuerpflichtiges Einkommen; Die Einbehaltung hängt von Ihren Umständen und Ihrer Gehaltsabrechnung ab.","What belongs in the basis?":"Was gehört in die Basis?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Verwenden Sie das feriepengegrunnlag auf Ihrer Gehaltsabrechnung oder Jahresabrechnung. Einige Rückerstattungen und andere Zahlungen sind durch die Regeln ausgeschlossen.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Norwegischer Einkommensteuerrechner","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Norwegischer Steuerrechner 2026 – Kostenlose Gehalts- und Rentenschätzung","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Schätzung 2026 Norwegische Einkommenssteuer auf Standardgehalt oder Altersrente für das ganze Jahr. Sehen Sie sich das Jahres- und Monatsnettogehalt sowie die Steuerbestandteile an und vergleichen Sie zwei Szenarien.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Schätzung 2026 Norwegische Einkommenssteuer für ein normales Einwohnergehalt oder eine ganzjährige Altersrente. Sehen Sie sich die wichtigsten Steuerkomponenten an und vergleichen Sie zwei Bruttoeinkommensszenarien.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Der Rechner wendet 2026 Standardabzüge, die fünf progressiven Steuerklassen und Sozialversicherungsbeiträge an. Der Rentenmodus beinhaltet die Rentensteuergutschrift nur für eine ganzjährige, 100 % qualifizierende Altersrente oder anspruchsberechtigte AFP. Es läuft vollständig in diesem Browser.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Vergleichen Sie für ein Gehalt von NOK 600,000 die geschätzte jährliche Steuer und den Nettolohn mit einem anderen Gehalt oder einem ganzjährigen Rentenbetrag.","Tax year":"Steuerjahr","Scenario":"Szenario","Salary":"Gehalt","Full-year old-age pension":"Volljährige Altersrente","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Bruttojahreseinkommen (NOK)","Tax zone":"Steuerzone","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Standardtarif (größter Teil Norwegens)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / aufgeführte Maßnahmenzonengemeinden","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Bei der Rentenschätzung wird für alle 12 Monate eine anspruchsberechtigte Altersrente oder AFP in Höhe von 100 % angenommen, ohne weiteres Einkommen.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Bei der Gehaltsschätzung wird ein normaler steuerlicher Wohnsitz in Norwegen, das Alter 17–69 und kein anderes Einkommen vorausgesetzt.","Compare two scenarios":"Vergleichen Sie zwei Szenarios","Scenario 1":"Szenario 1","Scenario 2":"Szenario 2","Calculate estimate":"Schätzung berechnen","Estimated tax per year":"Geschätzte Steuer pro Jahr","Average tax per month":"Durchschnittliche Steuer pro Monat","Estimated net per year":"Geschätzter Nettowert pro Jahr","Average net per month":"Durchschnittliches Netto pro Monat","Tax on ordinary income":"Steuer auf ordentliches Einkommen","Bracket tax":"Klammersteuer","National insurance contribution":"Sozialversicherungsbeitrag","Pension tax credit":"Rentensteuergutschrift","Estimated effective rate":"Geschätzte effektive Rate","Standard deduction base":"Standard-Abzugsbasis","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Sätze und Schwellenwerte gelten für das Einkommensjahr 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Nur eine Schätzung, keine offizielle Steuerberechnung oder Steuerkarte. Andere Einkünfte, Abzüge, Alter, Wohnort, Rentenstufe und persönliche Umstände können das Ergebnis verändern.","Reset values":"Werte zurücksetzen","Example":"Beispiel","How the estimate works":"So funktioniert die Schätzung","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Ist das genau meine Steuerrechnung oder der Quellensteuerabzug?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Nr. Es wird eine jährliche Standardsteuer von 2026 geschätzt. Eine Steuerkarte, eine endgültige Veranlagung und ein Quellensteuerabzug können aufgrund Ihres gesamten Einkommens, Ihrer Abzüge und Ihrer Umstände unterschiedlich sein.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Kann ich hier Gehalt und Rente kombinieren?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Diese Version schätzt jeweils eine Einkommensart. Es wird kein gemischter Gehalts- und Rentenfall berechnet.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Deckt der Rentenmodus jede Rente ab?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Nr. Die Rentengutschrift wird nur für eine anspruchsberechtigte Altersrente oder einen anspruchsberechtigten AFP in Höhe von 100 % im Laufe des Jahres modelliert. Teiljährige oder gestaffelte Renten sowie andere Rentenarten fallen nicht in den Geltungsbereich.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Was ist die Option „measures-zone“?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Es werden der veröffentlichte Normaleinkommenssatz 18.5 % und der Sonderabzug NOK 45,000 für Finnmark und die aufgeführten Gemeinden angewendet. Bestätigen Sie, dass Ihre Gemeinde qualifiziert ist.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Norwegischer Vermögenssteuerrechner","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Norwegischer Vermögenssteuerrechner 2026 – Kostenlose Schätzung","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Schätzung 2026 Norwegische Vermögenssteuer auf Eigenheime, Aktien, Geschäftsvermögen, Bargeld und Schulden. Sehen Sie sich die staatliche und kommunale Aufteilung, Bewertungsabschläge und eine Wertsensitivitätsspanne an.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Schätzung der norwegischen Privatvermögenssteuer für 2026. Geben Sie geschätzte Marktwerte für Häuser und Steuerbemessungsgrundlagen vor Abzug für Aktien und Unternehmensvermögen ein. Sehen Sie sich Bewertungsabschläge, Schuldenanpassungen und separate staatliche und kommunale Schätzungen an.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Für die Schätzung gelten die Bewertungsregeln 2026 und der maximale kommunale Steuersatz, es sei denn, Sie geben einen niedrigeren Steuersatz ein. Die Schulden werden nach dem vollen Vermögenswert vor Abschlägen aufgeteilt; Die auf diskontierte Anteile oder Betriebsvermögen entfallenden Schulden werden um denselben Disagio gemindert. Immobilienbewertungen, Förderfähigkeit und persönliche Steuerfakten können das offizielle Ergebnis verändern.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Ein Hauptwohnsitz mit einem Marktwert von NOK 10 Millionen hat nach der 2026-Hauptwohnsitzregel einen geschätzten Vermögenswert von NOK 2.5 Millionen, vor Schulden und dem persönlichen Freibetrag.","2026 tax year":"2026 Steuerjahr","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Geschätzter Marktwert des Haupthauses (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Geschätzter Marktwert von Zweitwohnungen (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Aktien und Aktienfonds vor Rabatt (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Zulässige Betriebsvermögenswerte vor Rabatt (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Bankeinlagen und andere Vermögenswerte (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Gesamtschulden (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Wir werden gemeinsam für unser Vermögen besteuert","Municipal rate (%)":"Kommunalsatz (%)","Home-value comparison":"Hauswertvergleich","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Schätzung der Vermögenssteuer","Export CSV":"CSV exportieren","Print estimate":"Kostenvoranschlag drucken","Assets before discounts":"Vermögenswerte vor Rabatten","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Steuerpflichtiger Vermögenswert nach Abschlägen","Debt reduction from discounts":"Schuldenreduzierung durch Rabatte","Deductible debt estimate":"Schätzung der abzugsfähigen Schulden","Estimated net wealth":"Geschätztes Nettovermögen","Personal allowance":"Persönlicher Zuschuss","Taxable net wealth":"Steuerpflichtiges Nettovermögen","Municipal wealth tax":"Kommunale Vermögenssteuer","State wealth tax":"Staatliche Vermögenssteuer","State tax, first band":"Staatssteuer, erstes Band","State tax, upper band":"Staatssteuer, oberes Band","Estimated total wealth tax":"Geschätzte Gesamtvermögenssteuer","Lower home-value estimate":"Niedrigere Hauswertschätzung","Current-value estimate":"Aktuelle Wertschätzung","Higher home-value estimate":"Höhere Hauswertschätzung","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 Regeln und Annahmen","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Nur Schätzung. Hierbei handelt es sich nicht um einen amtlichen Steuerbescheid oder eine Steuerberatung. Verwenden Sie Ihre Steuererklärungswerte, sofern verfügbar; Zinssätze, Anspruchsberechtigung, Schuldenaufteilung und Immobilienwerte können in Ihrem Fall unterschiedlich sein.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Häuser: Geben Sie den geschätzten Marktwert am Jahresende ein. Aktien und zulässige Unternehmensvermögenswerte: Geben Sie den Wert vor dem 2026-Rabatt ein, nicht den Marktwert, es sei denn, dies ist die korrekte Steuerbasis.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Der Freibetrag und die staatliche Obergrenze verdoppeln sich nur für Ehegatten, eingetragene Partner oder qualifizierte Lebenspartner, deren gemeinsames Vermögen gemeinsam veranlagt wird.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Die kommunale Berechnung verwendet den ausgewählten Satz und standardmäßig den 2026-Maximum von 0.35 %. Einige Gemeinden wenden möglicherweise einen niedrigeren Satz an.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Sensitivität ändert nur die eingegebenen Werte von Haupt- und Nebenhäusern. Es handelt sich um einen Vergleich, nicht um die Vorhersage einer offiziellen Bewertung.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Wie hoch ist der Vermögensteuerfreibetrag 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Der Standardschwellenwert beträgt NOK 1.9 Millionen für eine Person und NOK 3.8 Millionen für gemeinsam veranlagte Ehegatten oder qualifizierte Partner.","How is my primary home valued?":"Wie wird mein Hauptwohnsitz bewertet?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Für 2026 beträgt der geschätzte Vermögenswert 25 % des Marktwerts bis zu NOK 14 Millionen, plus 70 % des Betrags über NOK 14 Millionen.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Gibt dies einen Rabatt auf ein Zweitwohnsitz?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Nr. Die Tabelle 2026 gewährt Zweitwohnungen einen Bewertungsrabatt von 0 %. Als Schätzung dient der eingegebene Marktwert; Offizielle Schätzwerte können abweichen.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Warum ändern sich die abzugsfähigen Schulden, wenn ich Anteile oder Unternehmensvermögen besitze?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Die norwegischen Vorschriften weisen Schulden proportional zum gesamten Vermögenswert zu. Der auf Vermögenswerte mit Bewertungsabschlägen entfallende Anteil wird um denselben Abzinsungssatz gekürzt.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Ist der kommunale Steuersatz immer 0.35 %?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Nr. 0.35 % ist das standardmäßig verwendete Maximum von 2026. Eine Gemeinde kann einen niedrigeren Satz festlegen, den Sie eingeben können.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Deckt der Rechner jeden Vermögens- oder Steuerfall ab?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Nr. Es werden Eigenheime, Aktien, ausgewählte geeignete Unternehmensvermögenswerte, Bargeld und die Gesamtverschuldung geschätzt. Ausländische Vermögenswerte, Renten, komplexe Eigentumsverhältnisse, Befreiungen und andere Sonderregelungen können Ihre Einschätzung ändern.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Schweizer QR-Rechnungsgenerator","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Schweizer QR-Rechnungsgenerator – Kostenloser QR-Rechnungsersteller","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Erstellen und prüfen Sie lokal eine Schweizer QR-Rechnung. Validieren Sie IBAN-, QR-IBAN-, QRR- und SCOR-Referenzen; Drucken Sie den Zahlungsteil A6 und den Beleg aus, ohne Rechnungsdaten hochzuladen.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Erstellen Sie einen Schweizer Einzahlungsschein mit einem Schweizer QR-Code. Ihre Rechnungsdetails bleiben in diesem Browser; Es wird keine Zahlung veranlasst und keine Bankregisterabfrage durchgeführt.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Das Tool erstellt die Daten des SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) und überprüft deren Felder, Konto-/Referenzkombination, IBAN-Prüfziffern und unterstützte Zeichen. Es formatiert den Zahlungsteil und den Beleg für den Druck in der erforderlichen physischen Größe.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX Beispiel: eine QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, eine 27-stellige QRR-Referenz und strukturierte Gläubiger-/Schuldneradressen.","How it works":"Wie es funktioniert","Frequently asked questions":"Häufig gestellte Fragen","Limits and accuracy":"Grenzwerte und Genauigkeit","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Dies ist ein lokales Dokumententool, kein Bankdienst oder eine Zertifizierung. Es kann nicht bestätigt werden, wer eine IBAN besitzt, ob ein Konto eröffnet ist oder ob eine Zahlung akzeptiert wird. Drucken Sie in 100% / tatsächlicher Größe und messen Sie die Kontrolllinie 100 mm, bevor Sie einen Papierzahlungsauftrag verwenden.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Gläubiger-IBAN oder QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Zahlbar an · Gläubiger","Account holder / creditor name":"Name des Kontoinhabers/Gläubigers","Street or P.O. box":"Straße oder Postfach Box","Building number":"Gebäudenummer","Postal code":"Postleitzahl","Town / city":"Stadt","2-letter country code":"2-Buchstaben-Ländercode","Amount (optional)":"Betrag (optional)","Currency":"Währung","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Zahlbar durch · optionalen Schuldner","Debtor name":"Name des Schuldners","Reference type":"Referenztyp","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR-Referenz · Nur QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Gläubigerreferenz · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Keine strukturierte Referenz · IBAN","Reference":"Referenz","Unstructured message":"Unstrukturierte Nachricht","Billing information (optional)":"Rechnungsinformationen (optional)","Create QR-bill":"QR-Rechnung erstellen","Load SIX sample":"SIX Probe laden","Clear form":"Klares Formular","Check QR payload":"QR-Nutzlast prüfen","Download payment data":"Zahlungsdaten herunterladen","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG herunterladen","Print / save as PDF":"Drucken / als PDF speichern","Read a QR Code image":"Ein QR-Code-Bild lesen","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Wählen Sie PNG oder JPEG","Read image locally":"Bild lokal lesen","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Swiss QR Code-Zahlungsdaten einfügen","Invoice details":"Rechnungsdetails","QR-bill preview":"QR-Rechnungsvorschau","Receipt":"Quittung","Payment part":"Zahlungsteil","Payable to":"Zahlbar an","Payable by":"Zahlbar bis","Account":"Konto","Additional information":"Zusätzliche Informationen","Currency / amount":"Währung/Betrag","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Skalenprüfung drucken · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Schweizer QR-Rechnung-Standard","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-Rechnung bereit. Details blieben auf diesem Gerät.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Einige Felder müssen überprüft werden. Überprüfen Sie die hervorgehobenen Informationen.","Reading this image on your device…":"Dieses Bild wird auf Ihrem Gerät gelesen…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Swiss QR Code vor Ort gelesen und geprüft.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"In diesem Bild wurde kein lesbarer QR-Code gefunden.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Swiss QR Code-Daten sind für die unterstützten Felder gültig.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Die Daten sind keine gültige Schweizer QR-Code-Zahlungsnutzlast.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formular und Vorschau gelöscht.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX Beispiel geladen. Ersetzen Sie die Musterdetails vor dem tatsächlichen Gebrauch.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Erstellen oder lesen Sie zuerst eine gültige QR-Rechnung.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Wählen Sie ein PNG oder JPEG mit 10 MiB oder weniger.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Der lokale QR-Reader konnte nicht geladen werden. Sie können stattdessen die Zahlungsdaten einfügen.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Welche IBAN- und Referenzkombinationen sind erlaubt?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Eine QR-IBAN verwendet eine QRR-Referenz. Eine normale Schweizer IBAN verwendet SCOR oder keine strukturierte Referenz (NON). QRR gilt nur für CHF-Rechnungen.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Wird dadurch überprüft, ob das Konto existiert oder dem Gläubiger gehört?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Nr. Es überprüft nur das Format und die IBAN-Prüfsumme. Es wird keine Verbindung zu einer Bank oder einem Kontoregister hergestellt.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Kann ich das in jedem Maßstab drucken?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Für einen Zahlungsauftrag auf Papier drucken Sie im Format 100 % / Tatsächliche Größe aus. Der Zahlteil muss A6 Querformat sein (148 × 105 mm); Überprüfen Sie die mm-Linie 100 mit einem Lineal.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Sendet das Tool Rechnungsdaten irgendwohin?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Nr. Die Generierung und das Lesen der Bilder erfolgen in Ihrem Browser. Es wird kein Konto oder Zahlungsdienst genutzt.","Grade Scale Generator":"Generator für Notenskalen","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Notenskalengenerator – kostenloses Points-to-Grade-Tool","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Wandeln Sie Punkte mit Ihren eigenen Schwellenwerten in Prozentsätze und Noten um. Sehen Sie sich den gesamten Maßstab in der Vorschau an, kopieren oder exportieren Sie ihn und drucken Sie einen Bewertungsbogen aus.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Erstellen Sie eine transparente Bewertungsskala für eine Prüfung oder Aufgabe. Legen Sie die Höchstpunktzahl und den Mindestprozentsatz für jede Note fest; Die Skala geht nicht von einer schulischen oder nationalen Bewertungsregel aus.","Points earned":"Gesammelte Punkte","Maximum points":"Maximale Punktzahl","Top grade label":"Bestnote-Label","Top grade starts at (%)":"Bestnote beginnt bei (%)","Middle grade label":"Etikett Mittelklasse","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Mittelstufe beginnt bei (%)","Lowest grade label":"Label mit der niedrigsten Note","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Niedrigster Grad beginnt bei (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Bei einem Maximum von 50-Punkten entsprechen 45-Punkte 90 %. Ihre benutzerdefinierten Schwellenwerte bestimmen die Notenbezeichnung.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Wird hier eine offizielle Bewertungsrichtlinie verwendet?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Nr. Sie legen die Schwellenwerte fest. Die Bewertungssysteme unterscheiden sich je nach Schule, Kurs und Land. Bestätigen Sie die Skala, die Sie voraussichtlich verwenden werden.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Kann ich die Bewertungsbänder exportieren?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ja. Exportieren Sie die angezeigten Bänder als CSV-Datei oder drucken Sie die Skala aus."},"el":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Υπολογιστής πληρωμής διακοπών Νορβηγίας","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Αριθμομηχανή πληρωμής διακοπών Νορβηγίας — Δωρεάν ακαθάριστη εκτίμηση","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Υπολογίστε τις νορβηγικές αποδοχές διακοπών από τη βάση των αποδοχών σας. Συγκρίνετε τα κοινά ποσοστά για την τυπική άδεια, την πέμπτη εβδομάδα και τους υπαλλήλους ηλικίας 60 και άνω.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Εισαγάγετε το feriepengegrunnlag που εμφανίζεται στο δελτίο πληρωμών σας. Συγκρίνετε τα κοινά νορβηγικά ακαθάριστα ποσοστά διακοπών για την ηλικία σας και τη συμφωνημένη διάρκεια διακοπών.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Βάση πληρωμής διακοπών (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Είμαι 60 ή μεγαλύτερος το έτος διακοπών","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Η συμφωνία μου περιλαμβάνει μια πέμπτη εβδομάδα διακοπών","Estimated holiday pay":"Εκτιμώμενη αμοιβή διακοπών","Rate used":"Χρησιμοποιημένη τιμή","Basis used":"Βάση που χρησιμοποιείται","Reset choices":"Επαναφορά επιλογών","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Μόνο ακαθάριστη εκτίμηση. Οι αποδοχές διακοπών είναι φορολογητέο εισόδημα. Η παρακράτηση φόρου μπορεί να διαφέρει ανά άτομο και μισθοδοσία.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Με βάση NOK 500,000, το 10.2% δίνει NOK 51,000 πριν από οποιεσδήποτε προσαρμογές μισθοδοσίας.","Which rate should I use?":"Ποια τιμή να χρησιμοποιήσω;","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Η εκτίμηση χρησιμοποιεί κοινές ελάχιστες τιμές: 10.2% ή 12% με μια πέμπτη εβδομάδα. 12.5% ή 14.3% για υπαλλήλους ηλικίας 60 και άνω. Η συμφωνία σας μπορεί να δώσει περισσότερα.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Είναι το ποσό που καταβάλλεται μετά από φόρους;","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Αρ. Αυτή είναι μια ακαθάριστη εκτίμηση. Οι αποδοχές διακοπών είναι φορολογητέο εισόδημα. Η παρακράτηση εξαρτάται από τις περιστάσεις και τη μισθοδοσία σας.","What belongs in the basis?":"Τι ανήκει στη βάση;","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε το feriepengegrunnlag στο δελτίο πληρωμής ή στην ετήσια δήλωση. Ορισμένες επιστροφές και άλλες πληρωμές εξαιρούνται από τους κανόνες.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Υπολογιστής φόρου εισοδήματος Νορβηγίας","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Υπολογιστής φόρου Νορβηγίας 2026 — Δωρεάν εκτίμηση μισθού και συντάξεων","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Υπολογισμός 2026 Νορβηγικός φόρος εισοδήματος σε κανονικό μισθό ή σύνταξη γήρατος πλήρους έτους. Δείτε ετήσιες και μηνιαίες καθαρές αποδοχές, φορολογικά στοιχεία και συγκρίνετε δύο σενάρια.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Υπολογίστε 2026 Νορβηγικό φόρο εισοδήματος για κανονικό μισθό κατοίκου ή σύνταξη γήρατος πλήρους έτους. Δείτε τις κύριες φορολογικές συνιστώσες και συγκρίνετε δύο σενάρια ακαθάριστου εισοδήματος.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Η αριθμομηχανή εφαρμόζει τυπικές μειώσεις 2026, τις πέντε προοδευτικές ζώνες φόρου και τις εθνικές ασφαλιστικές εισφορές. Η λειτουργία σύνταξης περιλαμβάνει την πίστωση φόρου σύνταξης μόνο για ένα πλήρες έτος, 100% που πληροί τις προϋποθέσεις για σύνταξη γήρατος ή επιλέξιμο AFP. Εκτελείται εξ ολοκλήρου σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Για μισθό NOK 600,000, συγκρίνετε τον εκτιμώμενο ετήσιο φόρο και την καθαρή αμοιβή με έναν άλλο μισθό ή ένα ποσό σύνταξης πλήρους έτους.","Tax year":"Φορολογικό έτος","Scenario":"Σενάριο","Salary":"Μισθός","Full-year old-age pension":"Σύνταξη γήρατος πλήρους έτους","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Μικτό ετήσιο εισόδημα (NOK)","Tax zone":"Φορολογική ζώνη","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Τυπική τιμή (το μεγαλύτερο μέρος της Νορβηγίας)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Φινλανδικό μάρκο / καταγεγραμμένοι δήμοι της ζώνης μέτρων","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Η εκτίμηση της σύνταξης προϋποθέτει επιλέξιμη σύνταξη γήρατος ή AFP σε 100% για όλους τους 12 μήνες, χωρίς άλλο εισόδημα.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Η εκτίμηση του μισθού προϋποθέτει τη συνήθη φορολογική κατοικία της Νορβηγίας, την ηλικία 17–69 και κανένα άλλο εισόδημα.","Compare two scenarios":"Συγκρίνετε δύο σενάρια","Scenario 1":"Σενάριο 1","Scenario 2":"Σενάριο 2","Calculate estimate":"Υπολογισμός εκτίμησης","Estimated tax per year":"Εκτιμώμενος φόρος ανά έτος","Average tax per month":"Μέσος φόρος ανά μήνα","Estimated net per year":"Εκτιμώμενο καθαρό ανά έτος","Average net per month":"Μέσος όρος καθαρού ανά μήνα","Tax on ordinary income":"Φόρος στο κοινό εισόδημα","Bracket tax":"Φόρος παρένθεσης","National insurance contribution":"Εθνική ασφαλιστική εισφορά","Pension tax credit":"Πίστωση φόρου συντάξεων","Estimated effective rate":"Εκτιμώμενο πραγματικό ποσοστό","Standard deduction base":"Τυπική βάση έκπτωσης","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Τα ποσοστά και τα κατώτατα όρια είναι για το έτος εισοδήματος 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Μόνο εκτίμηση, όχι επίσημος υπολογισμός φόρου ή φορολογική κάρτα. Άλλα εισοδήματα, κρατήσεις, ηλικία, κατοικία, βαθμός σύνταξης και προσωπικές συνθήκες μπορούν να αλλάξουν το αποτέλεσμα.","Reset values":"Επαναφορά τιμών","Example":"Παράδειγμα","How the estimate works":"Πώς λειτουργεί η εκτίμηση","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Αυτή είναι η ακριβής μου παρακράτηση φόρου ή φορολογικής κάρτας;","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Αρ. Υπολογίζει τον τυπικό ετήσιο φόρο 2026. Η φορολογική κάρτα, η τελική εκτίμηση και η παρακράτηση μπορεί να διαφέρουν λόγω του πλήρους εισοδήματός σας, των κρατήσεων και των περιστάσεων.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Μπορώ να συνδυάσω μισθό και σύνταξη εδώ;","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Αυτή η έκδοση υπολογίζει έναν τύπο εισοδήματος τη φορά. Δεν υπολογίζει μικτή περίπτωση μισθού και σύνταξης.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Η λειτουργία σύνταξης καλύπτει κάθε σύνταξη;","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Αρ. Η πίστωση σύνταξης διαμορφώνεται μόνο για επιλέξιμη σύνταξη γήρατος ή επιλέξιμο AFP που λαμβάνεται σε 100% καθ' όλη τη διάρκεια του έτους. Η μερική ή κλιμακωτή σύνταξη και άλλα είδη συντάξεων δεν εμπίπτουν στο πεδίο εφαρμογής.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Ποια είναι η επιλογή ζώνης μέτρων;","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Εφαρμόζει το δημοσιευμένο επιτόκιο συνήθους εισοδήματος 18.5 και την ειδική έκπτωση NOK 45,000 για τη Finnmark και τους αναφερόμενους δήμους. Επιβεβαιώστε ότι ο δήμος σας πληροί τις προϋποθέσεις.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Υπολογιστής φόρου περιουσίας της Νορβηγίας","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Υπολογιστής φόρου περιουσίας της Νορβηγίας 2026 — Δωρεάν εκτίμηση","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Υπολογίστε 2026 Νορβηγικό φόρο περιουσίας από κατοικίες, μετοχές, περιουσιακά στοιχεία επιχειρήσεων, μετρητά και χρέη. Δείτε τη διάσπαση του κράτους και του δήμου, τις εκπτώσεις αποτίμησης και ένα εύρος ευαισθησίας αξίας.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Υπολογίστε τον προσωπικό νορβηγικό φόρο περιουσίας για 2026. Εισαγάγετε τις εκτιμώμενες αγοραίες αξίες για κατοικίες και τις φορολογικές βάσεις πριν από την έκπτωση για μετοχές και εταιρικά περιουσιακά στοιχεία. Δείτε εκπτώσεις αποτίμησης, προσαρμογή χρέους και ξεχωριστές κρατικές και δημοτικές εκτιμήσεις.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Η εκτίμηση ισχύει 2026 κανόνες αποτίμησης και τον μέγιστο δημοτικό συντελεστή, εκτός και αν εισαγάγετε χαμηλότερο συντελεστή. Το χρέος κατανέμεται με πλήρεις αξίες ενεργητικού πριν από τις εκπτώσεις. Το χρέος που εκχωρείται σε προεξοφλημένες μετοχές ή εταιρικά περιουσιακά στοιχεία μειώνεται κατά την ίδια έκπτωση. Οι αποτιμήσεις ακινήτων, η επιλεξιμότητα και τα προσωπικά δεδομένα φόρου μπορούν να αλλάξουν το επίσημο αποτέλεσμα.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Μια κύρια κατοικία με αγοραία αξία NOK 10 εκατομμυρίων NOK έχει εκτιμώμενη αξία πλούτου NOK 2.5 εκατομμυρίων NOK σύμφωνα με τον κανόνα της κύριας κατοικίας 2026, πριν από το χρέος και το προσωπικό επίδομα.","2026 tax year":"2026 φορολογικό έτος","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Εκτιμώμενη αγοραία αξία κύριας κατοικίας (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Εκτιμώμενη αγοραία αξία δευτερευουσών κατοικιών (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Μετοχές και μετοχές πριν από την έκπτωση (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Επιλέξιμα επιχειρηματικά περιουσιακά στοιχεία πριν από την έκπτωση (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Τραπεζικές καταθέσεις και άλλα περιουσιακά στοιχεία (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Συνολικό χρέος (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Φορολογούμαστε από κοινού για τον πλούτο","Municipal rate (%)":"Δημοτικό ποσοστό (%)","Home-value comparison":"Σύγκριση αρχικής αξίας","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Υπολογισμός φόρου περιουσίας","Export CSV":"Εξαγωγή CSV","Print estimate":"Εκτύπωση εκτίμησης","Assets before discounts":"Περιουσιακά στοιχεία πριν από τις εκπτώσεις","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Φορολογητέα αξία ενεργητικού μετά τις εκπτώσεις","Debt reduction from discounts":"Μείωση χρέους από εκπτώσεις","Deductible debt estimate":"Εκτιμώμενη οφειλή","Estimated net wealth":"Εκτιμώμενος καθαρός πλούτος","Personal allowance":"Προσωπικό επίδομα","Taxable net wealth":"Φορολογητέα καθαρή περιουσία","Municipal wealth tax":"Δημοτικός φόρος περιουσίας","State wealth tax":"Κρατικός φόρος περιουσίας","State tax, first band":"Κρατικός φόρος, πρώτη ζώνη","State tax, upper band":"Κρατικός φόρος, άνω ζώνη","Estimated total wealth tax":"Εκτιμώμενος συνολικός φόρος περιουσίας","Lower home-value estimate":"Χαμηλότερη εκτίμηση της αρχικής αξίας","Current-value estimate":"Εκτίμηση τρέχουσας αξίας","Higher home-value estimate":"Υψηλότερη εκτίμηση οικιακής αξίας","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 κανόνες και υποθέσεις","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Μόνο εκτίμηση. Δεν πρόκειται για επίσημη φορολογική εκτίμηση ή φορολογική συμβουλή. Χρησιμοποιήστε τις αξίες της φορολογικής σας δήλωσης όπου είναι διαθέσιμες. τα ποσοστά, η επιλεξιμότητα, η κατανομή του χρέους και οι αξίες των ακινήτων ενδέχεται να διαφέρουν στην περίπτωσή σας.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Σπίτια: καταχωρίστε την εκτιμώμενη αγοραία αξία στο τέλος του έτους. Μερίδια και επιλέξιμα περιουσιακά στοιχεία της επιχείρησης: εισαγάγετε την αξία πριν από την έκπτωση 2026, όχι την αγοραία αξία, εκτός εάν αυτή είναι η σωστή φορολογική βάση.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Το επίδομα και το ανώτατο όριο του κράτους διπλασιάζονται μόνο για τους συζύγους, τους εγγεγραμμένους συντρόφους ή τους δικαιούχους συμβιούχους που αξιολογούνται από κοινού για τη συνολική περιουσία τους.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Ο δημοτικός υπολογισμός χρησιμοποιεί τον επιλεγμένο συντελεστή, με προεπιλογή το μέγιστο 2026 του 0.35%. Ορισμένοι δήμοι ενδέχεται να χρησιμοποιούν χαμηλότερο συντελεστή.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Η ευαισθησία αλλάζει μόνο τις εισαγόμενες τιμές των πρωτογενών και δευτερευουσών κατοικιών. Είναι σύγκριση, όχι πρόβλεψη επίσημης αποτίμησης.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Τι είναι το επίδομα φόρου περιουσίας 2026;","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Το τυπικό όριο είναι NOK 1.9 εκατομμύρια για ένα άτομο και NOK 3.8 εκατομμύρια για τους συζύγους ή τους κατάλληλους συντρόφους που αξιολογούνται από κοινού.","How is my primary home valued?":"Πώς αποτιμάται το κύριο σπίτι μου;","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Για το 2026, η εκτιμώμενη αξία πλούτου είναι 25% της αγοραίας αξίας μέχρι 14 εκατ. NOK, συν το 70% του ποσού πάνω από το NOK 14 εκατ. NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Αυτό ισχύει έκπτωση σε δευτερεύουσα κατοικία;","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Αρ. Ο πίνακας 2026 δίνει στις δευτερεύουσες κατοικίες 0% έκπτωση αποτίμησης. Χρησιμοποιεί την εισαγόμενη αγοραία αξία ως εκτίμηση. Οι επίσημες αξιολογημένες τιμές μπορεί να διαφέρουν.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Γιατί αλλάζει το εκπεστέο χρέος όταν κατέχω μετοχές ή εταιρικά περιουσιακά στοιχεία;","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Οι νορβηγικοί κανόνες κατανέμουν το χρέος αναλογικά με πλήρεις αξίες ενεργητικού. Το τμήμα που αποδίδεται σε περιουσιακά στοιχεία με εκπτώσεις αποτίμησης μειώνεται κατά το ίδιο προεξοφλητικό επιτόκιο.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Ο δημοτικός συντελεστής είναι πάντα 0.35%;","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Αρ. Το 0.35% είναι το μέγιστο 2026 που χρησιμοποιείται από προεπιλογή. Ένας δήμος μπορεί να ορίσει χαμηλότερο συντελεστή, τον οποίο μπορείτε να εισαγάγετε.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Η αριθμομηχανή καλύπτει κάθε περιουσιακό στοιχείο ή φορολογική περίπτωση;","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Αρ. Εκτιμά κατοικίες, μετοχές, επιλεγμένα επιλέξιμα περιουσιακά στοιχεία επιχειρήσεων, μετρητά και συνολικό χρέος. Ξένα περιουσιακά στοιχεία, συντάξεις, συγκρότημα ιδιοκτησίας, εξαιρέσεις και άλλοι ειδικοί κανόνες ενδέχεται να αλλάξουν την αξιολόγησή σας.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Ελβετική γεννήτρια λογαριασμών QR","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Ελβετική γεννήτρια λογαριασμών QR — Δωρεάν Δημιουργός τιμολογίων QR","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Δημιουργήστε και ελέγξτε έναν ελβετικό λογαριασμό QR τοπικά. Επικύρωση παραπομπών IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR και SCOR. εκτυπώστε το τμήμα πληρωμής A6 και την απόδειξη χωρίς να ανεβάσετε δεδομένα τιμολογίου.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Δημιουργήστε ένα ελβετικό δελτίο πληρωμής με έναν ελβετικό κωδικό QR. Τα στοιχεία του τιμολογίου σας παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. δεν πραγματοποιείται πληρωμή και δεν ζητείται κανένα τραπεζικό μητρώο.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Το εργαλείο δημιουργεί τα δεδομένα SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) και ελέγχει τα πεδία, τον συνδυασμό λογαριασμού/αναφοράς, τα ψηφία ελέγχου IBAN και τους υποστηριζόμενους χαρακτήρες. Μορφοποιεί το μέρος πληρωμής και την απόδειξη για εκτύπωση στο απαιτούμενο φυσικό μέγεθος.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"ΕΞΙ παράδειγμα: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27-ψηφία αναφοράς QRR και δομημένες διευθύνσεις πιστωτή/οφειλέτη.","How it works":"Πώς λειτουργεί","Frequently asked questions":"Συχνές ερωτήσεις","Limits and accuracy":"Όρια και ακρίβεια","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Αυτό είναι ένα τοπικό εργαλείο εγγράφων, όχι μια τραπεζική υπηρεσία ή πιστοποίηση. Δεν μπορεί να επιβεβαιώσει ποιος είναι ο κάτοχος ενός IBAN, εάν ένας λογαριασμός είναι ανοιχτός ή εάν μια πληρωμή θα γίνει αποδεκτή. Εκτυπώστε σε 100% / Πραγματικό μέγεθος και μετρήστε τη γραμμή ελέγχου 100 mm πριν χρησιμοποιήσετε μια έντυπη εντολή πληρωμής.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Πιστωτής IBAN ή QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Πληρωμή σε · πιστωτή","Account holder / creditor name":"Όνομα κατόχου λογαριασμού / πιστωτή","Street or P.O. box":"Οδός ή Τ.Κ. κουτί","Building number":"Αριθμός κτιρίου","Postal code":"Ταχυδρομικός κώδικας","Town / city":"Πόλη / πόλη","2-letter country code":"2-γράμμα κωδικός χώρας","Amount (optional)":"Ποσό (προαιρετικό)","Currency":"Νόμισμα","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"ΕΥΡ","Payable by · optional debtor":"Πληρωμή από · προαιρετικός οφειλέτης","Debtor name":"Όνομα οφειλέτη","Reference type":"Τύπος αναφοράς","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Αναφορά QR · Μόνο QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Αναφορά πιστωτή · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Χωρίς δομημένη αναφορά · IBAN","Reference":"Αναφορά","Unstructured message":"Μη δομημένο μήνυμα","Billing information (optional)":"Στοιχεία χρέωσης (προαιρετικά)","Create QR-bill":"Δημιουργία λογαριασμού QR","Load SIX sample":"Φορτώστε ΕΞΙ δείγμα","Clear form":"Καθαρή φόρμα","Check QR payload":"Έλεγχος ωφέλιμου φορτίου QR","Download payment data":"Λήψη δεδομένων πληρωμής","Download QR SVG":"Λήψη QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Εκτύπωση / αποθήκευση ως PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Διαβάστε μια εικόνα με κωδικό QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Επιλέξτε PNG ή JPEG","Read image locally":"Διαβάστε τοπικά την εικόνα","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Επικολλήστε δεδομένα πληρωμής Swiss QR Code","Invoice details":"Στοιχεία τιμολογίου","QR-bill preview":"Προεπισκόπηση λογαριασμού QR","Receipt":"Απόδειξη","Payment part":"Μέρος πληρωμής","Payable to":"Πληρωμή σε","Payable by":"Πληρωμή από","Account":"Λογαριασμός","Additional information":"Πρόσθετες πληροφορίες","Currency / amount":"Νόμισμα / ποσό","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Έλεγχος κλίμακας εκτύπωσης · 100 mm\nΈτοιμος ο λογαριασμός","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Ελβετικό πρότυπο λογαριασμού QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR. Οι λεπτομέρειες παρέμειναν σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Μερικά πεδία χρειάζονται έλεγχο. Ελέγξτε τις επισημασμένες πληροφορίες.","Reading this image on your device…":"Διαβάζοντας αυτήν την εικόνα στη συσκευή σας…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Ο Ελβετικός κωδικός QR διαβάζεται και ελέγχεται τοπικά.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Δεν βρέθηκε αναγνώσιμος κωδικός QR σε αυτήν την εικόνα.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Τα δεδομένα του ελβετικού κωδικού QR είναι έγκυρα για τα υποστηριζόμενα πεδία.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Τα δεδομένα δεν είναι έγκυρο ωφέλιμο φορτίο πληρωμής με κωδικό QR της Ελβετίας.","Form and preview cleared.":"Η φόρμα και η προεπισκόπηση διαγράφηκαν.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"Φορτώθηκε έξι δείγματα. Αντικαταστήστε τα στοιχεία του δείγματός του πριν από την πραγματική χρήση.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Δημιουργήστε ή διαβάστε πρώτα έναν έγκυρο λογαριασμό QR.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Επιλέξτε PNG ή JPEG 10 MiB ή λιγότερο.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η φόρτωση του τοπικού αναγνώστη QR. Μπορείτε να επικολλήσετε τα δεδομένα πληρωμής.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Ποιοι συνδυασμοί IBAN και αναφοράς επιτρέπονται;","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Ένα QR-IBAN χρησιμοποιεί μια αναφορά QRR. Ένα κανονικό ελβετικό IBAN χρησιμοποιεί SCOR ή καμία δομημένη αναφορά (NON). Το QRR αφορά μόνο τιμολόγια CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Ελέγχει ότι ο λογαριασμός υπάρχει ή ανήκει στον πιστωτή;","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Αρ. Ελέγχει τη μορφή και το άθροισμα ελέγχου IBAN μόνο. Δεν επικοινωνεί με τράπεζα ή μητρώο λογαριασμών.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Μπορώ να το εκτυπώσω σε οποιαδήποτε κλίμακα;","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Για έντυπη εντολή πληρωμής, εκτυπώστε σε 100% / Πραγματικό μέγεθος. Το τμήμα πληρωμής πρέπει να είναι A6 τοπίο (148 × 105 mm). ελέγξτε τη γραμμή 100 mm με έναν χάρακα.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Στέλνει το εργαλείο πουθενά δεδομένα τιμολογίου;","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Αρ. Η δημιουργία και η ανάγνωση εικόνων συμβαίνουν στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας. Δεν χρησιμοποιείται λογαριασμός ή υπηρεσία πληρωμής.","Grade Scale Generator":"Γεννήτρια κλίμακας","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Γεννήτρια κλίμακας — Δωρεάν εργαλείο βαθμών","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Μετατρέψτε τους βαθμούς σε ποσοστά και βαθμούς με τα δικά σας όρια. Κάντε προεπισκόπηση της πλήρους κλίμακας, αντιγράψτε ή εξάγετε και εκτυπώστε ένα φύλλο βαθμολόγησης.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Δημιουργήστε μια διαφανή κλίμακα βαθμολόγησης για μια εξέταση ή μια εργασία. Ορίστε τους μέγιστους βαθμούς και το ελάχιστο ποσοστό για κάθε βαθμό. η κλίμακα δεν προϋποθέτει σχολικό ή εθνικό κανόνα βαθμολόγησης.","Points earned":"Πόντοι που κερδίσατε","Maximum points":"Μέγιστες πόντοι","Top grade label":"Ετικέτα κορυφαίας ποιότητας","Top grade starts at (%)":"Η κορυφαία βαθμολογία ξεκινά στο (%)","Middle grade label":"Ετικέτα μεσαίας ποιότητας","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Η μέση τάξη ξεκινά στο (%)","Lowest grade label":"Ετικέτα χαμηλότερης ποιότητας","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Ο χαμηλότερος βαθμός ξεκινά στο (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Με μέγιστο σημείο 50, οι πόντοι 45 ισούνται με 90%. Τα προσαρμοσμένα όρια σας καθορίζουν την ετικέτα βαθμού.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Χρησιμοποιεί μια επίσημη πολιτική βαθμολόγησης;","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Αρ. Εσείς ορίζετε τα κατώφλια. Τα συστήματα βαθμολόγησης διαφέρουν ανά σχολείο, μάθημα και χώρα. επιβεβαιώστε την κλίμακα που αναμένεται να χρησιμοποιήσετε.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Μπορώ να εξάγω τις ζώνες ταξινόμησης;","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ναι. Εξάγετε τις εμφανιζόμενες ζώνες ως αρχείο CSV ή εκτυπώστε την κλίμακα."},"es":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Calculadora de pago de vacaciones en Noruega","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Calculadora de pago de vacaciones en Noruega: estimación bruta gratuita","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Estime el pago de vacaciones en Noruega a partir de su base de pago de vacaciones. Compare las tarifas comunes para licencia estándar, una quinta semana y empleados de edad 60 o más.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Ingrese el feriepengegrunnlag que aparece en su nómina. Compare las tarifas brutas habituales de pago de vacaciones en Noruega según su edad y la duración acordada de las vacaciones.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Base de pago de vacaciones (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Soy 60 o mayor en el año festivo","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Mi acuerdo incluye una quinta semana festiva","Estimated holiday pay":"Pago estimado de vacaciones","Rate used":"Tarifa utilizada","Basis used":"Base utilizada","Reset choices":"Restablecer opciones","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Solo estimación bruta. El pago de vacaciones es un ingreso sujeto a impuestos; La retención de impuestos puede variar según la persona y la nómina.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Con una base NOK 500,000, 10.2% da NOK 51,000 antes de cualquier ajuste de nómina.","Which rate should I use?":"¿Qué tarifa debo utilizar?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"La estimación utiliza tarifas mínimas comunes: 10.2% o 12% con una quinta semana; 12.5% o 14.3% para empleados de edad 60 o más. Su acuerdo puede dar más.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"¿Es este el importe pagado después de impuestos?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"No. Esta es una estimación bruta. El pago de vacaciones es un ingreso sujeto a impuestos; La retención depende de sus circunstancias y nómina.","What belongs in the basis?":"¿Qué pertenece a la base?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Utilice el feriepengegrunnlag en su nómina o declaración anual. Algunos reembolsos y otros pagos están excluidos por las normas.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Calculadora del impuesto sobre la renta de Noruega","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Calculadora de impuestos de Noruega 2026 — Estimación gratuita de salarios y pensiones","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Estimación 2026 Impuesto sobre la renta noruego sobre el salario estándar o la pensión de vejez de un año completo. Vea el salario neto anual y mensual, los componentes impositivos y compare dos escenarios.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Estimación 2026 Impuesto sobre la renta noruego para un salario de residente estándar o una pensión de vejez de un año completo. Vea los principales componentes impositivos y compare dos escenarios de ingresos brutos.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"La calculadora aplica las deducciones estándar 2026, las cinco bandas progresivas de impuestos y las contribuciones al seguro nacional. La modalidad pensión incluye el crédito fiscal pensional únicamente para un año completo, 100% de pensión de vejez calificada o AFP elegible. Se ejecuta completamente en este navegador.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Para un salario de NOK 600,000, compare el impuesto anual estimado y el salario neto con otro salario o el monto de una pensión de todo el año.","Tax year":"Año fiscal","Scenario":"Escenario","Salary":"Salario","Full-year old-age pension":"Pensión de vejez de año completo","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Ingresos brutos anuales (NOK)","Tax zone":"Zona fiscal","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Tarifa estándar (la mayor parte de Noruega)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / municipios de la zona de medidas enumeradas","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Estimación de pensión asume una pensión de vejez elegible o AFP en 100% para todos los meses de 12, sin otros ingresos.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"La estimación de salario asume residencia fiscal ordinaria en Noruega, edad 17–69 y ningún otro ingreso.","Compare two scenarios":"Comparar dos escenarios","Scenario 1":"Escenario 1","Scenario 2":"Escenario 2","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimación","Estimated tax per year":"Impuesto estimado por año","Average tax per month":"Impuesto promedio por mes","Estimated net per year":"Neto estimado por año","Average net per month":"Promedio neto por mes","Tax on ordinary income":"Impuesto sobre la renta ordinaria","Bracket tax":"Impuesto de categoría","National insurance contribution":"Contribución al seguro nacional","Pension tax credit":"Crédito fiscal para pensiones","Estimated effective rate":"Tasa efectiva estimada","Standard deduction base":"Base de deducción estándar","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Las tarifas y los umbrales son para el año de ingresos 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Solo estimación, no un cálculo de impuestos oficial ni una tarjeta de impuestos. Otros ingresos, deducciones, edad, residencia, grado de pensión y circunstancias personales pueden cambiar el resultado.","Reset values":"Restablecer valores","Example":"Ejemplo","How the estimate works":"Cómo funciona el presupuesto","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"¿Es esta mi factura de impuestos exacta o la retención de mi tarjeta de impuestos?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"No. Calcula el impuesto anual estándar 2026. Una tarjeta de impuestos, una evaluación final y una retención pueden diferir según sus ingresos totales, sus deducciones y sus circunstancias.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"¿Puedo combinar salario y pensión aquí?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Esta versión estima un tipo de ingreso a la vez. No calcula un caso mixto de salario y pensión.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"¿El modo pensión cubre todas las pensiones?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"No. El crédito de pensión se modela únicamente para una pensión de vejez calificada o una AFP elegible cobrada al 100% durante todo el año. Las pensiones anuales parciales o escalonadas y otros tipos de pensiones están fuera del alcance.","What is the measures-zone option?":"¿Qué es la opción de zonas de medidas?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Aplica la tasa de ingreso ordinario 18.5% publicada y la deducción especial NOK 45,000 para Finnmark y los municipios incluidos en la lista. Confirma que tu municipio califica.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Calculadora del impuesto sobre el patrimonio de Noruega","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Calculadora del impuesto sobre el patrimonio de Noruega 2026 — Estimación gratuita","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Estimación 2026 Impuesto sobre el patrimonio noruego de viviendas, acciones, activos comerciales, efectivo y deuda. Vea la división estatal y municipal, los descuentos de valoración y un rango de sensibilidad de valor.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Estimación del impuesto sobre el patrimonio personal noruego para 2026. Ingrese los valores de mercado estimados para viviendas y las bases impositivas previas al descuento para acciones y activos comerciales. Ver descuentos de valoración, ajuste de deuda y estimaciones separadas estatales y municipales.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"El presupuesto aplica las reglas de valoración 2026 y la tarifa municipal máxima a menos que ingrese una tarifa más baja. La deuda se asigna por el valor total de los activos antes de descuentos; la deuda asignada a acciones o activos comerciales descontados se reduce con el mismo descuento. Las valoraciones de propiedades, la elegibilidad y los datos fiscales personales pueden cambiar el resultado oficial.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Una vivienda principal con un valor de mercado de NOK 10 millones tiene un valor patrimonial estimado de NOK 2.5 millones según la regla de vivienda principal 2026, antes de deuda y asignación personal.","2026 tax year":"2026 año fiscal","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Valor de mercado estimado de la vivienda principal (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Valor de mercado estimado de viviendas secundarias (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Acciones y fondos de acciones antes de descuento (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Activos comerciales elegibles antes del descuento (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Depósitos bancarios y otros activos (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Deuda total (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Pagamos impuestos conjuntos por la riqueza","Municipal rate (%)":"Tarifa municipal (%)","Home-value comparison":"Comparación del valor de la vivienda","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Estimación del impuesto al patrimonio","Export CSV":"Exportar CSV","Print estimate":"Imprimir presupuesto","Assets before discounts":"Activos antes de descuentos","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Valor del activo imponible después de descuentos","Debt reduction from discounts":"Reducción de deuda por descuentos","Deductible debt estimate":"Estimación de deuda deducible","Estimated net wealth":"Riqueza neta estimada","Personal allowance":"Asignación personal","Taxable net wealth":"Patrimonio neto imponible","Municipal wealth tax":"Impuesto municipal sobre el patrimonio","State wealth tax":"Impuesto estatal sobre el patrimonio","State tax, first band":"Impuesto estatal, primera banda","State tax, upper band":"Impuesto estatal, banda superior","Estimated total wealth tax":"Impuesto sobre el patrimonio total estimado","Lower home-value estimate":"Estimación del valor de la vivienda más bajo","Current-value estimate":"Estimación del valor actual","Higher home-value estimate":"Estimación del valor de la vivienda más alto","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 reglas y suposiciones","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Solo estimación. Esta no es una evaluación fiscal oficial ni un asesoramiento fiscal. Utilice los valores de su declaración de impuestos cuando estén disponibles; las tasas, la elegibilidad, la asignación de deuda y los valores de la propiedad pueden diferir en su caso.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Viviendas: ingrese el valor de mercado estimado al final del año. Acciones y activos comerciales elegibles: ingrese el valor antes del descuento 2026, no el valor de mercado a menos que esa sea la base impositiva correcta.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"La asignación y el umbral superior estatal se duplican solo para cónyuges, parejas registradas o cohabitantes calificados evaluados conjuntamente por su riqueza combinada.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"El cálculo municipal utiliza la tasa seleccionada, de forma predeterminada el máximo 2026 de 0.35%. Algunos municipios pueden utilizar una tarifa más baja.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"La sensibilidad cambia solo los valores ingresados ​​de las viviendas primarias y secundarias. Es una comparación, no una predicción de una valoración oficial.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"¿Qué es la desgravación del impuesto sobre el patrimonio 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"El umbral estándar es NOK 1.9 millones para una persona y NOK 3.8 millones para cónyuges o parejas calificadas evaluados de forma conjunta.","How is my primary home valued?":"¿Cómo se valora mi vivienda principal?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Para 2026, el valor de riqueza estimado es 25% del valor de mercado hasta NOK 14 millones, más 70% de la cantidad superior a NOK 14 millones.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"¿Esto aplica un descuento a una vivienda secundaria?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"No. La tabla 2026 ofrece a las viviendas secundarias un descuento de valoración del 0%. Utiliza el valor de mercado ingresado como estimación; Los valores evaluados oficiales pueden diferir.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"¿Por qué cambia la deuda deducible cuando poseo acciones o activos comerciales?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Las normas noruegas asignan la deuda proporcionalmente al valor total de los activos. La parte asignada a los activos con descuentos de valoración se reduce en la misma tasa de descuento.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"¿La tarifa municipal es siempre 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"No. 0.35% es el máximo 2026 utilizado de forma predeterminada. Un municipio puede fijar una tarifa más baja, que usted puede ingresar.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"¿La calculadora cubre todos los casos de activos o impuestos?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"No. Estima viviendas, acciones, activos comerciales elegibles seleccionados, efectivo y deuda total. Los activos extranjeros, las pensiones, la propiedad compleja, las exenciones y otras reglas especiales pueden cambiar su evaluación.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Generador de facturas QR suizas","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Generador de facturas QR suizo: creador de facturas QR gratuito","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Crear y consultar localmente una factura QR suiza. Validar referencias IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR y SCOR; Imprima el parte de pago A6 y el recibo sin cargar los datos de la factura.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Crear un comprobante de pago suizo con un código QR suizo. Los detalles de su factura permanecen en este navegador; no se inicia ningún pago ni se consulta ningún registro bancario.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"La herramienta genera los datos del SIX Código de pagos suizo (SPC) y verifica sus campos, combinación de cuenta/referencia, dígitos de control IBAN y caracteres admitidos. Formatea la parte de pago y el recibo para imprimirlos en el tamaño físico requerido.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX ejemplo: un QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, una referencia QRR de dígitos 27 y direcciones estructuradas de acreedor/deudor.","How it works":"Cómo funciona","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntas frecuentes","Limits and accuracy":"Límites y precisión","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Esta es una herramienta de documentos local, no un servicio bancario ni una certificación. No puede confirmar quién posee un IBAN, si una cuenta está abierta o si se aceptará un pago. Imprima en 100%/tamaño real y mida la línea de cheque 100 mm antes de utilizar una orden de pago en papel.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN del acreedor o QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"A pagar a · acreedor","Account holder / creditor name":"Titular de la cuenta/nombre del acreedor","Street or P.O. box":"Calle o apartado postal caja","Building number":"Número de edificio","Postal code":"Código postal","Town / city":"Pueblo / ciudad","2-letter country code":"Código de país de 2 letras","Amount (optional)":"Cantidad (opcional)","Currency":"Moneda","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"A pagar por · deudor facultativo","Debtor name":"Nombre del deudor","Reference type":"Tipo de referencia","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Referencia QR · Sólo QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Referencia del acreedor · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Sin referencia estructurada · IBAN","Reference":"Referencia","Unstructured message":"Mensaje no estructurado","Billing information (optional)":"Información de facturación (opcional)","Create QR-bill":"Crear factura QR","Load SIX sample":"Cargar SEIS muestras","Clear form":"Borrar formulario","Check QR payload":"Verificar carga útil QR","Download payment data":"Descargar datos de pago","Download QR SVG":"Descargar QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Imprimir/guardar como PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Leer un código QR imagen","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Elija PNG o JPEG","Read image locally":"Leer imagen localmente","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Pegar datos de pago del código QR suizo","Invoice details":"Detalles de la factura","QR-bill preview":"Vista previa de factura QR","Receipt":"Recibo","Payment part":"Parte de pago","Payable to":"A pagar a","Payable by":"A pagar por","Account":"Cuenta","Additional information":"Información adicional","Currency / amount":"Moneda / importe","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Imprimir comprobación de escala · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · estándar suizo de factura QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"Listo para factura QR. Los detalles permanecieron en este dispositivo.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Algunos campos deben comprobarse. Revise la información resaltada.","Reading this image on your device…":"Leyendo esta imagen en su dispositivo…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Código QR suizo leído y verificado localmente.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"No se encontró ningún código QR legible en esa imagen.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Los datos del código QR suizo son válidos para los campos admitidos.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Los datos no son una carga útil de pago con código QR suizo válida.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formulario y vista previa borrados.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SEIS muestras cargadas. Reemplace sus detalles de muestra antes de su uso real.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Primero cree o lea una factura QR válida.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Elija un PNG o JPEG de 10 MiB o menos.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"No se pudo cargar el lector QR local. En su lugar, puede pegar los datos de pago.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"¿Qué combinaciones de IBAN y referencias están permitidas?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Un QR-IBAN utiliza una referencia QRR. Un IBAN suizo normal utiliza SCOR o referencia no estructurada (NON). QRR es solo para facturas en CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"¿Esto verifica que la cuenta exista o pertenezca al acreedor?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"No. Comprueba únicamente el formato y la suma de comprobación del IBAN. No contacta con un banco o registro de cuentas.","Can I print this at any scale?":"¿Puedo imprimir esto a cualquier escala?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Para una orden de pago en papel, imprima en 100% / Tamaño real. La parte de pago debe ser A6 horizontal (148 × 105 mm); verifique la línea 100 mm con una regla.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"¿La herramienta envía datos de facturas a alguna parte?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"No. La generación y lectura de imágenes se realizan en su navegador. No se utiliza ninguna cuenta ni servicio de pago.","Grade Scale Generator":"Generador de escala de grado","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Generador de escala de calificaciones: herramienta gratuita de puntos a calificaciones","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Convierta puntos en porcentajes y calificaciones con sus propios umbrales. Obtenga una vista previa de la escala completa, cópiela o expórtela e imprima una hoja de calificaciones.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Cree una escala de calificaciones transparente para un examen o tarea. Establecer los puntos máximos y el porcentaje mínimo para cada calificación; la escala no asume una regla de calificación escolar o nacional.","Points earned":"Puntos ganados","Maximum points":"Puntos máximos","Top grade label":"Etiqueta de calidad superior","Top grade starts at (%)":"El grado superior comienza en (%)","Middle grade label":"Etiqueta de grado medio","Middle grade starts at (%)":"El grado medio comienza en (%)","Lowest grade label":"Etiqueta de grado más bajo","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"El grado más bajo comienza en (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Con un máximo de puntos 50, los puntos 45 equivalen a 90%. Sus umbrales personalizados deciden la etiqueta de calificación.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"¿Utiliza esto una política de calificación oficial?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"No. Tú estableces los umbrales. Los sistemas de calificación difieren según la escuela, el curso y el país; Confirme la escala que se espera que utilice.","Can I export the grading bands?":"¿Puedo exportar las bandas de calificación?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Sí. Exporte las bandas mostradas como un archivo CSV o imprima la escala."},"fa":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"ماشین حساب پرداخت تعطیلات نروژ","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"ماشین حساب پرداخت تعطیلات نروژ — برآورد ناخالص رایگان","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"دستمزد تعطیلات نروژی را بر اساس حقوق تعطیلات خود تخمین بزنید. نرخ های رایج مرخصی استاندارد، هفته پنجم و کارمندان با سن 60 یا بیشتر را مقایسه کنید.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"feriepengegrunnlag نشان داده شده در فیش حقوقی خود را وارد کنید. نرخ‌های معمول ناخالص تعطیلات نروژی را برای سن و طول تعطیلات مورد توافق مقایسه کنید.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"مبنای پرداخت تعطیلات (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"من 60 یا بزرگتر در سال تعطیلات هستم","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"قرارداد من شامل یک هفته تعطیلات پنجم است","Estimated holiday pay":"دستمزد تخمینی تعطیلات","Rate used":"نرخ استفاده شده","Basis used":"پایه استفاده شده","Reset choices":"بازنشانی انتخاب ها","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"فقط برآورد ناخالص. حقوق تعطیلات درآمد مشمول مالیات است. کسر مالیات می تواند بسته به شخص و لیست حقوق و دستمزد متفاوت باشد.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"با اساس NOK 500,000، 10.2% قبل از هر گونه تعدیل حقوق و دستمزد NOK 51,000 می دهد.","Which rate should I use?":"از کدام نرخ استفاده کنم؟","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"برآورد از حداقل نرخ های رایج استفاده می کند: 10.2% یا 12% با هفته پنجم. 12.5% یا 14.3% برای کارمندان 60 یا بالاتر. توافق شما ممکن است بیشتر به شما بدهد.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"این مبلغ بعد از کسر مالیات پرداخت می شود؟","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"شماره. این یک برآورد ناخالص است. حقوق تعطیلات درآمد مشمول مالیات است. کسر به شرایط و حقوق و دستمزد شما بستگی دارد.","What belongs in the basis?":"در اساس چه چیزی تعلق دارد؟","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"از feriepengegrunnlag در فیش حقوقی یا صورت حساب سالانه خود استفاده کنید. برخی از بازپرداخت ها و سایر پرداخت ها توسط قوانین مستثنی شده اند.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"محاسب مالیات بر درآمد نروژ","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"ماشین حساب مالیات نروژ 2026 — برآورد حقوق و مستمری رایگان","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"2026 مالیات بر درآمد نروژی بر حقوق استاندارد یا مستمری سالمندی کامل را تخمین بزنید. پرداخت خالص سالانه و ماهانه، مؤلفه های مالیاتی را ببینید و دو سناریو را مقایسه کنید.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"2026 مالیات بر درآمد نروژی را برای حقوق مقیم استاندارد یا مستمری سالمندی کامل تخمین بزنید. اجزای اصلی مالیات را ببینید و دو سناریو درآمد ناخالص را مقایسه کنید.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"ماشین‌حساب کسورات استاندارد 2026، پنج باند مالیاتی پیشرونده و سهم بیمه ملی را اعمال می‌کند. حالت بازنشستگی شامل اعتبار مالیات بازنشستگی فقط برای یک سال کامل، 100٪ مستمری واجد شرایط سالمندی یا AFP واجد شرایط است. به طور کامل در این مرورگر اجرا می شود.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"برای حقوق NOK 600,000، مالیات تخمینی سالانه و خالص پرداخت را با حقوق دیگری یا مبلغ بازنشستگی تمام سال مقایسه کنید.","Tax year":"سال مالیاتی","Scenario":"سناریو","Salary":"حقوق","Full-year old-age pension":"بازنشستگی سالمندی تمام سال","Gross annual income (NOK)":"درآمد ناخالص سالانه (NOK)","Tax zone":"منطقه مالیاتی","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"نرخ استاندارد (بیشتر نروژ)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / شهرداری های منطقه اقدامات فهرست شده","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"برآورد بازنشستگی مستمری سالمندی یا AFP واجد شرایط را در 100٪ برای تمام ماه‌های 12 فرض می‌کند، بدون هیچ درآمد دیگری.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"برآورد حقوق و دستمزد، اقامت مالیاتی معمولی نروژ، سن 17–69 و هیچ درآمد دیگری را فرض می‌کند.","Compare two scenarios":"دو سناریو را با هم مقایسه کنید","Scenario 1":"سناریو 1","Scenario 2":"سناریو 2","Calculate estimate":"برآورد را محاسبه کنید","Estimated tax per year":"تخمین مالیات در سال","Average tax per month":"میانگین مالیات در ماه","Estimated net per year":"تخمین خالص در سال","Average net per month":"میانگین خالص در ماه","Tax on ordinary income":"مالیات بر درآمد عادی","Bracket tax":"مالیات براکت","National insurance contribution":"سهم بیمه ملی","Pension tax credit":"اعتبار مالیات بازنشستگی","Estimated effective rate":"نرخ موثر تخمینی","Standard deduction base":"پایه کسر استاندارد","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"نرخ ها و آستانه ها برای سال درآمدی 2026 هستند.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"فقط برآورد، نه یک محاسبه مالیات رسمی یا کارت مالیاتی. سایر درآمدها، کسورات، سن، محل اقامت، درجه بازنشستگی و شرایط شخصی می توانند نتیجه را تغییر دهند.","Reset values":"بازنشانی مقادیر","Example":"مثال","How the estimate works":"تخمین چگونه کار می کند","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"این دقیقاً صورتحساب مالیاتی یا کسر کارت مالیاتی من است؟","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"شماره. مالیات سالانه استاندارد 2026 را برآورد می کند. کارت مالیاتی، ارزیابی نهایی و کسر مالیات ممکن است به دلیل درآمد کامل، کسورات و شرایط شما متفاوت باشد.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"آیا می توانم حقوق و مستمری را در اینجا ترکیب کنم؟","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"این نسخه هر بار یک نوع درآمد را تخمین می زند. این پرونده مختلط حقوق و بازنشستگی را محاسبه نمی کند.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"آیا حالت بازنشستگی همه حقوق بازنشستگی را پوشش می دهد؟","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"شماره. اعتبار بازنشستگی فقط برای بازنشستگی واجد شرایط سالمندی یا AFP واجد شرایط که در طول سال با 100٪ گرفته شده است، مدل‌سازی می‌شود. مستمری جزئی یا درجه بندی شده و سایر انواع مستمری خارج از محدوده است.","What is the measures-zone option?":"گزینه اندازه گیری منطقه چیست؟","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"نرخ درآمد معمولی منتشر شده 18.5 و کسر ویژه NOK 45,000 را برای Finnmark و شهرداری های فهرست شده اعمال می کند. تأیید کنید که شهرداری شما واجد شرایط است.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"ماشین حساب مالیات بر ثروت نروژ","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"ماشین حساب مالیات بر ثروت نروژ 2026 — تخمین رایگان","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"2026 مالیات بر ثروت نروژی را از خانه ها، سهام، دارایی های تجاری، پول نقد و بدهی تخمین بزنید. تقسیم ایالت و شهرداری، تخفیف های ارزش گذاری و محدوده حساسیت ارزش را ببینید.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"مالیات بر ثروت شخصی نروژی را برای 2026 برآورد کنید. ارزش‌های بازار تخمینی برای خانه‌ها و پایه‌های مالیاتی پیش از تخفیف برای سهام و دارایی‌های تجاری را وارد کنید. تخفیف های ارزیابی، تعدیل بدهی و برآوردهای جداگانه ایالتی و شهرداری را ببینید.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"برآورد قوانین ارزش گذاری 2026 و حداکثر نرخ شهرداری را اعمال می کند، مگر اینکه نرخ کمتری را وارد کنید. بدهی با ارزش دارایی کامل قبل از تخفیف تخصیص می یابد. بدهی اختصاص داده شده به سهام تنزیل شده یا دارایی های تجاری با همان تخفیف کاهش می یابد. ارزش گذاری املاک، واجد شرایط بودن و حقایق مالیاتی شخصی می تواند نتیجه رسمی را تغییر دهد.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"یک خانه اصلی با ارزش بازار NOK 10 میلیون کرون کرونه، قبل از بدهی و کمک هزینه شخصی، طبق قانون 2026، دارای ارزش تخمینی ثروت 2.5 میلیون کرون است.","2026 tax year":"2026 سال مالیاتی","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"ارزش بازار تخمینی خانه اصلی (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"ارزش بازار تخمینی خانه های فرعی (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"سهام و سهم وجوه قبل از تخفیف (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"دارایی های تجاری واجد شرایط قبل از تخفیف (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"سپرده‌های بانکی و سایر دارایی‌ها (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"مجموع بدهی (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"ما به طور مشترک برای ثروت مالیات می گیریم","Municipal rate (%)":"نرخ شهرداری (%)","Home-value comparison":"مقایسه ارزش خانه","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"برآورد مالیات بر ثروت","Export CSV":"صادرات CSV","Print estimate":"تخمین چاپی","Assets before discounts":"دارایی قبل از تخفیف","Taxable asset value after discounts":"ارزش دارایی مشمول مالیات پس از تخفیف","Debt reduction from discounts":"کاهش بدهی از تخفیف","Deductible debt estimate":"برآورد بدهی قابل کسر","Estimated net wealth":"ثروت خالص تخمینی","Personal allowance":"کمک هزینه شخصی","Taxable net wealth":"ثروت خالص مشمول مالیات","Municipal wealth tax":"مالیات بر دارایی شهرداری","State wealth tax":"مالیات بر دارایی دولتی","State tax, first band":"مالیات دولتی باند اول","State tax, upper band":"مالیات دولتی، باند بالایی","Estimated total wealth tax":"برآورد مالیات بر دارایی کل","Lower home-value estimate":"برآورد ارزش خانه کمتر","Current-value estimate":"برآورد ارزش فعلی","Higher home-value estimate":"برآورد ارزش خانه بالاتر\nقوانین و مفروضات","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"فقط برآورد. این یک ارزیابی رسمی مالیاتی یا توصیه مالیاتی نیست. از مقادیر اظهارنامه مالیاتی خود در صورت وجود استفاده کنید. نرخ ها، واجد شرایط بودن، تخصیص بدهی و ارزش اموال ممکن است در مورد شما متفاوت باشد.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"خانه ها: ارزش تخمینی بازار را در پایان سال وارد کنید. سهام و دارایی های تجاری واجد شرایط: ارزش را قبل از تخفیف 2026 وارد کنید، نه ارزش بازار را مگر اینکه مبنای مالیاتی صحیح باشد.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"معادل و آستانه بالای ایالتی فقط برای همسران، شرکای ثبت نام شده یا افراد واجد شرایطی که به طور مشترک از نظر دارایی ترکیبی آنها ارزیابی می شوند، دو برابر می شود.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"محاسبه شهرداری از نرخ انتخابی استفاده می‌کند و به‌طور پیش‌فرض از حداکثر 2026 0.35 استفاده می‌کند. برخی از شهرداری ها ممکن است از نرخ پایین تری استفاده کنند.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"حساسیت فقط مقادیر وارد شده در خانه های اولیه و فرعی را تغییر می دهد. این یک مقایسه است، نه پیش بینی ارزش گذاری رسمی.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"کمک هزینه مالیات بر ثروت 2026 چیست؟","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"آستانه استاندارد NOK 1.9 میلیون کرون برای یک نفر و NOK 3.8 میلیون کرون برای همسران یا شرکای واجد شرایط است که به طور مشترک ارزیابی می شوند.","How is my primary home valued?":"خانه اصلی من چگونه ارزش گذاری می شود؟","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"برای 2026، ارزش تخمینی ثروت 25٪ از ارزش بازار تا سقف 14 میلیون کرون، به علاوه 70٪ از مبلغ بالای NOK 14 است.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"آیا این تخفیف برای خانه های فرعی اعمال می شود؟","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"شماره. جدول 2026 به خانه های فرعی تخفیف ارزش گذاری 0٪ می دهد. از ارزش بازار وارد شده به عنوان برآورد استفاده می کند. مقادیر رسمی ارزیابی شده می تواند متفاوت باشد.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"چرا وقتی سهام یا دارایی های تجاری دارم بدهی قابل کسر تغییر می کند؟","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"قوانین نروژی بدهی را به طور متناسب با ارزش دارایی کامل تخصیص می دهند. بخشی که به دارایی‌های دارای تخفیف ارزشیابی اختصاص می‌یابد با همان نرخ تنزیل کاهش می‌یابد.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"آیا نرخ شهرداری همیشه 0.35% است؟","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"شماره. 0.35% حداکثر 2026 است که به طور پیش فرض استفاده می شود. شهرداری ممکن است نرخ کمتری را تعیین کند که شما می توانید آن را وارد کنید.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"آیا ماشین حساب هر دارایی یا پرونده مالیاتی را پوشش می دهد؟","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"شماره. خانه ها، سهام، دارایی های تجاری واجد شرایط انتخاب شده، پول نقد و کل بدهی را تخمین می زند. دارایی های خارجی، حقوق بازنشستگی، مالکیت مجتمع، معافیت ها و سایر قوانین خاص ممکن است ارزیابی شما را تغییر دهد.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"ژنراتور قبض QR سوئیس","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"سازنده قبض QR سوئیسی — سازنده فاکتور QR رایگان","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"یک صورت‌حساب QR سوئیس را به صورت محلی ایجاد و بررسی کنید. اعتبار سنجی منابع IBAN، QR-IBAN، QRR و SCOR؛ بخش پرداخت و رسید A6 را بدون بارگذاری اطلاعات فاکتور چاپ کنید.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"یک فیش پرداخت سوئیسی با کد QR سوئیسی ایجاد کنید. جزئیات فاکتور شما در این مرورگر باقی می ماند. هیچ پرداختی آغاز نمی شود و هیچ ثبت بانکی استعلام نمی شود.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"این ابزار، داده‌های کد پرداخت SIX Swiss Payments (SPC) را می‌سازد و فیلدهای آن، ترکیب حساب/مرجع، ارقام بررسی IBAN و کاراکترهای پشتیبانی‌شده را بررسی می‌کند. قسمت پرداخت و رسید را برای چاپ در اندازه فیزیکی مورد نیازشان فرمت می کند.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"شش مثال: یک QR-IBAN، CHF 50.00، یک مرجع QRR رقمی 27 و آدرس‌های بستانکار/بدهکار ساختاریافته.","How it works":"چگونه کار می کند","Frequently asked questions":"سوالات متداول","Limits and accuracy":"محدودیت ها و دقت","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"این یک ابزار اسناد محلی است، نه یک سرویس یا گواهی بانکی. نمی‌تواند تأیید کند که چه کسی دارای IBAN است، آیا یک حساب باز است یا آیا پرداختی پذیرفته می‌شود. چاپ در 100٪ / اندازه واقعی و اندازه گیری خط چک 100 میلی متر قبل از استفاده از یک سفارش پرداخت کاغذی.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"ایبان اعتباری یا QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"قابل پرداخت به · طلبکار","Account holder / creditor name":"نام دارنده حساب / بستانکار","Street or P.O. box":"خیابان یا P.O. جعبه","Building number":"شماره ساختمان","Postal code":"کد پستی","Town / city":"شهرک / شهر","2-letter country code":"2-حرف کد کشور","Amount (optional)":"مقدار (اختیاری)","Currency":"ارز","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"یورو","Payable by · optional debtor":"قابل پرداخت توسط · بدهکار اختیاری","Debtor name":"نام بدهکار","Reference type":"نوع مرجع","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"مرجع QR · فقط QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"مرجع بستانکار · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"بدون مرجع ساختاری · IBAN","Reference":"مرجع","Unstructured message":"پیام بدون ساختار","Billing information (optional)":"اطلاعات صورتحساب (اختیاری)","Create QR-bill":"ایجاد قبض QR","Load SIX sample":"شش نمونه بارگیری کنید","Clear form":"فرم شفاف","Check QR payload":"بار QR را بررسی کنید","Download payment data":"دانلود داده های پرداخت","Download QR SVG":"دانلود QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"چاپ / ذخیره به صورت PDF","Read a QR Code image":"یک تصویر کد QR را بخوانید","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG یا JPEG را انتخاب کنید","Read image locally":"تصویر را به صورت محلی بخوانید","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"داده‌های پرداخت کد QR سوئیس را جای‌گذاری کنید","Invoice details":"جزئیات فاکتور","QR-bill preview":"پیش نمایش قبض QR","Receipt":"رسید","Payment part":"بخش پرداخت","Payable to":"قابل پرداخت به","Payable by":"قابل پرداخت توسط","Account":"حساب","Additional information":"اطلاعات تکمیلی","Currency / amount":"ارز / مقدار","Print scale check · 100 mm":"بررسی مقیاس چاپ · 100 میلی متر","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · استاندارد قبض QR سوئیس","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"قبض QR آماده است. جزئیات در این دستگاه باقی ماند.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"برخی فیلدها نیاز به بررسی دارند. اطلاعات برجسته شده را مرور کنید.","Reading this image on your device…":"خواندن این تصویر در دستگاه شما…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"کد QR سوئیس به صورت محلی خوانده و بررسی می شود.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"کد QR قابل خواندن در آن تصویر یافت نشد.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"داده‌های کد QR سوئیس برای فیلدهای پشتیبانی شده معتبر است.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"داده‌ها یک محموله پرداخت معتبر با کد QR سوئیس نیستند.","Form and preview cleared.":"فرم و پیش نمایش پاک شد.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"شش نمونه بارگذاری شد. جزئیات نمونه آن را قبل از استفاده واقعی تعویض کنید.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"ابتدا یک قبض QR معتبر ایجاد کنید یا بخوانید.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"یک PNG یا JPEG با 10 MiB یا کمتر انتخاب کنید.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"خوان QR محلی بارگیری نشد. در عوض می‌توانید داده‌های پرداخت را جای‌گذاری کنید.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"کدام ترکیب IBAN و مرجع مجاز است؟","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"یک QR-IBAN از یک مرجع QRR استفاده می کند. یک IBAN معمولی سوئیس از SCOR یا بدون مرجع ساختاری (NON) استفاده می کند. QRR فقط برای فاکتورهای CHF است.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"آیا این بررسی می کند که حساب وجود دارد یا متعلق به بستانکار است؟","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"شماره. فقط فرمت و IBAN چک جمع را بررسی می کند. با بانک یا دفتر ثبت حساب تماس نمی گیرد.","Can I print this at any scale?":"آیا می توانم این را در هر مقیاسی چاپ کنم؟","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"برای سفارش پرداخت کاغذی، در 100% / اندازه واقعی چاپ کنید. قسمت پرداخت باید A6 چشم انداز (148 × 105 میلی متر) باشد. خط 100 میلی متر را با یک خط کش بررسی کنید.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"آیا این ابزار اطلاعات فاکتور را به جایی ارسال می کند؟","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"شماره. تولید و خواندن تصویر در مرورگر شما اتفاق می افتد. هیچ حساب یا خدمات پرداخت استفاده نمی شود.","Grade Scale Generator":"ترازو مولد درجه","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"تولید کننده مقیاس درجه - ابزار امتیاز به درجه رایگان","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"امتیازها را با آستانه های خود به درصد و نمره تبدیل کنید. مقیاس کامل را پیش نمایش کنید، آن را کپی یا صادر کنید و یک برگه درجه بندی چاپ کنید.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"یک مقیاس درجه بندی شفاف برای امتحان یا تکلیف بسازید. حداکثر امتیاز و حداقل درصد را برای هر نمره تعیین کنید. این مقیاس یک قانون درجه بندی مدرسه یا ملی را در نظر نمی گیرد.","Points earned":"امتیازهای کسب شده","Maximum points":"حداکثر امتیاز","Top grade label":"برچسب درجه برتر","Top grade starts at (%)":"درجه برتر از (%) شروع می شود","Middle grade label":"برچسب درجه متوسط","Middle grade starts at (%)":"درجه متوسط از (%) شروع می شود","Lowest grade label":"برچسب کمترین درجه","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"پایین ترین درجه از (%) شروع می شود","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"با حداکثر نقطه 50، امتیاز 45 برابر با 90٪ است. آستانه های سفارشی شما برچسب نمره را تعیین می کنند.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"آیا این از خط مشی درجه بندی رسمی استفاده می کند؟","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"شماره. شما آستانه ها را تعیین می کنید. سیستم های درجه بندی بر اساس مدرسه، دوره و کشور متفاوت است. مقیاسی که انتظار می رود استفاده کنید را تأیید کنید.","Can I export the grading bands?":"آیا می توانم باندهای درجه بندی را صادر کنم؟","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"بله. نوارهای نمایش داده شده را به عنوان یک فایل CSV صادر کنید یا مقیاس را چاپ کنید."},"fr":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Calculateur de congés payés en Norvège","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Calculateur de congés payés en Norvège — Estimation brute gratuite","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Estimez le pécule de vacances norvégien à partir de votre base de pécule de vacances. Comparez les tarifs courants pour les congés standards, une cinquième semaine et les employés âgés de 60 ou plus.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Saisissez le feriepengegrunnlag indiqué sur votre fiche de paie. Comparez les taux d'indemnités de congés bruts norvégiens courants en fonction de votre âge et de la durée des vacances convenue.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Base d'indemnité de vacances (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Je suis 60 ou plus pendant l'année des vacances","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Mon contrat comprend une cinquième semaine de vacances","Estimated holiday pay":"Indemnité de vacances estimée","Rate used":"Taux utilisé","Basis used":"Base utilisée","Reset choices":"Réinitialiser les choix","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Estimation brute uniquement. Les congés payés constituent un revenu imposable ; la retenue d'impôt peut varier selon la personne et la masse salariale.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Avec une base NOK 500,000, 10.2% donne NOK 51,000 avant tout ajustement de paie.","Which rate should I use?":"Quel tarif dois-je utiliser ?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"L'estimation utilise des taux minimaux communs : 10.2% ou 12% avec une cinquième semaine ; 12.5% ou 14.3% pour les salariés âgés de 60 ou plus. Votre accord peut donner plus.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Est-ce le montant payé après impôt ?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Non. Il s'agit d'une estimation brute. Les congés payés constituent un revenu imposable ; la retenue dépend de votre situation et de votre masse salariale.","What belongs in the basis?":"Qu'est-ce qui fait partie de la base ?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Utilisez le feriepengegrunnlag sur votre fiche de paie ou votre relevé annuel. Certains remboursements et autres paiements sont exclus par le règlement.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Calculateur d'impôt sur le revenu en Norvège","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Calculateur d'impôts pour la Norvège 2026 — Estimation gratuite du salaire et de la pension","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Estimation 2026 Impôt sur le revenu norvégien sur le salaire standard ou la pension de vieillesse pour un an. Consultez le salaire net annuel et mensuel, les composantes fiscales et comparez deux scénarios.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Estimation 2026 Impôt sur le revenu norvégien pour un salaire standard de résident ou une pension de vieillesse d'un an. Consultez les principales composantes fiscales et comparez deux scénarios de revenu brut.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Le calculateur applique les déductions forfaitaires 2026, les cinq tranches d'imposition progressives et les cotisations d'assurance nationale. Le régime retraite inclut le crédit d'impôt retraite uniquement pour une année complète, 100% ouvrant droit à une pension de vieillesse ou à l'AFP éligible. Il fonctionne entièrement dans ce navigateur.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Pour un salaire de NOK 600,000, comparez l'impôt annuel estimé et le salaire net avec un autre salaire ou le montant d'une pension pour une année complète.","Tax year":"Année d'imposition","Scenario":"Scénario","Salary":"Salaire","Full-year old-age pension":"Pension de vieillesse pour toute une année","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Revenu annuel brut (NOK)","Tax zone":"Zone fiscale","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Tarif standard (la majeure partie de la Norvège)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / municipalités de zones de mesures répertoriées","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"L'estimation de la pension suppose une pension de vieillesse ou AFP éligible à 100% pour tous les mois 12, sans autre revenu.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"L'estimation du salaire suppose une résidence fiscale norvégienne ordinaire, un âge 17–69 et aucun autre revenu.","Compare two scenarios":"Comparez deux scénarios","Scenario 1":"Scénario 1","Scenario 2":"Scénario 2","Calculate estimate":"Calculer l'estimation","Estimated tax per year":"Taxe estimée par an","Average tax per month":"Taxe moyenne par mois","Estimated net per year":"Net estimé par an","Average net per month":"Moyenne nette par mois","Tax on ordinary income":"Impôt sur le revenu ordinaire","Bracket tax":"Taxe sur tranche","National insurance contribution":"Cotisation d'assurance nationale","Pension tax credit":"Crédit d'impôt pour pension","Estimated effective rate":"Taux effectif estimé","Standard deduction base":"Assiette de déduction standard","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Les taux et les seuils concernent l'année de revenus 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Estimation uniquement, pas un calcul de taxe officiel ni une fiche fiscale. D'autres revenus, déductions, âge, résidence, niveau de pension et situation personnelle peuvent modifier le résultat.","Reset values":"Réinitialiser les valeurs","Example":"Exemple","How the estimate works":"Fonctionnement du devis","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Est-ce exactement ma facture fiscale ou ma retenue fiscale ?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Non. Il estime la taxe annuelle standard 2026. Une fiche fiscale, une évaluation finale et une retenue à la source peuvent différer en raison de votre revenu total, de vos déductions et de votre situation.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Puis-je combiner salaire et pension ici ?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Cette version estime un type de revenu à la fois. Il ne calcule pas un cas mixte de salaire et de retraite.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Le régime retraite couvre-t-il toutes les pensions ?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Non. Le crédit de pension est modélisé uniquement pour une pension de vieillesse ouvrant droit à l'AFP prélevée à 100% tout au long de l'année. Les pensions annuelles partielles ou progressives et les autres types de pension ne sont pas concernés.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Qu'est-ce que l'option zone de mesures ?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Il applique le taux de revenu ordinaire publié 18.5 % et la déduction spéciale NOK 45,000 pour le Finnmark et les municipalités répertoriées. Confirmez que votre municipalité est admissible.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Calculateur d'impôt sur la fortune en Norvège","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Calculateur d'impôt sur la fortune en Norvège 2026 — Estimation gratuite","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Estimation 2026 Impôt norvégien sur la fortune provenant des logements, des actions, des actifs commerciaux, des liquidités et des dettes. Consultez la répartition entre l’État et la municipalité, les remises de valorisation et une plage de sensibilité à la valeur.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Estimation de l'impôt sur la fortune des particuliers norvégien pour 2026. Entrez les valeurs marchandes estimées des maisons et les assiettes fiscales avant remise pour les actions et les actifs commerciaux. Voir les remises de valorisation, l’ajustement de la dette et les estimations distinctes de l’État et des municipalités.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"L'estimation applique les règles de valorisation 2026 et le taux municipal maximum, sauf si vous saisissez un taux inférieur. La dette est répartie selon la valeur totale des actifs avant escomptes ; la dette affectée aux actions ou aux fonds de commerce escomptés est diminuée de la même escompte. Les évaluations des propriétés, l’éligibilité et les faits fiscaux des particuliers peuvent modifier le résultat officiel.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Une résidence principale d'une valeur marchande de NOK 10 millions a une valeur de patrimoine estimée à NOK 2.5 millions selon la règle de résidence principale 2026, avant dette et allocation personnelle.","2026 tax year":"2026 année fiscale","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Valeur marchande estimée de la maison principale (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Valeur marchande estimée des maisons secondaires (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Actions et fonds d'actions avant décote (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Actifs professionnels éligibles avant remise (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Dépôts bancaires et autres actifs (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Dette totale (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Nous sommes imposés conjointement sur la fortune","Municipal rate (%)":"Taux municipal (%)","Home-value comparison":"Comparaison de la valeur de la maison","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Estimation impôt sur la fortune","Export CSV":"Exporter au format CSV","Print estimate":"Estimation d'impression","Assets before discounts":"Actifs avant remises","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Valeur du bien imposable après escomptes","Debt reduction from discounts":"Réduction de la dette grâce aux remises","Deductible debt estimate":"Estimation de la dette déductible","Estimated net wealth":"Patrimoine net estimé","Personal allowance":"Allocation personnelle","Taxable net wealth":"Patrimoine net imposable","Municipal wealth tax":"Impôt communal sur la fortune","State wealth tax":"Impôt sur la fortune de l'État","State tax, first band":"Taxe d'État, première tranche","State tax, upper band":"Taxe d'État, tranche supérieure","Estimated total wealth tax":"Impôt sur la fortune totale estimé","Lower home-value estimate":"Estimation inférieure de la valeur de la maison","Current-value estimate":"Estimation de la valeur actuelle","Higher home-value estimate":"Estimation plus élevée de la valeur de la maison","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 règles et hypothèses","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Estimation uniquement. Il ne s’agit pas d’une évaluation fiscale officielle ni d’un conseil fiscal. Utilisez les valeurs de votre déclaration de revenus lorsqu'elles sont disponibles ; les taux, l’éligibilité, la répartition de la dette et la valeur des propriétés peuvent différer dans votre cas.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Maisons : saisissez la valeur marchande estimée à la fin de l'année. Actions et actifs professionnels éligibles : saisissez la valeur avant la remise 2026, et non la valeur marchande, sauf s'il s'agit de la base fiscale correcte.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"L'allocation et le seuil supérieur de l'État doublent uniquement pour les conjoints, les partenaires enregistrés ou les concubins éligibles évalués conjointement pour leur patrimoine combiné.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Le calcul municipal utilise le taux sélectionné, par défaut le maximum 2026 de 0.35 %. Certaines municipalités peuvent utiliser un taux inférieur.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"La sensibilité modifie uniquement les valeurs saisies des résidences principales et secondaires. Il s’agit d’une comparaison et non d’une prédiction d’une évaluation officielle.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Qu'est-ce que l'abattement d'impôt sur la fortune 2026 ?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Le seuil standard est de NOK 1.9 millions pour une personne et de NOK 3.8 millions pour les conjoints ou partenaires éligibles évalués conjointement.","How is my primary home valued?":"Comment est valorisée ma résidence principale ?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Pour 2026, la valeur de richesse estimée est de 25 % de la valeur marchande jusqu'à concurrence de 14 millions NOK, plus 70 % du montant supérieur à 14 millions NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Est-ce que cela applique une réduction à une résidence secondaire ?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Non. La table 2026 accorde aux résidences secondaires une remise de valorisation 0%. Il utilise la valeur marchande saisie comme estimation ; les valeurs officielles évaluées peuvent différer.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Pourquoi la dette déductible change-t-elle lorsque je possède des actions ou des actifs commerciaux ?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Les règles norvégiennes répartissent la dette proportionnellement à la valeur totale des actifs. La part affectée aux actifs présentant des décotes de valorisation est diminuée du même taux d'actualisation.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Le tarif municipal est-il toujours 0.35% ?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Non. 0.35% est le maximum 2026 utilisé par défaut. Une municipalité peut fixer un taux inférieur, que vous pouvez saisir.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Le calculateur couvre-t-il tous les cas patrimoniaux ou fiscaux ?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Non. Il estime les logements, les actions, certains actifs commerciaux éligibles, la trésorerie et la dette totale. Les actifs étrangers, les pensions, la propriété complexe, les exemptions et autres règles spéciales peuvent modifier votre évaluation.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Générateur de QR-facture suisse","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Générateur de factures QR suisse — Créateur de factures QR gratuit","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Créez et vérifiez localement une QR-facture suisse. Valider les références IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR et SCOR ; imprimez la partie paiement et le reçu A6 sans télécharger les données de facture.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Créez un bulletin de versement suisse avec un Swiss QR Code. Les détails de votre facture restent dans ce navigateur ; aucun paiement n'est initié et aucun registre bancaire n'est consulté.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"L'outil construit les données du SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) et vérifie ses champs, la combinaison compte/référence, les chiffres de contrôle IBAN et les caractères pris en charge. Il formate la partie paiement et le reçu pour les imprimer à leur taille physique requise.\nExemple","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX : un QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, une référence QRR à chiffres 27 et des adresses structurées créancier/débiteur.","How it works":"Comment ça marche","Frequently asked questions":"Questions fréquemment posées","Limits and accuracy":"Limites et précision","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Il s'agit d'un outil de documentation local, et non d'un service bancaire ou d'une certification. Il ne peut pas confirmer qui possède un IBAN, si un compte est ouvert ou si un paiement sera accepté. Imprimez à 100% / Taille réelle et mesurez la ligne de contrôle 100 mm avant d'utiliser un ordre de paiement papier.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN créancier ou QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"À payer au · créancier","Account holder / creditor name":"Nom du titulaire du compte/créancier","Street or P.O. box":"Rue ou boîte postale boîte","Building number":"Numéro du bâtiment","Postal code":"Code postal","Town / city":"Ville / ville","2-letter country code":"2-lettre code pays","Amount (optional)":"Montant (facultatif)","Currency":"Devise","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Payable par · débiteur facultatif","Debtor name":"Nom du débiteur","Reference type":"Type de référence","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Référence QR · QR-IBAN uniquement","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Référence créancier · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Pas de référence structurée · IBAN","Reference":"Référence","Unstructured message":"Message non structuré","Billing information (optional)":"Informations de facturation (facultatif)","Create QR-bill":"Créer une QR-facture","Load SIX sample":"Charger SIX échantillons","Clear form":"Effacer le formulaire","Check QR payload":"Vérifier la charge utile QR","Download payment data":"Télécharger les données de paiement","Download QR SVG":"Télécharger QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Imprimer/enregistrer au format PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Lire une image de code QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Choisissez PNG ou JPEG","Read image locally":"Lire l'image localement","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Coller les données de paiement du Swiss QR Code","Invoice details":"Détails de la facture","QR-bill preview":"Aperçu de la facture QR","Receipt":"Reçu","Payment part":"Partie Paiement","Payable to":"À l'ordre de","Payable by":"Payable par","Account":"Compte","Additional information":"Informations supplémentaires","Currency / amount":"Devise / montant","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Vérification de l'échelle d'impression · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Norme suisse QR-facture","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-facture prête. Les détails sont restés sur cet appareil.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Certains champs doivent être vérifiés. Passez en revue les informations mises en surbrillance.","Reading this image on your device…":"Lecture de cette image sur votre appareil…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Swiss QR Code lu et vérifié localement.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Aucun code QR lisible n'a été trouvé dans cette image.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Les données du code QR suisse sont valables pour les champs pris en charge.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Les données ne constituent pas une charge utile de paiement Swiss QR Code valide.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formulaire et aperçu effacés.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"Échantillon SIX chargé. Remplacez ses détails d'échantillon avant une utilisation réelle.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Créez ou lisez d'abord une QR-facture valide.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Choisissez un format PNG ou JPEG de 10 MiB ou moins.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Le lecteur QR local n'a pas pu se charger. Vous pouvez plutôt coller les données de paiement.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Quelles combinaisons IBAN et référence autorisées ?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Un QR-IBAN utilise une référence QRR. Un IBAN suisse normal utilise SCOR ou aucune référence structurée (NON). QRR concerne uniquement les factures en CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Cela vérifie-t-il que le compte existe ou appartient au créancier ?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Non. Il vérifie uniquement le format et la somme de contrôle IBAN. Il ne contacte pas une banque ou un registre de comptes.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Puis-je imprimer ceci à n'importe quelle échelle ?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Pour un ordre de paiement papier, imprimez à 100% / Taille réelle. La partie paiement doit être A6 paysage (148 × 105 mm) ; vérifiez la ligne 100 mm avec une règle.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"L'outil envoie-t-il les données de facture n'importe où ?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Non. La génération et la lecture des images s'effectuent dans votre navigateur. Aucun compte ou service de paiement n'est utilisé.","Grade Scale Generator":"Générateur d'échelle de qualité","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Générateur d'échelle de note — Outil gratuit de points à note","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Transformez des points en pourcentages et notes avec vos propres seuils. Prévisualisez l'échelle complète, copiez-la ou exportez-la et imprimez une feuille de notation.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Créez une échelle de notation transparente pour un examen ou un devoir. Fixer le maximum de points et le pourcentage minimum pour chaque note ; l'échelle ne suppose pas une règle de notation scolaire ou nationale.","Points earned":"Points gagnés","Maximum points":"Points maximum","Top grade label":"Étiquette de qualité supérieure","Top grade starts at (%)":"La qualité supérieure commence à (%)","Middle grade label":"Étiquette de qualité moyenne","Middle grade starts at (%)":"La qualité moyenne commence à (%)","Lowest grade label":"Étiquette de qualité la plus basse","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"La note la plus basse commence à (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Avec un maximum de points 50, les points 45 sont égaux à 90%. Vos seuils personnalisés déterminent l'étiquette de note.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Est-ce que cela utilise une politique de notation officielle ?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Non. Vous fixez les seuils. Les systèmes de notation diffèrent selon l'école, le cours et le pays ; confirmez la balance que vous êtes censé utiliser.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Puis-je exporter les bandes de talus ?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Oui. Exportez les bandes affichées sous forme de fichier CSV ou imprimez la balance."},"gu":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"નોર્વે હોલીડે પે કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"નોર્વે હોલીડે પે કેલ્ક્યુલેટર - મફત કુલ અંદાજ","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"તમારા રજા-પગારના આધારે નોર્વેજીયન રજાના પગારનો અંદાજ કાઢો. પ્રમાણભૂત રજા, પાંચમા અઠવાડિયે અને 60 અથવા તેથી વધુ વયના કર્મચારીઓ માટે સામાન્ય દરોની તુલના કરો.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"તમારી પેસ્લિપ પર દર્શાવેલ ફેરીપેન્જેગ્રુનલગ દાખલ કરો. તમારી ઉંમર અને સંમત રજાની લંબાઈ માટે સામાન્ય નોર્વેજીયન કુલ રજા-વેતન દરોની તુલના કરો.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"હોલિડે-પે બેસિસ (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"હું રજાના વર્ષમાં 60 કે તેથી મોટો છું","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"મારા કરારમાં પાંચમી રજાના સપ્તાહનો સમાવેશ થાય છે","Estimated holiday pay":"અંદાજિત રજા પગાર","Rate used":"દર વપરાયેલ","Basis used":"આધાર વપરાયેલ","Reset choices":"રીસેટ પસંદગીઓ","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"ફક્ત કુલ અંદાજ. રજાનો પગાર કરપાત્ર આવક છે; ટેક્સ રોકવો વ્યક્તિ અને પગારપત્રક દ્વારા બદલાઈ શકે છે.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 આધાર સાથે, 10.2% કોઈપણ પગારપત્રક ગોઠવણો પહેલાં NOK 51,000 આપે છે.","Which rate should I use?":"મારે કયા દરનો ઉપયોગ કરવો જોઈએ?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"અંદાજ સામાન્ય લઘુત્તમ દરોનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે: 10.2% અથવા 12% પાંચમા સપ્તાહ સાથે; 12.5% અથવા 60 અથવા તેથી વધુ વયના કર્મચારીઓ માટે 14.3%. તમારો કરાર વધુ આપી શકે છે.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"શું આ ટેક્સ પછી ચૂકવવામાં આવેલી રકમ છે?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"નં. આ એક કુલ અંદાજ છે. રજાનો પગાર કરપાત્ર આવક છે; રોકવું તમારા સંજોગો અને પગારપત્રક પર આધાર રાખે છે.","What belongs in the basis?":"આધારામાં શું છે?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"તમારી પેસ્લિપ અથવા વાર્ષિક સ્ટેટમેન્ટ પર feriepengegrunnlag નો ઉપયોગ કરો. કેટલાક વળતર અને અન્ય ચૂકવણી નિયમો દ્વારા બાકાત છે.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"નોર્વે આવકવેરા કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"નોર્વે ટેક્સ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 — મફત પગાર અને પેન્શન અંદાજ","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ પગાર અથવા આખા વર્ષના વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન પર 2026 નોર્વેજીયન આવકવેરાનો અંદાજ કાઢો. વાર્ષિક અને માસિક ચોખ્ખો પગાર, કર ઘટકો જુઓ અને બે દૃશ્યોની તુલના કરો.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"માનક નિવાસી પગાર અથવા આખા વર્ષના વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન માટે 2026 નોર્વેજીયન આવકવેરાનો અંદાજ. મુખ્ય કર ઘટકો જુઓ અને બે કુલ-આવકના દૃશ્યોની તુલના કરો.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 માનક કપાત, પાંચ પ્રગતિશીલ કૌંસ-કર બેન્ડ અને રાષ્ટ્રીય વીમા યોગદાન લાગુ કરે છે. પેન્શન મોડમાં ફક્ત આખા વર્ષ માટે પેન્શન ટેક્સ ક્રેડિટનો સમાવેશ થાય છે, 100% લાયક વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન અથવા પાત્ર AFP. તે સંપૂર્ણપણે આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 ના પગાર માટે, અંદાજિત વાર્ષિક કર અને ચોખ્ખા પગારની સરખામણી અન્ય પગાર અથવા આખા વર્ષની પેન્શનની રકમ સાથે કરો.","Tax year":"કર વર્ષ","Scenario":"દૃશ્ય","Salary":"પગાર","Full-year old-age pension":"પૂર્ણ-વર્ષનું વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન","Gross annual income (NOK)":"કુલ વાર્ષિક આવક (NOK)","Tax zone":"ટેક્સ ઝોન","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ રેટ (મોટાભાગનો નોર્વે)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"ફિનમાર્ક / સૂચિબદ્ધ પગલાં-ઝોન નગરપાલિકાઓ","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"પેન્શન અંદાજ તમામ 12 મહિના માટે 100% પર લાયક વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન અથવા AFP ધારે છે, જેમાં અન્ય કોઈ આવક નથી.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"પગાર અંદાજ સામાન્ય નોર્વેજીયન ટેક્સ રેસીડેન્સી, વય 17–69 અને અન્ય કોઈ આવક ધારે છે.","Compare two scenarios":"બે દૃશ્યોની સરખામણી કરો","Scenario 1":"દૃશ્ય 1","Scenario 2":"દૃશ્ય 2","Calculate estimate":"અંદાજની ગણતરી કરો","Estimated tax per year":"દર વર્ષે અંદાજિત કર","Average tax per month":"દર મહિને સરેરાશ કર","Estimated net per year":"દર વર્ષે અંદાજિત નેટ","Average net per month":"દર મહિને સરેરાશ નેટ","Tax on ordinary income":"સામાન્ય આવક પર કર","Bracket tax":"કૌંસ કર","National insurance contribution":"રાષ્ટ્રીય વીમા યોગદાન","Pension tax credit":"પેન્શન ટેક્સ ક્રેડિટ","Estimated effective rate":"અનુમાનિત અસરકારક દર","Standard deduction base":"સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ ડિડક્શન બેઝ","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"દર અને થ્રેશોલ્ડ 2026 આવક વર્ષ માટે છે.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"ફક્ત અંદાજ, સત્તાવાર ટેક્સ ગણતરી અથવા ટેક્સ કાર્ડ નહીં. અન્ય આવક, કપાત, ઉંમર, રહેઠાણ, પેન્શન ગ્રેડ અને વ્યક્તિગત સંજોગો પરિણામ બદલી શકે છે.","Reset values":"મૂલ્યો રીસેટ કરો","Example":"ઉદાહરણ","How the estimate works":"અંદાજ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"શું આ મારું ચોક્કસ ટેક્સ બિલ છે કે ટેક્સ-કાર્ડ વિથહોલ્ડિંગ?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"નં. તે પ્રમાણભૂત 2026 વાર્ષિક કરનો અંદાજ કાઢે છે. તમારી સંપૂર્ણ આવક, કપાત અને સંજોગોને કારણે ટેક્સ કાર્ડ, અંતિમ આકારણી અને વિથહોલ્ડિંગ અલગ હોઈ શકે છે.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"શું હું અહીં પગાર અને પેન્શનને જોડી શકું?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"આ સંસ્કરણ એક સમયે એક આવકના પ્રકારનો અંદાજ લગાવે છે. તે મિશ્ર પગાર-અને-પેન્શન કેસની ગણતરી કરતું નથી.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"શું પેન્શન મોડ દરેક પેન્શનને આવરી લે છે?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"નં. પેન્શન ક્રેડિટ માત્ર લાયકાત ધરાવતા વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શન અથવા 100% પર સમગ્ર વર્ષ દરમિયાન લેવામાં આવેલ પાત્ર AFP માટે જ મોડેલ કરવામાં આવે છે. આંશિક-વર્ષ અથવા ગ્રેડ પેન્શન અને અન્ય પેન્શન પ્રકારો અવકાશની બહાર છે.","What is the measures-zone option?":"મેઝર્સ-ઝોન વિકલ્પ શું છે?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"તે ફિનમાર્ક અને સૂચિબદ્ધ નગરપાલિકાઓ માટે પ્રકાશિત 18.5% સામાન્ય-આવક દર અને NOK 45,000 વિશેષ કપાત લાગુ કરે છે. ખાતરી કરો કે તમારી નગરપાલિકા લાયક છે.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"નોર્વે વેલ્થ ટેક્સ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"નોર્વે વેલ્થ ટેક્સ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 — મફત અંદાજ","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"ઘરો, શેરો, વ્યવસાયિક અસ્કયામતો, રોકડ અને દેવુંમાંથી 2026 નોર્વેજીયન વેલ્થ ટેક્સનો અંદાજ. રાજ્ય અને મ્યુનિસિપલ વિભાજન, મૂલ્યાંકન ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ અને મૂલ્ય સંવેદનશીલતા શ્રેણી જુઓ.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026 માટે વ્યક્તિગત નોર્વેજીયન વેલ્થ ટેક્સનો અંદાજ કાઢો. ઘરો માટે અંદાજિત બજાર મૂલ્યો અને શેર અને વ્યવસાયિક સંપત્તિઓ માટે પૂર્વ-ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ ટેક્સ બેઝ દાખલ કરો. મૂલ્યાંકન ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ, દેવું ગોઠવણ અને અલગ રાજ્ય અને મ્યુનિસિપલ અંદાજો જુઓ.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"આ અંદાજ 2026 વેલ્યુએશન નિયમો અને મહત્તમ મ્યુનિસિપલ રેટ લાગુ કરે છે સિવાય કે તમે નીચો દર દાખલ કરો. ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ પહેલાં દેવું સંપૂર્ણ સંપત્તિ મૂલ્યો દ્વારા ફાળવવામાં આવે છે; ડિસ્કાઉન્ટેડ શેર અથવા વ્યવસાયિક અસ્કયામતોને સોંપાયેલ દેવું સમાન ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ દ્વારા ઘટાડવામાં આવે છે. મિલકત મૂલ્યાંકન, પાત્રતા અને વ્યક્તિગત કર તથ્યો સત્તાવાર પરિણામ બદલી શકે છે.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"NOK 10 મિલિયન બજાર મૂલ્ય સાથેનું પ્રાથમિક ઘર, 2026 પ્રાથમિક-ગૃહના નિયમ હેઠળ, દેવું અને વ્યક્તિગત ભથ્થાં પહેલાં NOK 2.5 મિલિયનની અંદાજિત સંપત્તિ મૂલ્ય ધરાવે છે.","2026 tax year":"2026 ટેક્સ વર્ષ","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"પ્રાથમિક ઘર અંદાજિત બજાર મૂલ્ય (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"સેકન્ડરી હોમ્સ અંદાજિત બજાર મૂલ્ય (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ પહેલા ફંડ શેર કરો અને શેર કરો (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ પહેલાં લાયક વ્યવસાય સંપત્તિ (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"બેંક ડિપોઝિટ અને અન્ય અસ્કયામતો (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"કુલ દેવું (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"સંપત્તિ માટે અમે સંયુક્ત રીતે ટેક્સ લગાવીએ છીએ","Municipal rate (%)":"મ્યુનિસિપલ દર (%)","Home-value comparison":"હોમ-વેલ્યુ સરખામણી","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"એસ્ટીમેટ વેલ્થ ટેક્સ","Export CSV":"CSV નિકાસ કરો","Print estimate":"પ્રિન્ટ અંદાજ","Assets before discounts":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ પહેલા સંપત્તિઓ","Taxable asset value after discounts":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ પછી કરપાત્ર સંપત્તિ મૂલ્ય","Debt reduction from discounts":"ડિસ્કાઉન્ટમાંથી દેવું ઘટાડો","Deductible debt estimate":"કપાતપાત્ર દેવું અંદાજ","Estimated net wealth":"અંદાજિત ચોખ્ખી સંપત્તિ","Personal allowance":"વ્યક્તિગત ભથ્થું","Taxable net wealth":"કરપાત્ર ચોખ્ખી સંપત્તિ","Municipal wealth tax":"મ્યુનિસિપલ વેલ્થ ટેક્સ","State wealth tax":"રાજ્ય સંપત્તિ વેરો","State tax, first band":"રાજ્ય કર, પ્રથમ બેન્ડ","State tax, upper band":"રાજ્ય કર, અપર બેન્ડ","Estimated total wealth tax":"અંદાજિત કુલ સંપત્તિ વેરો","Lower home-value estimate":"ઘર-મૂલ્ય અંદાજ","Current-value estimate":"વર્તમાન-મૂલ્ય અંદાજ","Higher home-value estimate":"ઉચ્ચ ઘર-મૂલ્ય અંદાજ","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 નિયમો અને ધારણાઓ","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"ફક્ત અંદાજ. આ કોઈ સત્તાવાર કર આકારણી અથવા કર સલાહ નથી. જ્યાં ઉપલબ્ધ હોય ત્યાં તમારા ટેક્સ રિટર્ન મૂલ્યોનો ઉપયોગ કરો; તમારા કેસમાં દરો, પાત્રતા, દેવાની ફાળવણી અને મિલકતની કિંમતો અલગ હોઈ શકે છે.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"હોમ્સ: વર્ષના અંતે અંદાજિત બજાર મૂલ્ય દાખલ કરો. શેર્સ અને લાયક વ્યવસાય સંપત્તિ: 2026 ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ પહેલાં મૂલ્ય દાખલ કરો, બજાર મૂલ્ય નહીં સિવાય કે તે યોગ્ય કર આધાર હોય.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"ભથ્થું અને રાજ્ય ઉપલા થ્રેશોલ્ડ માત્ર પત્નીઓ, નોંધાયેલા ભાગીદારો અથવા લાયકાત ધરાવતા સહવાસીઓ માટે તેમની સંયુક્ત સંપત્તિ માટે સંયુક્ત રીતે આકારણી કરવામાં આવે છે.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"મ્યુનિસિપલ ગણતરી પસંદ કરેલ દરનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે, 2026 મહત્તમ 0.35% સુધી ડિફોલ્ટ થાય છે. કેટલીક નગરપાલિકાઓ નીચા દરનો ઉપયોગ કરી શકે છે.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"સંવેદનશીલતા ફક્ત પ્રાથમિક અને ગૌણ ઘરોના દાખલ કરેલ મૂલ્યોને બદલે છે. તે એક સરખામણી છે, સત્તાવાર મૂલ્યાંકનની આગાહી નથી.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 સંપત્તિ-કર ભથ્થું શું છે?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"પ્રમાણભૂત થ્રેશોલ્ડ એક વ્યક્તિ માટે NOK 1.9 મિલિયન છે અને સંયુક્ત રીતે મૂલ્યાંકન કરાયેલ જીવનસાથી અથવા લાયકાત ધરાવતા ભાગીદારો માટે NOK 3.8 મિલિયન છે.","How is my primary home valued?":"મારું પ્રાથમિક ઘર કેવી રીતે મૂલ્યવાન છે?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026 માટે, અંદાજિત સંપત્તિ મૂલ્ય NOK 14 મિલિયન સુધીના બજાર મૂલ્યના 25% છે, ઉપરાંત NOK 14 મિલિયનથી વધુ રકમના 70% છે.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"શું આ ગૌણ ઘર માટે ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ લાગુ કરે છે?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"નં. 2026 કોષ્ટક ગૌણ ઘરોને 0% મૂલ્યાંકન ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ આપે છે. તે અંદાજ તરીકે દાખલ કરેલ બજાર મૂલ્યનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે; સત્તાવાર મૂલ્યાંકન મૂલ્યો અલગ હોઈ શકે છે.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"જ્યારે હું શેર અથવા વ્યવસાયિક સંપત્તિ ધરાવતો હોઉં ત્યારે કપાતપાત્ર દેવું કેમ બદલાય છે?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"નોર્વેજીયન નિયમો સંપૂર્ણ સંપત્તિ મૂલ્યો દ્વારા પ્રમાણસર દેવું ફાળવે છે. મૂલ્યાંકન ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ સાથે અસ્કયામતોને સોંપેલ ભાગ સમાન ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ દર દ્વારા ઘટાડવામાં આવે છે.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"શું મ્યુનિસિપલ રેટ હંમેશા 0.35% છે?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"નં. 0.35% એ 2026 ડિફૉલ્ટ રૂપે વપરાતી મહત્તમ છે. નગરપાલિકા નીચા દર નક્કી કરી શકે છે, જે તમે દાખલ કરી શકો છો.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"શું કેલ્ક્યુલેટર દરેક એસેટ અથવા ટેક્સ કેસને આવરી લે છે?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"નં. તે ઘરો, શેર્સ, પસંદ કરેલ પાત્ર વ્યવસાય અસ્કયામતો, રોકડ અને કુલ દેવુંનો અંદાજ કાઢે છે. વિદેશી અસ્કયામતો, પેન્શન, જટિલ માલિકી, મુક્તિ અને અન્ય વિશેષ નિયમો તમારું મૂલ્યાંકન બદલી શકે છે.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"સ્વિસ QR-બિલ જનરેટર","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"સ્વિસ QR-બિલ જનરેટર - મફત QR ઇન્વૉઇસ મેકર","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"સ્થાનિક રીતે સ્વિસ QR-બિલ બનાવો અને તપાસો. IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR અને SCOR સંદર્ભોને માન્ય કરો; ઇનવોઇસ ડેટા અપલોડ કર્યા વિના A6 ચુકવણી ભાગ અને રસીદ છાપો.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"સ્વિસ QR કોડ સાથે સ્વિસ પેમેન્ટ સ્લિપ બનાવો. તમારી ઇન્વોઇસ વિગતો આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે; કોઈ ચુકવણી શરૂ કરવામાં આવી નથી અને કોઈ બેંક રજિસ્ટરની પૂછપરછ કરવામાં આવી નથી.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"આ ટૂલ SIX સ્વિસ પેમેન્ટ્સ કોડ (SPC) ડેટા બનાવે છે અને તેના ક્ષેત્રો, એકાઉન્ટ/સંદર્ભ સંયોજન, IBAN ચેક અંકો અને સમર્થિત અક્ષરો તપાસે છે. તે તેમના જરૂરી ભૌતિક કદ પર પ્રિન્ટિંગ માટે ચૂકવણીના ભાગ અને રસીદને ફોર્મેટ કરે છે.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"છ ઉદાહરણ: એક QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27-અંકનો QRR સંદર્ભ અને સંરચિત લેણદાર/દેવાદાર સરનામાં.","How it works":"તે કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","Frequently asked questions":"વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો","Limits and accuracy":"મર્યાદાઓ અને ચોકસાઈ","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"આ એક સ્થાનિક દસ્તાવેજ સાધન છે, બેંક સેવા અથવા પ્રમાણપત્ર નથી. તે પુષ્ટિ કરી શકતું નથી કે IBAN કોણ ધરાવે છે, ખાતું ખુલ્લું છે કે કેમ, અથવા ચુકવણી સ્વીકારવામાં આવશે કે કેમ. 100% / વાસ્તવિક કદ પર પ્રિન્ટ કરો અને પેપર પેમેન્ટ ઓર્ડરનો ઉપયોગ કરતા પહેલા 100 mm ચેક લાઇનને માપો.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"લેણદાર IBAN અથવા QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"લેણદારને ચૂકવવાપાત્ર","Account holder / creditor name":"એકાઉન્ટ ધારક/લેણદારનું નામ","Street or P.O. box":"સ્ટ્રીટ અથવા P.O. બોક્સ","Building number":"બિલ્ડીંગ નંબર","Postal code":"પોસ્ટલ કોડ","Town / city":"નગર/શહેર","2-letter country code":"2- અક્ષરનો દેશ કોડ","Amount (optional)":"રકમ (વૈકલ્પિક)","Currency":"ચલણ","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"વૈકલ્પિક દેવાદાર દ્વારા ચૂકવવાપાત્ર","Debtor name":"દેવાદારનું નામ","Reference type":"સંદર્ભ પ્રકાર","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR સંદર્ભ · માત્ર QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"લેણદાર સંદર્ભ · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"કોઈ સંરચિત સંદર્ભ નથી · IBAN","Reference":"સંદર્ભ","Unstructured message":"અનસ્ટ્રક્ચર્ડ સંદેશ","Billing information (optional)":"બિલિંગ માહિતી (વૈકલ્પિક)","Create QR-bill":"QR-બિલ બનાવો","Load SIX sample":"SIX સેમ્પલ લોડ કરો","Clear form":"ફોર્મ સાફ કરો","Check QR payload":"QR પેલોડ તપાસો","Download payment data":"પેમેન્ટ ડેટા ડાઉનલોડ કરો","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG ડાઉનલોડ કરો","Print / save as PDF":"PDF તરીકે પ્રિન્ટ/સેવ કરો","Read a QR Code image":"QR કોડ છબી વાંચો","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG અથવા JPEG પસંદ કરો","Read image locally":"સ્થાનિક રીતે છબી વાંચો","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"સ્વિસ QR કોડ ચુકવણી ડેટા પેસ્ટ કરો","Invoice details":"ઇનવોઇસ વિગતો","QR-bill preview":"QR-બિલ પૂર્વાવલોકન","Receipt":"રસીદ","Payment part":"ચુકવણી ભાગ","Payable to":"ને ચૂકવવાપાત્ર","Payable by":"દ્વારા ચૂકવવાપાત્ર","Account":"એકાઉન્ટ","Additional information":"વધારાની માહિતી","Currency / amount":"ચલણ / રકમ","Print scale check · 100 mm":"પ્રિન્ટ સ્કેલ ચેક · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · સ્વિસ QR-બિલ સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-બિલ તૈયાર. વિગતો આ ઉપકરણ પર રહી.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"કેટલાક ફીલ્ડને તપાસવાની જરૂર છે. હાઇલાઇટ કરેલી માહિતીની સમીક્ષા કરો.","Reading this image on your device…":"તમારા ઉપકરણ પર આ છબી વાંચી રહ્યાં છીએ…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"સ્વિસ QR કોડ સ્થાનિક રીતે વાંચ્યો અને તપાસ્યો.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"તે છબીમાં વાંચી શકાય એવો કોઈ QR કોડ મળ્યો નથી.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"સ્વિસ QR કોડ ડેટા સપોર્ટેડ ફીલ્ડ્સ માટે માન્ય છે.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"ડેટા માન્ય સ્વિસ QR કોડ ચુકવણી પેલોડ નથી.","Form and preview cleared.":"ફોર્મ અને પૂર્વાવલોકન સાફ.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"6 નમૂના લોડ કર્યા. વાસ્તવિક ઉપયોગ પહેલાં તેની નમૂના વિગતો બદલો.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"પ્રથમ એક માન્ય QR-બિલ બનાવો અથવા વાંચો.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB અથવા તેનાથી ઓછાનું PNG અથવા JPEG પસંદ કરો.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"સ્થાનિક QR રીડર લોડ કરી શક્યું નથી. તમે તેના બદલે ચુકવણી ડેટા પેસ્ટ કરી શકો છો.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"કયા IBAN અને સંદર્ભ સંયોજનોને મંજૂરી છે?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN QRR સંદર્ભનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. સામાન્ય સ્વિસ IBAN SCOR અથવા નો સ્ટ્રક્ચર્ડ રેફરન્સ (NON) નો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. QRR માત્ર CHF ઇન્વૉઇસ માટે છે.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"શું આ તપાસ કરે છે કે એકાઉન્ટ અસ્તિત્વમાં છે કે લેણદારનું છે?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"નં. તે માત્ર ફોર્મેટ અને IBAN ચેકસમ તપાસે છે. તે બેંક અથવા એકાઉન્ટ રજિસ્ટ્રીનો સંપર્ક કરતું નથી.","Can I print this at any scale?":"શું હું આને કોઈપણ સ્કેલ પર છાપી શકું?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"પેપર પેમેન્ટ ઓર્ડર માટે, 100% / વાસ્તવિક કદ પર પ્રિન્ટ કરો. ચુકવણીનો ભાગ A6 લેન્ડસ્કેપ (148 × 105 mm) હોવો જોઈએ; 100 mm લાઇનને શાસક સાથે તપાસો.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"શું સાધન ઇન્વોઇસ ડેટા ગમે ત્યાં મોકલે છે?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"નં. જનરેશન અને ઇમેજ રીડિંગ તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં થાય છે. કોઈ એકાઉન્ટ અથવા ચુકવણી સેવાનો ઉપયોગ થતો નથી.","Grade Scale Generator":"ગ્રેડ સ્કેલ જનરેટર","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"ગ્રેડ સ્કેલ જનરેટર — ફ્રી પોઈન્ટ્સ-ટુ-ગ્રેડ ટૂલ","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"પોઈન્ટને તમારા પોતાના થ્રેશોલ્ડ સાથે ટકાવારી અને ગ્રેડમાં ફેરવો. સંપૂર્ણ સ્કેલનું પૂર્વાવલોકન કરો, તેની નકલ કરો અથવા નિકાસ કરો અને ગ્રેડિંગ શીટ છાપો.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"પરીક્ષા અથવા સોંપણી માટે પારદર્શક ગ્રેડિંગ સ્કેલ બનાવો. દરેક ગ્રેડ માટે મહત્તમ પોઈન્ટ અને ન્યૂનતમ ટકાવારી સેટ કરો; સ્કેલ શાળા અથવા રાષ્ટ્રીય ગ્રેડિંગ નિયમ ધારણ કરતું નથી.","Points earned":"પૉઇન્ટ્સ મેળવ્યા","Maximum points":"મહત્તમ પોઈન્ટ","Top grade label":"ટોપ ગ્રેડ લેબલ","Top grade starts at (%)":"ટોચનો ગ્રેડ (%) થી શરૂ થાય છે","Middle grade label":"મિડલ ગ્રેડ લેબલ","Middle grade starts at (%)":"મધ્યમ ગ્રેડ (%) થી શરૂ થાય છે","Lowest grade label":"લોએસ્ટ ગ્રેડ લેબલ","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"સૌથી નીચો ગ્રેડ (%) થી શરૂ થાય છે","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"50-પોઇન્ટ મહત્તમ સાથે, 45 પોઇન્ટ્સ 90% બરાબર છે. તમારી કસ્ટમ થ્રેશોલ્ડ ગ્રેડ લેબલ નક્કી કરે છે.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"શું આ સત્તાવાર ગ્રેડિંગ નીતિનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"નં. તમે થ્રેશોલ્ડ સેટ કરો. ગ્રેડિંગ સિસ્ટમ્સ શાળા, અભ્યાસક્રમ અને દેશ દ્વારા અલગ પડે છે; તમે જે સ્કેલનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની અપેક્ષા રાખો છો તેની પુષ્ટિ કરો.","Can I export the grading bands?":"શું હું ગ્રેડિંગ બેન્ડની નિકાસ કરી શકું?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"હા. પ્રદર્શિત બેન્ડ્સને CSV ફાઇલ તરીકે નિકાસ કરો અથવા સ્કેલ પ્રિન્ટ કરો."},"ha":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Lissafin Biyan Biyan Kuɗi na Norway","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Ƙididdigar Biyan Hutu ta Norway - Babban Kiyasin Kyauta","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Kididdigar biyan hutun Norwegian daga tsarin biyan ku na hutu. Kwatanta farashin gama gari don daidaitaccen hutu, mako na biyar da ma'aikatan da suka kai 60 ko sama da haka.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Shigar da feriepengegrunnlag da aka nuna akan takardar biyan ku. Kwatanta yawan kuɗin biyan biki na Norway na gama gari na shekarunku da tsawon hutun da aka amince.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Tsarin biyan kuɗi na hutu (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Ni 60 ne ko babba a cikin shekarar hutu","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Yarjejeniyar ta ta ƙunshi mako na hutu na biyar","Estimated holiday pay":"Kimanin biyan biki","Rate used":"Kiwon da aka yi amfani da shi","Basis used":"Tushen Amfani","Reset choices":"Sake saitin zaɓuɓɓuka","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Babban ƙididdiga kawai. Biyan biki shine kudin shiga na haraji; Haɗin haraji na iya bambanta ta mutum da kuma biyan kuɗi.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Tare da NOK 500,000 tushe, 10.2% yana ba da NOK 51,000 kafin kowane gyare-gyaren biyan kuɗi.","Which rate should I use?":"Wanne kudi zan yi amfani da shi?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Kididdigar tana amfani da mafi ƙarancin ƙima: 10.2% ko 12% tare da mako na biyar; 12.5% ko 14.3% don ma'aikata masu shekaru 60 ko fiye. Yarjejeniyar ku na iya ba da ƙarin.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Shin wannan adadin da aka biya bayan haraji?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"A'a. Wannan babban kiyasi ne. Biyan biki shine kudin shiga na haraji; riƙewa ya dogara da yanayin ku da lissafin kuɗin ku.","What belongs in the basis?":"Menene ke cikin tushe?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Yi amfani da feriepengegrunnlag akan takardar kuɗin ku ko bayanin shekara-shekara. Wasu ramawa da sauran biyan kuɗi ba a haɗa su da ƙa'idodi.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Kalkuleta na Harajin Kuɗi na Norway","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Ƙididdigar Harajin Norway 2026 - Ƙimar Albashi & Fansho Kyauta","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Yi ƙididdige harajin kuɗin shiga na 2026 Yaren mutanen Norway akan daidaitaccen albashi ko fansho na cikakken shekara. Duba biyan kuɗi na shekara-shekara da na wata-wata, abubuwan haraji kuma kwatanta yanayi biyu.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Kiyasta harajin shiga na 2026 Yaren mutanen Norway don daidaitaccen albashin mazaunin gida ko fansho na cikakken shekara. Dubi manyan abubuwan haraji kuma kwatanta yanayi biyu na babban kuɗin shiga.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Ƙididdigar ƙididdiga ta shafi daidaitattun ragi na 2026, ƙungiyoyin harajin ci gaba guda biyar da gudunmawar inshora na ƙasa. Yanayin fensho ya haɗa da kuɗin harajin fensho kawai don cikakken shekara, 100% cancantar fensho ko cancantar AFP. Yana gudana gaba ɗaya a cikin wannan mashigar.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Don albashin NOK 600,000, kwatanta lissafin haraji na shekara da biyan kuɗi tare da wani albashi ko adadin fensho na cikakken shekara.","Tax year":"Shekarar haraji","Scenario":"Yanayin","Salary":"Albashi","Full-year old-age pension":"Fansho na tsufa na cikakken shekara","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Babban kudin shiga na shekara (NOK)","Tax zone":"Yankin haraji","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Madaidaicin ƙimar (mafi yawan Norway)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / da aka jera matakan-yankin gundumomi","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Ƙimar fensho tana ɗaukar fensho na tsufa ko AFP a 100% na duk watanni 12, ba tare da wani samun kudin shiga ba.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Ƙimar albashi yana ɗaukar mazaunin haraji na Norwegian, shekaru 17-69 kuma babu wani samun kudin shiga.","Compare two scenarios":"Kwatanta yanayi biyu","Scenario 1":"Yanayin 1","Scenario 2":"Yanayin 2","Calculate estimate":"Yi ƙididdige ƙima","Estimated tax per year":"Kiyasin haraji a kowace shekara","Average tax per month":"Matsakaicin haraji kowane wata","Estimated net per year":"Ƙimar net a kowace shekara","Average net per month":"Matsakaicin net kowane wata","Tax on ordinary income":"haraji akan kudin shiga na yau da kullun","Bracket tax":"Harajin Bangaren","National insurance contribution":"Gudunmawar inshora ta ƙasa","Pension tax credit":"Kiredit na harajin fansho","Estimated effective rate":"Kimanin tasiri mai tasiri","Standard deduction base":"Tsarin cirewa daidai","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Ƙimar kuɗi da ƙofa don shekarar samun shiga ta 2026 ne.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Ƙididdiga kawai, ba lissafin haraji na hukuma ko katin haraji ba. Sauran kudin shiga, cirewa, shekaru, zama, matakin fansho da yanayin mutum na iya canza sakamakon.","Reset values":"Sake saita dabi'u","Example":"Misali","How the estimate works":"Yadda kimantawa ke aiki","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Shin wannan shine ainihin lissafin haraji na ko riƙe katin haraji?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"No. Yana kimanta daidaitaccen haraji na shekara-shekara 2026. Katin haraji, ƙima na ƙarshe da riƙewa na iya bambanta saboda cikakken kuɗin shiga, ragi da yanayi.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Zan iya hada albashi da fansho a nan?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Wannan sigar tana ƙididdige nau'in kuɗin shiga guda ɗaya a lokaci guda. Ba ya ƙididdige adadin albashi-da-fensho mai gauraya.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Shin yanayin fensho yana ɗaukar kowane fansho?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"A'a. An ƙididdige ƙimar kuɗin fensho kawai don fenshon tsufa ko cancantar AFP da aka ɗauka a 100% a duk shekara. fensho na ɗan shekara ko ƙima da sauran nau'ikan fensho ba su da iyaka.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Menene zaɓin matakan-shina?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Yana amfani da adadin kudin shiga na yau da kullun na 18.5 da aka buga da NOK 45,000 na musamman don Finnmark da gundumomi da aka jera. Tabbatar cewa gundumar ku ta cancanci.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Kalkuletar Harajin Dukiya ta Norway","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Ƙididdigar Harajin Dukiyar Norway 2026 - Ƙididdiga Kyauta","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Ƙimar 2026 harajin dukiyar Norwegian daga gidaje, hannun jari, kadarorin kasuwanci, tsabar kudi da bashi. Dubi rarrabuwar kawuna na jiha da na birni, rangwamen ƙima da kewayon ƙima.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Ƙimar harajin dukiyar Norway na sirri na 2026. Shigar da ƙididdige ƙimar kasuwa don gidaje da sansanonin haraji kafin rangwame don hannun jari da kadarorin kasuwanci. Dubi rangwamen ƙima, daidaita bashi da keɓancewar ƙididdiga na jihohi da na birni.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Ƙimar ta shafi dokokin ƙimar 2026 da matsakaicin ƙimar birni sai dai idan kun shigar da ƙananan ƙimar. Ana keɓe bashi ta cikakken ƙimar kadari kafin ragi; bashin da aka ba wa rangwamen hannun jari ko kadarorin kasuwanci an rage shi da rangwame iri ɗaya. Ƙimar dukiya, cancanta da bayanan haraji na sirri na iya canza sakamakon hukuma.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Gida na farko tare da darajar kasuwa na NOK 10 miliyan yana da kimanin darajar dukiya na NOK 2.5 miliyan a karkashin tsarin 2026 na farko-gida, kafin bashi da izinin sirri.","2026 tax year":"Shekarar haraji 2026","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Ƙimar kasuwar gida ta farko (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Ƙimar gidaje na sakandare kiyasin ƙimar kasuwa (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Raba da raba kudade kafin rangwame (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Dokokin kasuwanci da suka cancanta kafin rangwame (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Adadin banki da sauran kadarorin (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Jimlar bashi (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"An haɗa mu haraji don dukiya","Municipal rate (%)":"Kudirin gunduma (%)","Home-value comparison":"Kwatancen ƙimar gida","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Kimanin harajin dukiya","Export CSV":"Fitar da CSV","Print estimate":"Kimanin Buga","Assets before discounts":"Kadari kafin rangwame","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Kimar kadari mai haraji bayan rangwame","Debt reduction from discounts":"Rage bashi daga rangwame","Deductible debt estimate":"Kididdigar bashi mai cirewa","Estimated net wealth":"Ƙimar dukiya mai ƙima","Personal allowance":"Izinin sirri","Taxable net wealth":"Dukiyar gidan yanar gizo mai haraji","Municipal wealth tax":"Harajin dukiyar birni","State wealth tax":"Harajin dukiyar Jiha","State tax, first band":"Harajin Jiha, rukunin farko","State tax, upper band":"Haraji na Jiha, babban band","Estimated total wealth tax":"Kididdigar jimlar harajin dukiya","Lower home-value estimate":"Ƙimar ƙimar gida ƙasa","Current-value estimate":"Kimanin ƙima na yanzu","Higher home-value estimate":"Mafi girman ƙimar gida","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 dokoki da zato","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Ƙimar kawai. Wannan ba ƙididdigar haraji ba ce ko shawarar haraji. Yi amfani da ƙimar dawo da harajin ku idan akwai; ƙimar kuɗi, cancanta, rabon bashi da ƙimar kadara na iya bambanta a yanayin ku.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Gidaje: shigar da kimanta ƙimar kasuwa a ƙarshen shekara. Hannun jari da kadarorin kasuwanci masu cancanta: shigar da ƙimar kafin rangwamen 2026, ba ƙimar kasuwa ba sai dai idan wannan shine ainihin tushen haraji.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Alawus da ƙofa na sama ninki biyu kawai ga ma'aurata, abokan hulɗa ko waɗanda suka cancanta waɗanda aka tantance tare don haɗin dukiyarsu.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Lissafin gundumomi yana amfani da ƙimar da aka zaɓa, wanda ya sabawa mafi girman 2026 na 0.35%. Wasu gundumomi na iya amfani da ƙaramin ƙima.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Kwatanta ne, ba hasashe na kima na hukuma ba.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Menene 2026 alawus-alawus na haraji?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Madaidaicin ƙofa shine NOK 1.9 miliyan na mutum ɗaya da kuma NOK 3.8 miliyan na ma'aurata ko abokan cancanta waɗanda aka tantance tare.","How is my primary home valued?":"Yaya ake daraja gidana na farko?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Don 2026, ƙimar dukiyar da aka kiyasta shine 25% na darajar kasuwa har zuwa NOK 14 miliyan, da 70% na adadin sama da NOK 14 miliyan.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Shin wannan yana amfani da rangwame ga gida na biyu?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"No. Tebur na 2026 yana ba gidaje na biyu rangwamen ƙima na 0%. Yana amfani da ƙimar kasuwar da aka shigar a matsayin kimantawa; Ƙimar da aka tantance na hukuma na iya bambanta.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Me yasa bashi mai cirewa ke canzawa lokacin da na mallaki hannun jari ko kadarorin kasuwanci?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Dokokin Norwegian suna rarraba bashi daidai gwargwado ta cikakken ƙimar kadari. An rage rabon da aka ba wa kadarori tare da rangwamen ƙima da ƙimar rangwame iri ɗaya.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Shin yawan kuɗin birni koyaushe 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"No. 0.35% shine mafi girman 2026 da aka yi amfani dashi ta tsohuwa. Gundumar na iya saita ƙima kaɗan, wanda zaku iya shigar dashi.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Shin kalkuleta yana rufe duk wata kadara ko harkallar haraji?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"No. Yana ƙididdige gidaje, hannun jari, zaɓaɓɓun kadarorin kasuwanci da suka cancanta, tsabar kuɗi da jimillar bashi. Kadarorin kasashen waje, fansho, hadadden mallaka, keɓancewa da sauran ƙa'idodi na musamman na iya canza kimar ku.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Janatarar lissafin QR na Swiss","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Generator QR-lissafin Swiss - Mai yin daftarin QR kyauta","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Ƙirƙiri kuma duba lissafin QR na Swiss a gida. Tabbatar da nassoshi IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR da SCOR; buga sashin biyan kuɗi na A6 da karɓa ba tare da loda bayanan daftari ba.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Ƙirƙiri takardar biyan kuɗi ta Swiss tare da lambar QR ta Swiss. Bayanin daftarin ku ya tsaya a cikin wannan burauzar; ba a fara biyan kuɗi kuma ba a nemi rajistar banki ba.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Kayan aiki yana gina bayanan Six Swiss Payments Code (SPC) kuma yana bincika filayensa, haɗin asusun ajiya, IBAN duba lambobi da haruffa masu goyan baya. Yana tsara ɓangaren biyan kuɗi da rasidin bugu a girman jikinsu da ake buƙata.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"Misali SHIDA: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27 mai lamba QRR da adiresoshin masu bashi/mai bin bashi.","How it works":"Yadda yake aiki","Frequently asked questions":"Tambayoyin da ake yawan yi","Limits and accuracy":"Iyakoki da daidaito","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Wannan kayan aikin takaddun gida ne, ba sabis na banki ko takaddun shaida ba. Ba zai iya tabbatar da wanda ya mallaki IBAN ba, ko asusu a bude yake, ko kuma za'a karba. Buga a 100% / Ainihin girman kuma auna layin rajistan 100 mm kafin amfani da odar biyan kuɗi na takarda.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Credit IBAN ko QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Bayarwa ga · mai bashi","Account holder / creditor name":"Mai riƙe asusu / sunan mai bashi","Street or P.O. box":"Titin ko P.O. akwati","Building number":"Lambar gini","Postal code":"Lambar gidan waya","Town / city":"Gari / birni","2-letter country code":"2-lambar ƙasa","Amount (optional)":"Adadi (na zaɓi)","Currency":"Kudi","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Mai biya ta · mai bin bashi na zaɓi","Debtor name":"Sunan mai bashi","Reference type":"Nau'in Magana","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR tunani · QR-IBAN kawai","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Credit Reference · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Babu tsarin tunani · IBAN","Reference":"Magana","Unstructured message":"Saƙon da ba a tsara shi ba","Billing information (optional)":"Bayanin lissafin kuɗi (na zaɓi)","Create QR-bill":"Ƙirƙiri lissafin QR","Load SIX sample":"Load da samfurin SHIDA","Clear form":"Share tsari","Check QR payload":"Duba kaya QR","Download payment data":"Zazzage bayanan biyan kuɗi","Download QR SVG":"Zazzage QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Buga / adana azaman PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Karanta hoton lambar QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Zaɓi PNG ko JPEG","Read image locally":"Karanta hoto a gida","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Manna bayanan biyan kuɗi na lambar QR na Swiss","Invoice details":"Takardar bayanai","QR-bill preview":"bayanin lissafin lissafin QR","Receipt":"Rashi","Payment part":"Kashin biyan kuɗi","Payable to":"Bayarwa ga","Payable by":"Mai biya ta","Account":"Asusun","Additional information":"Ƙarin bayani","Currency / amount":"Kudi / adadin","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Binciken sikelin bugawa · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Ƙimar lissafin QR na Swiss","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"lissafin QR a shirye. Cikakkun bayanai sun tsaya kan wannan na'urar.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Wasu filayen suna buƙatar dubawa. Yi nazarin bayanan da aka haskaka.","Reading this image on your device…":"Karanta wannan hoton akan na'urarka…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Swiss QR Code karanta kuma a duba cikin gida.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Ba a sami lambar QR mai karantawa a wannan hoton ba.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Bayanan lambar QR na Swiss yana aiki don filayen da aka goyan baya.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Bayanan ba su da inganci na biyan kuɗi na lambar QR na Swiss.","Form and preview cleared.":"An share fom da samfoti.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"samfurin shida da aka ɗora. Sauya bayanan samfurin sa kafin amfani da gaske.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Ƙirƙiri ko karanta ingantaccen lissafin QR.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Zaɓi PNG ko JPEG na 10 MiB ko ƙasa da haka.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Mai karanta QR na gida ya kasa ɗauka. Kuna iya liƙa bayanan biyan kuɗi maimakon.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Wanne IBAN da haɗin kai aka yarda?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"QR-IBAN yana amfani da ma'anar QRR. IBAN na Swiss na al'ada yana amfani da SCOR ko babu tsarin tunani (NON). QRR don rasitan CHF ne kawai.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Shin wannan yana bincika cewa akwai asusun ko na mai bin bashi?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"A'a. Yana duba tsarin da IBAN checksum kawai. Ba ya tuntuɓar banki ko rajistar asusu.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Zan iya buga wannan a kowane sikeli?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Don odar biyan kuɗi na takarda, buga a 100% / Girman gaske. Dole ne ɓangaren biyan kuɗi ya zama A6 wuri mai faɗi (148 × 105 mm); duba layin 100 mm tare da mai mulki.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Shin kayan aikin yana aika bayanan daftari a ko'ina?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"A'a. Ƙarni da karatun hoto suna faruwa a cikin burauzar ku. Ba a yi amfani da asusu ko sabis na biyan kuɗi ba.","Grade Scale Generator":"Generator Sikelin Daraja","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Generator Sikeli na Daraja - Kayan Aikin Maki-zuwa-Grade Kyauta","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Juya maki zuwa kashi-kashi da maki tare da matakan kanku. Duba cikakken sikelin, kwafi ko fitar dashi, kuma buga takardar ƙira.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Gina ma'auni na gaskiya don jarrabawa ko aiki. Saita matsakaicin maki da mafi ƙarancin kaso na kowane maki; ma'auni ba ya ɗaukan ƙa'idar makaranta ko na ƙasa.","Points earned":"Maki da aka samu","Maximum points":"Mafi girman maki","Top grade label":"Tambarin maɗaukaki","Top grade starts at (%)":"Mafi daraja yana farawa a (%)","Middle grade label":"Tambarin matakin tsakiya","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Matsayi na tsakiya yana farawa a (%)","Lowest grade label":"Mafi ƙarancin daraja","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Mafi ƙarancin daraja yana farawa a (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Tare da iyakar 50-maki, 45 maki daidai da 90%. Matsalolinku na al'ada sun yanke shawarar alamar daraja.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Shin wannan yana amfani da manufar ƙima na hukuma?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"A'a. Kun saita ƙofa. Tsarin digiri ya bambanta ta makaranta, hanya da ƙasa; tabbatar da ma'aunin da ake sa ran amfani da ku.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Zan iya fitar da makada masu daraja?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ee. Fitar da makada da aka nuna azaman fayil ɗin CSV ko buga ma'auni."},"hi":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"नॉर्वे अवकाश वेतन कैलकुलेटर","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"नॉर्वे हॉलिडे पे कैलकुलेटर - निःशुल्क सकल अनुमान","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"अपने अवकाश-वेतन के आधार पर नॉर्वेजियन अवकाश वेतन का अनुमान लगाएं। मानक अवकाश, पांचवें सप्ताह और 60 या उससे अधिक आयु के कर्मचारियों के लिए सामान्य दरों की तुलना करें।","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"अपनी भुगतान पर्ची पर दिखाया गया फेरीपेंगेग्रुनलैग दर्ज करें। अपनी उम्र और सहमत छुट्टियों की अवधि के लिए सामान्य नॉर्वेजियन सकल अवकाश-भुगतान दरों की तुलना करें।","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"अवकाश-भुगतान आधार (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"मैं छुट्टियों के वर्ष में 60 या इससे अधिक उम्र का हूं","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"मेरे अनुबंध में पांचवां अवकाश सप्ताह शामिल है","Estimated holiday pay":"अनुमानित अवकाश वेतन","Rate used":"उपयोग की गई दर","Basis used":"आधार का उपयोग किया गया","Reset choices":"विकल्प रीसेट करें","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"केवल सकल अनुमान। अवकाश वेतन करयोग्य आय है; कर कटौती व्यक्ति और पेरोल के अनुसार अलग-अलग हो सकती है।","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 आधार के साथ, 10.2% किसी भी पेरोल समायोजन से पहले NOK 51,000 देता है।","Which rate should I use?":"मुझे किस दर का उपयोग करना चाहिए?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"अनुमान सामान्य न्यूनतम दरों का उपयोग करता है: पांचवें सप्ताह के साथ 10.2% या 12%; 60 या उससे अधिक आयु के कर्मचारियों के लिए 12.5% या 14.3%। आपका समझौता और अधिक दे सकता है.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"क्या यह कर के बाद भुगतान की गई राशि है?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"नहीं। यह एक मोटा अनुमान है. अवकाश वेतन करयोग्य आय है; रोकना आपकी परिस्थितियों और पेरोल पर निर्भर करता है।","What belongs in the basis?":"आधार में क्या शामिल है?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"अपनी वेतन पर्ची या वार्षिक विवरण पर फेरीपेंगेग्रुनलैग का उपयोग करें। कुछ प्रतिपूर्ति और अन्य भुगतान नियमों से बाहर रखे गए हैं।","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"नॉर्वे आयकर कैलकुलेटर","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"नॉर्वे टैक्स कैलकुलेटर 2026 — मुफ़्त वेतन और पेंशन अनुमान","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"अनुमान 2026 मानक वेतन या पूरे वर्ष की वृद्धावस्था पेंशन पर नॉर्वेजियन आयकर। वार्षिक और मासिक शुद्ध वेतन, कर घटक देखें और दो परिदृश्यों की तुलना करें।","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"मानक निवासी वेतन या पूरे वर्ष की वृद्धावस्था पेंशन के लिए नॉर्वेजियन आयकर का अनुमान 2026। मुख्य कर घटकों को देखें और दो सकल-आय परिदृश्यों की तुलना करें।","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"कैलकुलेटर 2026 मानक कटौती, पांच प्रगतिशील ब्रैकेट-टैक्स बैंड और राष्ट्रीय बीमा योगदान लागू करता है। पेंशन मोड में केवल पूरे वर्ष के लिए पेंशन टैक्स क्रेडिट, 100% योग्य वृद्धावस्था पेंशन या पात्र एएफपी शामिल है। यह पूरी तरह से इस ब्राउज़र में चलता है.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 के वेतन के लिए, अनुमानित वार्षिक कर और शुद्ध वेतन की तुलना किसी अन्य वेतन या पूरे साल की पेंशन राशि से करें।","Tax year":"कर वर्ष","Scenario":"परिदृश्य","Salary":"वेतन","Full-year old-age pension":"पूरे वर्ष की वृद्धावस्था पेंशन","Gross annual income (NOK)":"सकल वार्षिक आय (NOK)","Tax zone":"कर क्षेत्र","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"मानक दर (अधिकांश नॉर्वे)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"फ़िनमार्क/सूचीबद्ध उपाय-क्षेत्र नगर पालिकाएँ","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"पेंशन अनुमान सभी 12 महीनों के लिए 100% पर पात्र वृद्धावस्था पेंशन या AFP मानता है, बिना किसी अन्य आय के।","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"वेतन अनुमान में सामान्य नॉर्वेजियन कर निवास, आयु 17–69 और कोई अन्य आय नहीं मानी गई है।","Compare two scenarios":"दो परिदृश्यों की तुलना करें","Scenario 1":"परिदृश्य 1","Scenario 2":"परिदृश्य 2","Calculate estimate":"अनुमान की गणना करें","Estimated tax per year":"प्रति वर्ष अनुमानित कर","Average tax per month":"प्रति माह औसत कर","Estimated net per year":"अनुमानित शुद्ध प्रति वर्ष","Average net per month":"प्रति माह औसत नेट","Tax on ordinary income":"साधारण आय पर कर","Bracket tax":"ब्रैकेट टैक्स","National insurance contribution":"राष्ट्रीय बीमा योगदान","Pension tax credit":"पेंशन टैक्स क्रेडिट","Estimated effective rate":"अनुमानित प्रभावी दर","Standard deduction base":"मानक कटौती आधार","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"दरें और सीमाएँ 2026 आय वर्ष के लिए हैं।","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"केवल अनुमान, आधिकारिक कर गणना या कर कार्ड नहीं। अन्य आय, कटौतियाँ, आयु, निवास, पेंशन ग्रेड और व्यक्तिगत परिस्थितियाँ परिणाम बदल सकती हैं।","Reset values":"मान रीसेट करें","Example":"उदाहरण","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कैसे काम करता है","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"क्या यह मेरा सटीक कर बिल या कर-कार्ड रोक है?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"नहीं। यह मानक 2026 वार्षिक कर का अनुमान लगाता है। आपकी पूरी आय, कटौतियों और परिस्थितियों के कारण टैक्स कार्ड, अंतिम मूल्यांकन और रोक अलग-अलग हो सकते हैं।","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"क्या मैं यहां वेतन और पेंशन को जोड़ सकता हूँ?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"यह संस्करण एक समय में एक आय प्रकार का अनुमान लगाता है। यह मिश्रित वेतन और पेंशन मामले की गणना नहीं करता है।","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"क्या पेंशन मोड हर पेंशन को कवर करता है?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"नहीं। पेंशन क्रेडिट केवल योग्य वृद्धावस्था पेंशन या पूरे वर्ष में 100% पर ली गई योग्य एएफपी के लिए तैयार किया गया है। आंशिक-वर्षीय या श्रेणीबद्ध पेंशन और अन्य पेंशन प्रकार दायरे से बाहर हैं।","What is the measures-zone option?":"माप-क्षेत्र विकल्प क्या है?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"यह फिनमार्क और सूचीबद्ध नगर पालिकाओं के लिए प्रकाशित 18.5% साधारण-आय दर और NOK 45,000 विशेष कटौती लागू करता है। पुष्टि करें कि आपकी नगर पालिका योग्य है।","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"नॉर्वे वेल्थ टैक्स कैलकुलेटर","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"नॉर्वे वेल्थ टैक्स कैलकुलेटर 2026 — निःशुल्क अनुमान","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"घरों, शेयरों, व्यावसायिक परिसंपत्तियों, नकदी और ऋण से नॉर्वेजियन संपत्ति कर का अनुमान 2026। राज्य और नगरपालिका विभाजन, मूल्यांकन छूट और मूल्य संवेदनशीलता सीमा देखें।","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026 के लिए व्यक्तिगत नॉर्वेजियन संपत्ति कर का अनुमान लगाएं। घरों के लिए अनुमानित बाजार मूल्य और शेयरों और व्यावसायिक संपत्तियों के लिए पूर्व-छूट कर आधार दर्ज करें। मूल्यांकन छूट, ऋण समायोजन और अलग-अलग राज्य और नगरपालिका अनुमान देखें।","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"अनुमान 2026 मूल्यांकन नियमों और अधिकतम नगरपालिका दर पर लागू होता है जब तक कि आप कम दर दर्ज नहीं करते। छूट से पहले ऋण को पूर्ण परिसंपत्ति मूल्यों द्वारा आवंटित किया जाता है; रियायती शेयरों या व्यावसायिक परिसंपत्तियों को सौंपा गया ऋण उसी छूट से कम हो जाता है। संपत्ति का मूल्यांकन, पात्रता और व्यक्तिगत कर तथ्य आधिकारिक परिणाम को बदल सकते हैं।","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"NOK 10 मिलियन बाजार मूल्य वाले प्राथमिक घर का ऋण और व्यक्तिगत भत्ते से पहले, 2026 प्राथमिक-गृह नियम के तहत अनुमानित संपत्ति मूल्य NOK 2.5 मिलियन है।","2026 tax year":"2026 कर वर्ष","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"प्राथमिक गृह अनुमानित बाजार मूल्य (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"माध्यमिक घरों का अनुमानित बाजार मूल्य (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"छूट से पहले शेयर और शेयर फंड (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"छूट से पहले योग्य व्यावसायिक संपत्ति (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"बैंक जमा और अन्य संपत्ति (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"कुल ऋण (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"संपत्ति के लिए हम पर संयुक्त रूप से कर लगाया जाता है","Municipal rate (%)":"नगरपालिका दर (%)","Home-value comparison":"घर-मूल्य तुलना","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"संपत्ति कर का अनुमान लगाएं","Export CSV":"निर्यात सीएसवी","Print estimate":"प्रिंट अनुमान","Assets before discounts":"छूट से पहले संपत्ति","Taxable asset value after discounts":"छूट के बाद कर योग्य संपत्ति मूल्य","Debt reduction from discounts":"छूट से कर्ज में कमी","Deductible debt estimate":"कटौती योग्य ऋण अनुमान","Estimated net wealth":"अनुमानित शुद्ध संपत्ति","Personal allowance":"व्यक्तिगत भत्ता","Taxable net wealth":"कर योग्य शुद्ध संपत्ति","Municipal wealth tax":"नगरपालिका संपत्ति कर","State wealth tax":"राज्य संपत्ति कर","State tax, first band":"राज्य कर, प्रथम बैंड","State tax, upper band":"राज्य कर, ऊपरी बैंड","Estimated total wealth tax":"अनुमानित कुल संपत्ति कर","Lower home-value estimate":"कम घरेलू-मूल्य अनुमान","Current-value estimate":"वर्तमान-मूल्य अनुमान","Higher home-value estimate":"उच्च गृह-मूल्य अनुमान","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 नियम और धारणाएँ","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"केवल अनुमान। यह कोई आधिकारिक कर निर्धारण या कर सलाह नहीं है। जहां उपलब्ध हो वहां अपने कर रिटर्न मूल्यों का उपयोग करें; आपके मामले में दरें, पात्रता, ऋण आवंटन और संपत्ति मूल्य भिन्न हो सकते हैं।","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"होम्स: वर्ष के अंत में अनुमानित बाजार मूल्य दर्ज करें। शेयर और पात्र व्यावसायिक संपत्तियां: 2026 छूट से पहले का मूल्य दर्ज करें, बाजार मूल्य नहीं जब तक कि वह सही कर आधार न हो।","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"केवल पति-पत्नी, पंजीकृत साझेदारों या योग्य सहवासियों के लिए भत्ता और राज्य की ऊपरी सीमा दोगुनी हो जाती है, जिसका मूल्यांकन उनकी संयुक्त संपत्ति के लिए संयुक्त रूप से किया जाता है।","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"नगरपालिका गणना चयनित दर का उपयोग करती है, जो डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से 2026 अधिकतम 0.35% है। कुछ नगर पालिकाएँ कम दर का उपयोग कर सकती हैं।","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"संवेदनशीलता केवल प्राथमिक और माध्यमिक घरों के दर्ज किए गए मूल्यों को बदलती है। यह एक तुलना है, आधिकारिक मूल्यांकन की भविष्यवाणी नहीं।","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 संपत्ति कर भत्ता क्या है?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"मानक सीमा एक व्यक्ति के लिए NOK 1.9 मिलियन और संयुक्त रूप से मूल्यांकन किए गए जीवनसाथी या योग्य भागीदारों के लिए NOK 3.8 मिलियन है।","How is my primary home valued?":"मेरे प्राथमिक घर का मूल्य क्या है?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026 के लिए, अनुमानित संपत्ति मूल्य NOK 14 मिलियन तक बाजार मूल्य का 25% है, साथ ही NOK 14 मिलियन से ऊपर की राशि का 70% है।","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"क्या यह द्वितीयक घर पर छूट लागू करता है?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"नहीं। 2026 तालिका द्वितीयक घरों को 0% मूल्यांकन छूट देती है। यह अनुमान के रूप में दर्ज किये गये बाजार मूल्य का उपयोग करता है; आधिकारिक मूल्यांकन मूल्य भिन्न हो सकते हैं।","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"जब मेरे पास शेयर या व्यावसायिक संपत्ति होती है तो कटौती योग्य ऋण क्यों बदल जाता है?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"नॉर्वेजियन नियम पूर्ण परिसंपत्ति मूल्यों के आधार पर आनुपातिक रूप से ऋण आवंटित करते हैं। मूल्यांकन छूट वाली परिसंपत्तियों को सौंपा गया हिस्सा उसी छूट दर से कम हो जाता है।","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"क्या नगरपालिका दर हमेशा 0.35% है?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"नहीं। 0.35% डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से उपयोग की जाने वाली अधिकतम 2026 है। नगर पालिका कम दर निर्धारित कर सकती है, जिसे आप दर्ज कर सकते हैं।","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"क्या कैलकुलेटर प्रत्येक संपत्ति या कर मामले को कवर करता है?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"नहीं। यह घरों, शेयरों, चयनित पात्र व्यावसायिक संपत्तियों, नकदी और कुल ऋण का अनुमान लगाता है। विदेशी संपत्ति, पेंशन, जटिल स्वामित्व, छूट और अन्य विशेष नियम आपके मूल्यांकन को बदल सकते हैं।","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"स्विस क्यूआर-बिल जेनरेटर","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"स्विस क्यूआर-बिल जेनरेटर - निःशुल्क क्यूआर चालान निर्माता","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"स्थानीय स्तर पर स्विस क्यूआर-बिल बनाएं और जांचें। IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR और SCOR संदर्भों को मान्य करें; चालान डेटा अपलोड किए बिना A6 भुगतान भाग और रसीद प्रिंट करें।","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"स्विस क्यूआर कोड के साथ स्विस भुगतान पर्ची बनाएं। आपके चालान विवरण इस ब्राउज़र में रहते हैं; कोई भुगतान शुरू नहीं किया गया है और किसी बैंक रजिस्टर के बारे में पूछताछ नहीं की गई है।","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"टूल SIX स्विस पेमेंट्स कोड (SPC) डेटा बनाता है और इसके फ़ील्ड, खाता/संदर्भ संयोजन, IBAN चेक अंक और समर्थित वर्णों की जांच करता है। यह भुगतान भाग और रसीद को उनके आवश्यक भौतिक आकार में मुद्रण के लिए प्रारूपित करता है।","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX उदाहरण: एक QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, एक 27-अंकीय QRR संदर्भ और संरचित लेनदार/देनदार पते।","How it works":"यह कैसे काम करता है","Frequently asked questions":"अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न","Limits and accuracy":"सीमाएं और सटीकता","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"यह एक स्थानीय दस्तावेज़ उपकरण है, कोई बैंक सेवा या प्रमाणन नहीं। यह पुष्टि नहीं कर सकता कि IBAN का मालिक कौन है, क्या कोई खाता खुला है, या कोई भुगतान स्वीकार किया जाएगा या नहीं। 100% / वास्तविक आकार पर प्रिंट करें और कागजी भुगतान आदेश का उपयोग करने से पहले 100 मिमी चेक लाइन को मापें।","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"लेनदार IBAN या QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"लेनदार को देय","Account holder / creditor name":"खाताधारक/लेनदार का नाम","Street or P.O. box":"स्ट्रीट या पी.ओ. बक्सा","Building number":"बिल्डिंग नंबर","Postal code":"पोस्टल कोड","Town / city":"नगर/शहर","2-letter country code":"2-अक्षर देश कोड","Amount (optional)":"राशि (वैकल्पिक)","Currency":"मुद्रा","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"वैकल्पिक देनदार द्वारा भुगतान योग्य","Debtor name":"देनदार का नाम","Reference type":"संदर्भ प्रकार","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR संदर्भ · केवल QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"क्रेडिटर संदर्भ · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"कोई संरचित संदर्भ नहीं · IBAN","Reference":"संदर्भ","Unstructured message":"असंरचित संदेश","Billing information (optional)":"बिलिंग जानकारी (वैकल्पिक)","Create QR-bill":"QR-बिल बनाएं","Load SIX sample":"छह नमूना लोड करें","Clear form":"फॉर्म साफ़ करें","Check QR payload":"QR पेलोड की जाँच करें","Download payment data":"भुगतान डेटा डाउनलोड करें","Download QR SVG":"क्यूआर एसवीजी डाउनलोड करें","Print / save as PDF":"पीडीएफ के रूप में प्रिंट/सेव करें","Read a QR Code image":"QR कोड छवि पढ़ें","Choose PNG or JPEG":"पीएनजी या जेपीईजी चुनें","Read image locally":"छवि को स्थानीय रूप से पढ़ें","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"स्विस QR कोड भुगतान डेटा चिपकाएँ","Invoice details":"चालान विवरण","QR-bill preview":"QR-बिल पूर्वावलोकन","Receipt":"रसीद","Payment part":"भुगतान भाग","Payable to":"को देय","Payable by":"द्वारा देय","Account":"खाता","Additional information":"अतिरिक्त जानकारी","Currency / amount":"मुद्रा/राशि","Print scale check · 100 mm":"प्रिंट स्केल जांच · 100 मिमी","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · स्विस क्यूआर-बिल मानक","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-बिल तैयार। विवरण इस डिवाइस पर रहे.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"कुछ फ़ील्ड की जाँच की आवश्यकता है। हाइलाइट की गई जानकारी की समीक्षा करें.","Reading this image on your device…":"आपके डिवाइस पर यह छवि पढ़ रहा हूँ…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"स्विस क्यूआर कोड स्थानीय स्तर पर पढ़ा और जांचा गया।","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"उस छवि में कोई पढ़ने योग्य QR कोड नहीं मिला।","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"स्विस QR कोड डेटा समर्थित फ़ील्ड के लिए मान्य है।","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"डेटा वैध स्विस क्यूआर कोड भुगतान पेलोड नहीं है।","Form and preview cleared.":"फॉर्म और पूर्वावलोकन साफ़ किया गया।","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"छह नमूना लोड किया गया। वास्तविक उपयोग से पहले इसके नमूना विवरण बदलें।","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"पहले एक वैध QR-बिल बनाएं या पढ़ें।","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB या उससे कम का PNG या JPEG चुनें।","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"स्थानीय QR रीडर लोड नहीं हो सका। आप इसके बजाय भुगतान डेटा पेस्ट कर सकते हैं.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"कौन से IBAN और संदर्भ संयोजन की अनुमति है?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"एक QR-IBAN एक QRR संदर्भ का उपयोग करता है। एक सामान्य स्विस IBAN SCOR या कोई संरचित संदर्भ (NON) का उपयोग करता है। क्यूआरआर केवल सीएचएफ चालान के लिए है।","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"क्या यह जाँचता है कि खाता मौजूद है या लेनदार का है?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"नहीं। यह केवल प्रारूप और IBAN चेकसम की जाँच करता है। यह किसी बैंक या खाता रजिस्ट्री से संपर्क नहीं करता है.","Can I print this at any scale?":"क्या मैं इसे किसी भी पैमाने पर प्रिंट कर सकता हूँ?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"कागजी भुगतान आदेश के लिए, 100% / वास्तविक आकार पर प्रिंट करें। भुगतान भाग A6 लैंडस्केप (148 × 105 मिमी) होना चाहिए; रूलर से 100 मिमी लाइन की जाँच करें।","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"क्या उपकरण इनवॉइस डेटा कहीं भी भेजता है?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"नहीं। जेनरेशन और इमेज रीडिंग आपके ब्राउज़र में होती है। किसी खाते या भुगतान सेवा का उपयोग नहीं किया जाता है.","Grade Scale Generator":"ग्रेड स्केल जेनरेटर","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"ग्रेड स्केल जेनरेटर - निःशुल्क पॉइंट-टू-ग्रेड टूल","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"अपनी स्वयं की सीमा के साथ अंकों को प्रतिशत और ग्रेड में बदलें। पूर्ण पैमाने का पूर्वावलोकन करें, उसे कॉपी या निर्यात करें और एक ग्रेडिंग शीट प्रिंट करें।","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"किसी परीक्षा या असाइनमेंट के लिए एक पारदर्शी ग्रेडिंग स्केल बनाएं। प्रत्येक ग्रेड के लिए अधिकतम अंक और न्यूनतम प्रतिशत निर्धारित करें; पैमाना स्कूल या राष्ट्रीय ग्रेडिंग नियम को नहीं मानता है।","Points earned":"अंक अर्जित","Maximum points":"अधिकतम अंक","Top grade label":"शीर्ष ग्रेड लेबल","Top grade starts at (%)":"शीर्ष ग्रेड (%) से शुरू होता है","Middle grade label":"मध्यम ग्रेड लेबल","Middle grade starts at (%)":"मध्यम ग्रेड (%) से शुरू होता है","Lowest grade label":"निम्नतम ग्रेड लेबल","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"निम्नतम ग्रेड (%) से शुरू होता है","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"50-बिंदु अधिकतम के साथ, 45 अंक 90% के बराबर है। आपकी कस्टम सीमाएँ ग्रेड लेबल तय करती हैं।","Does this use an official grading policy?":"क्या यह आधिकारिक ग्रेडिंग नीति का उपयोग करता है?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"नहीं। आप सीमाएँ निर्धारित करें. ग्रेडिंग प्रणालियाँ स्कूल, पाठ्यक्रम और देश के अनुसार भिन्न होती हैं; उस पैमाने की पुष्टि करें जिसका आपसे उपयोग करने की अपेक्षा की जाती है।","Can I export the grading bands?":"क्या मैं ग्रेडिंग बैंड निर्यात कर सकता हूँ?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"हाँ। प्रदर्शित बैंड को CSV फ़ाइल के रूप में निर्यात करें या स्केल प्रिंट करें।"},"id":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Kalkulator Pembayaran Liburan Norwegia","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Kalkulator Pembayaran Liburan Norwegia — Perkiraan Kotor Gratis","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Perkirakan pembayaran liburan Norwegia berdasarkan pembayaran liburan Anda. Bandingkan tarif umum untuk cuti standar, minggu kelima dan karyawan berusia 60 atau lebih.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Masukkan feriepengegrunnlag yang tertera di slip gaji Anda. Bandingkan tarif pembayaran liburan bruto Norwegia yang umum untuk usia Anda dan jangka waktu liburan yang disepakati.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Dasar pembayaran liburan (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Saya 60 atau lebih tua pada tahun liburan","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Perjanjian saya mencakup hari libur minggu kelima","Estimated holiday pay":"Perkiraan gaji liburan","Rate used":"Nilai yang digunakan","Basis used":"Dasar yang digunakan","Reset choices":"Atur ulang pilihan","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Estimasi kotor saja. Pembayaran hari libur adalah penghasilan kena pajak; pemotongan pajak dapat bervariasi menurut orang dan gaji.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Dengan basis NOK 500,000, 10.2% memberikan NOK 51,000 sebelum penyesuaian penggajian.","Which rate should I use?":"Tarif manakah yang harus saya gunakan?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Perkiraan menggunakan tarif minimum umum: 10.2% atau 12% dengan minggu kelima; 12.5% atau 14.3% untuk karyawan berusia 60 ke atas. Persetujuan Anda mungkin memberi lebih banyak.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Apakah ini jumlah yang dibayarkan setelah pajak?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Tidak. Ini adalah perkiraan kotor. Pembayaran hari libur adalah penghasilan kena pajak; pemotongan tergantung pada keadaan dan gaji Anda.","What belongs in the basis?":"Apa yang termasuk dalam dasar?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Gunakan feriepengegrunnlag pada slip gaji atau laporan tahunan Anda. Beberapa penggantian biaya dan pembayaran lainnya dikecualikan oleh aturan.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator Pajak Penghasilan Norwegia","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Kalkulator Pajak Norwegia 2026 — Perkiraan Gaji & Pensiun Gratis","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Perkirakan 2026 Pajak penghasilan Norwegia atas gaji standar atau pensiun hari tua setahun penuh. Lihat gaji bersih tahunan dan bulanan, komponen pajak, dan bandingkan dua skenario.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Perkirakan 2026 Pajak penghasilan Norwegia untuk gaji penduduk standar atau pensiun hari tua setahun penuh. Lihat komponen pajak utama dan bandingkan dua skenario pendapatan kotor.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Kalkulator ini menerapkan pemotongan standar 2026, lima kelompok pajak progresif, dan kontribusi asuransi nasional. Modus pensiun mencakup kredit pajak pensiun hanya untuk setahun penuh, 100% pensiun hari tua yang memenuhi syarat atau AFP yang memenuhi syarat. Ini sepenuhnya berjalan di browser ini.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Untuk gaji NOK 600,000, bandingkan perkiraan pajak tahunan dan gaji bersih dengan gaji lain atau jumlah pensiun setahun penuh.","Tax year":"Tahun pajak","Scenario":"Skenario","Salary":"Gaji","Full-year old-age pension":"Pensiun hari tua setahun penuh","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Pendapatan kotor tahunan (NOK)","Tax zone":"Zona pajak","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Tarif standar (sebagian besar Norwegia)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / kota zona tindakan yang terdaftar","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Perkiraan pensiun mengasumsikan pensiun hari tua atau AFP yang memenuhi syarat sebesar 100% untuk semua bulan 12, tanpa penghasilan lain.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Perkiraan gaji mengasumsikan domisili pajak Norwegia biasa, usia 17–69 dan tidak ada penghasilan lain.","Compare two scenarios":"Bandingkan dua skenario","Scenario 1":"Skenario 1","Scenario 2":"Skenario 2","Calculate estimate":"Hitung perkiraan","Estimated tax per year":"Perkiraan pajak per tahun","Average tax per month":"Pajak rata-rata per bulan","Estimated net per year":"Perkiraan bersih per tahun","Average net per month":"Rata-rata bersih per bulan","Tax on ordinary income":"Pajak atas penghasilan biasa","Bracket tax":"Pajak braket","National insurance contribution":"Kontribusi asuransi nasional","Pension tax credit":"Kredit pajak pensiun","Estimated effective rate":"Perkiraan tingkat efektif","Standard deduction base":"Dasar pengurangan standar","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Tarif dan ambang batas adalah untuk tahun pendapatan 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Hanya perkiraan, bukan penghitungan pajak atau kartu pajak resmi. Pendapatan lain, potongan, usia, tempat tinggal, tingkat pensiun dan keadaan pribadi dapat mengubah hasilnya.","Reset values":"Setel ulang nilai","Example":"Contoh","How the estimate works":"Cara kerja perkiraan","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Apakah ini tagihan pajak atau potongan kartu pajak saya yang sebenarnya?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Tidak. Ini memperkirakan pajak tahunan standar 2026. Kartu pajak, penilaian akhir, dan pemotongan dapat berbeda tergantung pada penghasilan penuh, potongan, dan keadaan Anda.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Dapatkah saya menggabungkan gaji dan pensiun di sini?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Versi ini memperkirakan satu jenis pendapatan dalam satu waktu. Ini tidak menghitung kasus campuran gaji dan pensiun.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Apakah mode pensiun mencakup setiap pensiun?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Tidak. Kredit pensiun dimodelkan hanya untuk pensiun hari tua yang memenuhi syarat atau AFP yang memenuhi syarat yang diambil sebesar 100% sepanjang tahun. Pensiun paruh tahun atau pensiun bertahap dan jenis pensiun lainnya berada di luar cakupan.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Apa yang dimaksud dengan opsi zona tindakan?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Ini menerapkan tingkat pendapatan biasa 18.5% yang dipublikasikan dan potongan khusus NOK 45,000 untuk Finnmark dan kota-kota yang terdaftar. Konfirmasikan bahwa kotamadya Anda memenuhi syarat.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator Pajak Kekayaan Norwegia","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Kalkulator Pajak Kekayaan Norwegia 2026 — Perkiraan Gratis","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Perkirakan 2026 Pajak kekayaan Norwegia dari rumah, saham, aset bisnis, uang tunai, dan utang. Lihat pembagian negara bagian dan kota, diskon penilaian, dan rentang sensitivitas nilai.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Perkirakan pajak kekayaan pribadi Norwegia untuk 2026. Masukkan perkiraan nilai pasar untuk rumah dan basis pajak sebelum diskon untuk saham dan aset bisnis. Lihat diskon penilaian, penyesuaian utang, dan perkiraan negara bagian dan kota yang terpisah.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Perkiraan ini menerapkan aturan penilaian 2026 dan tarif kota maksimum kecuali Anda memasukkan tarif yang lebih rendah. Hutang dialokasikan berdasarkan nilai aset penuh sebelum diskon; hutang yang dialihkan ke saham yang didiskontokan atau aset bisnis dikurangi dengan diskon yang sama. Penilaian properti, kelayakan, dan fakta pajak pribadi dapat mengubah hasil resmi.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Rumah utama dengan nilai pasar NOK 10 juta memiliki perkiraan nilai kekayaan NOK 2.5 juta berdasarkan aturan rumah utama 2026, sebelum utang dan tunjangan pribadi.","2026 tax year":"2026 tahun pajak","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Estimasi nilai pasar rumah utama (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Estimasi nilai pasar rumah sekunder (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Bagikan dan bagikan dana sebelum diskon (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Aset bisnis yang memenuhi syarat sebelum diskon (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Deposito bank dan aset lainnya (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Total utang (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Kita dikenai pajak bersama atas kekayaan","Municipal rate (%)":"Tarif kota (%)","Home-value comparison":"Perbandingan nilai rumah","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Perkiraan pajak kekayaan","Export CSV":"Ekspor CSV","Print estimate":"Cetak perkiraan","Assets before discounts":"Aset sebelum diskon","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Nilai aset kena pajak setelah diskon","Debt reduction from discounts":"Pengurangan hutang dari diskon","Deductible debt estimate":"Estimasi utang yang dapat dikurangkan","Estimated net wealth":"Perkiraan kekayaan bersih","Personal allowance":"Tunjangan pribadi","Taxable net wealth":"Kekayaan Bersih Kena Pajak","Municipal wealth tax":"Pajak kekayaan kota","State wealth tax":"Pajak Kekayaan Negara","State tax, first band":"Pajak negara, pita pertama","State tax, upper band":"Pajak negara bagian, pita atas","Estimated total wealth tax":"Perkiraan total pajak kekayaan","Lower home-value estimate":"Perkiraan nilai rumah yang lebih rendah","Current-value estimate":"Estimasi nilai saat ini","Higher home-value estimate":"Perkiraan nilai rumah lebih tinggi\nAturan dan asumsi","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Estimasi saja. Ini bukan penilaian pajak resmi atau nasihat perpajakan. Gunakan nilai pengembalian pajak Anda jika tersedia; tarif, kelayakan, alokasi utang, dan nilai properti mungkin berbeda dalam kasus Anda.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Rumah: masukkan perkiraan nilai pasar pada akhir tahun. Saham dan aset bisnis yang memenuhi syarat: masukkan nilai sebelum diskon 2026, bukan nilai pasar kecuali jika itu adalah dasar pajak yang benar.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Tunjangan dan ambang batas atas negara bagian berlipat ganda hanya untuk pasangan, pasangan terdaftar, atau orang yang tinggal bersama yang memenuhi syarat yang dinilai bersama untuk kekayaan gabungan mereka.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Perhitungan kota menggunakan tarif yang dipilih, defaultnya adalah maksimum 2026 sebesar 0.35%. Beberapa kota mungkin menggunakan tarif yang lebih rendah.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Sensitivitas hanya mengubah nilai rumah primer dan sekunder yang dimasukkan. Ini adalah perbandingan, bukan prediksi penilaian resmi.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Berapakah tunjangan pajak kekayaan 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Ambang standarnya adalah NOK 1.9 juta untuk satu orang dan NOK 3.8 juta untuk pasangan atau pasangan yang memenuhi syarat yang dinilai bersama.","How is my primary home valued?":"Berapa harga rumah utama saya?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Untuk 2026, perkiraan nilai kekayaannya adalah 25% dari nilai pasar hingga NOK 14 juta, ditambah 70% dari jumlah di atas NOK 14 juta.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Apakah ini berlaku diskon untuk rumah sekunder?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Tidak. Tabel 2026 memberikan diskon penilaian 0% pada rumah sekunder. Ia menggunakan nilai pasar yang dimasukkan sebagai perkiraan; nilai penilaian resmi dapat berbeda.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Mengapa utang yang dapat dikurangkan berubah ketika saya memiliki saham atau aset bisnis?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Peraturan Norwegia mengalokasikan utang secara proporsional berdasarkan nilai aset penuh. Porsi yang ditetapkan pada aset dengan diskon penilaian dikurangi dengan tingkat diskonto yang sama.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Apakah tarif kota selalu 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Tidak. 0.35% adalah 2026 maksimum yang digunakan secara default. Kotamadya mungkin menetapkan tarif yang lebih rendah, yang dapat Anda masukkan.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Apakah kalkulator mencakup setiap kasus aset atau pajak?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Tidak. Ini memperkirakan rumah, saham, aset bisnis terpilih yang memenuhi syarat, uang tunai, dan total utang. Aset asing, pensiun, kepemilikan kompleks, pengecualian, dan aturan khusus lainnya dapat mengubah penilaian Anda.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Generator Tagihan QR Swiss","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Generator Tagihan QR Swiss — Pembuat Faktur QR Gratis","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Buat dan periksa tagihan QR Swiss secara lokal. Validasi referensi IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR dan SCOR; cetak bagian pembayaran dan kwitansi A6 tanpa mengunggah data faktur.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Buat slip pembayaran Swiss dengan Kode QR Swiss. Detail faktur Anda tetap ada di browser ini; tidak ada pembayaran yang dilakukan dan tidak ada pendaftaran bank yang ditanyakan.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Alat ini membuat data ENAM Kode Pembayaran Swiss (SPC) dan memeriksa bidangnya, kombinasi akun/referensi, digit pemeriksaan IBAN, dan karakter yang didukung. Ini memformat bagian pembayaran dan tanda terima untuk dicetak pada ukuran fisik yang diperlukan.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX contoh: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, referensi QRR digit 27 dan alamat kreditur/debitur terstruktur.","How it works":"Cara kerjanya","Frequently asked questions":"Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan","Limits and accuracy":"Batas dan akurasi","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Ini adalah alat dokumen lokal, bukan layanan atau sertifikasi bank. Ini tidak dapat memastikan siapa pemilik IBAN, apakah rekeningnya terbuka, atau apakah pembayaran akan diterima. Cetak pada 100% / Ukuran sebenarnya dan ukur garis centang 100 mm sebelum menggunakan perintah pembayaran kertas.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Kreditor IBAN atau QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Hutang kepada · kreditur","Account holder / creditor name":"Nama pemegang rekening/kreditur","Street or P.O. box":"Jalan atau P.O. kotak","Building number":"Nomor bangunan","Postal code":"Kode Pos","Town / city":"Kota / kota","2-letter country code":"2-huruf kode negara","Amount (optional)":"Jumlah (opsional)","Currency":"Mata uang","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Dibayar oleh · debitur opsional","Debtor name":"Nama debitur","Reference type":"Jenis referensi","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Referensi QR · Hanya QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Referensi kreditor · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Tidak ada referensi terstruktur · IBAN","Reference":"Referensi","Unstructured message":"Pesan tidak terstruktur","Billing information (optional)":"Informasi penagihan (opsional)","Create QR-bill":"Buat tagihan QR","Load SIX sample":"Muat ENAM sampel","Clear form":"Bentuk bening","Check QR payload":"Periksa muatan QR","Download payment data":"Unduh data pembayaran","Download QR SVG":"Unduh QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Cetak / simpan sebagai PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Baca gambar Kode QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Pilih PNG atau JPEG","Read image locally":"Baca gambar secara lokal","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Tempel data pembayaran Kode QR Swiss","Invoice details":"Rincian faktur","QR-bill preview":"Pratinjau tagihan QR","Receipt":"Kwitansi","Payment part":"Bagian pembayaran","Payable to":"Dibayarkan kepada","Payable by":"Dibayar oleh","Account":"Akun","Additional information":"Informasi tambahan","Currency / amount":"Mata uang / jumlah","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Pemeriksaan skala cetak · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"ENAM · Standar tagihan QR Swiss","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-tagihan siap. Detailnya tetap ada di perangkat ini.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Beberapa bidang perlu diperiksa. Tinjau informasi yang disorot.","Reading this image on your device…":"Membaca gambar ini di perangkat Anda…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Kode QR Swiss dibaca dan diperiksa secara lokal.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Tidak ditemukan Kode QR yang dapat dibaca pada gambar itu.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Data Kode QR Swiss valid untuk bidang yang didukung.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Data tersebut bukan payload pembayaran Kode QR Swiss yang valid.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formulir dan pratinjau dihapus.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ENAM sampel dimuat. Ganti detail sampelnya sebelum penggunaan sebenarnya.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Buat atau baca tagihan QR yang valid terlebih dahulu.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Pilih PNG atau JPEG dari 10 MiB atau kurang.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Pembaca QR lokal tidak dapat memuat. Anda dapat menempelkan data pembayaran.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Kombinasi IBAN dan referensi manakah yang diperbolehkan?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"QR-IBAN menggunakan referensi QRR. IBAN Swiss normal menggunakan SCOR atau tanpa referensi terstruktur (NON). QRR hanya untuk faktur CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Apakah ini memeriksa apakah rekening itu ada atau milik kreditur?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Tidak. Ia memeriksa format dan checksum IBAN saja. Itu tidak menghubungi bank atau registrasi rekening.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Dapatkah saya mencetak ini dalam skala berapa pun?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Untuk perintah pembayaran kertas, cetak pada 100% / Ukuran sebenarnya. Bagian pembayaran harus lanskap A6 (148 × 105 mm); periksa garis 100 mm dengan penggaris.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Apakah alat ini mengirimkan data faktur ke mana saja?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Tidak. Pembuatan dan pembacaan gambar terjadi di browser Anda. Tidak ada akun atau layanan pembayaran yang digunakan.","Grade Scale Generator":"Generator Skala Kelas","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Generator Skala Nilai — Alat Poin-ke-Kelas Gratis","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Ubah poin menjadi persentase dan nilai dengan ambang batas Anda sendiri. Pratinjau skala penuh, salin atau ekspor, dan cetak lembar penilaian.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Membuat skala penilaian yang transparan untuk ujian atau tugas. Tetapkan poin maksimum dan persentase minimum untuk setiap nilai; skala ini tidak mengasumsikan aturan penilaian sekolah atau nasional.","Points earned":"Poin diperoleh","Maximum points":"Poin maksimum","Top grade label":"Label kelas atas","Top grade starts at (%)":"Kelas teratas mulai dari (%)","Middle grade label":"Label kelas menengah","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Kelas menengah mulai dari (%)","Lowest grade label":"Label kelas terendah","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Nilai terendah dimulai dari (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Dengan maksimum poin 50, poin 45 sama dengan 90%. Ambang batas khusus Anda menentukan label nilai.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Apakah ini menggunakan kebijakan penilaian resmi?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Tidak. Anda menetapkan ambang batas. Sistem penilaian berbeda-beda di setiap sekolah, kursus, dan negara; konfirmasikan skala yang ingin Anda gunakan.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Dapatkah saya mengekspor pita penilaian?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ya. Ekspor band yang ditampilkan sebagai file CSV atau cetak skalanya."},"it":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Calcola la retribuzione delle ferie in Norvegia","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Calcola la retribuzione delle ferie in Norvegia: stima lorda gratuita","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Stima la retribuzione delle ferie norvegesi in base alla retribuzione delle ferie. Confronta le tariffe comuni per il congedo standard, la quinta settimana e i dipendenti di età pari o superiore a 60.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Inserisci il feriepengegrunnlag riportato sulla busta paga. Confronta le comuni tariffe norvegesi per le ferie lorde in base alla tua età e alla durata delle vacanze concordata.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Base ferie (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Ho almeno 60 nell'anno festivo","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Il mio contratto prevede una quinta settimana di ferie","Estimated holiday pay":"Retribuzione ferie stimata","Rate used":"Tariffa utilizzata","Basis used":"Base utilizzata","Reset choices":"Reimposta le scelte","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Solo stima lorda. Il pagamento delle ferie costituisce un reddito imponibile; la ritenuta fiscale può variare in base alla persona e alla busta paga.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Con una base NOK 500,000, 10.2% restituisce NOK 51,000 prima di qualsiasi adeguamento delle buste paga.","Which rate should I use?":"Quale tariffa dovrei utilizzare?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Il preventivo utilizza tariffe minime comuni: 10.2% o 12% con una quinta settimana; 12.5% o 14.3% per i dipendenti di età pari o superiore a 60. Il tuo accordo potrebbe dare di più.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"È questo l'importo pagato al netto delle tasse?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"N. Questa è una stima lorda. Il pagamento delle ferie costituisce un reddito imponibile; la ritenuta dipende dalle circostanze e dalla busta paga.","What belongs in the basis?":"Cosa c'è nella base?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Utilizza il feriepengegrunnlag sulla busta paga o sull'estratto conto annuale. Alcuni rimborsi e altri pagamenti sono esclusi dalle norme.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Calcolatore delle imposte sul reddito norvegese","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Calcolatore tasse norvegesi 2026 — Stima gratuita di stipendio e pensione","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Stima 2026 Imposta norvegese sul reddito sullo stipendio standard o sulla pensione di vecchiaia per l'intero anno. Visualizza la retribuzione netta annuale e mensile, le componenti fiscali e confronta due scenari.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Stima 2026 Imposta norvegese sul reddito per uno stipendio residente standard o una pensione di vecchiaia per l'intero anno. Scopri le principali componenti fiscali e confronta due scenari di reddito lordo.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Il calcolatore applica le detrazioni standard 2026, i cinque scaglioni fiscali progressivi e i contributi previdenziali. La modalità pensione include il credito d'imposta sulla pensione solo per un anno intero, 100% di pensione di vecchiaia qualificante o AFP ammissibile. Funziona interamente in questo browser.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Per uno stipendio di NOK 600,000, confronta l'imposta annuale stimata e la retribuzione netta con un altro stipendio o l'importo della pensione per l'intero anno.","Tax year":"Anno fiscale","Scenario":"Scenario","Salary":"Stipendio","Full-year old-age pension":"Pensione di vecchiaia per l'intero anno","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Reddito annuo lordo (NOK)","Tax zone":"Zona fiscale","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Tariffa standard (gran parte della Norvegia)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / comuni delle zone di misure elencate","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"La stima della pensione presuppone una pensione di vecchiaia ammissibile o AFP al 100% per tutti i mesi 12, senza altri redditi.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"La stima dello stipendio presuppone la residenza fiscale norvegese ordinaria, l'età 17–69 e nessun altro reddito.","Compare two scenarios":"Confronta due scenari","Scenario 1":"Scenario 1","Scenario 2":"Scenario 2","Calculate estimate":"Calcola preventivo","Estimated tax per year":"Imposta stimata all'anno","Average tax per month":"Imposta media al mese","Estimated net per year":"Netto stimato per anno","Average net per month":"Netto medio al mese","Tax on ordinary income":"Imposta sul reddito ordinario","Bracket tax":"Imposta a scaglione","National insurance contribution":"Contributo previdenziale nazionale","Pension tax credit":"Credito d'imposta sulle pensioni","Estimated effective rate":"Tasso effettivo stimato","Standard deduction base":"Base di detrazione standard","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Le tariffe e le soglie si riferiscono all'anno di reddito 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Solo stima, non calcolo fiscale ufficiale o tessera fiscale. Altri redditi, detrazioni, età, residenza, grado di pensione e circostanze personali possono modificare il risultato.","Reset values":"Reimposta valori","Example":"Esempio","How the estimate works":"Come funziona il preventivo","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Questa è la mia fattura fiscale esatta o la trattenuta sulla tessera fiscale?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"N. Si stima l'imposta annuale standard 2026. La tessera fiscale, l'accertamento finale e la ritenuta possono differire a causa del reddito complessivo, delle detrazioni e delle circostanze.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Posso combinare qui stipendio e pensione?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Questa versione stima un tipo di reddito alla volta. Non calcola un caso misto di stipendio e pensione.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"La modalità pensione copre ogni pensione?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"N. Il credito pensionistico è modellato solo per una pensione di vecchiaia qualificante o un AFP ammissibile percepito al 100% durante tutto l'anno. La pensione annuale parziale o graduata e altri tipi di pensione non rientrano nel campo di applicazione.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Che cos'è l'opzione zona misure?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Si applica il tasso di reddito ordinario 18.5% pubblicato e la detrazione speciale NOK 45,000 per il Finnmark e i comuni elencati. Conferma che il tuo comune è idoneo.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Calcolatore delle imposte patrimoniali norvegesi","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Calcola imposte patrimoniali norvegesi 2026 — Stima gratuita","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Stima 2026 Imposta patrimoniale norvegese su case, azioni, beni aziendali, contanti e debiti. Visualizza la suddivisione statale e municipale, gli sconti di valutazione e un intervallo di sensibilità del valore.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Stima dell'imposta patrimoniale norvegese personale per 2026. Inserisci i valori di mercato stimati per le case e le basi imponibili pre-sconto per azioni e beni aziendali. Consulta gli sconti di valutazione, l'adeguamento del debito e le stime statali e comunali separate.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Il preventivo applica le regole di valutazione 2026 e la tariffa comunale massima a meno che non si inserisca una tariffa inferiore. Il debito viene allocato in base al valore patrimoniale completo prima degli sconti; il debito assegnato ad azioni o beni aziendali scontati viene ridotto dello stesso sconto. Valutazioni immobiliari, ammissibilità e fatti fiscali personali possono modificare il risultato ufficiale.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Una casa primaria con un valore di mercato di 10 milioni di NOK ha un valore patrimoniale stimato di 2.5 milioni di NOK secondo la regola della casa primaria 2026, prima del debito e dell'indennità personale.","2026 tax year":"2026 anno fiscale","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Valore di mercato stimato della casa principale (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Valore di mercato stimato delle case secondarie (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Azioni e fondi azionari prima dello sconto (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Beni aziendali idonei prima dello sconto (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Depositi bancari e altre attività (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Debito totale (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Siamo tassati congiuntamente per la ricchezza","Municipal rate (%)":"Tariffa comunale (%)","Home-value comparison":"Confronto del valore della casa","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Stima dell'imposta sul patrimonio","Export CSV":"Esporta CSV","Print estimate":"Stampa preventivo","Assets before discounts":"Attività prima degli sconti","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Valore patrimoniale imponibile dopo gli sconti","Debt reduction from discounts":"Riduzione del debito da sconti","Deductible debt estimate":"Stima del debito deducibile","Estimated net wealth":"Ricchezza netta stimata","Personal allowance":"Indennità personale","Taxable net wealth":"Ricchezza netta imponibile","Municipal wealth tax":"Imposta patrimoniale comunale","State wealth tax":"Imposta statale sul patrimonio","State tax, first band":"Imposta statale prima fascia","State tax, upper band":"Imposta statale, fascia superiore","Estimated total wealth tax":"Imposta sul patrimonio totale stimata","Lower home-value estimate":"Stima del valore della casa inferiore","Current-value estimate":"Stima del valore corrente","Higher home-value estimate":"Stima del valore della casa più alta","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 regole e presupposti","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Solo stima. Questa non è una valutazione fiscale ufficiale o una consulenza fiscale. Utilizza i valori della tua dichiarazione dei redditi, ove disponibili; tassi, ammissibilità, allocazione del debito e valori delle proprietà possono differire nel tuo caso.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Case: inserisci il valore di mercato stimato a fine anno. Azioni e beni aziendali idonei: inserisci il valore prima dello sconto 2026, non il valore di mercato, a meno che non sia la base imponibile corretta.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"L'assegno e la soglia massima statale raddoppiano solo per i coniugi, i partner registrati o i conviventi qualificati valutati congiuntamente per il loro patrimonio complessivo.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Il calcolo comunale utilizza la tariffa selezionata, per impostazione predefinita il massimo 2026 pari a 0.35%. Alcuni comuni potrebbero applicare una tariffa più bassa.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"La sensibilità modifica solo i valori immessi delle case primarie e secondarie. Si tratta di un confronto, non di una previsione di una valutazione ufficiale.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Qual è la detrazione fiscale 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"La soglia standard è 1.9 milioni di NOK per una persona e 3.8 milioni di NOK per coniugi o partner qualificati valutati congiuntamente.","How is my primary home valued?":"Come viene valutata la mia casa principale?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Per 2026, il valore stimato della ricchezza è pari al 25% del valore di mercato fino a 14 milioni di NOK, più 70% dell'importo superiore a 14 milioni di NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Si applica uno sconto a una casa secondaria?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"N. La tabella 2026 attribuisce alle case secondarie uno sconto sulla valutazione pari al 0%. Utilizza il valore di mercato inserito come stima; i valori valutati ufficiali possono differire.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Perché il debito deducibile cambia quando possiedo azioni o beni aziendali?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Le regole norvegesi assegnano il debito proporzionalmente in base al valore patrimoniale completo. La quota assegnata alle attività con sconto di valutazione è ridotta dello stesso tasso di sconto.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"La tariffa comunale è sempre 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"N. 0.35% è il valore massimo 2026 utilizzato per impostazione predefinita. Un comune può fissare una tariffa più bassa, che puoi inserire.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Il calcolatore copre ogni caso patrimoniale o fiscale?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"N. Stima case, azioni, attività aziendali ammissibili selezionate, liquidità e debito totale. Beni esteri, pensioni, proprietà complesse, esenzioni e altre regole speciali possono modificare la tua valutazione.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Generatore di fatture QR svizzere","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Generatore di fatture QR svizzere: generatore di fatture QR gratuito","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Crea e controlla localmente una QR-fattura svizzera. Convalidare i riferimenti IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR e SCOR; stampare la parte pagamento A6 e la ricevuta senza caricare i dati della fattura.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Crea una polizza di versamento svizzera con un codice QR svizzero. I dettagli della tua fattura rimangono in questo browser; nessun pagamento viene avviato e nessun registro bancario viene interrogato.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Lo strumento crea i dati SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) e ne controlla i campi, la combinazione conto/riferimento, le cifre di controllo IBAN e i caratteri supportati. Formatta la parte relativa al pagamento e la ricevuta per la stampa nella dimensione fisica richiesta.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX esempio: un QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, un riferimento QRR a cifre 27 e indirizzi strutturati di creditore/debitore.","How it works":"Come funziona","Frequently asked questions":"Domande frequenti","Limits and accuracy":"Limiti e precisione","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Questo è uno strumento di documentazione locale, non un servizio bancario o una certificazione. Non può confermare chi possiede un IBAN, se un conto è aperto o se verrà accettato un pagamento. Stampa a 100% / Dimensioni effettive e misura la riga di controllo in mm 100 prima di utilizzare un ordine di pagamento cartaceo.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN creditore o QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Da pagare al · creditore","Account holder / creditor name":"Nome del titolare del conto/creditore","Street or P.O. box":"Via o P.O. scatola","Building number":"Numero edificio","Postal code":"Codice postale","Town / city":"Città/città","2-letter country code":"2-lettera codice paese","Amount (optional)":"Importo (facoltativo)","Currency":"Valuta","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Pagabile da · debitore facoltativo","Debtor name":"Nome debitore","Reference type":"Tipo di riferimento","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Riferimento QR · Solo QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Riferimento creditore · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Nessun riferimento strutturato · IBAN","Reference":"Riferimento","Unstructured message":"Messaggio non strutturato","Billing information (optional)":"Informazioni di fatturazione (facoltativo)","Create QR-bill":"Crea QR-fattura","Load SIX sample":"Carica SEI campioni","Clear form":"Cancella modulo","Check QR payload":"Controlla il carico utile QR","Download payment data":"Scarica i dati di pagamento","Download QR SVG":"Scarica QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Stampa/salva come PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Leggi un'immagine del codice QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Scegli PNG o JPEG","Read image locally":"Leggi l'immagine localmente","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Incolla i dati di pagamento del codice QR svizzero","Invoice details":"Dettagli fattura","QR-bill preview":"Anteprima della fattura QR","Receipt":"Ricevuta","Payment part":"Parte pagamento","Payable to":"Intestato a","Payable by":"Pagabile da","Account":"Conto","Additional information":"Ulteriori informazioni","Currency / amount":"Valuta/importo","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Stampa controllo scala · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Standard svizzero della fattura QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-fattura pronta. I dettagli sono rimasti su questo dispositivo.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Alcuni campi devono essere controllati. Esamina le informazioni evidenziate.","Reading this image on your device…":"Lettura di questa immagine sul tuo dispositivo…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Codice QR svizzero letto e controllato localmente.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Nessun codice QR leggibile è stato trovato in quell'immagine.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"I dati del codice QR svizzero sono validi per i campi supportati.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"I dati non sono un payload di pagamento Swiss QR Code valido.","Form and preview cleared.":"Modulo e anteprima cancellati.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SEI campione caricato. Sostituisci i dettagli del campione prima dell'uso reale.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Creare o leggere prima una QR-fattura valida.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Scegli un PNG o JPEG di 10 MiB o meno.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Impossibile caricare il lettore QR locale. Puoi invece incollare i dati di pagamento.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Quali combinazioni IBAN e riferimento sono consentite?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Un QR-IBAN utilizza un riferimento QRR. Un normale IBAN svizzero utilizza SCOR o nessun riferimento strutturato (NON). QRR è valido solo per fatture in CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Verifica che il conto esista o appartenga al creditore?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"N. Controlla solo il formato e il checksum IBAN. Non contatta la banca o il registro del conto.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Posso stamparlo in qualsiasi scala?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Per un ordine di pagamento cartaceo, stampare a 100%/dimensione effettiva. La parte pagamento deve essere A6 orizzontale (148 × 105 mm); controlla la linea 100 mm con un righello.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Lo strumento invia i dati delle fatture ovunque?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"N. La generazione e la lettura delle immagini avvengono nel tuo browser. Non viene utilizzato alcun account o servizio di pagamento.","Grade Scale Generator":"Generatore scala di valutazione","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Generatore scala di valutazione: strumento gratuito da punti a valutazione","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Trasforma i punti in percentuali e voti con le tue soglie. Visualizza l'anteprima della scala intera, copiala o esportala e stampa un foglio di valutazione.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Crea una scala di valutazione trasparente per un esame o un compito. Imposta il punteggio massimo e la percentuale minima per ciascun voto; la scala non presuppone una regola di classificazione scolastica o nazionale.","Points earned":"Punti guadagnati","Maximum points":"Punti massimi","Top grade label":"Etichetta di qualità superiore","Top grade starts at (%)":"Il voto massimo inizia alle (%)","Middle grade label":"Etichetta di grado medio","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Il voto medio inizia alle (%)","Lowest grade label":"Etichetta di grado più basso","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Il voto più basso inizia da (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Con un massimo di punti 50, i punti 45 equivalgono a 90%. Le tue soglie personalizzate determinano l'etichetta del voto.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Utilizza una politica di valutazione ufficiale?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"N. Sei tu a impostare le soglie. I sistemi di valutazione differiscono a seconda della scuola, del corso e del paese; confermare la scala che si prevede di utilizzare.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Posso esportare le fasce di valutazione?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Sì. Esporta le bande visualizzate come file CSV o stampa la scala."},"ja":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"ノルウェーの休日給与計算ツール","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"ノルウェーの休日給与計算ツール - 無料の総見積り","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"休日給与ベースからノルウェーの休日給与を見積もります。標準休暇、5 週間目、および 60 以上の年齢の従業員の一般的な率を比較します。","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"給与明細に記載されているferiepengegrunnlagを入力してください。あなたの年齢と合意された休暇期間に応じた、ノルウェーの一般的な休日総支給額を比較してください。","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"休日給与ベース (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"私はホリデーイヤーの 60 以降です","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"私の契約には 5 週目の休日が含まれています","Estimated holiday pay":"休日給与の見積もり","Rate used":"使用レート","Basis used":"使用される基準","Reset choices":"選択肢をリセット","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"総見積りのみ。休日手当は課税所得です。源泉徴収額は人や給与によって異なります。","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 ベースでは、給与調整前の 10.2% は NOK 51,000 になります。","Which rate should I use?":"どのレートを使用すればよいですか?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"見積もりでは一般的な最低料金を使用します: 5 週目の場合は 10.2% または 12%。 60 以上の年齢の従業員の場合は、12.5% または 14.3%。あなたの合意により、さらに多くのことが得られる可能性があります。","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"これは税引後の支払額ですか?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"いいえ。これは大まかな見積もりです。休日手当は課税所得です。源泉徴収はあなたの状況と給与によって異なります。","What belongs in the basis?":"基礎には何が含まれますか?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"給与明細または年次明細書に feriepengegrunnlag を使用します。一部の払い戻しおよびその他の支払いは規則によって除外されます。","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"ノルウェーの所得税計算機","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"ノルウェーの税金計算ツール 2026 — 無料の給与と年金の見積もり","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"2026 標準給与または満年の老齢年金に対するノルウェーの所得税を見積もります。年間および毎月の純給与、税金の構成要素を確認し、2 つのシナリオを比較します。","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"標準居住者給与または満1年間の老齢年金に対するノルウェー所得税の推定額2026。主要な税構成要素を確認し、2 つの総所得シナリオを比較します。","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"計算機は、2026 標準控除、5 つの累進ブラケット税帯、および国民保険料を適用します。年金モードには、年間 100% の対象となる老齢年金または対象となる AFP に対してのみ年金税額控除が含まれます。すべてこのブラウザ内で実行されます。","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 の給与について、推定年間税金と純給与を別の給与または年間年金額と比較します。","Tax year":"課税年度","Scenario":"シナリオ","Salary":"給与","Full-year old-age pension":"満年間の老齢年金","Gross annual income (NOK)":"総年間収入 (NOK)","Tax zone":"課税ゾーン","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"標準料金 (ノルウェーの大部分)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"フィンマルク / リスト化された対策区域自治体","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"年金の見積もりは、すべての 12 月に対象となる老齢年金または AFP が 100% であり、他の収入がないことを前提としています。","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"給与の見積りは、ノルウェーの一般納税居住者、年齢 17 ～ 69、その他の収入がないことを前提としています。","Compare two scenarios":"2 つのシナリオを比較する","Scenario 1":"シナリオ 1","Scenario 2":"シナリオ 2","Calculate estimate":"見積もりを計算する","Estimated tax per year":"年間推定税額","Average tax per month":"月あたりの平均税金","Estimated net per year":"年間推定純額","Average net per month":"1 か月あたりの平均純額","Tax on ordinary income":"経常利益に対する税金","Bracket tax":"ブラケット税","National insurance contribution":"国民保険料","Pension tax credit":"年金税額控除","Estimated effective rate":"推定有効率","Standard deduction base":"標準控除ベース","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"レートとしきい値は、2026 所得年度のものです。","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"見積もりの​​みであり、正式な税金計算や税金カードではありません。その他の収入、控除、年齢、居住地、年金等級、個人的な状況によって結果が変わる可能性があります。","Reset values":"値をリセット","Example":"例","How the estimate works":"見積もりの仕組み","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"これは私の正確な税金請求書または源泉徴収票ですか?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"いいえ。標準的な年間税額 2026 を見積もっています。納税カード、最終評価、および源泉徴収は、あなたの全収入、控除、状況によって異なる場合があります。","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"ここで給与と年金を組み合わせることはできますか?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"このバージョンでは、一度に 1 つの収入タイプを推定します。給与と年金が混合したケースは計算されません。","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"年金モードはすべての年金をカバーしますか?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"いいえ。年金クレジットは、年間を通して 100% で取得される適格な老齢年金または適格な AFP のみを対象としてモデル化されています。部分年または段階的年金およびその他の種類の年金は対象外です。","What is the measures-zone option?":"対策ゾーン オプションとは何ですか?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"フィンマルクおよびリストされた地方自治体には、公表されている 18.5% の経常所得率と NOK 45,000 特別控除が適用されます。お住いの自治体が対象となるか確認してください。","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"ノルウェー富税計算ツール","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"ノルウェー富税計算機 2026 — 無料見積り","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"住宅、株式、事業資産、現金、負債からの 2026 ノルウェーの富裕税を推定します。州と地方自治体の分割、評価割引、および価値感応範囲をご覧ください。","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026 の個人ノルウェー富裕税を見積もります。住宅の推定市場価格と、株式および事業資産の割引前の課税標準を入力します。評価割引、債務調整、州および地方自治体の個別の見積もりをご覧ください。","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"低いレートを入力しない限り、見積りには 2026 評価ルールと最大自治体レートが適用されます。負債は割引前の全額資産価値に基づいて割り当てられます。割引された株式または事業資産に割り当てられた負債は、同じ割引によって減額されます。財産の評価、適格性、個人の納税事実によって、公式の結果が変わる可能性があります。","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"市場価格が 10 百万ノルウェー クローネの本拠地は、2026 の本拠地ルールに基づき、負債と個人手当を差し引く前の推定資産価値が 2.5 百万ノルウェー クロークとなります。","2026 tax year":"2026 課税年度","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"一次住宅推定市場価格 (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"中古住宅の推定市場価格 (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"割引前の株式および株式ファンド (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"割引前の適格ビジネス資産 (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"銀行預金およびその他の資産 (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"負債総額 (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"私たちは富に対して共同課税されます","Municipal rate (%)":"市区町村率 (%)","Home-value comparison":"住宅価格の比較","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"富裕税の見積もり","Export CSV":"CSV のエクスポート","Print estimate":"見積もりを印刷","Assets before discounts":"割引前の資産","Taxable asset value after discounts":"割引後の課税対象資産価値","Debt reduction from discounts":"割引による負債削減","Deductible debt estimate":"控除対象となる負債の見積り","Estimated net wealth":"推定純資産","Personal allowance":"個人手当","Taxable net wealth":"課税対象の純資産","Municipal wealth tax":"地方税","State wealth tax":"州富裕税","State tax, first band":"州税、最初のバンド","State tax, upper band":"州税、アッパーバンド","Estimated total wealth tax":"富裕税の推定総額","Lower home-value estimate":"住宅価格の推定値の下限","Current-value estimate":"現在値の推定値","Higher home-value estimate":"より高い住宅価格の推定値","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 のルールと前提条件","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"見積もりのみ。これは正式な税金評価や税金に関するアドバイスではありません。可能な場合は納税申告書の値を使用します。金利、適格性、債務配分、資産価値はお客様のケースによって異なる場合があります。","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"住宅: 年末の推定市場価格を入力します。株式および適格事業資産: 正しい税基準でない限り、市場価格ではなく、2026 割引前の価格を入力します。","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"配偶者、登録パートナー、または資産の合計を共同で評価される適格な同居者に限り、手当と州の上限額が 2 倍になります。","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"地方自治体の計算では選択されたレートが使用され、デフォルトでは 2026 の最大値 0.35% になります。一部の自治体では、これより低い料金が適用される場合があります。","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"感度は、プライマリ ホームとセカンダリ ホームの入力値のみを変更します。これは比較であり、正式な評価額の予測ではありません。","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 富裕税控除とは何ですか?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"標準の基準額は、1 人の場合は 1.9 百万ノルウェークローネ、共同で査定される配偶者または適格パートナーの場合は 3.8 百万ノルウェークローネです。","How is my primary home valued?":"私の主要な住宅はどのように評価されますか?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026 の場合、推定資産価値は、14 百万ノルウェークローネまでは市場価値の 25% に、14 百万ノルウェークローネを超える金額の 70% を加えたものです。","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"これは二次住宅に割引を適用しますか?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"いいえ。 2026 テーブルでは、二次住宅に 0% の評価割引が与えられます。入力された市場価格を推定値として使用します。正式な評価額は異なる場合があります。","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"株式や事業資産を所有している場合、控除対象となる負債が変わるのはなぜですか?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"ノルウェーのルールでは、資産価値全体に比例して負債を割り当てます。評価割引により資産に割り当てられる部分は、同じ割引率で減額されます。","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"地方自治体の税率は常に 0.35% ですか?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"いいえ。 0.35% は、デフォルトで使用される 2026 の最大値です。自治体によっては、より低い料金が設定されている場合がありますので、その料金を入力することができます。","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"この計算機はあらゆる資産や税金のケースをカバーしていますか?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"いいえ。住宅、株式、選択された適格な事業資産、現金、負債総額を推定します。海外資産、年金、複雑な所有権、免除およびその他の特別規則により、評価が変更される場合があります。","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"スイス QR 請求書ジェネレーター","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"スイス QR 請求書ジェネレーター — 無料の QR 請求書メーカー","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"スイスの QR 請求書をローカルで作成して確認します。 IBAN、QR-IBAN、QRR、および SCOR 参照を検証します。請求書データをアップロードせずに、A6 支払い部分と領収書を印刷します。","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"スイスの QR コードを使用してスイスの支払い明細を作成します。請求書の詳細はこのブラウザに残ります。支払いは開始されず、銀行口座への照会も行われません。","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"このツールは、SIX スイス ペイメント コード (SPC) データを構築し、そのフィールド、アカウント/参照の組み合わせ、IBAN チェック ディジット、およびサポートされている文字をチェックします。支払い部分と領収書を必要な物理サイズで印刷できるようにフォーマットします。","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX の例: QR-IBAN、CHF 50.00、27 桁の QRR 参照および構造化された債権者/債務者の住所。","How it works":"仕組み","Frequently asked questions":"よくある質問","Limits and accuracy":"限界と精度","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"これはローカルの文書ツールであり、銀行サービスや証明書ではありません。 IBAN の所有者が誰か、口座が開設されているかどうか、支払いが受け入れられるかどうかを確認することはできません。紙の支払い注文を使用する前に、100% / 実際のサイズで印刷し、100 mm のチェック ラインを測定します。","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"債権者 IBAN または QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"債権者に支払われる","Account holder / creditor name":"口座名義人/債権者名","Street or P.O. box":"街頭または私書箱ボックス","Building number":"建物番号","Postal code":"郵便番号","Town / city":"町/都市","2-letter country code":"2-文字の国コード","Amount (optional)":"金額 (オプション)","Currency":"通貨","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"ユーロ","Payable by · optional debtor":"任意債務者が支払う","Debtor name":"債務者名","Reference type":"参照タイプ","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR リファレンス · QR-IBAN のみ","Creditor reference · IBAN":"債権者照会 · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"構造化参照なし · IBAN","Reference":"リファレンス","Unstructured message":"非構造化メッセージ","Billing information (optional)":"請求情報 (オプション)","Create QR-bill":"QR 請求書の作成","Load SIX sample":"SIX サンプルをロード","Clear form":"クリアフォーム","Check QR payload":"QR ペイロードを確認する","Download payment data":"支払いデータのダウンロード","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG をダウンロード","Print / save as PDF":"印刷/PDF として保存","Read a QR Code image":"QR コード画像を読み取る","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG または JPEG を選択してください","Read image locally":"イメージをローカルで読み取る","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"スイスの QR コード支払いデータを貼り付け","Invoice details":"請求書の詳細","QR-bill preview":"QR 請求書のプレビュー","Receipt":"領収書","Payment part":"支払い部分","Payable to":"支払先","Payable by":"支払い可能者","Account":"アカウント","Additional information":"追加情報","Currency / amount":"通貨/金額","Print scale check · 100 mm":"印刷スケールチェック・100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · スイスの QR ビル標準","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR 請求書の準備ができました。詳細はこのデバイスに残りました。","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"いくつかのフィールドをチェックする必要があります。強調表示された情報を確認します。","Reading this image on your device…":"この画像をデバイスで読んでいます…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"スイスの QR コードをローカルで読み取ってチェックしました。","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"その画像には読み取り可能な QR コードが見つかりませんでした。","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"スイス QR コード データは、サポートされているフィールドで有効です。","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"データは有効なスイス QR コード支払いペイロードではありません。","Form and preview cleared.":"フォームとプレビューがクリアされました。","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX サンプルがロードされました。実際に使用する前にサンプルの詳細を置き換えてください。","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"最初に有効な QR 請求書を作成または読み取ります。","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB 以下の PNG または JPEG を選択してください。","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"ローカル QR リーダーをロードできませんでした。代わりに支払いデータを貼り付けることもできます。","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"どの IBAN と参照の組み合わせが許可されますか?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN は QRR 参照を使用します。通常のスイス IBAN は SCOR を使用するか、構造化参照なし (NON) を使用します。 QRR は CHF 請求書のみに適用されます。","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"これは、口座が存在するか、または債権者に属しているかを確認しますか?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"いいえ。フォーマットと IBAN チェックサムのみをチェックします。銀行や口座登録簿には連絡しません。","Can I print this at any scale?":"これを任意の縮尺で印刷できますか?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"紙の支払い注文の場合は、100% / 実際のサイズで印刷します。支払い部分は A6 横長 (148 × 105 mm) である必要があります。 100 mm の線を定規で確認します。","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"このツールは請求書データをどこかに送信しますか?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"いいえ。画像の生成と読み取りはブラウザ内で行われます。アカウントや決済サービスは使用しません。","Grade Scale Generator":"グレード スケール ジェネレーター","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"評定スケール ジェネレーター — 無料の評定点ツール","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"独自のしきい値を使用して、ポイントをパーセンテージと等級に変換します。フルスケールをプレビューし、コピーまたはエクスポートして、グレーディングシートを印刷します。","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"試験または課題用の透明な採点スケールを作成します。各グレードの最大ポイントと最小パーセンテージを設定します。この尺度は学校や国の採点規則を想定していません。","Points earned":"獲得ポイント","Maximum points":"最大ポイント","Top grade label":"最高級ラベル","Top grade starts at (%)":"最高グレードは (%) から始まります","Middle grade label":"中級ラベル","Middle grade starts at (%)":"中級グレードは (%) から始まります","Lowest grade label":"最低グレードのラベル","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"最低グレードは (%) から始まります","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"50 ポイントの最大値では、45 ポイントは 90% に等しくなります。カスタムしきい値によって等級ラベルが決まります。","Does this use an official grading policy?":"これは公式のグレーディング ポリシーを使用していますか?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"いいえ。しきい値を設定するのはあなたです。成績評価システムは学校、コース、国によって異なります。使用が予想されるスケールを確認してください。","Can I export the grading bands?":"グレーディング バンドをエクスポートできますか?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"はい。表示されているバンドを CSV ファイルとしてエクスポートするか、スケールを印刷します。"},"ko":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"노르웨이 휴일 급여 계산기","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"노르웨이 휴일 급여 계산기 — 무료 총 견적","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"휴일 급여 기준으로 노르웨이 휴가 급여를 추정하세요. 표준 휴가, 5주차 및 60 이상의 직원에 대한 공통 요율을 비교하세요.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"급여 명세서에 표시된 feriepengegrunnlag를 입력하세요. 귀하의 연령과 합의된 휴가 기간에 따른 일반적인 노르웨이 총 휴가 수당 요율을 비교하세요.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"휴일 지급 기준(NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"나는 연휴에 60 이상입니다","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"나의 계약에는 다섯 번째 휴일이 포함됩니다.","Estimated holiday pay":"추정 휴일 급여","Rate used":"사용된 속도","Basis used":"사용된 기준","Reset choices":"선택 사항 재설정","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"총 추정치만 해당됩니다. 휴일 수당은 과세 대상 소득입니다. 세금 원천징수는 개인 및 급여에 따라 다를 수 있습니다.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 기준으로 10.2%는 급여 조정 전에 NOK 51,000를 제공합니다.","Which rate should I use?":"어떤 속도를 사용해야 합니까?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"추정에는 5주차에 10.2% 또는 12%라는 공통 최소 비율이 사용됩니다. 60세 이상 직원의 경우 12.5% 또는 14.3%. 귀하의 동의가 더 많은 것을 제공할 수도 있습니다.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"세금을 제외하고 지불한 금액입니까?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"아니요. 이것은 총 추정치입니다. 휴일 수당은 과세 대상 소득입니다. 원천징수는 귀하의 상황과 급여에 따라 다릅니다.","What belongs in the basis?":"기본에는 무엇이 속합니까?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"급여 명세서나 연차 명세서에 feriepengegrunnlag를 사용하세요. 일부 환급 및 기타 지급은 규정에 의해 제외됩니다.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"노르웨이 소득세 계산기","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"노르웨이 세금 계산기 2026 — 무료 급여 및 연금 견적","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"표준 급여 또는 만년 노령 연금에 대한 노르웨이 소득세 2026 추정입니다. 연간 및 월별 순 급여, 세금 구성 요소를 확인하고 두 가지 시나리오를 비교하십시오.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"표준 거주자 급여 또는 만년 노령 연금에 대한 노르웨이 소득세 추정치 2026입니다. 주요 세금 구성요소를 확인하고 두 가지 총소득 시나리오를 비교해 보세요.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"계산기는 2026 표준 공제, 5가지 누진세 구간 및 국민 보험료를 적용합니다. 연금 모드에는 1년, 100% 적격 노령 연금 또는 적격 AFP에 대해서만 연금 세금 공제가 포함됩니다. 이 브라우저에서 완전히 실행됩니다.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 급여에 대해 예상 연간 세금 및 순 급여를 다른 급여 또는 1년 연금 금액과 비교하십시오.","Tax year":"과세연도","Scenario":"시나리오","Salary":"급여","Full-year old-age pension":"만년노령연금","Gross annual income (NOK)":"총연간소득(NOK)","Tax zone":"세금 구역","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"표준 요금(노르웨이 대부분)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / 등재된 측정 구역 자치단체","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"연금 추정치는 다른 소득 없이 전체 12개월 동안 적격 노령 연금 또는 AFP가 100%라고 가정합니다.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"연봉 추정치는 노르웨이의 일반 세금 거주자, 연령 17–69 및 기타 소득이 없다고 가정합니다.","Compare two scenarios":"두 시나리오 비교","Scenario 1":"시나리오 1","Scenario 2":"시나리오 2","Calculate estimate":"견적 계산","Estimated tax per year":"연간 추정 세금","Average tax per month":"월 평균 세금","Estimated net per year":"연간 순 추정치","Average net per month":"월 평균 순익","Tax on ordinary income":"경상소득에 대한 세금","Bracket tax":"브래킷 세금","National insurance contribution":"국민보험료","Pension tax credit":"연금 세금 공제","Estimated effective rate":"예상 유효율","Standard deduction base":"표준공제기준","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"세율 및 임계값은 2026 소득 연도에 대한 것입니다.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"추정만 가능하며 공식적인 세금 계산이나 세금 카드는 아닙니다. 기타 소득, 공제액, 연령, 거주지, 연금 등급 및 개인 상황에 따라 결과가 달라질 수 있습니다.","Reset values":"값 재설정","Example":"예","How the estimate works":"추정 작동 방식","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"이것이 나의 정확한 세금 계산서입니까, 아니면 세금 카드 원천징수입니까?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"아니요. 표준 2026 연간 세금을 추정합니다. 세금 카드, 최종 평가 및 원천징수는 전체 소득, 공제 및 상황에 따라 다를 수 있습니다.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"여기서 급여와 연금을 합산할 수 있나요?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"이 버전은 한 번에 하나의 소득 유형을 추정합니다. 급여와 연금이 혼합된 경우는 계산하지 않습니다.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"연금 모드가 모든 연금에 적용됩니까?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"아니요. 연금 크레딧은 일년 내내 100%를 받는 적격 노령 연금 또는 적격 AFP에 대해서만 모델링됩니다. 부분 연도 또는 차등 연금 및 기타 연금 유형은 범위를 벗어납니다.","What is the measures-zone option?":"조치 영역 옵션은 무엇입니까?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Finnmark 및 상장 지방자치단체에 대해 공표된 18.5%의 경상 소득율과 NOK 45,000 특별 공제를 적용합니다. 귀하의 지방자치단체가 자격을 갖추고 있는지 확인하세요.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"노르웨이 부유세 계산기","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"노르웨이 부유세 계산기 2026 — 무료 견적","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"주택, 주식, 사업 자산, 현금 및 부채에서 2026 노르웨이 부유세를 추정합니다. 주 및 지방자치단체 분할, 평가 할인 및 가치 민감도 범위를 확인하세요.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026에 대한 노르웨이 개인 부유세를 추산합니다. 주택의 예상 시장 가치와 주식 및 비즈니스 자산의 할인 전 과세 기준을 입력하세요. 평가 할인, 부채 조정, 별도의 주 및 지방자치단체 추정치를 확인하세요.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"추정에는 더 낮은 환율을 입력하지 않는 한 2026 평가 규칙과 최대 지방자치단체 환율이 적용됩니다. 부채는 할인 전 전체 자산 가치로 할당됩니다. 할인된 주식이나 비즈니스 자산에 할당된 부채는 동일한 할인만큼 감소됩니다. 부동산 평가, 자격 및 개인 세금 사실에 따라 공식 결과가 바뀔 수 있습니다.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"1차 주택의 시장 가치가 NOK 10백만 달러인 경우 2026 기본 주택 규칙에 따라 부채 및 개인 수당을 제외하고 추정 자산 가치가 NOK 2.5백만 달러입니다.","2026 tax year":"2026 과세연도","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"주요 주택 예상 시장 가치(NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"2차 주택 추정 시장 가치(NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"할인 전 주식 및 자금 공유(NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"할인 전 적격 비즈니스 자산(NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"은행 예금 및 기타 자산(NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"총 부채(NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"우리는 부에 대해 공동으로 과세됩니다","Municipal rate (%)":"시세율(%)","Home-value comparison":"주택 가치 비교","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"부유세 추정","Export CSV":"CSV 내보내기","Print estimate":"견적 인쇄","Assets before discounts":"할인 전 자산","Taxable asset value after discounts":"할인 후 과세 대상 자산 가치","Debt reduction from discounts":"할인으로 인한 부채 감소","Deductible debt estimate":"공제 가능한 부채 추정","Estimated net wealth":"추정 순자산","Personal allowance":"개인수당","Taxable net wealth":"과세 대상 순자산","Municipal wealth tax":"지방자치단체 부유세","State wealth tax":"주 부유세","State tax, first band":"주 세금, 첫 번째 밴드","State tax, upper band":"주세, 상위 밴드","Estimated total wealth tax":"추정 총 부유세","Lower home-value estimate":"낮은 주택 가치 추정치","Current-value estimate":"현재 가치 추정","Higher home-value estimate":"더 높은 주택 가치 추정치","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 규칙 및 가정","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"추정만 가능합니다. 이는 공식적인 세금 평가나 세금 조언이 아닙니다. 가능한 경우 세금 신고 금액을 사용하세요. 귀하의 경우에는 이자율, 자격, 부채 할당 및 부동산 가치가 다를 수 있습니다.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"주택: 연말 예상 시장 가치를 입력하세요. 주식 및 적격 비즈니스 자산: 올바른 과세 기준이 아닌 한 시장 가치가 아닌 2026 할인 전 가치를 입력하세요.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"수당 및 주 상한선은 배우자, 등록 파트너 또는 합산 자산에 대해 공동으로 평가된 적격 동거인에 대해서만 두 배가 됩니다.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"지방자치단체 계산에서는 선택한 비율을 사용하며 기본값은 2026 최대 0.35%입니다. 일부 지방자치단체에서는 더 낮은 요금을 사용할 수도 있습니다.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"민감도는 기본 및 보조 주택의 입력된 값만 변경합니다. 이는 공식적인 평가에 대한 예측이 아니라 비교입니다.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 부유세 수당은 무엇입니까?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"표준 임계값은 1인의 경우 NOK 1.9백만, 배우자 또는 공동 평가 대상 파트너의 경우 NOK 3.8백만입니다.","How is my primary home valued?":"내 기본 주택의 가치는 어떻게 되나요?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026의 경우 예상 자산 가치는 최대 NOK 14백만 달러까지 시장 가치의 25%에 NOK 14백만 달러 이상 금액의 70%를 더한 것입니다.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"이것은 보조 주택에 할인을 적용합니까?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"아니요. 2026 테이블은 보조 주택에 0% 평가 할인을 제공합니다. 입력된 시장 가치를 추정치로 사용합니다. 공식 평가 값은 다를 수 있습니다.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"주식이나 사업 자산을 소유할 때 공제 가능한 부채가 변경되는 이유는 무엇입니까?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"노르웨이 규칙은 전체 자산 가치에 비례하여 부채를 할당합니다. 평가할인이 있는 자산에 할당된 부분은 동일한 할인율만큼 감소됩니다.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"시 세율은 항상 0.35%입니까?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"아니요. 0.35%는 기본적으로 사용되는 2026 최대값입니다. 지방 자치 단체는 귀하가 입력할 수 있는 더 낮은 요금을 설정할 수 있습니다.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"계산기가 모든 자산이나 세금 사건을 포괄합니까?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"아니요. 이는 주택, 주식, 선별된 적격 사업 자산, 현금 및 총 부채를 추정합니다. 외국 자산, 연금, 복합 소유권, 면제 및 기타 특별 규정에 따라 귀하의 평가가 변경될 수 있습니다.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"스위스 QR 청구서 생성기","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"스위스 QR 청구서 생성기 — 무료 QR 청구서 작성기","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"스위스 QR 청구서를 로컬에서 생성하고 확인하세요. IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR 및 SCOR 참조를 검증합니다. 송장 데이터를 업로드하지 않고 A6 결제 부분 및 영수증을 인쇄합니다.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"스위스 QR 코드로 스위스 지불 전표를 생성하세요. 귀하의 청구서 세부정보는 이 브라우저에 유지됩니다. 결제가 시작되지 않으며 은행 계좌도 조회되지 않습니다.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"이 도구는 SIX 스위스 결제 코드(SPC) 데이터를 구축하고 해당 필드, 계정/참조 조합, IBAN 확인 숫자 및 지원되는 문자를 확인합니다. 결제 부분과 영수증을 필요한 물리적 크기로 인쇄할 수 있도록 형식을 지정합니다.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX 예: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27 자리 QRR 참조 및 구조화된 채권자/채무자 주소.","How it works":"작동 방식","Frequently asked questions":"자주 묻는 질문","Limits and accuracy":"한계 및 정확도","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"이것은 은행 서비스나 인증이 아닌 로컬 문서 도구입니다. IBAN 소유자가 누구인지, 계좌가 열려 있는지, 결제가 허용되는지 여부는 확인할 수 없습니다. 100% / 실제 크기로 인쇄하고 종이 지불 주문을 사용하기 전에 100 mm 수표 라인을 측정하십시오.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"채권자 IBAN 또는 QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"지급 대상 · 채권자","Account holder / creditor name":"예금주/채권자 이름","Street or P.O. box":"거리 또는 P.O. 상자","Building number":"건물번호","Postal code":"우편번호","Town / city":"타운/시","2-letter country code":"2 문자 국가 코드","Amount (optional)":"금액(선택 사항)","Currency":"통화","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"지불 대상 · 선택적 채무자","Debtor name":"채무자 이름","Reference type":"참조 유형","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR 참조 · QR-IBAN 전용","Creditor reference · IBAN":"채권자 참조 · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"구조화된 참조 없음 · IBAN","Reference":"참조","Unstructured message":"구조화되지 않은 메시지","Billing information (optional)":"결제 정보(선택 사항)","Create QR-bill":"QR 청구서 생성","Load SIX sample":"6개 샘플 로드","Clear form":"클리어 폼","Check QR payload":"QR 페이로드 확인","Download payment data":"결제 데이터 다운로드","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG 다운로드","Print / save as PDF":"인쇄/PDF로 저장","Read a QR Code image":"QR 코드 이미지 읽기","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG 또는 JPEG 선택","Read image locally":"로컬에서 이미지 읽기","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"스위스 QR 코드 결제 데이터 붙여넣기","Invoice details":"송장 세부정보","QR-bill preview":"QR 청구서 미리보기","Receipt":"영수증","Payment part":"결제 부분","Payable to":"지불 대상","Payable by":"지불 대상자","Account":"계정","Additional information":"추가 정보","Currency / amount":"통화/금액","Print scale check · 100 mm":"인쇄 배율 확인 · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · 스위스 QR 지폐 표준","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR 청구서가 준비되었습니다. 세부정보는 이 기기에 남아 있습니다.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"일부 필드를 확인해야 합니다. 강조 표시된 정보를 검토하세요.","Reading this image on your device…":"기기에서 이 이미지를 읽는 중…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"스위스 QR 코드를 로컬에서 읽고 확인했습니다.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"해당 이미지에서 읽을 수 있는 QR 코드가 없습니다.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"스위스 QR 코드 데이터는 지원되는 필드에 유효합니다.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"데이터는 유효한 스위스 QR 코드 결제 페이로드가 아닙니다.","Form and preview cleared.":"양식 및 미리보기가 지워졌습니다.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX 샘플이 로드되었습니다. 실제 사용하기 전에 샘플 세부 정보를 교체하십시오.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"먼저 유효한 QR 청구서를 생성하거나 읽으십시오.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10MiB 이하의 PNG 또는 JPEG를 선택하세요.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"로컬 QR 리더를 로드할 수 없습니다. 대신 결제 데이터를 붙여넣을 수 있습니다.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"어떤 IBAN과 참조 조합이 허용됩니까?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN은 QRR 참조를 사용합니다. 일반 스위스 IBAN은 SCOR 또는 구조화 참조 없음(NON)을 사용합니다. QRR은 CHF 송장에만 사용됩니다.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"계좌가 존재하는지 또는 채권자에게 속해 있는지 확인합니까?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"아니요. 형식과 IBAN 체크섬만 확인합니다. 은행이나 계좌 등록부에 연락하지 않습니다.","Can I print this at any scale?":"이것을 어떤 규모로도 인쇄할 수 있습니까?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"종이 결제 주문의 경우 100% / 실제 크기로 인쇄하세요. 결제 부분은 A6 가로(148 × 105mm)여야 합니다. 눈금자로 100 mm 선을 확인하십시오.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"도구가 송장 데이터를 어디로든 보내나요?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"아니요. 생성 및 이미지 읽기는 브라우저에서 수행됩니다. 계정이나 결제 서비스는 사용되지 않습니다.","Grade Scale Generator":"등급 등급 생성기","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"등급 척도 생성기 — 무료 포인트-등급 도구","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"포인트를 자신만의 임계값을 사용하여 백분율과 등급으로 전환하세요. 전체 축척을 미리 보고, 복사하거나 내보내고, 등급 시트를 인쇄하세요.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"시험이나 과제에 대한 투명한 채점 척도를 구축하세요. 각 성적에 대한 최대 점수와 최소 백분율을 설정합니다. 척도는 학교 또는 국가 등급 규칙을 가정하지 않습니다.","Points earned":"포인트 획득","Maximum points":"최대 포인트","Top grade label":"최고 등급 라벨","Top grade starts at (%)":"최고 등급은 (%)에서 시작됩니다.","Middle grade label":"중급 라벨","Middle grade starts at (%)":"중급은 (%)에서 시작합니다","Lowest grade label":"최하위 등급 라벨","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"최저 등급은 (%)에서 시작됩니다.","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"최대 50 포인트의 경우 45 포인트는 90%와 같습니다. 사용자 정의 기준에 따라 성적 라벨이 결정됩니다.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"이것은 공식적인 등급 정책을 사용합니까?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"아니요. 임계값을 설정합니다. 성적 시스템은 학교, 코스, 국가에 따라 다릅니다. 사용할 것으로 예상되는 규모를 확인하십시오.","Can I export the grading bands?":"등급 밴드를 내보낼 수 있습니까?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"예. 표시된 밴드를 CSV 파일로 내보내거나 스케일을 인쇄합니다."},"mr":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"नॉर्वे हॉलिडे पे कॅल्क्युलेटर","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"नॉर्वे हॉलिडे पे कॅल्क्युलेटर - मोफत एकूण अंदाज","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"तुमच्या सुट्टी-पगाराच्या आधारावर नॉर्वेजियन सुट्टीच्या वेतनाचा अंदाज लावा. मानक रजा, पाचवा आठवडा आणि 60 किंवा त्याहून अधिक वयाच्या कर्मचाऱ्यांसाठी सामान्य दरांची तुलना करा.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"तुमच्या पेस्लिपवर दाखवलेला feriepengegrunnlag एंटर करा. तुमचे वय आणि मान्य केलेल्या सुट्टीच्या कालावधीसाठी सामान्य नॉर्वेजियन एकूण सुट्टी-वेतन दरांची तुलना करा.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"सुट्टी-वेतन आधार (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"मी सुट्टीच्या वर्षात 60 किंवा त्याहून मोठा आहे","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"माझ्या करारामध्ये पाचव्या सुट्टीचा आठवडा समाविष्ट आहे","Estimated holiday pay":"अंदाजे सुट्टीचे वेतन","Rate used":"दर वापरले","Basis used":"बेसिस वापरले","Reset choices":"निवडी रीसेट करा","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"केवळ एकूण अंदाज. सुट्टीचे वेतन हे करपात्र उत्पन्न आहे; कर रोखणे व्यक्ती आणि वेतनानुसार बदलू शकते.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 आधारावर, 10.2% कोणत्याही वेतन समायोजनापूर्वी NOK 51,000 देते.","Which rate should I use?":"मी कोणता दर वापरावा?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"अंदाज सामान्य किमान दर वापरतो: 10.2% किंवा 12% पाचव्या आठवड्यासह; 12.5% किंवा 60 किंवा त्याहून अधिक वयाच्या कर्मचाऱ्यांसाठी 14.3%. तुमचा करार अधिक देऊ शकतो.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"ही करानंतर भरलेली रक्कम आहे का?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"नं. हा एक ढोबळ अंदाज आहे. सुट्टीचे वेतन हे करपात्र उत्पन्न आहे; रोखणे तुमच्या परिस्थितीवर आणि पगारावर अवलंबून असते.","What belongs in the basis?":"आधारात काय आहे?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"तुमच्या पेस्लिप किंवा वार्षिक विवरणपत्रावर feriepengegrunnlag वापरा. काही प्रतिपूर्ती आणि इतर देयके नियमांद्वारे वगळण्यात आली आहेत.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"नॉर्वे आयकर कॅल्क्युलेटर","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"नॉर्वे टॅक्स कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 - मोफत पगार आणि पेन्शन अंदाज","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"मानक पगारावर किंवा पूर्ण वर्षाच्या वृद्धापकाळाच्या पेन्शनवर 2026 नॉर्वेजियन आयकराचा अंदाज लावा. वार्षिक आणि मासिक निव्वळ वेतन, कर घटक पहा आणि दोन परिस्थितींची तुलना करा.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"मानक रहिवासी पगार किंवा पूर्ण वर्षाच्या वृद्धापकाळाच्या पेन्शनसाठी 2026 नॉर्वेजियन आयकराचा अंदाज लावा. मुख्य कर घटक पहा आणि दोन सकल-उत्पन्न परिस्थितींची तुलना करा.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 मानक वजावट, पाच प्रगतीशील ब्रॅकेट-कर बँड आणि राष्ट्रीय विमा योगदान लागू करतो. पेन्शन मोडमध्ये केवळ पूर्ण वर्षासाठी, 100% पात्र वृद्धापकाळ पेन्शन किंवा पात्र AFP पेन्शन कर क्रेडिट समाविष्ट आहे. हे संपूर्णपणे या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 च्या पगारासाठी, अंदाजे वार्षिक कर आणि निव्वळ पगाराची तुलना दुसऱ्या पगाराशी किंवा पूर्ण वर्षाच्या पेन्शनच्या रकमेशी करा.","Tax year":"कर वर्ष","Scenario":"परिदृश्य","Salary":"पगार","Full-year old-age pension":"पूर्ण वर्षाचे वृद्धापकाळ निवृत्तीवेतन","Gross annual income (NOK)":"एकूण वार्षिक उत्पन्न (NOK)","Tax zone":"कर क्षेत्र","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"मानक दर (बहुतेक नॉर्वे)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"फिनमार्क / सूचीबद्ध उपाय-झोन नगरपालिका","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"पेन्शन अंदाज इतर कोणत्याही उत्पन्नाशिवाय, सर्व 12 महिन्यांसाठी 100% वर पात्र वृद्ध पेन्शन किंवा AFP गृहीत धरतो.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"पगाराचा अंदाज सामान्य नॉर्वेजियन कर निवास, वय 17–69 आणि इतर कोणतेही उत्पन्न गृहीत धरतो.","Compare two scenarios":"दोन परिस्थितींची तुलना करा","Scenario 1":"परिदृश्य 1","Scenario 2":"परिदृश्य 2","Calculate estimate":"अंदाज मोजा","Estimated tax per year":"दर वर्षी अंदाजे कर","Average tax per month":"दरमहा सरासरी कर","Estimated net per year":"दर वर्षी अंदाजे निव्वळ","Average net per month":"दरमहा सरासरी निव्वळ","Tax on ordinary income":"सामान्य उत्पन्नावरील कर","Bracket tax":"कंस कर","National insurance contribution":"राष्ट्रीय विमा योगदान","Pension tax credit":"पेन्शन टॅक्स क्रेडिट","Estimated effective rate":"अंदाज प्रभावी दर","Standard deduction base":"स्टँडर्ड डिडक्शन बेस","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"दर आणि थ्रेशोल्ड 2026 उत्पन्न वर्षासाठी आहेत.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"फक्त अंदाज, अधिकृत कर गणना किंवा कर कार्ड नाही. इतर उत्पन्न, वजावट, वय, निवासस्थान, निवृत्ती वेतन श्रेणी आणि वैयक्तिक परिस्थिती परिणाम बदलू शकतात.","Reset values":"मूल्ये रीसेट करा","Example":"उदाहरण","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कसे कार्य करते","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"हे माझे अचूक कर बिल आहे की कर-कार्ड रोखणे?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"नं. हे मानक 2026 वार्षिक कर अंदाजित करते. तुमचे संपूर्ण उत्पन्न, कपात आणि परिस्थितींमुळे टॅक्स कार्ड, अंतिम मूल्यांकन आणि रोखे वेगळे असू शकतात.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"मी येथे पगार आणि पेन्शन एकत्र करू शकतो का?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"ही आवृत्ती एका वेळी एका उत्पन्न प्रकाराचा अंदाज लावते. हे मिश्रित पगार-आणि-पेन्शन प्रकरणाची गणना करत नाही.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"पेन्शन मोडमध्ये प्रत्येक पेन्शनचा समावेश होतो का?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"नं. पेन्शन क्रेडिट केवळ पात्र वृद्धापकाळ पेन्शनसाठी किंवा वर्षभर 100% वर घेतलेल्या पात्र AFP साठी तयार केले आहे. आंशिक-वर्ष किंवा श्रेणीबद्ध पेन्शन आणि इतर पेन्शन प्रकार व्याप्तीच्या बाहेर आहेत.","What is the measures-zone option?":"मेप-झोन पर्याय काय आहे?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"हे फिनमार्क आणि सूचीबद्ध नगरपालिकांसाठी प्रकाशित 18.5% सामान्य-उत्पन्न दर आणि NOK 45,000 विशेष वजावट लागू करते. तुमची नगरपालिका पात्र असल्याची पुष्टी करा.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"नॉर्वे वेल्थ टॅक्स कॅल्क्युलेटर","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"नॉर्वे वेल्थ टॅक्स कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 — मोफत अंदाज","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"घरे, शेअर्स, व्यवसाय मालमत्ता, रोख आणि कर्ज यावरून 2026 नॉर्वेजियन संपत्ती कराचा अंदाज लावा. राज्य आणि नगरपालिका विभाजन, मूल्यमापन सवलत आणि मूल्य संवेदनशीलता श्रेणी पहा.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026 साठी वैयक्तिक नॉर्वेजियन संपत्ती कराचा अंदाज लावा. घरांसाठी अंदाजे बाजार मूल्य आणि शेअर्स आणि व्यवसाय मालमत्तेसाठी प्री-डिस्काउंट कर बेस एंटर करा. मूल्यमापन सवलत, कर्ज समायोजन आणि स्वतंत्र राज्य आणि नगरपालिका अंदाज पहा.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"तुम्ही कमी दर प्रविष्ट केल्याशिवाय अंदाज 2026 मूल्यांकन नियम आणि कमाल नगरपालिका दर लागू होतो. सवलतींपूर्वी संपूर्ण मालमत्ता मूल्यांद्वारे कर्ज वाटप केले जाते; सवलतीच्या शेअर्स किंवा व्यवसाय मालमत्तेसाठी नियुक्त केलेले कर्ज समान सवलतीने कमी केले जाते. मालमत्ता मूल्यांकन, पात्रता आणि वैयक्तिक कर तथ्ये अधिकृत निकाल बदलू शकतात.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"NOK 10 दशलक्ष बाजार मूल्य असलेल्या प्राथमिक घराचे कर्ज आणि वैयक्तिक भत्ता आधी 2026 प्राथमिक-गृह नियमांतर्गत NOK 2.5 दशलक्ष अंदाजे संपत्ती मूल्य आहे.","2026 tax year":"2026 कर वर्ष","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"प्राथमिक घर अंदाजे बाजार मूल्य (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"दुय्यम घरे अंदाजे बाजार मूल्य (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"सवलतीपूर्वी शेअर्स आणि शेअर्स फंड (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"सवलतीपूर्वी पात्र व्यवसाय मालमत्ता (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"बँक ठेवी आणि इतर मालमत्ता (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"एकूण कर्ज (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"आम्ही संपत्तीसाठी संयुक्तपणे कर आकारला जातो","Municipal rate (%)":"महानगरपालिका दर (%)","Home-value comparison":"घर-मूल्य तुलना","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"अंदाज संपत्ती कर","Export CSV":"CSV निर्यात करा","Print estimate":"मुद्रित अंदाज","Assets before discounts":"सवलतीपूर्वी मालमत्ता","Taxable asset value after discounts":"सवलतींनंतर करपात्र मालमत्ता मूल्य","Debt reduction from discounts":"सवलतींमधून कर्ज कपात","Deductible debt estimate":"कपात करण्यायोग्य कर्ज अंदाज","Estimated net wealth":"अंदाजित निव्वळ संपत्ती","Personal allowance":"वैयक्तिक भत्ता","Taxable net wealth":"करपात्र निव्वळ संपत्ती","Municipal wealth tax":"महानगरपालिका संपत्ती कर","State wealth tax":"राज्य संपत्ती कर","State tax, first band":"राज्य कर, पहिला बँड","State tax, upper band":"राज्य कर, अप्पर बँड","Estimated total wealth tax":"अंदाजित एकूण संपत्ती कर","Lower home-value estimate":"कमी घर-मूल्य अंदाज","Current-value estimate":"वर्तमान-मूल्य अंदाज","Higher home-value estimate":"उच्च घर-मूल्य अंदाज","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 नियम आणि गृहीतके","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"फक्त अंदाज. हे अधिकृत कर मूल्यांकन किंवा कर सल्ला नाही. जेथे उपलब्ध असेल तेथे तुमची कर परतावा मूल्ये वापरा; दर, पात्रता, कर्ज वाटप आणि मालमत्ता मूल्ये तुमच्या बाबतीत भिन्न असू शकतात.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"घरे: वर्षाच्या शेवटी अंदाजे बाजार मूल्य प्रविष्ट करा. शेअर्स आणि पात्र व्यवसाय मालमत्ता: 2026 सूटपूर्वी मूल्य प्रविष्ट करा, जोपर्यंत योग्य कर आधार नसेल तोपर्यंत बाजार मूल्य नाही.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"फक्त पती/पत्नी, नोंदणीकृत भागीदार किंवा त्यांच्या एकत्रित संपत्तीसाठी संयुक्तपणे मूल्यांकन केलेल्या पात्र सहवासियांसाठी भत्ता आणि राज्याचा वरचा उंबरठा दुप्पट.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"महानगरपालिका गणना निवडलेल्या दराचा वापर करते, 2026 कमाल 0.35% पर्यंत डीफॉल्ट करते. काही नगरपालिका कमी दर वापरू शकतात.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"संवेदनशीलता केवळ प्राथमिक आणि दुय्यम घरांची प्रविष्ट केलेली मूल्ये बदलते. ही तुलना आहे, अधिकृत मूल्यांकनाचा अंदाज नाही.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 संपत्ती-कर भत्ता काय आहे?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"मानक उंबरठा एका व्यक्तीसाठी NOK 1.9 दशलक्ष आणि जोडीदार किंवा पात्र भागीदारांसाठी NOK 3.8 दशलक्ष आहे.","How is my primary home valued?":"माझ्या प्राथमिक घराचे मूल्य कसे आहे?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026 साठी, अंदाजे संपत्ती मूल्य बाजार मूल्याच्या 25% NOK 14 दशलक्ष पर्यंत, तसेच NOK 14 दशलक्ष वरील रकमेच्या 70% आहे.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"दुय्यम घरासाठी ही सूट लागू होते का?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"नं. 2026 टेबल दुय्यम घरांना 0% मूल्यांकन सूट देते. हे एंटर केलेले बाजार मूल्य अंदाज म्हणून वापरते; अधिकृत मूल्यांकन मूल्ये भिन्न असू शकतात.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"माझ्याकडे शेअर्स किंवा व्यवसाय मालमत्ता असताना वजावटीचे कर्ज का बदलते?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"नॉर्वेजियन नियम संपूर्ण मालमत्तेच्या मूल्यांनुसार कर्ज वाटप करतात. मूल्यमापन सवलतींसह मालमत्तेला नियुक्त केलेला भाग समान सवलतीच्या दराने कमी केला जातो.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"महापालिकेचा दर नेहमीच 0.35% असतो का?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"नं. 0.35% हे मुलभूतरित्या वापरलेले 2026 कमाल आहे. नगरपालिका कमी दर सेट करू शकते, जो तुम्ही प्रविष्ट करू शकता.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"कॅल्क्युलेटर प्रत्येक मालमत्ता किंवा कर प्रकरण कव्हर करते का?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"नं. हे घरे, शेअर्स, निवडलेल्या पात्र व्यवसाय मालमत्ता, रोख रक्कम आणि एकूण कर्ज यांचा अंदाज लावते. परदेशी मालमत्ता, पेन्शन, जटिल मालकी, सूट आणि इतर विशेष नियम तुमचे मूल्यांकन बदलू शकतात.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"स्विस QR-बिल जनरेटर","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"स्विस QR-बिल जनरेटर - मोफत QR इनव्हॉइस मेकर","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"स्थानिकरित्या स्विस QR-बिल तयार करा आणि तपासा. IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR आणि SCOR संदर्भ सत्यापित करा; A6 पेमेंट पार्ट आणि इनव्हॉइस डेटा अपलोड न करता पावती प्रिंट करा.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"स्विस QR कोडसह स्विस पेमेंट स्लिप तयार करा. तुमचे बीजक तपशील या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतात; कोणतेही पेमेंट सुरू केले जात नाही आणि बँक रजिस्टरची चौकशी केली जात नाही.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"टूल SIX स्विस पेमेंट्स कोड (SPC) डेटा तयार करते आणि त्याचे फील्ड, खाते/संदर्भ संयोजन, IBAN चेक अंक आणि समर्थित वर्ण तपासते. ते त्यांच्या आवश्यक भौतिक आकारात मुद्रणासाठी देयक भाग आणि पावतीचे स्वरूपित करते.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"सहा उदाहरणे: एक QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, एक 27-अंकी QRR संदर्भ आणि संरचित लेनदार/कर्जदार पत्ते.","How it works":"ते कसे कार्य करते","Frequently asked questions":"वारंवार विचारले जाणारे प्रश्न","Limits and accuracy":"मर्यादा आणि अचूकता","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"हे स्थानिक दस्तऐवज साधन आहे, बँक सेवा किंवा प्रमाणपत्र नाही. हे IBAN चे मालक कोण आहे, खाते उघडले आहे की नाही किंवा पेमेंट स्वीकारले जाईल की नाही याची पुष्टी करू शकत नाही. 100% / वास्तविक आकारावर प्रिंट करा आणि पेपर पेमेंट ऑर्डर वापरण्यापूर्वी 100 मिमी चेक लाइन मोजा.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"क्रेडिटर IBAN किंवा QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"लेनदाराला देय","Account holder / creditor name":"खातेधारक/लेनदाराचे नाव","Street or P.O. box":"रस्ता किंवा P.O. बॉक्स","Building number":"बिल्डिंग नंबर","Postal code":"पोस्टल कोड","Town / city":"टाउन/शहर","2-letter country code":"2-अक्षर देश कोड","Amount (optional)":"रक्कम (पर्यायी)","Currency":"चलन","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"पर्यायी कर्जदाराद्वारे देय","Debtor name":"कर्जदाराचे नाव","Reference type":"संदर्भ प्रकार","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR संदर्भ · फक्त QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"क्रेडिटर संदर्भ · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"संरचित संदर्भ नाही · IBAN","Reference":"संदर्भ","Unstructured message":"असंरचित संदेश","Billing information (optional)":"बिलिंग माहिती (पर्यायी)","Create QR-bill":"QR-बिल तयार करा","Load SIX sample":"सहा नमुना लोड करा","Clear form":"क्लीअर फॉर्म","Check QR payload":"QR पेलोड तपासा","Download payment data":"पेमेंट डेटा डाउनलोड करा","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG डाउनलोड करा","Print / save as PDF":"पीडीएफ म्हणून प्रिंट/सेव्ह करा","Read a QR Code image":"QR कोड प्रतिमा वाचा","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG किंवा JPEG निवडा","Read image locally":"स्थानिकरित्या प्रतिमा वाचा","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"स्विस QR कोड पेमेंट डेटा पेस्ट करा","Invoice details":"चालन तपशील","QR-bill preview":"QR-बिल पूर्वावलोकन","Receipt":"पावती","Payment part":"पेमेंट भाग","Payable to":"याला देय","Payable by":"द्वारे देय","Account":"खाते","Additional information":"अतिरिक्त माहिती","Currency / amount":"चलन / रक्कम","Print scale check · 100 mm":"प्रिंट स्केल तपासणी · 100 मिमी","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · स्विस QR-बिल मानक","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-बिल तयार. तपशील या डिव्हाइसवर राहिले.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"काही फील्ड तपासणे आवश्यक आहे. हायलाइट केलेल्या माहितीचे पुनरावलोकन करा.","Reading this image on your device…":"तुमच्या डिव्हाइसवर ही प्रतिमा वाचत आहे…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"स्विस QR कोड स्थानिक पातळीवर वाचला आणि तपासला.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"त्या प्रतिमेमध्ये कोणताही वाचनीय QR कोड आढळला नाही.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"स्विस QR कोड डेटा समर्थित फील्डसाठी वैध आहे.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"डेटा वैध स्विस QR कोड पेलोड नाही.","Form and preview cleared.":"फॉर्म आणि पूर्वावलोकन साफ ​​केले.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"सहा नमुना लोड केला. वास्तविक वापरापूर्वी त्याचे नमुना तपशील बदला.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"प्रथम वैध QR-बिल तयार करा किंवा वाचा.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB किंवा त्यापेक्षा कमी PNG किंवा JPEG निवडा.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"स्थानिक QR रीडर लोड होऊ शकला नाही. त्याऐवजी तुम्ही पेमेंट डेटा पेस्ट करू शकता.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"कोणत्या IBAN आणि संदर्भ संयोजनांना अनुमती आहे?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN QRR संदर्भ वापरतो. एक सामान्य स्विस IBAN SCOR किंवा कोणताही संरचित संदर्भ (NON) वापरतो. QRR फक्त CHF बीजकांसाठी आहे.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"हे खाते अस्तित्वात आहे की धनकोचे आहे हे तपासते?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"नं. हे फक्त फॉरमॅट आणि IBAN चेकसम तपासते. ते बँक किंवा खाते नोंदणीशी संपर्क साधत नाही.","Can I print this at any scale?":"मी हे कोणत्याही प्रमाणात प्रिंट करू शकतो का?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"पेपर पेमेंट ऑर्डरसाठी, 100% / वास्तविक आकारावर प्रिंट करा. देयक भाग A6 लँडस्केप (148 × 105 मिमी) असणे आवश्यक आहे; 100 mm रेषा रुलरसह तपासा.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"टूल इन्व्हॉइस डेटा कुठेही पाठवते का?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"नं. जनरेशन आणि इमेज वाचन तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये होते. कोणतेही खाते किंवा पेमेंट सेवा वापरली जात नाही.","Grade Scale Generator":"ग्रेड स्केल जनरेटर","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"ग्रेड स्केल जनरेटर - फ्री पॉइंट-टू-ग्रेड टूल","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"तुमच्या स्वतःच्या थ्रेशोल्डसह गुणांना टक्केवारी आणि ग्रेडमध्ये बदला. पूर्ण स्केलचे पूर्वावलोकन करा, कॉपी करा किंवा निर्यात करा आणि ग्रेडिंग शीट मुद्रित करा.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"परीक्षा किंवा असाइनमेंटसाठी पारदर्शक ग्रेडिंग स्केल तयार करा. प्रत्येक इयत्तेसाठी कमाल गुण आणि किमान टक्केवारी सेट करा; स्केल शाळा किंवा राष्ट्रीय ग्रेडिंग नियम गृहीत धरत नाही.","Points earned":"गुण मिळवले","Maximum points":"जास्तीत जास्त गुण","Top grade label":"टॉप ग्रेड लेबल","Top grade starts at (%)":"शीर्ष श्रेणी (%) पासून सुरू होते","Middle grade label":"मध्यम दर्जाचे लेबल","Middle grade starts at (%)":"मध्यम श्रेणी (%) पासून सुरू होते","Lowest grade label":"सर्वात कमी दर्जाचे लेबल","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"सर्वात कमी ग्रेड (%) पासून सुरू होते","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"50-पॉइंट कमाल सह, 45 पॉइंट 90% च्या बरोबरीचे आहेत. तुमचे कस्टम थ्रेशोल्ड ग्रेड लेबल ठरवतात.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"हे अधिकृत ग्रेडिंग धोरण वापरते का?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"नं. तुम्ही थ्रेशोल्ड सेट करा. शाळा, अभ्यासक्रम आणि देशानुसार ग्रेडिंग सिस्टम भिन्न आहेत; आपण वापरणे अपेक्षित असलेल्या स्केलची पुष्टी करा.","Can I export the grading bands?":"मी ग्रेडिंग बँड एक्सपोर्ट करू शकतो का?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"होय. प्रदर्शित बँड CSV फाइल म्हणून निर्यात करा किंवा स्केल मुद्रित करा."},"ms":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Kalkulator Gaji Percutian Norway","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Kalkulator Gaji Percutian Norway — Anggaran Kasar Percuma","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Anggaran bayaran percutian Norway daripada asas gaji percutian anda. Bandingkan kadar biasa untuk cuti standard, minggu kelima dan pekerja berumur 60 atau lebih.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Masukkan feriepengegrunnlag yang ditunjukkan pada slip gaji anda. Bandingkan kadar gaji percutian kasar Norway biasa untuk umur anda dan tempoh percutian yang dipersetujui.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Asas bayaran cuti (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Saya 60 atau lebih tua pada tahun cuti","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Perjanjian saya termasuk minggu cuti kelima","Estimated holiday pay":"Anggaran gaji hari cuti","Rate used":"Kadar digunakan","Basis used":"Asas digunakan","Reset choices":"Tetapkan semula pilihan","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Anggaran kasar sahaja. Bayaran percutian ialah pendapatan boleh cukai; penahanan cukai boleh berbeza mengikut orang dan senarai gaji.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Dengan asas NOK 500,000, 10.2% memberikan NOK 51,000 sebelum sebarang pelarasan gaji.","Which rate should I use?":"Kadar yang manakah harus saya gunakan?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Anggaran menggunakan kadar minimum biasa: 10.2% atau 12% dengan minggu kelima; 12.5% atau 14.3% untuk pekerja berumur 60 ke atas. Perjanjian anda mungkin memberi lebih banyak.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Adakah ini jumlah yang dibayar selepas cukai?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"No. Ini adalah anggaran kasar. Bayaran percutian ialah pendapatan boleh cukai; penahanan bergantung pada keadaan dan senarai gaji anda.","What belongs in the basis?":"Apakah yang terkandung dalam asas?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Gunakan feriepengegrunnlag pada slip gaji atau penyata tahunan anda. Beberapa pembayaran balik dan pembayaran lain dikecualikan oleh peraturan.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator Cukai Pendapatan Norway","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Kalkulator Cukai Norway 2026 — Anggaran Gaji & Pencen Percuma","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Anggaran cukai pendapatan Norway 2026 ke atas gaji standard atau pencen usia tua setahun penuh. Lihat gaji bersih tahunan dan bulanan, komponen cukai dan bandingkan dua senario.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Anggaran 2026 Cukai pendapatan Norway untuk gaji pemastautin standard atau pencen umur tua setahun penuh. Lihat komponen cukai utama dan bandingkan dua senario pendapatan kasar.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Kalkulator menggunakan potongan standard 2026, lima jalur cukai kurungan progresif dan sumbangan insurans nasional. Mod pencen termasuk kredit cukai pencen hanya untuk setahun penuh, 100% pencen tua yang layak atau AFP yang layak. Ia berjalan sepenuhnya dalam penyemak imbas ini.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Untuk gaji NOK 600,000, bandingkan anggaran cukai tahunan dan gaji bersih dengan gaji lain atau amaun pencen setahun penuh.","Tax year":"Tahun cukai","Scenario":"Senario","Salary":"Gaji","Full-year old-age pension":"Pencen umur tua setahun penuh","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Pendapatan tahunan kasar (NOK)","Tax zone":"Zon cukai","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Kadar standard (sebahagian besar Norway)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Perbandaran zon langkah Finnmark / tersenarai","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Anggaran pencen menganggap pencen hari tua atau AFP yang layak pada 100% untuk semua bulan 12, tanpa pendapatan lain.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Anggaran gaji menganggap pemastautin cukai Norway biasa, umur 17–69 dan tiada pendapatan lain.","Compare two scenarios":"Bandingkan dua senario","Scenario 1":"Senario 1","Scenario 2":"Senario 2","Calculate estimate":"Kira anggaran","Estimated tax per year":"Anggaran cukai setahun","Average tax per month":"Purata cukai sebulan","Estimated net per year":"Anggaran bersih setahun","Average net per month":"Purata bersih sebulan","Tax on ordinary income":"Cukai ke atas pendapatan biasa","Bracket tax":"Cukai kurungan","National insurance contribution":"Caruman insurans negara","Pension tax credit":"Kredit cukai pencen","Estimated effective rate":"Anggaran kadar berkesan","Standard deduction base":"Asas potongan standard","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Kadar dan ambang adalah untuk tahun pendapatan 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Anggaran sahaja, bukan pengiraan cukai rasmi atau kad cukai. Pendapatan lain, potongan, umur, pemastautin, gred pencen dan keadaan peribadi boleh mengubah keputusan.","Reset values":"Tetapkan semula nilai","Example":"Contoh","How the estimate works":"Cara anggaran berfungsi","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Adakah ini bil cukai tepat saya atau penahanan kad cukai?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"No. Ia menganggarkan cukai tahunan standard 2026. Kad cukai, penilaian akhir dan penahanan boleh berbeza kerana pendapatan penuh, potongan dan keadaan anda.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Bolehkah saya menggabungkan gaji dan pencen di sini?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Versi ini menganggarkan satu jenis pendapatan pada satu masa. Ia tidak mengira kes gaji dan pencen bercampur.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Adakah mod pencen meliputi setiap pencen?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"No. Kredit pencen dimodelkan hanya untuk pencen hari tua yang layak atau AFP yang layak yang diambil pada 100% sepanjang tahun. Pencen separa tahun atau berperingkat dan jenis pencen lain adalah di luar skop.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Apakah pilihan zon ukuran?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Ia menggunakan kadar pendapatan biasa 18.5% yang diterbitkan dan potongan khas NOK 45,000 untuk Finnmark dan majlis perbandaran yang disenaraikan. Sahkan bahawa perbandaran anda layak.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator Cukai Kekayaan Norway","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Kalkulator Cukai Kekayaan Norway 2026 — Anggaran Percuma","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Anggaran 2026 cukai kekayaan Norway daripada rumah, saham, aset perniagaan, tunai dan hutang. Lihat pembahagian negeri dan perbandaran, diskaun penilaian dan julat sensitiviti nilai.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Anggaran cukai kekayaan peribadi Norway untuk 2026. Masukkan anggaran nilai pasaran untuk rumah dan asas cukai pra-diskaun untuk saham dan aset perniagaan. Lihat diskaun penilaian, pelarasan hutang dan anggaran negeri dan perbandaran yang berasingan.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Anggaran menggunakan peraturan penilaian 2026 dan kadar maksimum perbandaran melainkan anda memasukkan kadar yang lebih rendah. Hutang diperuntukkan mengikut nilai aset penuh sebelum diskaun; hutang yang diperuntukkan kepada saham terdiskaun atau aset perniagaan dikurangkan dengan diskaun yang sama. Penilaian hartanah, kelayakan dan fakta cukai peribadi boleh mengubah keputusan rasmi.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Rumah utama dengan nilai pasaran NOK 10 juta mempunyai anggaran nilai kekayaan NOK 2.5 juta di bawah peraturan rumah utama 2026, sebelum hutang dan elaun peribadi.","2026 tax year":"2026 tahun cukai","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Anggaran nilai pasaran rumah utama (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Anggaran nilai pasaran rumah menengah (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Saham dan kongsi dana sebelum diskaun (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Aset perniagaan yang layak sebelum diskaun (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Deposit bank dan aset lain (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Jumlah hutang (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Kami dicukai bersama untuk kekayaan","Municipal rate (%)":"Kadar perbandaran (%)","Home-value comparison":"Perbandingan nilai rumah","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Anggaran cukai kekayaan","Export CSV":"Eksport CSV","Print estimate":"Cetak anggaran","Assets before discounts":"Aset sebelum diskaun","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Nilai aset boleh cukai selepas diskaun","Debt reduction from discounts":"Pengurangan hutang daripada diskaun","Deductible debt estimate":"Anggaran hutang boleh ditolak","Estimated net wealth":"Anggaran kekayaan bersih","Personal allowance":"Elaun peribadi","Taxable net wealth":"Kekayaan bersih boleh cukai","Municipal wealth tax":"Cukai kekayaan perbandaran","State wealth tax":"Cukai kekayaan negeri","State tax, first band":"Cukai negeri, jalur pertama","State tax, upper band":"Cukai negeri, jalur atas","Estimated total wealth tax":"Anggaran jumlah cukai kekayaan","Lower home-value estimate":"Anggaran nilai rumah yang lebih rendah","Current-value estimate":"Anggaran nilai semasa","Higher home-value estimate":"Anggaran nilai rumah yang lebih tinggi\nPeraturan dan andaian","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Anggaran sahaja. Ini bukan taksiran cukai rasmi atau nasihat cukai. Gunakan nilai pulangan cukai anda jika ada; kadar, kelayakan, peruntukan hutang dan nilai harta mungkin berbeza dalam kes anda.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Rumah: masukkan anggaran nilai pasaran pada akhir tahun. Saham dan aset perniagaan yang layak: masukkan nilai sebelum diskaun 2026, bukan nilai pasaran melainkan itu adalah asas cukai yang betul.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Elaun dan ambang atas negeri dua kali ganda hanya untuk pasangan, rakan kongsi berdaftar atau bersekedudukan yang layak yang dinilai bersama untuk kekayaan gabungan mereka.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Pengiraan perbandaran menggunakan kadar yang dipilih, lalai kepada 2026 maksimum 0.35%. Sesetengah majlis perbandaran mungkin menggunakan kadar yang lebih rendah.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Sensitiviti menukar hanya nilai yang dimasukkan bagi rumah primer dan sekunder. Ia adalah perbandingan, bukan ramalan penilaian rasmi.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Apakah elaun cukai kekayaan 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Ambang standard ialah NOK 1.9 juta untuk seorang dan NOK 3.8 juta untuk pasangan atau rakan kongsi yang layak yang dinilai bersama.","How is my primary home valued?":"Bagaimana rumah utama saya dihargai?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Untuk 2026, anggaran nilai kekayaan ialah 25% daripada nilai pasaran sehingga NOK 14 juta, ditambah dengan 70% daripada jumlah melebihi NOK 14 juta.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Adakah ini menggunakan diskaun untuk rumah menengah?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"No. Jadual 2026 memberikan diskaun penilaian 0% kepada kediaman menengah. Ia menggunakan nilai pasaran yang dimasukkan sebagai anggaran; nilai rasmi yang dinilai boleh berbeza.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Mengapakah hutang boleh ditolak berubah apabila saya memiliki saham atau aset perniagaan?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Peraturan Norway memperuntukkan hutang secara berkadar mengikut nilai aset penuh. Bahagian yang diperuntukkan kepada aset dengan diskaun penilaian dikurangkan dengan kadar diskaun yang sama.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Adakah kadar perbandaran sentiasa 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"No. 0.35% ialah maksimum 2026 yang digunakan secara lalai. Sebuah majlis perbandaran mungkin menetapkan kadar yang lebih rendah, yang boleh anda masukkan.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Adakah kalkulator meliputi setiap aset atau kes cukai?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"No. Ia menganggarkan rumah, saham, aset perniagaan terpilih yang layak, tunai dan jumlah hutang. Aset asing, pencen, pemilikan kompleks, pengecualian dan peraturan khas lain mungkin mengubah penilaian anda.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Penjana bil QR Switzerland","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Swiss QR-bill Generator — Pembuat Invois QR Percuma","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Buat dan semak bil QR Switzerland secara tempatan. Sahkan rujukan IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR dan SCOR; cetak bahagian pembayaran dan resit A6 tanpa memuat naik data invois.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Buat slip pembayaran Switzerland dengan Kod QR Switzerland. Butiran invois anda kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini; tiada pembayaran dimulakan dan tiada daftar bank ditanya.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Alat membina data ENAM Swiss Payments Code (SPC) dan menyemak medannya, gabungan akaun/rujukan, digit semakan IBAN dan aksara yang disokong. Ia memformat bahagian pembayaran dan resit untuk mencetak pada saiz fizikal yang diperlukan.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"ENAM contoh: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, rujukan QRR digit 27 dan alamat pemiutang/penghutang berstruktur.","How it works":"Cara ia berfungsi","Frequently asked questions":"Soalan lazim","Limits and accuracy":"Had dan ketepatan","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Ini ialah alat dokumen tempatan, bukan perkhidmatan bank atau pensijilan. Ia tidak dapat mengesahkan siapa yang memiliki IBAN, sama ada akaun dibuka atau sama ada pembayaran akan diterima. Cetak pada 100% / Saiz sebenar dan ukur garis cek 100 mm sebelum menggunakan pesanan pembayaran kertas.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Pembiaya IBAN atau QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Boleh dibayar kepada · pemiutang","Account holder / creditor name":"Nama pemegang akaun / pemiutang","Street or P.O. box":"Jalan atau P.O. kotak","Building number":"Nombor bangunan","Postal code":"Poskod","Town / city":"Bandar / bandar","2-letter country code":"2 kod negara huruf","Amount (optional)":"Jumlah (pilihan)","Currency":"Mata wang","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Dibayar oleh · penghutang pilihan","Debtor name":"Nama penghutang","Reference type":"Jenis rujukan","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Rujukan QR · QR-IBAN sahaja","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Rujukan pemiutang · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Tiada rujukan berstruktur · IBAN","Reference":"Rujukan","Unstructured message":"Mesej tidak berstruktur","Billing information (optional)":"Maklumat pengebilan (pilihan)","Create QR-bill":"Buat QR-bil","Load SIX sample":"Muat ENAM sampel","Clear form":"Borang yang jelas","Check QR payload":"Semak muatan QR","Download payment data":"Muat turun data pembayaran","Download QR SVG":"Muat turun QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Cetak / simpan sebagai PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Baca imej Kod QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Pilih PNG atau JPEG","Read image locally":"Baca imej secara setempat","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Tampal data pembayaran Kod QR Switzerland","Invoice details":"Butiran invois","QR-bill preview":"pratonton bil QR","Receipt":"Resit","Payment part":"Bahagian pembayaran","Payable to":"Boleh dibayar kepada","Payable by":"Dibayar oleh","Account":"Akaun","Additional information":"Maklumat tambahan","Currency / amount":"Mata wang / amaun","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Semakan skala cetakan · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Piawaian bil QR Switzerland","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"bil QR sedia. Butiran kekal pada peranti ini.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Sesetengah medan perlu disemak. Semak maklumat yang diserlahkan.","Reading this image on your device…":"Membaca imej ini pada peranti anda…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Kod QR Switzerland dibaca dan disemak secara tempatan.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Tiada Kod QR yang boleh dibaca ditemui dalam imej itu.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Data Kod QR Switzerland sah untuk medan yang disokong.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Data tersebut bukan muatan pembayaran Kod QR Switzerland yang sah.","Form and preview cleared.":"Borang dan pratonton dikosongkan.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ENAM sampel dimuatkan. Gantikan butiran sampelnya sebelum penggunaan sebenar.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Buat atau baca bil QR yang sah dahulu.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Pilih PNG atau JPEG daripada 10 MiB atau kurang.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Pembaca QR tempatan tidak dapat dimuatkan. Anda boleh menampal data pembayaran sebaliknya.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"IBAN dan gabungan rujukan yang manakah dibenarkan?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN menggunakan rujukan QRR. IBAN Switzerland biasa menggunakan SCOR atau tiada rujukan berstruktur (NON). QRR adalah untuk invois CHF sahaja.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Adakah ini menyemak sama ada akaun itu wujud atau milik pemiutang?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"No. Ia menyemak format dan checksum IBAN sahaja. Ia tidak menghubungi bank atau pendaftaran akaun.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Bolehkah saya mencetak ini pada sebarang skala?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Untuk pesanan pembayaran kertas, cetak pada 100% / Saiz sebenar. Bahagian pembayaran mestilah A6 landskap (148 × 105 mm); semak garisan 100 mm dengan pembaris.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Adakah alat menghantar data invois ke mana-mana sahaja?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"No. Penjanaan dan pembacaan imej berlaku dalam penyemak imbas anda. Tiada akaun atau perkhidmatan pembayaran digunakan.","Grade Scale Generator":"Penjana Skala Gred","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Penjana Skala Gred — Alat Mata-ke-Gred Percuma","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Tukar mata kepada peratusan dan gred dengan ambang anda sendiri. Pratonton skala penuh, salin atau eksportnya dan cetak helaian penggredan.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Bina skala penggredan yang telus untuk peperiksaan atau tugasan. Tetapkan mata maksimum dan peratusan minimum untuk setiap gred; skala tidak menganggap peraturan penggredan sekolah atau kebangsaan.","Points earned":"Mata diperoleh","Maximum points":"Mata maksimum","Top grade label":"Label gred teratas","Top grade starts at (%)":"Gred teratas bermula pada (%)","Middle grade label":"Label gred pertengahan","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Gred pertengahan bermula pada (%)","Lowest grade label":"Label gred terendah","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Gred terendah bermula pada (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Dengan mata maksimum 50, mata 45 bersamaan dengan 90%. Ambang tersuai anda menentukan label gred.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Adakah ini menggunakan dasar penggredan rasmi?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"No. Anda menetapkan ambang. Sistem penggredan berbeza mengikut sekolah, kursus dan negara; sahkan skala yang anda dijangka gunakan.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Bolehkah saya mengeksport jalur penggredan?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ya. Eksport jalur yang dipaparkan sebagai fail CSV atau cetak skala."},"nb":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Norge Feriepengekalkulator","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Norsk feriepengerkalkulator — gratis bruttoberegning","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Beregn norske feriepenger fra feriepengegrunnlaget ditt. Sammenlign vanlige satser for standardferie, en femte ferieuke og ansatte som er 60 år eller eldre.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Oppgi feriepengegrunnlaget på lønnsslippen. Sammenlign vanlige norske brutto feriepengesatser etter alder og avtalt ferielengde.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Ferielønnsgrunnlag (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Jeg fyller 60 år eller mer i ferieåret","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Avtalen min inkluderer en femte ferieuke","Estimated holiday pay":"Beregnet feriepenger","Rate used":"Pris brukt","Basis used":"Basis brukt","Reset choices":"Tilbakestill valg","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Kun brutto estimat. Feriepenger er skattepliktig inntekt; skattetrekk kan variere fra person til person og lønn.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Med NOK 500,000 basis gir 10.2% NOK 51,000 før eventuelle lønnsjusteringer.","Which rate should I use?":"Hvilken kurs skal jeg bruke?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Estimatet bruker vanlige minimumssatser: 10.2% eller 12% med en femte uke; 12.5% eller 14.3% for ansatte i alderen 60 eller eldre. Avtalen din kan gi mer.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Er dette beløpet som betales etter skatt?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Nr. Dette er et grovt anslag. Feriepenger er skattepliktig inntekt; forskuddstrekk avhenger av omstendighetene dine og lønn.","What belongs in the basis?":"Hva hører hjemme i grunnlaget?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Bruk feriepengegrunnlag på lønnsslipp eller årsoppgave. Noen refusjoner og andre betalinger er utelukket av reglene.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Norge inntektsskattekalkulator","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Norge skattekalkulator 2026 — Gratis lønn og pensjonsestimat","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Estimat 2026 Norsk inntektsskatt på standardlønn eller helårs alderspensjon. Se årlig og månedlig nettolønn, skattekomponenter og sammenlign to scenarier.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Estimer 2026 Norsk inntektsskatt for standard bosattlønn eller helårs alderspensjon. Se de viktigste skattekomponentene og sammenlign to bruttoinntektsscenarier.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Kalkulatoren bruker 2026 standardfradrag, de fem progressive skatteintervallene og folketrygdavgiftene. Pensjonsmodus inkluderer pensjonsskattefradraget bare for et helt år, 100 % kvalifiserende alderspensjon eller kvalifisert AFP. Den kjører helt i denne nettleseren.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"For en lønn på NOK 600,000, sammenligne den beregnede årlige skatten og nettolønnen med en annen lønn eller et helårspensjonsbeløp.","Tax year":"Skatteår","Scenario":"Scenario","Salary":"Lønn","Full-year old-age pension":"Fullårspensjon","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Brutto årsinntekt (NOK)","Tax zone":"Skattesone","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Standardpris (det meste av Norge)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / oppførte tiltakssonekommuner","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Pensjonsestimat forutsetter kvalifisert alderspensjon eller AFP på 100 % for alle 12 måneder, uten annen inntekt.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Lønnsestimat forutsetter ordinært norsk skattemessig bosted, alder 17–69 og ingen annen inntekt.","Compare two scenarios":"Sammenlign to scenarier","Scenario 1":"Alternativ 1","Scenario 2":"Alternativ 2","Calculate estimate":"Beregn estimat","Estimated tax per year":"Estimert skatt per år","Average tax per month":"Gjennomsnittlig skatt per måned","Estimated net per year":"Estimert netto per år","Average net per month":"Gjennomsnittlig netto per måned","Tax on ordinary income":"Skatt på alminnelig inntekt","Bracket tax":"Bracketavgift","National insurance contribution":"Trygdavgift","Pension tax credit":"Pensjonsskattefradrag","Estimated effective rate":"Estimert effektiv rente","Standard deduction base":"Standard fradragsgrunnlag","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Satser og terskler gjelder for inntektsåret 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Kun anslag, ikke en offisiell skatteberegning eller skattekort. Annen inntekt, fradrag, alder, bosted, pensjonskarakter og personlige forhold kan endre resultatet.","Reset values":"Tilbakestill verdier","Example":"Eksempel","How the estimate works":"Hvordan estimatet fungerer","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Er dette min eksakte skatteregning eller skattekorttrekk?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Nr. Den anslår standard 2026 årlig skatt. Skattekort, sluttvurdering og forskuddstrekk kan variere på grunn av din fulle inntekt, fradrag og forhold.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Kan jeg kombinere lønn og pensjon her?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Denne versjonen anslår én inntektstype om gangen. Den beregner ikke en blandet lønn-og-pensjonssak.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Dekker pensjonsmodus hver pensjon?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Nr. Pensjonskreditten er kun modellert for en kvalifiserende alderspensjon eller kvalifisert AFP tatt til 100 % gjennom hele året. Delår eller gradert pensjon og andre pensjonstyper er utenfor virkeområdet.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Hva er alternativet for tiltakssone?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Den gjelder publisert 18.5 % alminnelig inntektssats og NOK 45,000 særfradrag for Finnmark og de oppførte kommunene. Bekreft at din kommune er kvalifisert.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Norge formuesskattekalkulator","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Norge formuesskattekalkulator 2026 — Gratis estimat","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Estimat 2026 Norsk formuesskatt fra boliger, aksjer, næringsmidler, kontanter og gjeld. Se statlig og kommunedeling, verdirabatter og verdifølsomhetsområde.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Beregn personlig norsk formuesskatt for 2026. Angi estimerte markedsverdier for boliger og skattegrunnlag før rabatt for aksjer og næringsmidler. Se verdsettelsesrabatter, gjeldsjustering og egne statlige og kommunale overslag.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Estimatet gjelder 2026 verdivurderingsregler og den maksimale kommunale satsen med mindre du angir en lavere sats. Gjeld er allokert etter full formuesverdi før rabatter; gjeld tilordnet neddiskonterte aksjer eller forretningsmidler reduseres med samme rabatt. Eiendomsvurderinger, valgbarhet og personlige skattefakta kan endre det offisielle resultatet.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"En primærbolig med 10 millioner kroner markedsverdi har en estimert formuesverdi på 2.5 millioner kroner under 2026 primærboligregel, før gjeld og personfradrag.","2026 tax year":"2026 skatteår","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Estimert markedsverdi for primærbolig (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Sekundærboliger estimert markedsverdi (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Aksjer og aksjefond før rabatt (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Kvalifiserte virksomhetsmidler før rabatt (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Bankinnskudd og andre eiendeler (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Total gjeld (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Vi er sambeskattet for formue","Municipal rate (%)":"Kommunal sats (%)","Home-value comparison":"Sammenligning av boligverdi","±5%":"±5 %","±10%":"±10 %","±20%":"±20 %","Estimate wealth tax":"Estimer formuesskatt","Export CSV":"Eksporter CSV","Print estimate":"Skriv ut estimat","Assets before discounts":"Eiendeler før rabatter","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Skattepliktig formuesverdi etter rabatter","Debt reduction from discounts":"Gjeldsreduksjon fra rabatter","Deductible debt estimate":"Fradragsberettiget gjeldsestimat","Estimated net wealth":"Estimert nettoformue","Personal allowance":"Persongodtgjørelse","Taxable net wealth":"Skattepliktig nettoformue","Municipal wealth tax":"Kommunal formuesskatt","State wealth tax":"Statlig formuesskatt","State tax, first band":"Statsavgift, første bånd","State tax, upper band":"Statsavgift, øvre bånd","Estimated total wealth tax":"Estimert total formuesskatt","Lower home-value estimate":"Lavere boligverdianslag","Current-value estimate":"Estimat for nåværende verdi","Higher home-value estimate":"Høyere boligverdianslag","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 regler og forutsetninger","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Kun anslag. Dette er ikke en offisiell ligning eller skatteråd. Bruk selvangivelsesverdiene dine der de er tilgjengelige; priser, berettigelse, gjeldsfordeling og eiendomsverdier kan variere i ditt tilfelle.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Bolig: skriv inn estimert markedsverdi ved årsslutt. Aksjer og kvalifiserte forretningsmidler: skriv inn verdien før 2026-rabatten, ikke markedsverdi med mindre det er riktig skattegrunnlag.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Støttet og statens øvre terskel dobles kun for ektefeller, registrerte partnere eller kvalifiserende samboere som vurderes i fellesskap for deres samlede formue.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Den kommunale beregningen bruker den valgte satsen, som standard til maksimalt 2026 på 0.35 %. Noen kommuner kan bruke lavere sats.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Sensitivitet endrer kun de angitte verdiene for primære og sekundære boliger. Det er en sammenligning, ikke en prediksjon av en offisiell verdivurdering.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Hva er 2026 formuesskattefradrag?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Standardgrensen er 1.9 millioner kroner for én person og 3.8 millioner kroner for ektefeller eller kvalifiserte partnere som vurderes i fellesskap.","How is my primary home valued?":"Hvordan verdsettes hovedboligen min?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"For 2026 er den estimerte formuesverdien 25 % av markedsverdi opp til NOK 14 millioner, pluss 70 % av beløpet over NOK 14 millioner.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Gjelder dette rabatt på et sekundært hjem?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Nr. 2026-tabellen gir sekundærboliger en 0 % verdsettelsesrabatt. Den bruker den angitte markedsverdien som estimatet; offisielle takserte verdier kan variere.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Hvorfor endres egenandelsgjeld når jeg eier aksjer eller forretningsmidler?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Norske regler fordeler gjeld proporsjonalt etter full formuesverdi. Andelen tilordnet eiendeler med verdsettelsesrabatter reduseres med samme diskonteringsrente.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Er den kommunale taksten alltid 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Nr. 0.35% er 2026 maksimum som brukes som standard. En kommune kan sette en lavere sats, som du kan legge inn.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Dekker kalkulatoren alle eiendeler eller skattesaker?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Nr. Den estimerer boliger, aksjer, utvalgte kvalifiserte forretningseiendeler, kontanter og total gjeld. Utenlandske eiendeler, pensjoner, sammensatt eierskap, fritak og andre særregler kan endre vurderingen din.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Sveitsisk QR-seddelgenerator","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Sveitsisk QR-regningsgenerator — Gratis QR-fakturaprodusent","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Opprett og sjekk en sveitsisk QR-regning lokalt. Validere IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR og SCOR referanser; skriv ut A6 betalingsdel og kvittering uten å laste opp fakturadata.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Opprett en sveitsisk betalingsseddel med en sveitsisk QR-kode. Dine fakturadetaljer forblir i denne nettleseren; ingen betaling igangsettes og ingen bankregister spørres.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Verktøyet bygger SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC)-data og sjekker feltene, konto-/referansekombinasjonen, IBAN-sjekksifrene og støttede tegn. Den formaterer betalingsdelen og kvitteringen for utskrift i den nødvendige fysiske størrelsen.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX eksempel: en QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, en 27-sifret QRR-referanse og strukturerte kreditor-/debitoradresser.","How it works":"Slik fungerer det","Frequently asked questions":"Ofte stilte spørsmål","Limits and accuracy":"Begrensninger og nøyaktighet","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Dette er et lokalt dokumentverktøy, ikke en banktjeneste eller sertifisering. Den kan ikke bekrefte hvem som eier et IBAN, om en konto er åpen eller om en betaling vil bli akseptert. Skriv ut med 100% / faktisk størrelse og mål 100 mm sjekklinjen før du bruker en papirbetalingsordre.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Kreditør IBAN eller QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Betales til · kreditor","Account holder / creditor name":"Kontoinnehaver/kreditornavn","Street or P.O. box":"Street eller P.O. boks","Building number":"Byggenummer","Postal code":"Postnummer","Town / city":"By/by","2-letter country code":"2-bokstavlandskode","Amount (optional)":"Beløp (valgfritt)","Currency":"Valuta","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Betales av · valgfri debitor","Debtor name":"Debitornavn","Reference type":"Referansetype","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR-referanse · Kun QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Kredorreferanse · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Ingen strukturert referanse · IBAN","Reference":"Referanse","Unstructured message":"Ustrukturert melding","Billing information (optional)":"Faktureringsinformasjon (valgfritt)","Create QR-bill":"Opprett QR-regning","Load SIX sample":"Last inn SIX prøve","Clear form":"Klar form","Check QR payload":"Sjekk QR-nyttelast","Download payment data":"Last ned betalingsdata","Download QR SVG":"Last ned QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Skriv ut / lagre som PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Les et QR-kodebilde","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Velg PNG eller JPEG","Read image locally":"Les bildet lokalt","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Lim inn sveitsisk QR-kode betalingsdata","Invoice details":"Fakturadetaljer","QR-bill preview":"QR-bill forhåndsvisning","Receipt":"Kvittering","Payment part":"Betalingsdel","Payable to":"Betales til","Payable by":"Betales av","Account":"Konto","Additional information":"Ytterligere informasjon","Currency / amount":"Valuta / beløp","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Skriv ut skalakontroll · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · sveitsisk standard for QR-faktura","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-regning klar. Detaljer ble værende på denne enheten.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Noen felt må sjekkes. Se gjennom den uthevede informasjonen.","Reading this image on your device…":"Leser dette bildet på enheten din …","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Sveitsisk QR-kode lest og kontrollert lokalt.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Ingen lesbar QR-kode ble funnet i det bildet.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Sveitsiske QR-kodedata er gyldige for de støttede feltene.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Dataene er ikke en gyldig sveitsisk QR-kode-betalingsnyttelast.","Form and preview cleared.":"Form og forhåndsvisning fjernet.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX prøve lastet. Bytt ut prøvedetaljene før reell bruk.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Opprett eller les en gyldig QR-regning først.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Velg en PNG eller JPEG på 10 MiB eller mindre.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Den lokale QR-leseren kunne ikke laste. Du kan lime inn betalingsdataene i stedet.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Hvilke IBAN- og referansekombinasjoner er tillatt?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN bruker en QRR-referanse. Et vanlig sveitsisk IBAN bruker SCOR eller ingen strukturert referanse (NON). QRR er kun for CHF-fakturaer.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Sjekker dette at kontoen eksisterer eller tilhører kreditor?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Nr. Den sjekker kun formatet og IBAN-sjekksummen. Den kontakter ikke et bank- eller kontoregister.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Kan jeg skrive ut dette i hvilken som helst skala?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"For en papirbetalingsordre, skriv ut ved 100% / faktisk størrelse. Betalingsdelen må være A6 liggende (148 × 105 mm); sjekk 100 mm-linjen med en linjal.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Sender verktøyet fakturadata hvor som helst?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Nr. Generering og bildelesing skjer i nettleseren din. Ingen konto eller betalingstjeneste brukes.","Grade Scale Generator":"Karakterkalkulator","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Grade Scale Generator — Gratis verktøy for poeng til karakter","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Gjør poeng om til prosenter og karakterer med dine egne terskler. Forhåndsvis hele skalaen, kopier eller eksporter den, og skriv ut et karakterark.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Bygg en gjennomsiktig karakterskala for en eksamen eller oppgave. Angi maksimum poeng og minimum prosentandel for hver karakter; skalaen forutsetter ikke en skole eller nasjonal karakterregel.","Points earned":"Poeng opptjent","Maximum points":"Maksimal poeng","Top grade label":"Etikett av topp kvalitet","Top grade starts at (%)":"Toppkarakter starter på (%)","Middle grade label":"Mellomklasseetikett","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Middelkarakter starter på (%)","Lowest grade label":"Lavest karakter etikett","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Laveste karakter starter på (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Med et maksimum 50-punkt, tilsvarer 45-poeng 90 %. Dine egendefinerte terskler avgjør karakteretiketten.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Bruker dette en offisiell karakterpolicy?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Nr. Du setter tersklene. Karaktersystemer varierer etter skole, kurs og land; bekrefte skalaen du forventes å bruke.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Kan jeg eksportere graderingsbåndene?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ja. Eksporter de viste båndene som en CSV-fil eller skriv ut skalaen."},"nl":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Rekenmachine voor vakantiegeld in Noorwegen","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Rekenmachine voor vakantiegeld in Noorwegen - Gratis brutoschatting","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Schat het Noorse vakantiegeld op basis van uw vakantiegeld. Vergelijk gangbare tarieven voor standaardverlof, een vijfde week en werknemers van 60 of ouder.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Vul de feriepengegrunnlag in die op uw loonstrook staat. Vergelijk de gebruikelijke Noorse bruto vakantiegeldtarieven voor uw leeftijd en overeengekomen vakantieduur.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Basis vakantiegeld (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Ik ben 60 of ouder in het vakantiejaar","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"In mijn overeenkomst is een vijfde vakantieweek opgenomen","Estimated holiday pay":"Geschat vakantiegeld","Rate used":"Gebruikt tarief","Basis used":"Gebruikte basis","Reset choices":"Reset keuzes","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Alleen brutoschatting. Vakantiegeld is belastbaar inkomen; de belastinginhouding kan variëren per persoon en loonlijst.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Op basis van NOK 500,000 geeft 10.2% NOK 51,000 vóór eventuele salarisaanpassingen.","Which rate should I use?":"Welk tarief moet ik gebruiken?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"De schatting maakt gebruik van gebruikelijke minimumtarieven: 10.2% of 12% met een vijfde week; 12.5% of 14.3% voor werknemers van 60 of ouder. Uw overeenkomst kan meer opleveren.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Is dit het bedrag na belastingen?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Nr. Dit is een bruto schatting. Vakantiegeld is belastbaar inkomen; De inhouding is afhankelijk van uw omstandigheden en salarisadministratie.","What belongs in the basis?":"Wat hoort er in de basis?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Gebruik de feriepengegrunnlag op uw loonstrook of jaaropgave. Sommige vergoedingen en andere betalingen zijn door de regels uitgesloten.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Noorwegen inkomstenbelastingcalculator","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Belastingcalculator voor Noorwegen 2026 — Gratis schatting van uw salaris en pensioen","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Schatting 2026 Noorse inkomstenbelasting op standaardsalaris of volledig ouderdomspensioen. Bekijk het jaarlijkse en maandelijkse nettoloon, de belastingcomponenten en vergelijk twee scenario's.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Schatting 2026 Noorse inkomstenbelasting voor een standaardinwonersalaris of een heel jaar ouderdomspensioen. Bekijk de belangrijkste belastingcomponenten en vergelijk twee bruto-inkomensscenario's.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"De calculator past de standaardaftrek 2026, de vijf progressieve belastingschijven en premies volksverzekeringen toe. De pensioenmodus omvat alleen de pensioenheffingskorting voor een volledig jaar, 100% in aanmerking komend ouderdomspensioen of in aanmerking komend AFP. Het draait volledig in deze browser.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Voor een salaris van NOK 600,000 vergelijkt u de geschatte jaarlijkse belasting en het nettoloon met een ander salaris of een pensioenbedrag voor een heel jaar.","Tax year":"Belastingjaar","Scenario":"Scenario","Salary":"Salaris","Full-year old-age pension":"Een heel jaar ouderdomspensioen","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Bruto jaarinkomen (NOK)","Tax zone":"Belastingzone","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Standaardtarief (het grootste deel van Noorwegen)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / vermelde maatregelenzonegemeenten","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Pensioenschatting gaat uit van een in aanmerking komend ouderdomspensioen of AFP van 100% voor alle 12 maanden, zonder ander inkomen.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Salarisschatting gaat uit van gewone Noorse fiscale woonplaats, leeftijd 17–69 en geen ander inkomen.","Compare two scenarios":"Vergelijk twee scenario's","Scenario 1":"Scenario 1","Scenario 2":"Scenario 2","Calculate estimate":"Bereken schatting","Estimated tax per year":"Geschatte belasting per jaar","Average tax per month":"Gemiddelde belasting per maand","Estimated net per year":"Geschat netto per jaar","Average net per month":"Gemiddeld netto per maand","Tax on ordinary income":"Belasting op gewoon inkomen","Bracket tax":"Bracketbelasting","National insurance contribution":"Bijdrage volksverzekeringen","Pension tax credit":"Pensioenheffingskorting","Estimated effective rate":"Geschat effectief tarief","Standard deduction base":"Standaard aftrekgrondslag","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Tarieven en drempels gelden voor het inkomstenjaar 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Alleen een schatting, geen officiële belastingberekening of belastingkaart. Andere inkomsten, inhoudingen, leeftijd, woonplaats, pensioenhoogte en persoonlijke omstandigheden kunnen de uitslag wijzigen.","Reset values":"Waarden resetten","Example":"Voorbeeld","How the estimate works":"Hoe de schatting werkt","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Is dit mijn exacte belastingaanslag of de inhouding op mijn belastingkaart?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Nr. Het schat de standaard jaarlijkse belasting 2026. Een belastingkaart, eindaanslag en inhouding kunnen verschillen vanwege uw volledige inkomen, aftrekposten en omstandigheden.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Kan ik hier salaris en pensioen combineren?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Deze versie schat één inkomenstype tegelijk. Er wordt geen gemengd salaris-en-pensioengeval berekend.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Dekt de pensioenmodus elk pensioen?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Nr. Het pensioentegoed is alleen gemodelleerd voor een in aanmerking komend ouderdomspensioen of in aanmerking komend AFP, opgenomen tegen 100% gedurende het hele jaar. Gedeeltelijk of getrapt pensioen en andere pensioenvormen vallen buiten de reikwijdte.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Wat is de maatregelenzone-optie?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Het past het gepubliceerde 18.5% gewone inkomenstarief en de speciale aftrek NOK 45,000 toe voor Finnmark en de genoemde gemeenten. Controleer of uw gemeente in aanmerking komt.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Noorwegen vermogensbelastingcalculator","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Noorwegen vermogensbelastingcalculator 2026 — gratis schatting","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Schatting 2026 Noorse vermogensbelasting op huizen, aandelen, bedrijfseigendommen, contant geld en schulden. Bekijk de staats- en gemeentelijke verdeling, waarderingskortingen en een waardegevoeligheidsbereik.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Schatting van de persoonlijke Noorse vermogensbelasting voor 2026. Voer geschatte marktwaarden in voor woningen en belastinggrondslagen vóór korting voor aandelen en bedrijfsmiddelen. Bekijk waarderingskortingen, schuldaanpassingen en afzonderlijke staats- en gemeentelijke schattingen.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Voor de schatting gelden de 2026-waarderingsregels en het maximale gemeentelijke tarief, tenzij u een lager tarief invoert. Schulden worden toegewezen op basis van de volledige activawaarden vóór kortingen; de schuld toegewezen aan aandelen of bedrijfsactiva met korting wordt verminderd met dezelfde korting. Taxaties van onroerend goed, geschiktheid en persoonlijke belastingfeiten kunnen het officiële resultaat veranderen.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Een primaire woning met een marktwaarde van NOK 10 miljoen heeft een geschatte vermogenswaarde van NOK 2.5 miljoen volgens de 2026-regel voor de primaire woning, vóór schulden en persoonsgebonden aftrek.","2026 tax year":"2026 belastingjaar","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Geschatte marktwaarde van de primaire woning (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Geschatte marktwaarde secundaire woningen (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Aandelen en aandelenfondsen vóór korting (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"In aanmerking komende bedrijfsactiva vóór korting (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Bankdeposito's en andere activa (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Totale schuld (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"We worden gezamenlijk belast op rijkdom","Municipal rate (%)":"Gemeentelijk tarief (%)","Home-value comparison":"Woningwaardevergelijking","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Schatting van de vermogensbelasting","Export CSV":"CSV exporteren","Print estimate":"Schatting afdrukken","Assets before discounts":"Activiteiten vóór kortingen","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Belastbare vermogenswaarde na kortingen","Debt reduction from discounts":"Schuldreductie door kortingen","Deductible debt estimate":"Aftrekbare schuldschatting","Estimated net wealth":"Geschat nettovermogen","Personal allowance":"Persoonlijke toeslag","Taxable net wealth":"Belastbaar netto vermogen","Municipal wealth tax":"Gemeente vermogensbelasting","State wealth tax":"Staatsvermogensbelasting","State tax, first band":"Staatsbelasting, eerste band","State tax, upper band":"Staatsbelasting, bovenste band","Estimated total wealth tax":"Geschatte totale vermogensbelasting","Lower home-value estimate":"Lagere schatting van de woningwaarde","Current-value estimate":"Schatting van de huidige waarde","Higher home-value estimate":"Hogere schatting van de woningwaarde","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 regels en aannames","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Alleen schatting. Dit is geen officiële belastingaanslag of belastingadvies. Gebruik uw belastingaangiftewaarden indien beschikbaar; tarieven, geschiktheid, toewijzing van schulden en waarde van onroerend goed kunnen in uw geval verschillen.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Woningen: geschatte marktwaarde ultimo jaar invullen. Aandelen en in aanmerking komende bedrijfsmiddelen: voer de waarde vóór de 2026-korting in, niet de marktwaarde, tenzij dat de juiste belastinggrondslag is.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"De toeslag en de rijksbovengrens verdubbelen alleen voor echtgenoten, geregistreerde partners of kwalificerende samenwonenden die gezamenlijk worden beoordeeld op hun gezamenlijke vermogen.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"De gemeentelijke berekening gebruikt het geselecteerde tarief, standaard ingesteld op het 2026 maximum van 0.35%. Sommige gemeenten kunnen een lager tarief hanteren.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Gevoeligheid verandert alleen de ingevoerde waarden van primaire en secundaire woningen. Het is een vergelijking, geen voorspelling van een officiële taxatie.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Wat is de 2026 vermogensbelastingvrijstelling?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"De standaarddrempel bedraagt ​​NOK 1.9 miljoen voor één persoon en NOK 3.8 miljoen voor echtgenoten of in aanmerking komende partners, gezamenlijk beoordeeld.","How is my primary home valued?":"Hoe wordt mijn primaire woning gewaardeerd?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Voor 2026 bedraagt ​​de geschatte vermogenswaarde 25% van de marktwaarde tot maximaal NOK 14 miljoen, plus 70% van het bedrag boven NOK 14 miljoen.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Geldt dit voor een tweede woning met korting?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Nr. De tabel 2026 geeft tweede woningen een waarderingskorting 0%. Als schatting wordt de ingevoerde marktwaarde gebruikt; officieel beoordeelde waarden kunnen verschillen.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Waarom verandert de aftrekbare schuld als ik aandelen of bedrijfsmiddelen bezit?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"De Noorse regels verdelen schulden proportioneel op basis van de volledige activawaarde. Het deel dat wordt toegewezen aan activa met waarderingskortingen wordt verminderd met hetzelfde discontopercentage.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Is het gemeentetarief altijd 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Nr. 0.35% is het standaard maximum voor 2026. Het kan zijn dat een gemeente een lager tarief vaststelt, dit kunt u ingeven.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Dekt de rekenmachine elk vermogens- of belastinggeval?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Nr. Het schat huizen, aandelen, geselecteerde in aanmerking komende bedrijfsactiva, contant geld en totale schulden. Buitenlandse bezittingen, pensioenen, complex eigendom, vrijstellingen en andere bijzondere regels kunnen uw beoordeling veranderen.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Zwitserse QR-biljetgenerator","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Zwitserse QR-factuurgenerator - Gratis QR-factuurmaker","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Maak en controleer lokaal een Zwitserse QR-factuur. Valideren van IBAN-, QR-IBAN-, QRR- en SCOR-referenties; druk het A6-betalingsgedeelte en de kassabon af zonder factuurgegevens te uploaden.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Maak een Zwitsers betalingsbewijs met een Zwitserse QR-code. Uw factuurgegevens blijven in deze browser; er wordt geen betaling gestart en er wordt geen bankregister opgevraagd.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"De tool bouwt de SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC)-gegevens op en controleert de velden, rekening-/referentiecombinatie, IBAN-controlecijfers en ondersteunde tekens. Het formatteert het betalingsgedeelte en het ontvangstbewijs voor afdrukken op de gewenste fysieke grootte.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX voorbeeld: een QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, een 27-cijferige QRR-referentie en gestructureerde crediteur/debiteuradressen.","How it works":"Hoe het werkt","Frequently asked questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","Limits and accuracy":"Grenzen en nauwkeurigheid","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Dit is een lokale documenttool, geen bankdienst of certificering. Het kan niet bevestigen wie de eigenaar is van een IBAN, of er een rekening open is en of een betaling wordt geaccepteerd. Druk af op 100% / ware grootte en meet de 100 mm-controlelijn voordat u een papieren betalingsopdracht gebruikt.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Crediteur IBAN of QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Te betalen aan · crediteur","Account holder / creditor name":"Naam rekeninghouder/crediteur","Street or P.O. box":"Straat of P.O. doos","Building number":"Bouwnummer","Postal code":"Postcode","Town / city":"Stad/stad","2-letter country code":"2-letterige landcode","Amount (optional)":"Bedrag (optioneel)","Currency":"Valuta","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Betaalbaar door · optionele debiteur","Debtor name":"Naam debiteur","Reference type":"Referentietype","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR-referentie · Alleen QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Crediteurreferentie · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Geen gestructureerde referentie · IBAN","Reference":"Referentie","Unstructured message":"Ongestructureerd bericht","Billing information (optional)":"Factuurgegevens (optioneel)","Create QR-bill":"QR-factuur maken","Load SIX sample":"Laad ZES monster","Clear form":"Duidelijke vorm","Check QR payload":"Controleer de QR-payload","Download payment data":"Betaalgegevens downloaden","Download QR SVG":"QR-SVG downloaden","Print / save as PDF":"Afdrukken / opslaan als PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Lees een QR-codeafbeelding","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Kies PNG of JPEG","Read image locally":"Afbeelding lokaal lezen","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Paste de betalingsgegevens van de Zwitserse QR-code","Invoice details":"Factuurgegevens","QR-bill preview":"QR-factuurvoorbeeld","Receipt":"Ontvangst","Payment part":"Betalingsgedeelte","Payable to":"Betaalbaar aan","Payable by":"Betaalbaar per","Account":"Rekening","Additional information":"Aanvullende informatie","Currency / amount":"Valuta / bedrag","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Afdrukschaalcontrole · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Zwitserse QR-factuurstandaard","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-factuur gereed. Details bleven op dit apparaat staan.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Sommige velden moeten worden gecontroleerd. Bekijk de gemarkeerde informatie.","Reading this image on your device…":"Deze afbeelding op uw apparaat lezen...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Zwitserse QR-code lokaal gelezen en gecontroleerd.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Er is geen leesbare QR-code gevonden in die afbeelding.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Zwitserse QR-codegegevens zijn geldig voor de ondersteunde velden.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"De gegevens vormen geen geldige betalingslading met een Zwitserse QR-code.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formulier en voorbeeld gewist.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX monster geladen. Vervang de voorbeeldgegevens vóór echt gebruik.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Maak of lees eerst een geldige QR-factuur.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Kies een PNG of JPEG van 10 MiB of minder.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"De lokale QR-lezer kon niet laden. U kunt in plaats daarvan de betalingsgegevens plakken.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Welke combinaties van IBAN en referentie zijn toegestaan?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Een QR-IBAN maakt gebruik van een QRR-referentie. Een normale Zwitserse IBAN gebruikt SCOR of geen gestructureerde referentie (NON). QRR is alleen voor CHF-facturen.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Controleert dit of de rekening bestaat of eigendom is van de schuldeiser?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Nr. Het controleert alleen het formaat en de IBAN-controlesom. Er wordt geen contact opgenomen met een bank of rekeningregister.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Kan ik dit op elke schaal afdrukken?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Voor een papieren betalingsopdracht drukt u af op 100% / ware grootte. Het betalingsgedeelte moet A6 liggend zijn (148 × 105 mm); controleer de 100 mm-lijn met een liniaal.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Verzendt de tool factuurgegevens ergens naartoe?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Nr. Het genereren en lezen van afbeeldingen gebeurt in uw browser. Er wordt geen rekening of betaaldienst gebruikt.","Grade Scale Generator":"Grade schaalgenerator","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Grade Scale Generator - Gratis tool voor punten-naar-niveau","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Zet punten om in percentages en cijfers met uw eigen drempelwaarden. Bekijk een voorbeeld van de volledige schaal, kopieer of exporteer deze en druk een beoordelingsblad af.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Bouw een transparante beoordelingsschaal voor een examen of opdracht. Stel het maximumaantal punten en het minimumpercentage in voor elk cijfer; de schaal gaat niet uit van een school- of nationale beoordelingsregel.","Points earned":"Punten verdiend","Maximum points":"Maximum aantal punten","Top grade label":"Etiket van topkwaliteit","Top grade starts at (%)":"Topkwaliteit begint bij (%)","Middle grade label":"Etiket van gemiddelde kwaliteit","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Middenklasse begint bij (%)","Lowest grade label":"Etiket van de laagste kwaliteit","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Laagste cijfer begint bij (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Bij een maximum van 50-punten zijn de 45-punten gelijk aan 90%. Uw aangepaste drempelwaarden bepalen het cijferlabel.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Gebruikt dit een officieel beoordelingsbeleid?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Nr. Jij bepaalt de drempels. Beoordelingssystemen verschillen per school, cursus en land; bevestig de weegschaal die u verwacht te gebruiken.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Kan ik de beoordelingsbanden exporteren?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ja. Exporteer de weergegeven banden als CSV-bestand of druk de schaal af."},"pl":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Kalkulator wynagrodzeń urlopowych w Norwegii","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Norweski kalkulator wynagrodzeń urlopowych — bezpłatna wycena brutto","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Oszacuj wynagrodzenie urlopowe w Norwegii na podstawie podstawy wynagrodzenia urlopowego. Porównaj wspólne stawki za standardowy urlop, piąty tydzień i pracowników w wieku 60 i starszych.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Wprowadź feriepengegrunnlag widoczny na odcinku wypłaty. Porównaj typowe norweskie stawki wynagrodzenia urlopowego brutto dla Twojego wieku i uzgodnionej długości urlopu.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Podstawa urlopu (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Mam 60 lub więcej w roku świątecznym","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Moja umowa obejmuje piąty tydzień urlopu","Estimated holiday pay":"Szacowana płaca urlopowa","Rate used":"Wykorzystana szybkość","Basis used":"Użyta baza","Reset choices":"Zresetuj wybory","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Tylko szacunki brutto. Wynagrodzenie urlopowe stanowi dochód podlegający opodatkowaniu; Potrącenie podatku u źródła może się różnić w zależności od osoby i wynagrodzenia.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Przy podstawie NOK 500,000, 10.2% daje NOK 51,000 przed jakimikolwiek korektami płac.","Which rate should I use?":"Jakiej stawki powinienem użyć?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"W oszacowaniu zastosowano wspólne stawki minimalne: 10.2% lub 12% z piątym tygodniem; 12.5% lub 14.3% dla pracowników w wieku 60 lub starszych. Twoja umowa może dać więcej.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Czy jest to kwota zapłacona po opodatkowaniu?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Nie. Jest to szacunkowa wartość brutto. Wynagrodzenie urlopowe stanowi dochód podlegający opodatkowaniu; potrącenie zależy od Twojej sytuacji i listy płac.","What belongs in the basis?":"Co należy do podstawy?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Użyj feriepengegrunnlag na odcinku wypłaty lub wyciągu rocznym. Niektóre zwroty kosztów i inne płatności są wyłączone przez zasady.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator podatku dochodowego w Norwegii","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Norweski kalkulator podatkowy 2026 — bezpłatne oszacowanie wynagrodzenia i emerytury","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Oszacuj 2026 Norweski podatek dochodowy od standardowego wynagrodzenia lub całorocznej emerytury. Zobacz roczne i miesięczne wynagrodzenie netto, składniki podatku i porównaj dwa scenariusze.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Oszacuj 2026 Norweski podatek dochodowy dla standardowego wynagrodzenia rezydenta lub całorocznej emerytury. Zobacz główne składniki podatku i porównaj dwa scenariusze dochodu brutto.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Kalkulator uwzględnia standardowe odliczenia 2026, pięć progresywnych przedziałów podatkowych oraz składki na ubezpieczenie społeczne. Tryb emerytalny obejmuje ulgę podatkową dotyczącą emerytury tylko w przypadku kwalifikującej się emerytury za cały rok, 100% lub kwalifikującego się AFP. Działa całkowicie w tej przeglądarce.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"W przypadku wynagrodzenia w wysokości 600,000 NOK porównaj szacunkowy roczny podatek i wynagrodzenie netto z inną pensją lub kwotą całorocznej emerytury.","Tax year":"Rok podatkowy","Scenario":"Scenariusz","Salary":"Wynagrodzenie","Full-year old-age pension":"Emerytura całoroczna","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Roczny dochód brutto (NOK)","Tax zone":"Strefa podatkowa","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Stawka standardowa (większość Norwegii)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / gminy wymienione w strefie działań","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Oszacowanie emerytury zakłada kwalifikującą się emeryturę lub AFP na poziomie 100% za wszystkie miesiące 12, bez innych dochodów.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Oszacowanie wynagrodzenia zakłada zwykłą norweską rezydencję podatkową, wiek 17–69 i brak innych dochodów.","Compare two scenarios":"Porównaj dwa scenariusze","Scenario 1":"Scenariusz 1","Scenario 2":"Scenariusz 2","Calculate estimate":"Oblicz oszacowanie","Estimated tax per year":"Szacowany podatek roczny","Average tax per month":"Średni podatek miesięczny","Estimated net per year":"Szacowana wartość netto rocznie","Average net per month":"Średnia kwota netto miesięcznie","Tax on ordinary income":"Podatek od zwykłego dochodu","Bracket tax":"Podatek wspornikowy","National insurance contribution":"Składka na ubezpieczenie społeczne","Pension tax credit":"Ulga podatkowa na emeryturę","Estimated effective rate":"Szacowana efektywna szybkość","Standard deduction base":"Standardowa podstawa odliczenia","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Stawki i progi dotyczą roku dochodowego 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Tylko oszacowanie, a nie oficjalne obliczenie podatku ani karta podatkowa. Inne dochody, odliczenia, wiek, miejsce zamieszkania, wysokość emerytury i sytuacja osobista mogą zmienić wynik.","Reset values":"Zresetuj wartości","Example":"Przykład","How the estimate works":"Jak działa oszacowanie","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Czy to jest mój dokładny rachunek podatkowy czy potrącenie na karcie podatkowej?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Nie. Szacuje standardowy roczny podatek 2026. Karta podatkowa, ostateczna ocena i potrącenie mogą się różnić w zależności od pełnego dochodu, odliczeń i okoliczności.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Czy mogę tutaj łączyć pensję i emeryturę?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Ta wersja szacuje jeden rodzaj dochodu na raz. Nie uwzględnia przypadku mieszanego wynagrodzenia i emerytury.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Czy tryb emerytalny obejmuje każdą emeryturę?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Nie. Kredyt emerytalny jest modelowany wyłącznie dla kwalifikującej się emerytury lub kwalifikującego się AFP pobieranego w wysokości 100% przez cały rok. Renty częściowe lub stopniowane oraz inne rodzaje emerytur nie wchodzą w zakres zakresu.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Co to jest opcja strefy pomiarów?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Ma zastosowanie opublikowana stawka zwykłego dochodu 18.5% i specjalne odliczenie NOK 45,000 dla Finnmark i wymienionych gmin. Potwierdź, że Twoja gmina kwalifikuje się.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Norweski kalkulator podatku majątkowego","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Norweski kalkulator podatku majątkowego 2026 — bezpłatna wycena","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Oszacuj 2026 Norweski podatek majątkowy od domów, udziałów, majątku przedsiębiorstwa, gotówki i długów. Zobacz podział na stan i gminę, rabaty z tytułu wyceny i zakres wrażliwości wartości.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Oszacuj osobisty norweski podatek majątkowy dla 2026. Wprowadź szacunkowe wartości rynkowe domów i podstawy opodatkowania przed dyskontem dla akcji i aktywów biznesowych. Zobacz dyskonta wyceny, korektę zadłużenia oraz osobne szacunki stanowe i gminne.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Wycena dotyczy zasad wyceny 2026 oraz maksymalnej stawki gminnej, chyba że wpiszesz niższą stawkę. Dług alokuje się według pełnej wartości aktywów przed dyskontami; zadłużenie przypisane do zdyskontowanych udziałów lub aktywów biznesowych jest pomniejszane o to samo dyskonto. Wyceny nieruchomości, kwalifikowalność i fakty dotyczące podatków osobistych mogą zmienić oficjalny wynik.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Główny dom o wartości rynkowej 10 w milionach NOK ma szacunkową wartość majątku 2.5 w milionach NOK zgodnie z zasadą 2026 dotyczącą głównego domu, przed zadłużeniem i ulgami osobistymi.","2026 tax year":"2026 rok podatkowy","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Szacunkowa wartość rynkowa domu pierwotnego (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Szacunkowa wartość rynkowa domów drugorzędnych (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Akcje i fundusze akcji przed dyskontem (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Kwalifikujące się aktywa biznesowe przed dyskontem (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Lokaty bankowe i inne aktywa (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Całkowite zadłużenie (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Jesteśmy opodatkowani wspólnie z tytułu majątku","Municipal rate (%)":"Stawka gminna (%)","Home-value comparison":"Porównanie wartości domowej","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Oszacuj podatek majątkowy","Export CSV":"Eksportuj plik CSV","Print estimate":"Wydrukuj oszacowanie","Assets before discounts":"Aktywa przed rabatami","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Wartość aktywów podlegających opodatkowaniu po obniżkach","Debt reduction from discounts":"Redukcja zadłużenia dzięki rabatom","Deductible debt estimate":"Oszacowanie zadłużenia podlegającego odliczeniu","Estimated net wealth":"Szacowany majątek netto","Personal allowance":"Zasiłek osobisty","Taxable net wealth":"Majtek netto podlegający opodatkowaniu","Municipal wealth tax":"Gminny podatek majątkowy","State wealth tax":"Stawowy podatek majątkowy","State tax, first band":"Podatek stanowy, pierwszy zakres","State tax, upper band":"Podatek stanowy, górna granica","Estimated total wealth tax":"Szacowany całkowity podatek majątkowy","Lower home-value estimate":"Dolna szacunkowa wartość domu","Current-value estimate":"Oszacowanie wartości bieżącej","Higher home-value estimate":"Wyższa szacunkowa wartość domu\nReguły i założenia","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Tylko szacunkowe. To nie jest oficjalny wymiar podatku ani porada podatkowa. Jeśli to możliwe, użyj wartości zeznania podatkowego; stawki, kwalifikowalność, alokacja długu i wartości nieruchomości mogą się różnić w Twoim przypadku.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Domy: wprowadź szacunkową wartość rynkową na koniec roku. Akcje i kwalifikujące się aktywa biznesowe: wprowadź wartość przed rabatem 2026, a nie wartość rynkową, chyba że jest to właściwa podstawa opodatkowania.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Zasiłek i górny próg stanu są podwajane tylko w przypadku małżonków, zarejestrowanych partnerów lub kwalifikujących się konkubentów ocenianych łącznie pod kątem ich łącznego majątku.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"W obliczeniach miejskich używana jest wybrana stawka, domyślnie maksymalna wartość 2026 wynosi 0.35%. Niektóre gminy mogą stosować niższą stawkę.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Czułość zmienia tylko wprowadzone wartości domów podstawowych i dodatkowych. To porównanie, a nie przewidywanie oficjalnej wyceny.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Co to jest ulga podatkowa 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Standardowy próg wynosi 1.9 mln NOK w przypadku jednej osoby i mln NOK 3.8 w przypadku małżonków lub uprawnionych partnerów ocenianych wspólnie.","How is my primary home valued?":"Jak wyceniany jest mój główny dom?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"W przypadku 2026 szacowana wartość majątku wynosi 25% wartości rynkowej do kwoty 14 mln NOK plus 70% kwoty powyżej 14 mln NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Czy dotyczy to zniżki na drugi dom?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Nie. Tabela 2026 zapewnia domy drugorzędne zniżkę z wyceny 0%. Jako szacunek wykorzystuje wprowadzoną wartość rynkową; oficjalne wartości szacunkowe mogą się różnić.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Dlaczego zadłużenie podlegające odliczeniu zmienia się, gdy posiadam udziały lub aktywa biznesowe?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Norweskie przepisy alokują dług proporcjonalnie według pełnej wartości aktywów. Część przypisaną do aktywów objętych dyskontami wyceny pomniejsza się o tę samą stopę dyskontową.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Czy stawka miejska zawsze wynosi 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Nie. 0.35% to domyślnie używane maksimum 2026. Gmina może ustalić niższą stawkę, na którą można wpisać.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Czy kalkulator uwzględnia każdy przypadek majątkowy lub podatkowy?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Nie. Szacuje domy, udziały, wybrane kwalifikujące się aktywa biznesowe, środki pieniężne i całkowite zadłużenie. Aktywa zagraniczne, emerytury, złożona własność, zwolnienia i inne specjalne zasady mogą zmienić Twoją ocenę.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Szwajcarski generator rachunków QR","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Szwajcarski generator rachunków QR — bezpłatne narzędzie do tworzenia faktur QR","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Utwórz i sprawdź lokalnie szwajcarski rachunek QR. Zweryfikuj referencje IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR i SCOR; wydrukuj część płatności i paragon A6 bez przesyłania danych do faktury.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Utwórz szwajcarski dowód płatności ze szwajcarskim kodem QR. Dane Twojej faktury pozostają w tej przeglądarce; żadna płatność nie jest inicjowana ani nie jest sprawdzane żadne konto bankowe.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Narzędzie buduje dane SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) i sprawdza jego pola, kombinację konta/referencji, cyfry kontrolne IBAN i obsługiwane znaki. Formatuje część płatniczą i pokwitowanie do wydrukowania w wymaganym rozmiarze fizycznym.\nPrzykład","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, cyfrowa referencja QRR 27 i strukturyzowane adresy wierzyciela/dłużnika.","How it works":"Jak to działa","Frequently asked questions":"Często zadawane pytania","Limits and accuracy":"Granice i dokładność","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"To jest narzędzie do obsługi dokumentów lokalnych, a nie usługa bankowa czy certyfikacja. Nie może potwierdzić, kto jest właścicielem numeru IBAN, czy konto jest otwarte ani czy płatność zostanie zaakceptowana. Wydrukuj w 100% / Rzeczywisty rozmiar i zmierz linię kontrolną 100 mm przed skorzystaniem z papierowego zlecenia płatniczego.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN wierzyciela lub QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Zapłata · wierzycielowi","Account holder / creditor name":"Nazwa właściciela konta / wierzyciela","Street or P.O. box":"Ulica lub punkt sprzedaży pudełko","Building number":"Numer budynku","Postal code":"Kod pocztowy","Town / city":"Miasto / miasto","2-letter country code":"2-literowy kod kraju","Amount (optional)":"Kwota (opcjonalnie)","Currency":"Waluta","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Płatne przez · opcjonalnego dłużnika","Debtor name":"Nazwa dłużnika","Reference type":"Typ odniesienia","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Odniesienie QR · Tylko QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Numer referencyjny wierzyciela · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Brak uporządkowanego odniesienia · IBAN","Reference":"Odniesienie","Unstructured message":"Wiadomość bez struktury","Billing information (optional)":"Informacje rozliczeniowe (opcjonalnie)","Create QR-bill":"Utwórz rachunek QR","Load SIX sample":"Załaduj SZEŚĆ próbek","Clear form":"Przejrzysta forma","Check QR payload":"Sprawdź ładunek QR","Download payment data":"Pobierz dane dotyczące płatności","Download QR SVG":"Pobierz QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Wydrukuj / zapisz w formacie PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Odczytaj obraz kodu QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Wybierz PNG lub JPEG","Read image locally":"Odczytaj obraz lokalnie","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Wklej dane dotyczące płatności szwajcarskim kodem QR","Invoice details":"Szczegóły faktury","QR-bill preview":"Podgląd rachunku QR","Receipt":"Odbiór","Payment part":"Część płatnicza","Payable to":"Płatne dla","Payable by":"Płatne do","Account":"Konto","Additional information":"Dodatkowe informacje","Currency / amount":"Waluta / kwota","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Wydrukuj kontrolę skali · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Szwajcarski standard QR-rachunków","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"Rachunek QR gotowy. Szczegóły pozostały na tym urządzeniu.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Niektóre pola wymagają sprawdzenia. Przejrzyj wyróżnione informacje.","Reading this image on your device…":"Czytanie tego obrazu na Twoim urządzeniu…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Szwajcarski kod QR odczytany i sprawdzony lokalnie.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Na tym obrazie nie znaleziono czytelnego kodu QR.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Dane szwajcarskiego kodu QR obowiązują dla obsługiwanych pól.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Dane nie są prawidłowym ładunkiem płatności szwajcarskim kodem QR.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formularz i podgląd zostały wyczyszczone.\nZaładowano próbkę","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SZEŚĆ. Wymień jego przykładowe szczegóły przed rzeczywistym użyciem.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Najpierw utwórz lub przeczytaj ważny rachunek QR.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Wybierz plik PNG lub JPEG o wielkości 10 MiB lub mniejszej.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Nie można załadować lokalnego czytnika QR. Zamiast tego możesz wkleić dane dotyczące płatności.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Jakie kombinacje numeru IBAN i numeru referencyjnego są dozwolone?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN wykorzystuje odniesienie QRR. Zwykły szwajcarski numer IBAN wykorzystuje SCOR lub nie ma odniesienia strukturalnego (NON). QRR dotyczy wyłącznie faktur w CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Czy to sprawdza, czy konto istnieje lub należy do wierzyciela?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Nie. Sprawdza tylko format i sumę kontrolną IBAN. Nie kontaktuje się z bankiem ani rejestrem kont.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Czy mogę to wydrukować w dowolnej skali?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"W przypadku papierowego zlecenia płatniczego drukuj w formacie 100% / Rzeczywisty rozmiar. Część płatnicza musi mieć postać A6 poziomą (148 × 105 mm); sprawdź linijką linię 100 mm.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Czy narzędzie wysyła gdziekolwiek dane do faktur?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Nie. Generowanie i odczytywanie obrazów odbywa się w Twojej przeglądarce. Nie jest używane żadne konto ani usługa płatności.","Grade Scale Generator":"Generator skali stopni","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Generator skali ocen — bezpłatne narzędzie do obliczania punktów do oceny","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Zamień punkty na procenty i oceny, korzystając z własnych progów. Wyświetl podgląd w pełnej skali, skopiuj lub wyeksportuj go i wydrukuj arkusz oceny.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Zbuduj przejrzystą skalę ocen do egzaminu lub zadania. Ustaw maksymalną liczbę punktów i minimalny procent dla każdej oceny; skala nie uwzględnia szkolnych ani ogólnokrajowych zasad oceniania.","Points earned":"Zdobyte punkty","Maximum points":"Maksymalna liczba punktów","Top grade label":"Etykieta najwyższej jakości","Top grade starts at (%)":"Najwyższa jakość zaczyna się od (%)","Middle grade label":"Etykieta średniej klasy","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Gadość średnia zaczyna się od (%)","Lowest grade label":"Etykieta najniższej jakości","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Najniższy stopień zaczyna się od (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Przy maksymalnej liczbie punktów 50, punkty 45 równają się 90%. Twoje niestandardowe progi decydują o etykiecie oceny.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Czy to korzysta z oficjalnych zasad oceniania?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Nie. Ty ustalasz progi. Systemy oceniania różnią się w zależności od szkoły, kursu i kraju; potwierdź skalę, której będziesz używać.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Czy mogę wyeksportować pasma klasyfikacji?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Tak. Eksportuj wyświetlane pasma jako plik CSV lub wydrukuj skalę."},"pt":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Calculadora de pagamento de férias na Noruega","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Calculadora de pagamento de férias na Noruega - estimativa bruta gratuita","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Estime o pagamento de férias na Noruega a partir de sua base de pagamento de férias. Compare as taxas comuns para licença padrão, uma quinta semana e funcionários com idade igual ou superior a 60.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Insira o feriepengegrunnlag mostrado no seu contracheque. Compare as taxas brutas comuns de férias pagas na Noruega de acordo com sua idade e duração de férias acordada.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Base de pagamento de férias (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Eu sou 60 ou mais velho no ano festivo","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Meu contrato inclui uma quinta semana de feriado","Estimated holiday pay":"Pagamento estimado de férias","Rate used":"Taxa usada","Basis used":"Base usada","Reset choices":"Redefinir opções","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Somente estimativa bruta. O subsídio de férias é rendimento tributável; a retenção de impostos pode variar de acordo com a pessoa e a folha de pagamento.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Com base NOK 500,000, 10.2% dá NOK 51,000 antes de qualquer ajuste na folha de pagamento.","Which rate should I use?":"Qual taxa devo usar?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"A estimativa utiliza taxas mínimas comuns: 10.2% ou 12% com uma quinta semana; 12.5% ou 14.3% para funcionários com idade igual ou superior a 60. Seu acordo pode dar mais.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Este é o valor pago após impostos?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Não. Esta é uma estimativa bruta. O subsídio de férias é rendimento tributável; a retenção depende de suas circunstâncias e folha de pagamento.","What belongs in the basis?":"O que pertence à base?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Use o feriepengegrunnlag em seu contracheque ou extrato anual. Alguns reembolsos e outros pagamentos estão excluídos pelas regras.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Calculadora de imposto de renda da Noruega","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Calculadora de impostos da Noruega 2026 - estimativa gratuita de salário e pensão","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Estimativa 2026 imposto de renda norueguês sobre salário padrão ou pensão de velhice de um ano inteiro. Veja o salário líquido anual e mensal, componentes fiscais e compare dois cenários.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Estimativa 2026 do imposto de renda norueguês para um salário padrão de residente ou uma pensão de velhice de um ano inteiro. Veja os principais componentes tributários e compare dois cenários de renda bruta.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"A calculadora aplica deduções padrão 2026, as cinco faixas progressivas de impostos e contribuições para o seguro nacional. O modo de pensão inclui o crédito fiscal de pensão apenas para um ano inteiro, 100% de pensão de velhice qualificada ou AFP elegível. Ele roda inteiramente neste navegador.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Para um salário de NOK 600,000, compare o imposto anual estimado e o pagamento líquido com outro salário ou valor de pensão anual.","Tax year":"Ano fiscal","Scenario":"Cenário","Salary":"Salário","Full-year old-age pension":"Pensão de velhice de um ano inteiro","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Rendimento anual bruto (NOK)","Tax zone":"Zona fiscal","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Taxa padrão (a maior parte da Noruega)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / municípios listados na zona de medidas","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"A estimativa de pensão pressupõe uma pensão de velhice elegível ou AFP em 100% para todos os meses 12, sem outros rendimentos.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"A estimativa salarial pressupõe residência fiscal normal na Noruega, idade 17 – 69 e nenhuma outra renda.","Compare two scenarios":"Compare dois cenários","Scenario 1":"Cenário 1","Scenario 2":"Cenário 2","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimativa","Estimated tax per year":"Imposto estimado por ano","Average tax per month":"Imposto médio por mês","Estimated net per year":"Líquido estimado por ano","Average net per month":"Média líquida por mês","Tax on ordinary income":"Imposto sobre o rendimento ordinário","Bracket tax":"Imposto de suporte","National insurance contribution":"Contribuição para o seguro nacional","Pension tax credit":"Crédito fiscal de pensão","Estimated effective rate":"Taxa efetiva estimada","Standard deduction base":"Base de dedução padrão","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Taxas e limites são para o ano de renda 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Apenas estimativa, não um cálculo de imposto oficial ou cartão de imposto. Outros rendimentos, deduções, idade, residência, nível de pensão e circunstâncias pessoais podem alterar o resultado.","Reset values":"Redefinir valores","Example":"Exemplo","How the estimate works":"Como funciona a estimativa","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Esta é exatamente minha fatura de imposto ou retenção de cartão de imposto?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Não. Ele estima o imposto anual padrão 2026. Um cartão de imposto, avaliação final e retenção na fonte podem diferir devido ao seu rendimento total, deduções e circunstâncias.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Posso combinar salário e pensão aqui?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Esta versão estima um tipo de renda por vez. Não calcula um caso misto de salário e pensão.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"O modo de pensão cobre todas as pensões?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Não. O crédito de pensão é modelado apenas para uma pensão de velhice qualificada ou AFP elegível tomada a 100% ao longo do ano. As pensões de ano parcial ou escalonadas e outros tipos de pensões estão fora do âmbito.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Qual é a opção de zona de medidas?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Aplica-se a taxa de renda ordinária 18.5% publicada e a dedução especial NOK 45,000 para Finnmark e os municípios listados. Confirme se o seu município se qualifica.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Calculadora de imposto sobre riqueza da Noruega","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Calculadora de imposto sobre riqueza da Noruega 2026 - estimativa gratuita","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Estimativa 2026 imposto sobre a riqueza norueguês de casas, ações, ativos comerciais, dinheiro e dívidas. Veja a divisão estadual e municipal, descontos de avaliação e faixa de sensibilidade de valor.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Estimativa do imposto sobre a fortuna pessoal norueguês para 2026. Insira valores de mercado estimados para residências e bases fiscais pré-descontadas para ações e ativos comerciais. Consulte descontos de avaliação, ajuste de dívida e estimativas estaduais e municipais separadas.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"A estimativa aplica regras de avaliação 2026 e a taxa municipal máxima, a menos que você insira uma taxa mais baixa. A dívida é alocada pelos valores totais dos ativos antes dos descontos; a dívida atribuída a ações ou ativos comerciais com desconto é reduzida pelo mesmo desconto. Avaliações de propriedades, elegibilidade e fatos fiscais pessoais podem alterar o resultado oficial.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Uma casa principal com um valor de mercado de NOK 10 milhões tem um valor patrimonial estimado de NOK 2.5 milhões de acordo com a regra da casa principal 2026, antes da dívida e do subsídio pessoal.","2026 tax year":"2026 ano fiscal","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Valor de mercado estimado da casa principal (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Valor de mercado estimado de casas secundárias (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Ações e fundos de ações antes do desconto (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Ativos comerciais elegíveis antes do desconto (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Depósitos bancários e outros ativos (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Dívida total (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Somos tributados conjuntamente pela riqueza","Municipal rate (%)":"Taxa municipal (%)","Home-value comparison":"Comparação de valor inicial","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Estimativa do imposto sobre a riqueza","Export CSV":"Exportar CSV","Print estimate":"Imprimir estimativa","Assets before discounts":"Ativos antes dos descontos","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Valor patrimonial tributável após descontos","Debt reduction from discounts":"Redução de dívidas com descontos","Deductible debt estimate":"Estimativa de dívida dedutível","Estimated net wealth":"Riqueza líquida estimada","Personal allowance":"Subsídio pessoal","Taxable net wealth":"Patrimônio líquido tributável","Municipal wealth tax":"Imposto municipal sobre riqueza","State wealth tax":"Imposto estadual sobre riqueza","State tax, first band":"Imposto estadual, primeira faixa","State tax, upper band":"Imposto estadual, faixa superior","Estimated total wealth tax":"Imposto sobre a fortuna total estimado","Lower home-value estimate":"Estimativa de valor residencial mais baixa","Current-value estimate":"Estimativa do valor atual","Higher home-value estimate":"Estimativa de valor residencial mais alta","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 regras e suposições","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Apenas estimativa. Esta não é uma avaliação fiscal oficial ou aconselhamento fiscal. Use os valores de sua declaração de imposto quando disponíveis; taxas, elegibilidade, alocação de dívidas e valores de propriedade podem diferir no seu caso.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Casas: insira o valor de mercado estimado no final do ano. Ações e ativos comerciais elegíveis: insira o valor antes do desconto 2026, e não o valor de mercado, a menos que essa seja a base tributária correta.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"O subsídio e o limite máximo estadual dobram apenas para cônjuges, parceiros registrados ou coabitantes qualificados avaliados em conjunto por sua riqueza combinada.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"O cálculo municipal utiliza a alíquota selecionada, padronizando o máximo de 2026 de 0.35%. Alguns municípios podem usar uma taxa mais baixa.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"A sensibilidade altera apenas os valores inseridos das residências primárias e secundárias. É uma comparação, não uma previsão de uma avaliação oficial.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"O que é o subsídio de imposto sobre a riqueza 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"O limite padrão é NOK 1.9 milhões para uma pessoa e NOK 3.8 milhões para cônjuges ou parceiros qualificados avaliados em conjunto.","How is my primary home valued?":"Como é avaliada a minha casa principal?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Para 2026, o valor patrimonial estimado é 25% do valor de mercado até NOK 14 milhões, mais 70% do valor acima de NOK 14 milhões.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Aplica-se desconto a uma habitação secundária?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Não. A tabela 2026 oferece às residências secundárias um desconto de avaliação de 0%. Utiliza o valor de mercado inserido como estimativa; os valores oficiais avaliados podem diferir.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Por que a dívida dedutível muda quando possuo ações ou ativos comerciais?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"As regras norueguesas alocam a dívida proporcionalmente pelos valores totais dos ativos. A parcela atribuída aos ativos com descontos de avaliação é reduzida pela mesma taxa de desconto.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"A alíquota municipal é sempre 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Não. 0.35% é o máximo 2026 usado por padrão. Um município pode definir uma taxa mais baixa, que você pode inserir.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"A calculadora cobre todos os ativos ou casos fiscais?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Não. Ele estima casas, ações, ativos comerciais elegíveis selecionados, dinheiro e dívida total. Ativos estrangeiros, pensões, propriedade complexa, isenções e outras regras especiais podem alterar a sua avaliação.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Gerador de notas QR suíças","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Gerador de faturas QR suíças — Criador de faturas QR gratuito","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Crie e verifique uma fatura QR suíça localmente. Validar referências IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR e SCOR; imprimir a parte de pagamento e o recibo A6 sem carregar os dados da fatura.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Crie um comprovante de pagamento suíço com um QR Code suíço. Os detalhes da sua fatura permanecem neste navegador; nenhum pagamento é iniciado e nenhum registro bancário é consultado.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"A ferramenta constrói os dados do SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) e verifica seus campos, combinação conta/referência, dígitos de verificação do IBAN e caracteres suportados. Ele formata a parte de pagamento e o recibo para impressão no tamanho físico exigido.\nExemplo","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX: um QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, uma referência QRR de dígitos 27 e endereços estruturados de credor/devedor.","How it works":"Como funciona","Frequently asked questions":"Perguntas frequentes","Limits and accuracy":"Limites e precisão","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Esta é uma ferramenta de documento local, não um serviço bancário ou certificação. Não pode confirmar quem possui um IBAN, se uma conta está aberta ou se um pagamento será aceite. Imprima em 100% / Tamanho real e meça a linha de verificação 100 mm antes de usar uma ordem de pagamento em papel.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN do credor ou QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"A pagar ao · credor","Account holder / creditor name":"Nome do titular da conta/credor","Street or P.O. box":"Rua ou posto postal caixa","Building number":"Número do prédio","Postal code":"Código postal","Town / city":"Cidade","2-letter country code":"2 código do país com letras","Amount (optional)":"Quantidade (opcional)","Currency":"Moeda","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"A pagar por · devedor opcional","Debtor name":"Nome do devedor","Reference type":"Tipo de referência","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Referência QR · Somente QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Referência do credor · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Sem referência estruturada · IBAN","Reference":"Referência","Unstructured message":"Mensagem não estruturada","Billing information (optional)":"Informações de cobrança (opcional)","Create QR-bill":"Criar fatura QR","Load SIX sample":"Carregar SEIS amostras","Clear form":"Limpar formulário","Check QR payload":"Verificar carga útil do QR","Download payment data":"Baixar dados de pagamento","Download QR SVG":"Baixar QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Imprimir/salvar como PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Ler uma imagem de código QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Escolha PNG ou JPEG","Read image locally":"Ler a imagem localmente","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Colar dados de pagamento do código QR suíço","Invoice details":"Detalhes da fatura","QR-bill preview":"Visualização da fatura QR","Receipt":"Recibo","Payment part":"Parte de pagamento","Payable to":"Pagável a","Payable by":"Pagável por","Account":"Conta","Additional information":"Informações adicionais","Currency / amount":"Moeda/valor","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Verificação da escala de impressão · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Padrão suíço de fatura QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"Nota QR pronta. Os detalhes permaneceram neste dispositivo.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Alguns campos precisam ser verificados. Revise as informações destacadas.","Reading this image on your device…":"Lendo esta imagem no seu dispositivo…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"QR Code suíço lido e verificado localmente.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Nenhum código QR legível foi encontrado nessa imagem.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Os dados do QR Code suíço são válidos para os campos suportados.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Os dados não são uma carga útil de pagamento válida do código QR suíço.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formulário e visualização limpos.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SEIS amostras carregadas. Substitua os detalhes da amostra antes do uso real.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Crie ou leia uma fatura QR válida primeiro.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Escolha um PNG ou JPEG de 10 MiB ou menos.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"O leitor QR local não pôde ser carregado. Você pode colar os dados de pagamento.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Quais combinações de IBAN e referências são permitidas?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Um QR-IBAN usa uma referência QRR. Um IBAN suíço normal usa SCOR ou nenhuma referência estruturada (NON). QRR é apenas para faturas em CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Isso verifica se a conta existe ou pertence ao credor?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Não. Ele verifica apenas o formato e a soma de verificação do IBAN. Ele não entra em contato com um banco ou registro de conta.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Posso imprimir em qualquer escala?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Para uma ordem de pagamento em papel, imprima em 100% / Tamanho real. A parte de pagamento deverá ser paisagem A6 (148 × 105 mm); verifique a linha 100 mm com uma régua.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"A ferramenta envia dados de fatura para qualquer lugar?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Não. A geração e a leitura das imagens acontecem no seu navegador. Nenhuma conta ou serviço de pagamento é usado.","Grade Scale Generator":"Gerador de escala de classificação","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Gerador de escala de notas - ferramenta gratuita de pontuação por nota","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Transforme pontos em porcentagens e notas com seus próprios limites. Visualize a escala completa, copie ou exporte e imprima uma folha de classificação.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Crie uma escala de notas transparente para um exame ou tarefa. Definir a pontuação máxima e o percentual mínimo para cada nota; a escala não pressupõe uma regra de classificação escolar ou nacional.","Points earned":"Pontos ganhos","Maximum points":"Máximo de pontos","Top grade label":"Etiqueta de qualidade superior","Top grade starts at (%)":"A nota máxima começa em (%)","Middle grade label":"Etiqueta de grau médio","Middle grade starts at (%)":"A série intermediária começa em (%)","Lowest grade label":"Etiqueta de grau mais baixo","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"A nota mais baixa começa em (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Com um máximo de pontos 50, os pontos 45 são iguais a 90%. Seus limites personalizados decidem o rótulo da nota.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Isso usa uma política de classificação oficial?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Não. Você define os limites. Os sistemas de classificação variam consoante a escola, o curso e o país; confirme a escala que você deve usar.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Posso exportar as faixas de classificação?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Sim. Exporte as bandas exibidas como um arquivo CSV ou imprima a escala."},"ru":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Калькулятор отпускных в Норвегии","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Калькулятор отпускных в Норвегии — бесплатная валовая оценка","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Оцените норвежские отпускные на основе отпускных. Сравните общие ставки стандартного отпуска, пятой недели и сотрудников в возрасте 60 и старше.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Введите Feriepengegrunnlag, указанный в вашей расчетной ведомости. Сравните общие норвежские валовые ставки отпускных для вашего возраста и согласованной продолжительности отпуска.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Оплата отпускных (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Мне 60 или больше в праздничный год","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Мое соглашение включает пятую праздничную неделю","Estimated holiday pay":"Ориентировочная отпускная заработная плата","Rate used":"Использованная скорость","Basis used":"Используемая основа","Reset choices":"Сбросить выбор","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Только приблизительная оценка. Отпускные являются налогооблагаемым доходом; удержание налога может варьироваться в зависимости от человека и заработной платы.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"При базе NOK 500,000 10.2% дает NOK 51,000 до каких-либо корректировок заработной платы.","Which rate should I use?":"Какой тариф мне использовать?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"В оценке используются общие минимальные ставки: 10.2% или 12% с пятой неделей; 12.5% или 14.3% для сотрудников в возрасте 60 и старше. Ваше согласие может дать больше.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Это сумма, выплаченная после уплаты налогов?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Нет. Это приблизительная оценка. Отпускные являются налогооблагаемым доходом; удержание зависит от ваших обстоятельств и заработной платы.","What belongs in the basis?":"Что входит в базу?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Используйте Feriepengegrunnlag в своей расчетной ведомости или годовом отчете. Некоторые возмещения и другие выплаты исключены правилами.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Калькулятор подоходного налога для Норвегии","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Налоговый калькулятор для Норвегии 2026 — бесплатный расчет зарплат и пенсий","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Оцените 2026 Норвежский подоходный налог на стандартную зарплату или пенсию по старости за полный год. Посмотрите годовую и ежемесячную чистую заработную плату, налоговые компоненты и сравните два сценария.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Оцените 2026 Норвежский подоходный налог для стандартной зарплаты резидента или годовой пенсии по старости. Посмотрите основные налоговые компоненты и сравните два сценария валового дохода.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Калькулятор применяет стандартные вычеты 2026, пять групп прогрессивных налогов и взносы национального страхования. Пенсионный режим включает пенсионный налоговый кредит только за полный год, 100% соответствующей пенсии по старости или отвечающего критериям AFP. Он полностью работает в этом браузере.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Для зарплаты в размере NOK 600,000 сравните расчетный годовой налог и чистую заработную плату с другой зарплатой или суммой годовой пенсии.","Tax year":"Налоговый год","Scenario":"Сценарий","Salary":"Заработная плата","Full-year old-age pension":"Полнолетняя пенсия по старости","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Валовой годовой доход (NOK)","Tax zone":"Налоговая зона","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Стандартная ставка (большая часть Норвегии)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Финнмарк / перечисленные муниципалитеты зон мер","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Расчет пенсии предполагает наличие права на пенсию по старости или AFP в размере 100% за все 12 месяцев без каких-либо других доходов.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"При расчете зарплаты предполагается обычное норвежское налоговое резидентство, возраст 17–69 и отсутствие другого дохода.","Compare two scenarios":"Сравните два сценария","Scenario 1":"Сценарий 1","Scenario 2":"Сценарий 2","Calculate estimate":"Рассчитать смету","Estimated tax per year":"Расчетный налог в год","Average tax per month":"Средний налог в месяц","Estimated net per year":"Оценочная чистая прибыль в год","Average net per month":"Средняя чистая сумма в месяц","Tax on ordinary income":"Налог на обычный доход","Bracket tax":"Налог на кронштейн","National insurance contribution":"Вклад национального страхования","Pension tax credit":"Пенсионный налоговый кредит","Estimated effective rate":"Оценочная эффективная ставка","Standard deduction base":"Стандартная база вычета","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Ставки и пороговые значения указаны для доходного года 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Только оценка, а не официальный расчет налога или налоговая карточка. Другие доходы, вычеты, возраст, место жительства, пенсионный уровень и личные обстоятельства могут изменить результат.","Reset values":"Сбросить значения","Example":"Пример","How the estimate works":"Как работает смета","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Это мой точный налоговый счет или удержание по налоговой карте?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Нет. Он рассчитывает стандартный годовой налог 2026. Налоговая карта, окончательная оценка и удержание налогов могут различаться в зависимости от вашего полного дохода, вычетов и обстоятельств.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Можно ли здесь совместить зарплату и пенсию?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Эта версия оценивает один тип дохода за раз. Он не рассчитывает смешанный случай заработной платы и пенсии.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Пенсионный режим распространяется на все пенсии?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Нет. Пенсионный кредит моделируется только для соответствующей пенсии по старости или правомочного AFP, полученного в размере 100% в течение года. Неполная годовая или ступенчатая пенсия и другие виды пенсий выходят за рамки рассмотрения.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Что такое опция зоны измерения?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Применяется опубликованная ставка обычного дохода 18.5% и специальный вычет NOK 45,000 для Финнмарка и перечисленных муниципалитетов. Подтвердите, что ваш муниципалитет соответствует критериям.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Калькулятор налога на богатство в Норвегии","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Калькулятор налога на богатство в Норвегии 2026 — бесплатная оценка","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Оценить 2026 Норвежский налог на богатство с домов, акций, бизнес-активов, денежных средств и долгов. См. распределение по штатам и муниципалитетам, скидки при оценке и диапазон чувствительности стоимости.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Оцените личный норвежский налог на богатство для 2026. Введите расчетную рыночную стоимость домов и налоговую базу до дисконтирования для акций и бизнес-активов. См. скидки при оценке, корректировку долга и отдельные государственные и муниципальные оценки.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"При оценке применяются правила оценки 2026 и максимальная муниципальная ставка, если вы не укажете более низкую ставку. Задолженность распределяется по полной стоимости активов до учета скидок; долг, отнесенный к дисконтированным акциям или бизнес-активам, уменьшается на такую ​​же скидку. Оценки недвижимости, право на участие и факты личного налогообложения могут изменить официальный результат.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Основной дом с рыночной стоимостью 10 миллионов норвежских крон имеет оценочную стоимость богатства в размере 2.5 миллионов норвежских крон в соответствии с правилом 2026 для основного дома, без учета долгов и личных пособий.","2026 tax year":"2026 налоговый год","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Оценочная рыночная стоимость основного дома (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Оценочная рыночная стоимость вторичного жилья (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Акции и паевые фонды до скидки (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Приемлемые бизнес-активы до скидки (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Банковские депозиты и другие активы (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Общий долг (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Мы платим общий налог на богатство","Municipal rate (%)":"Муниципальная ставка (%)","Home-value comparison":"Сравнение стоимости дома","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Оценить налог на богатство","Export CSV":"Экспорт в CSV","Print estimate":"Распечатать смету","Assets before discounts":"Активы до учета скидок","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Стоимость налогооблагаемого актива после скидок","Debt reduction from discounts":"Уменьшение долга за счет скидок","Deductible debt estimate":"Оценка вычитаемого долга","Estimated net wealth":"Оценочный чистый капитал","Personal allowance":"Личное пособие","Taxable net wealth":"Налогооблагаемое чистое богатство","Municipal wealth tax":"Муниципальный налог на имущество","State wealth tax":"Государственный налог на богатство","State tax, first band":"Государственный налог, первый диапазон","State tax, upper band":"Государственный налог, верхний диапазон","Estimated total wealth tax":"Оценочная общая сумма налога на имущество","Lower home-value estimate":"Нижняя оценка стоимости дома","Current-value estimate":"Оценка текущей стоимости","Higher home-value estimate":"Увеличенная оценка стоимости дома","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 правила и предположения","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Только оценка. Это не официальная налоговая оценка или налоговая консультация. Используйте значения налоговой декларации, где это возможно; ставки, право на участие, распределение долга и стоимость имущества могут отличаться в вашем случае.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Дома: введите ориентировочную рыночную стоимость на конец года. Акции и соответствующие бизнес-активы: введите стоимость до скидки 2026, а не рыночную стоимость, если только она не является правильной налоговой базой.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Пособие и верхний порог штата удваиваются только для супругов, зарегистрированных партнеров или отвечающих критериям сожителей, оцениваемых совместно в соответствии с их совокупным богатством.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"В муниципальном расчете используется выбранная ставка, по умолчанию максимальная 2026 равна 0.35%. Некоторые муниципалитеты могут использовать более низкую ставку.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Чувствительность изменяет только введенные значения основного и вторичного домов. Это сравнение, а не прогноз официальной оценки.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Что такое льгота по налогу на богатство 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Стандартный порог составляет 1.9 миллионов норвежских крон для одного человека и 3.8 миллионов норвежских крон для супругов или отвечающих критериям партнеров, оцениваемых совместно.","How is my primary home valued?":"Как оценивается мой основной дом?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Для 2026 оценочная стоимость имущества составляет 25% от рыночной стоимости до 14 миллионов норвежских крон плюс 70% от суммы, превышающей 14 миллионов норвежских крон.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Применяется ли это скидка на вторичный дом?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Нет. Таблица 2026 дает вторичному дому скидку на оценку 0%. В качестве оценки используется введенная рыночная стоимость; Официальная оценочная стоимость может отличаться.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Почему вычитаемая задолженность меняется, если я владею акциями или бизнес-активами?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Норвежские правила распределяют долг пропорционально полной стоимости активов. Доля, отнесенная к активам с оценочными дисконтами, уменьшается на ту же ставку дисконтирования.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Всегда ли муниципальная ставка составляет 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Нет. 0.35% — это максимум 2026, используемый по умолчанию. Муниципалитет может установить более низкую ставку, которую вы можете ввести.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Калькулятор охватывает все активы и налоговые случаи?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Нет. Он оценивает дома, акции, выбранные подходящие бизнес-активы, денежные средства и общий долг. Иностранные активы, пенсии, комплексная собственность, льготы и другие специальные правила могут изменить вашу оценку.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Швейцарский генератор QR-счетов","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Швейцарский генератор QR-счетов — бесплатный генератор QR-счетов","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Создайте и проверьте швейцарский QR-счет локально. Подтвердить ссылки IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR и SCOR; распечатайте платежную часть A6 и квитанцию, не загружая данные счета.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Создайте платежную квитанцию ​​для Швейцарии со швейцарским QR-кодом. Данные вашего счета останутся в этом браузере; платеж не инициируется и банковский регистр не запрашивается.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Инструмент создает данные SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) и проверяет его поля, комбинацию учетной записи и ссылки, контрольные цифры IBAN и поддерживаемые символы. Он форматирует платежную часть и квитанцию ​​для печати в требуемом физическом размере.\nПример","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27-цифровая ссылка QRR и структурированные адреса кредитора/должника.","How it works":"Как это работает","Frequently asked questions":"Часто задаваемые вопросы","Limits and accuracy":"Пределы и точность","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Это локальный инструмент для работы с документами, а не банковская служба или сертификация. Он не может подтвердить, кому принадлежит IBAN, открыт ли счет и будет ли принят платеж. Распечатайте в размере 100% / Фактический размер и измерьте контрольную линию 100 мм перед использованием бумажного платежного поручения.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN кредитора или QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"К оплате · кредитору","Account holder / creditor name":"Владелец счета/имя кредитора","Street or P.O. box":"Улица или п.о. коробка","Building number":"Номер здания","Postal code":"Почтовый индекс","Town / city":"Город / город","2-letter country code":"2-буквенный код страны","Amount (optional)":"Сумма (необязательно)","Currency":"Валюта","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"ЕВРО","Payable by · optional debtor":"Оплачивается · необязательным дебитором","Debtor name":"Имя должника","Reference type":"Справочный тип","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR-ссылка · Только QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Справочник кредитора · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Без структурированной ссылки · IBAN","Reference":"Справочный материал","Unstructured message":"Неструктурированное сообщение","Billing information (optional)":"Платежные данные (необязательно)","Create QR-bill":"Создать QR-счет","Load SIX sample":"Загрузить ШЕСТЬ образцов","Clear form":"Прозрачная форма","Check QR payload":"Проверьте полезную нагрузку QR","Download payment data":"Загрузить платежные данные","Download QR SVG":"Загрузить QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Распечатать/сохранить в формате PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Читать изображение QR-кода","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Выберите PNG или JPEG.","Read image locally":"Читать изображение локально","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Вставьте платежные данные швейцарского QR-кода","Invoice details":"Детали счета","QR-bill preview":"Предварительный просмотр QR-счета","Receipt":"Квитанция","Payment part":"Оплата","Payable to":"Оплачивается","Payable by":"Оплачивает","Account":"Аккаунт","Additional information":"Дополнительная информация","Currency / amount":"Валюта/сумма","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Проверка масштаба печати · 100 мм","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Швейцарский стандарт QR-счета","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-счет готов. Детали остались на этом устройстве.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Некоторые поля требуют проверки. Ознакомьтесь с выделенной информацией.","Reading this image on your device…":"Чтение этого изображения на вашем устройстве…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Швейцарский QR-код считывается и проверяется локально.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"На этом изображении не найден читаемый QR-код.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Данные швейцарского QR-кода действительны для поддерживаемых полей.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Данные не являются действительными платежными данными швейцарского QR-кода.","Form and preview cleared.":"Форма и предварительный просмотр очищены.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ШЕСТЬ образцов загружены. Замените детали образца перед реальным использованием.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Сначала создайте или прочитайте действительный QR-счет.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Выберите PNG или JPEG размером 10 MiB или меньше.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Не удалось загрузить локальный QR-ридер. Вместо этого вы можете вставить платежные данные.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Какие комбинации IBAN и номера кода разрешены?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"QR-IBAN использует ссылку QRR. Обычный швейцарский IBAN использует SCOR или неструктурированную ссылку (NON). QRR предназначен только для счетов в швейцарских франках.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Проверяется ли это, что учетная запись существует или принадлежит кредитору?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Нет. Он проверяет только формат и контрольную сумму IBAN. Он не связывается с банком или реестром счетов.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Могу ли я распечатать это в любом масштабе?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Для бумажного платежного поручения распечатайте его в размере 100% / Фактический размер. Платежная часть должна быть горизонтальной A6 (148 × 105 мм); проверьте линию 100 мм с помощью линейки.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Отправляет ли инструмент куда-нибудь данные счета?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Нет. Генерация и чтение изображений происходят в вашем браузере. Никакой аккаунт или платежный сервис не используется.","Grade Scale Generator":"Генератор шкалы оценок","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Генератор шкалы оценок — бесплатный инструмент для оценки баллов","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Превратите баллы в проценты и оценки с помощью собственных пороговых значений. Просмотрите полный масштаб, скопируйте или экспортируйте его и распечатайте оценочный лист.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Создайте прозрачную шкалу оценок за экзамен или задание. Установите максимальное количество баллов и минимальный процент для каждой оценки; шкала не предполагает школьных или национальных правил выставления оценок.","Points earned":"Заработанные баллы","Maximum points":"Максимальное количество баллов","Top grade label":"Этикетка высшего качества","Top grade starts at (%)":"Высший класс начинается с (%)","Middle grade label":"Этикетка среднего класса","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Средний класс начинается с (%)","Lowest grade label":"Этикетка самого низкого класса","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Самая низкая оценка начинается с (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"При максимальном количестве баллов 50 количество баллов 45 равно 90%. Ваши пользовательские пороговые значения определяют метку оценки.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Используется ли здесь официальная политика выставления оценок?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Нет. Вы устанавливаете пороги. Системы оценок различаются в зависимости от школы, курса и страны; подтвердите масштаб, который вы собираетесь использовать.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Могу ли я экспортировать полосы профилирования?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Да. Экспортируйте отображаемые полосы в файл CSV или распечатайте шкалу."},"sv":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Norge Holiday Pay Calculator","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Norge Holiday Pay Calculator — Gratis bruttouppskattning","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Uppskatta norsk semesterlön utifrån din semesterlönebas. Jämför vanliga priser för standardledighet, en femte vecka och anställda i åldern 60 eller äldre.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Ange feriepengegrunnlag som visas på din lönebesked. Jämför vanliga norska bruttosemesteravgifter för din ålder och avtalad semesterlängd.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Semesterlön (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Jag är 60 eller äldre under semesteråret","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Mitt avtal inkluderar en femte semestervecka","Estimated holiday pay":"Beräknad semesterersättning","Rate used":"Använt pris","Basis used":"Använd bas","Reset choices":"Återställ val","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Endast bruttouppskattning. Semesterlön är skattepliktig inkomst; skatteinnehållning kan variera beroende på person och lönesumma.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Med en NOK 500,000-basis ger 10.2% NOK 51,000 före eventuella lönejusteringar.","Which rate should I use?":"Vilken kurs ska jag använda?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Uppskattningen använder vanliga minimisatser: 10.2% eller 12% med en femte vecka; 12.5% eller 14.3% för anställda i åldern 60 eller äldre. Ditt avtal kan ge mer.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Är detta beloppet som betalas efter skatt?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Nr. Detta är en grov uppskattning. Semesterlön är skattepliktig inkomst; Innehåll beror på dina omständigheter och löner.","What belongs in the basis?":"Vad hör hemma i underlaget?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Använd feriepengegrunnlag på din lönebesked eller årsredovisning. Vissa återbetalningar och andra betalningar är uteslutna av reglerna.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Norge inkomstskattekalkylator","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Norge skattekalkylator 2026 — Gratis lön och pensionsuppskattning","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Uppskatta 2026 Norsk inkomstskatt på standardlön eller helårspension. Se årliga och månatliga nettolöner, skattekomponenter och jämför två scenarier.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Uppskatta 2026 norsk inkomstskatt för en vanlig inhemsk lön eller en helårspension. Se de viktigaste skattekomponenterna och jämför två bruttoinkomstscenarier.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Kalkylatorn tillämpar 2026 standardavdrag, de fem progressiva skatteintervallen och socialförsäkringsavgifter. Pensionsläget inkluderar pensionsskatteavdraget endast för ett helt år, 100 % kvalificerande ålderspension eller kvalificerad AFP. Det körs helt i den här webbläsaren.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"För en lön på NOK 600,000, jämför den beräknade årliga skatten och nettolönen med en annan lön eller ett helårspensionsbelopp.","Tax year":"Taxeringsår","Scenario":"Scenario","Salary":"Lön","Full-year old-age pension":"Fullårig ålderspension","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Årlig bruttoinkomst (NOK)","Tax zone":"Skattezon","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Standardpris (större delen av Norge)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / listade åtgärdszonskommuner","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Pensionsuppskattning förutsätter kvalificerad ålderspension eller AFP på 100 % för alla 12 månader, utan annan inkomst.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Löneuppskattning förutsätter vanligt norskt skattehemvist, ålder 17–69 och ingen annan inkomst.","Compare two scenarios":"Jämför två scenarier","Scenario 1":"Alternativ 1","Scenario 2":"Alternativ 2","Calculate estimate":"Beräkna uppskattning","Estimated tax per year":"Uppskattad skatt per år","Average tax per month":"Genomsnittlig skatt per månad","Estimated net per year":"Uppskattat netto per år","Average net per month":"Genomsnittligt netto per månad","Tax on ordinary income":"Skatt på vanlig inkomst","Bracket tax":"Konsolskatt","National insurance contribution":"Folkförsäkringsavgift","Pension tax credit":"Pensionsskatteavdrag","Estimated effective rate":"Uppskattad effektiv ränta","Standard deduction base":"Standard avdragsbas","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Taxor och trösklar gäller för inkomståret 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Endast uppskattning, inte en officiell skatteberäkning eller skattekort. Övriga inkomster, avdrag, ålder, bosättning, pensionsbetyg och personliga förhållanden kan förändra resultatet.","Reset values":"Återställ värden","Example":"Exempel","How the estimate works":"Hur uppskattningen fungerar","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Är detta min exakta skattesedel eller skattekortsinnehållning?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Nr. Den uppskattar standard 2026 årlig skatt. Skattekort, sluttaxering och innehållande kan skilja sig på grund av din fulla inkomst, avdrag och omständigheter.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Kan jag kombinera lön och pension här?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Denna version uppskattar en inkomsttyp åt gången. Den beräknar inte ett blandat löne- och pensionsfall.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Täcker pensionsläget alla pensioner?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Nr. Pensionskrediten är endast modellerad för en kvalificerande ålderspension eller berättigad AFP som tas till 100 % under hela året. Delårs- eller graderad pension och andra pensionsformer faller utanför tillämpningsområdet.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Vad är alternativet åtgärdszon?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Den tillämpar den publicerade 18.5% ordinarie inkomstsatsen och NOK 45,000 särskilt avdrag för Finnmark och de listade kommunerna. Bekräfta att din kommun är kvalificerad.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Norges förmögenhetsskattekalkylator","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Norge förmögenhetsskatteberäknare 2026 — Gratis uppskattning","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Uppskatta 2026 Norsk förmögenhetsskatt från bostäder, aktier, affärstillgångar, kontanter och skulder. Se den statliga och kommunala uppdelningen, värderingsrabatter och ett värdekänslighetsintervall.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Uppskatta personlig norsk förmögenhetsskatt för 2026. Ange uppskattade marknadsvärden för bostäder och skattebaser före rabatt för aktier och affärstillgångar. Se värderingsrabatter, skuldjustering och separata statliga och kommunala uppskattningar.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Uppskattningen tillämpar 2026 värderingsregler och den högsta kommunala taxan om du inte anger en lägre taxa. Skulden allokeras med fullt tillgångsvärde före rabatter; skulder som hänförs till diskonterade aktier eller rörelsetillgångar minskas med samma rabatt. Fastighetsvärderingar, behörighet och personlig skattefakta kan ändra det officiella resultatet.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"En primär bostad med ett marknadsvärde på NOK 10 miljoner NOK har ett uppskattat förmögenhetsvärde på NOK 2.5 miljoner NOK enligt 2026 primära hemregeln, före skuld och personligt avdrag.","2026 tax year":"2026 skatteår","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Primärt hem uppskattat marknadsvärde (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Sekundära bostäder uppskattat marknadsvärde (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Aktier och aktiefonder före rabatt (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Kvalificerade företagstillgångar före rabatt (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Bankinlåning och andra tillgångar (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Total skuld (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Vi sambeskattas för förmögenhet","Municipal rate (%)":"Kommunal taxa (%)","Home-value comparison":"Jämförelse av hem-värde","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Uppskatta förmögenhetsskatt","Export CSV":"Exportera CSV","Print estimate":"Skriv ut uppskattning","Assets before discounts":"Tillgångar före rabatter","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Beskattningsbart förmögenhetsvärde efter rabatter","Debt reduction from discounts":"Skulderminskning från rabatter","Deductible debt estimate":"Uppskattning av avdragsgill skuld","Estimated net wealth":"Uppskattad nettoförmögenhet","Personal allowance":"Personbidrag","Taxable net wealth":"Skattepliktig nettoförmögenhet","Municipal wealth tax":"Kommunal förmögenhetsskatt","State wealth tax":"Statlig förmögenhetsskatt","State tax, first band":"Statlig skatt, första bandet","State tax, upper band":"Statsskatt, övre bandet","Estimated total wealth tax":"Uppskattad total förmögenhetsskatt","Lower home-value estimate":"Lägre uppskattning av bostadsvärde","Current-value estimate":"Uppskattning av aktuellt värde","Higher home-value estimate":"Högre uppskattning av bostadsvärde","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 regler och antaganden","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Endast uppskattning. Detta är inte en officiell skattetaxering eller skatterådgivning. Använd dina skattedeklarationsvärden där sådana finns; priser, berättigande, skuldfördelning och fastighetsvärden kan skilja sig åt i ditt fall.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Hem: ange uppskattat marknadsvärde vid årets slut. Aktier och kvalificerade affärstillgångar: ange värdet före rabatten 2026, inte marknadsvärdet om det inte är den korrekta skattegrunden.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Personen och statens övre tröskel fördubblas endast för makar, registrerade partners eller kvalificerade sambor som bedöms gemensamt för sin sammanlagda förmögenhet.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Den kommunala beräkningen använder den valda taxan, som standard till 2026 maximalt 0.35%. Vissa kommuner kan använda en lägre taxa.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Känslighet ändrar endast de angivna värdena för primära och sekundära hem. Det är en jämförelse, inte en förutsägelse av en officiell värdering.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Vad är 2026 förmögenhetsskatteavdrag?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Standardtröskeln är NOK 1.9 miljoner NOK för en person och NOK 3.8 miljoner NOK för makar eller kvalificerade partner som bedöms gemensamt.","How is my primary home valued?":"Hur värderas mitt primära hem?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"För 2026 är det uppskattade förmögenhetsvärdet 25% av marknadsvärdet upp till NOK 14 miljoner, plus 70% av beloppet över NOK 14 miljoner NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Gäller detta rabatt på ett fritidshus?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Nr. 2026-tabellen ger sekundära hem en 0 % värderingsrabatt. Den använder det inmatade marknadsvärdet som uppskattning; officiella taxeringsvärden kan skilja sig åt.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Varför förändras avdragsgill skuld när jag äger aktier eller företagstillgångar?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Norska regler fördelar skulden proportionellt efter fulla tillgångsvärden. Den del som hänförs till tillgångar med värderingsrabatter reduceras med samma diskonteringsränta.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Är den kommunala taxan alltid 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Nr. 0.35% är det maximala 2026 som används som standard. En kommun kan sätta en lägre taxa, som du kan ange.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Täcker kalkylatorn alla tillgångar eller skattefall?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Nr. Den uppskattar bostäder, aktier, utvalda kvalificerade affärstillgångar, kontanter och totala skulder. Utländska tillgångar, pensioner, komplext ägande, undantag och andra särskilda regler kan ändra din bedömning.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Schweizisk QR-billgenerator","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Schweizisk QR-fakturagenerator — Gratis QR-fakturor","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Skapa och kontrollera en schweizisk QR-faktura lokalt. Validera IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR och SCOR referenser; skriv ut A6 betalningsdel och kvitto utan att ladda upp fakturadata.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Skapa en schweizisk betalningskort med en schweizisk QR-kod. Dina fakturauppgifter stannar i den här webbläsaren; ingen betalning initieras och inget bankregister efterfrågas.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Verktyget bygger SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC)-data och kontrollerar dess fält, konto-/referenskombination, IBAN-kontrollsiffror och tecken som stöds. Den formaterar betalningsdelen och kvittot för utskrift i önskad fysisk storlek.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX exempel: ett QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, en 27-siffrig QRR-referens och strukturerade borgenärs-/gäldenärsadresser.","How it works":"Så fungerar det","Frequently asked questions":"Vanliga frågor","Limits and accuracy":"Begränsningar och noggrannhet","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Detta är ett lokalt dokumentverktyg, inte en banktjänst eller certifiering. Den kan inte bekräfta vem som äger ett IBAN, om ett konto är öppet eller om en betalning kommer att accepteras. Skriv ut med 100% / faktisk storlek och mät kontrolllinjen 100 mm innan du använder en pappersbetalningsorder.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Kreditör IBAN eller QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Betalning till · borgenär","Account holder / creditor name":"Kontoinnehavarens/borgenärens namn","Street or P.O. box":"Street eller P.O. låda","Building number":"Byggnadsnummer","Postal code":"Postnummer","Town / city":"Stad/stad","2-letter country code":"2 landskod med bokstäver","Amount (optional)":"Mängd (valfritt)","Currency":"Valuta","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Betalning av · frivillig gäldenär","Debtor name":"Gäldenärens namn","Reference type":"Referenstyp","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR referens · Endast QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Referens till kreditgivare · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Ingen strukturerad referens · IBAN","Reference":"Referens","Unstructured message":"Ostrukturerat meddelande","Billing information (optional)":"Faktureringsinformation (valfritt)","Create QR-bill":"Skapa QR-faktura","Load SIX sample":"Ladda SIX prov","Clear form":"Klar form","Check QR payload":"Kontrollera QR-nyttolasten","Download payment data":"Ladda ner betalningsdata","Download QR SVG":"Ladda ner QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Skriv ut / spara som PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Läs en QR-kodbild","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Välj PNG eller JPEG","Read image locally":"Läs bilden lokalt","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Klistra in Swiss QR Code betalningsdata","Invoice details":"Fakturainformation","QR-bill preview":"QR-bill förhandsvisning","Receipt":"Kvitto","Payment part":"Betalningsdel","Payable to":"Betalning till","Payable by":"Betalning av","Account":"Konto","Additional information":"Ytterligare information","Currency / amount":"Valuta/belopp","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Skriv ut skalkontroll · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Schweizisk QR-sedelstandard","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-sedel klar. Detaljerna fanns kvar på den här enheten.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Vissa fält måste kontrolleras. Granska den markerade informationen.","Reading this image on your device…":"Läser den här bilden på din enhet...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Schweizisk QR-kod läst och kontrollerat lokalt.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Ingen läsbar QR-kod hittades i den bilden.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Swiss QR Code-data är giltiga för de fält som stöds.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Datan är inte en giltig schweizisk QR-kod-betalningsnyttolast.","Form and preview cleared.":"Formulär och förhandsgranskning har rensats.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX prov laddat. Byt ut dess provdetaljer före verklig användning.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Skapa eller läs en giltig QR-faktura först.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Välj en PNG eller JPEG på 10 MiB eller mindre.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Den lokala QR-läsaren kunde inte laddas. Du kan klistra in betalningsdata istället.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Vilka IBAN- och referenskombinationer är tillåtna?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN använder en QRR-referens. Ett vanligt schweiziskt IBAN använder SCOR eller ingen strukturerad referens (NON). QRR är endast för CHF-fakturor.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Kontrollerar detta att kontot finns eller tillhör borgenären?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Nr. Den kontrollerar endast formatet och IBAN-kontrollsumman. Den kontaktar inte ett bank- eller kontoregister.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Kan jag skriva ut detta i vilken skala som helst?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"För en pappersbetalningsorder, skriv ut med 100% / faktisk storlek. Betalningsdelen måste vara A6 liggande (148 × 105 mm); kontrollera 100 mm-linjen med en linjal.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Sänder verktyget fakturadata någonstans?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Nr. Generering och bildläsning sker i din webbläsare. Inget konto eller betaltjänst används.","Grade Scale Generator":"Betygsskalagenerator","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Grade Scale Generator — Gratis poäng-till-betyg-verktyg","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Vänd poäng till procent och betyg med dina egna trösklar. Förhandsgranska hela skalan, kopiera eller exportera den och skriv ut ett betygsark.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Skapa en transparent betygsskala för ett prov eller en uppgift. Ställ in högsta poäng och lägsta procentsats för varje betyg; skalan förutsätter inte en skola eller nationell betygsregel.","Points earned":"Intjänade poäng","Maximum points":"Maximala poäng","Top grade label":"Etikett av högsta kvalitet","Top grade starts at (%)":"Toppbetyg börjar på (%)","Middle grade label":"Mellanklassetikett","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Mellanklass börjar på (%)","Lowest grade label":"Lägsta betygsetikett","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Lägsta betyg börjar på (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Med maximalt 50-poäng är 45 poäng lika med 90%. Dina anpassade trösklar avgör betygsetiketten.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Använder detta en officiell betygspolicy?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Nr. Du ställer in tröskelvärdena. Betygssystemen skiljer sig åt beroende på skola, kurs och land; bekräfta den våg du förväntas använda.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Kan jag exportera betygsbanden?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ja. Exportera de visade banden som en CSV-fil eller skriv ut skalan."},"sw":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Malipo ya Likizo ya Norwe","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Kikokotoo cha Malipo ya Likizo ya Norwe — Makadirio ya Jumla Bila Malipo","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Kadiria malipo ya likizo ya Norway kutokana na malipo yako ya likizo. Linganisha viwango vya kawaida vya likizo ya kawaida, wiki ya tano na wafanyikazi wenye umri wa 60 au zaidi.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Ingiza feriepengegrunnlag iliyoonyeshwa kwenye payslip yako. Linganisha viwango vya kawaida vya malipo ya likizo ya Norwe kwa umri wako na urefu wa likizo uliokubaliwa.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Msingi wa malipo ya likizo (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Mimi ni 60 au zaidi katika mwaka wa likizo","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Mkataba wangu unajumuisha wiki ya likizo ya tano","Estimated holiday pay":"Kadirio la malipo ya likizo","Rate used":"Kiwango kilichotumika","Basis used":"Misingi iliyotumika","Reset choices":"Weka upya chaguo","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Makadirio ya Jumla pekee. Malipo ya likizo ni mapato yanayopaswa kodi; zuio la ushuru linaweza kutofautiana kulingana na mtu na mishahara.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Kwa msingi wa NOK 500,000, 10.2% inatoa NOK 51,000 kabla ya marekebisho yoyote ya malipo.","Which rate should I use?":"Je, nitumie kiwango gani?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Kadirio linatumia viwango vya chini vya kawaida: 10.2% au 12% kwa wiki ya tano; 12.5% au 14.3% kwa wafanyakazi wenye umri wa 60 au zaidi. Makubaliano yako yanaweza kutoa zaidi.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Je, hii ndiyo kiasi kinacholipwa baada ya kodi?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Na. Haya ni makadirio ya jumla. Malipo ya likizo ni mapato yanayopaswa kodi; zuio inategemea hali yako na malipo.","What belongs in the basis?":"Ni nini kinachofaa katika msingi?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Tumia feriepengegrunnlag kwenye payslip yako au taarifa ya mwaka. Baadhi ya marejesho na malipo mengine hayajumuishwi na sheria.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Ushuru wa Mapato ya Norwe","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Kikokotoo cha Ushuru cha Norwe 2026 — Makadirio ya Bila malipo ya Mshahara na Pensheni","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Kadiria 2026 Kodi ya mapato ya Norway kwa mshahara wa kawaida au pensheni ya uzee ya mwaka mzima. Tazama malipo yote ya kila mwaka na ya kila mwezi, vipengele vya kodi na ulinganishe hali mbili.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Kadiria 2026 kodi ya mapato ya Norway kwa mshahara wa kawaida wa mkazi au pensheni ya uzee ya mwaka mzima. Tazama sehemu kuu za ushuru na ulinganishe hali mbili za mapato ya jumla.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Kikokotoo kinatumia makato ya kawaida ya 2026, kanda tano za kodi za mabano zinazoendelea na michango ya bima ya kitaifa. Hali ya pensheni inajumuisha mkopo wa ushuru wa pensheni kwa mwaka mzima pekee, 100% anayehitimu pensheni ya uzee au AFP inayostahiki. Inatumika kabisa katika kivinjari hiki.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Kwa mshahara wa NOK 600,000, linganisha makadirio ya kodi ya kila mwaka na malipo yote pamoja na mshahara mwingine au kiasi cha pensheni cha mwaka mzima.","Tax year":"Mwaka wa Kodi","Scenario":"Mtazamo","Salary":"Mshahara","Full-year old-age pension":"Pensheni ya uzee ya mwaka mzima","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Pato la jumla la mwaka (NOK)","Tax zone":"Eneo la Ushuru","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Kiwango cha kawaida (sehemu kubwa ya Norwe)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / manispaa za eneo zilizoorodheshwa","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Kadirio la pensheni huchukua pensheni ya uzee inayostahiki au AFP kwa 100% kwa miezi yote 12, bila mapato mengine.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Makadirio ya mshahara yanachukua ukaaji wa kodi wa kawaida wa Norway, umri 17–69 na hakuna mapato mengine.","Compare two scenarios":"Linganisha hali mbili","Scenario 1":"Mchoro 1","Scenario 2":"Mchoro 2","Calculate estimate":"Kokotoa makadirio","Estimated tax per year":"Kadirio la kodi kwa mwaka","Average tax per month":"Wastani wa kodi kwa mwezi","Estimated net per year":"Kadirio la wavu kwa mwaka","Average net per month":"Wastani wa wavu kwa mwezi","Tax on ordinary income":"Kodi ya mapato ya kawaida","Bracket tax":"Ushuru wa mabano","National insurance contribution":"Mchango wa bima ya kitaifa","Pension tax credit":"Mkopo wa ushuru wa pensheni","Estimated effective rate":"Kadirio la kiwango cha ufanisi","Standard deduction base":"Msingi wa makato wa kawaida","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Viwango na vizingiti ni vya mwaka wa mapato wa 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Kadiria pekee, si hesabu rasmi ya kodi au kadi ya kodi. Mapato mengine, makato, umri, ukaazi, daraja la pensheni na hali za kibinafsi zinaweza kubadilisha matokeo.","Reset values":"Weka upya thamani","Example":"Mfano","How the estimate works":"Jinsi makadirio yanavyofanya kazi","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Je, hii ni bili yangu kamili ya kodi au zuio la kadi ya kodi?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Na. Inakadiria ushuru wa kila mwaka wa 2026. Kadi ya ushuru, tathmini ya mwisho na zuio vinaweza kutofautiana kwa sababu ya mapato yako kamili, makato na hali.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Je, ninaweza kuchanganya mshahara na pensheni hapa?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Toleo hili linakadiria aina moja ya mapato kwa wakati mmoja. Haihesabu kesi ya mchanganyiko wa mshahara na pensheni.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Je, hali ya pensheni inashughulikia kila pensheni?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Na. Salio la pensheni ni mfano wa pensheni ya wazee inayohitimu au AFP inayostahiki inayochukuliwa kwa 100% mwaka mzima. Pensheni ya kiasi cha mwaka au daraja na aina zingine za pensheni ziko nje ya wigo.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Ni chaguo gani la eneo la vipimo?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Inatumika kiwango cha mapato ya kawaida cha 18.5% kilichochapishwa na makato maalum ya NOK 45,000 kwa Finnmark na manispaa zilizoorodheshwa. Thibitisha kuwa manispaa yako inahitimu.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Ushuru wa Utajiri wa Norwe","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Kikokotoo cha Ushuru wa Utajiri wa Norwe 2026 — Makadirio Bila Malipo","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Kadiria 2026 Ushuru wa utajiri wa Norway kutoka kwa nyumba, hisa, mali ya biashara, pesa taslimu na deni. Angalia mgawanyiko wa serikali na manispaa, punguzo la uthamini na anuwai ya unyeti wa thamani.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Kadiria ushuru wa kibinafsi wa utajiri wa Norwe kwa 2026. Weka makadirio ya thamani za soko za nyumba na misingi ya kodi ya punguzo la awali kwa hisa na mali za biashara. Tazama punguzo la uthamini, marekebisho ya deni na makadirio tofauti ya serikali na manispaa.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Kadirio linatumika sheria za kuthamini 2026 na kiwango cha juu zaidi cha kiwango cha manispaa isipokuwa ukiweka kiwango cha chini. Deni linatolewa na maadili kamili ya mali kabla ya punguzo; deni lililopewa hisa zilizopunguzwa bei au mali ya biashara hupunguzwa kwa punguzo sawa. Ukadiriaji wa mali, ustahiki na ukweli wa ushuru wa kibinafsi unaweza kubadilisha matokeo rasmi.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Nyumba ya msingi yenye thamani ya soko ya milioni NOK 10 ina makadirio ya thamani ya utajiri ya NOK 2.5 milioni chini ya sheria ya nyumba ya msingi ya 2026, kabla ya deni na posho ya kibinafsi.","2026 tax year":"2026 mwaka wa ushuru","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Makadirio ya bei ya soko la nyumba ya msingi (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Nyumba za Sekondari inakadiriwa thamani ya soko (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Hushiriki na kushiriki pesa kabla ya punguzo (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Bidhaa zinazostahiki za biashara kabla ya punguzo (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Amana za benki na mali nyingine (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Jumla ya deni (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Tunatozwa ushuru wa mali kwa pamoja","Municipal rate (%)":"Kiwango cha Manispaa (%)","Home-value comparison":"Ulinganisho wa thamani ya nyumbani","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Kadiria kodi ya utajiri","Export CSV":"Hamisha CSV","Print estimate":"Makadirio ya kuchapisha","Assets before discounts":"Vipengee kabla ya punguzo","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Thamani ya mali inayoweza kutozwa ushuru baada ya punguzo","Debt reduction from discounts":"Kupunguza deni kutoka kwa punguzo","Deductible debt estimate":"Makadirio ya deni linalokatwa","Estimated net wealth":"Kadirio la utajiri wa jumla","Personal allowance":"Posho ya kibinafsi","Taxable net wealth":"Utajiri halisi unaotozwa ushuru","Municipal wealth tax":"Kodi ya mali ya Manispaa","State wealth tax":"Ushuru wa utajiri wa serikali","State tax, first band":"Ushuru wa serikali, bendi ya kwanza","State tax, upper band":"Ushuru wa serikali, bendi ya juu","Estimated total wealth tax":"Kadirio la jumla ya kodi ya utajiri","Lower home-value estimate":"Kadirio la chini la thamani ya nyumbani","Current-value estimate":"Kadirio la thamani ya sasa","Higher home-value estimate":"Kadirio la juu la thamani ya nyumbani","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 sheria na mawazo","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Kadiria pekee. Huu sio tathmini rasmi ya ushuru au ushauri wa ushuru. Tumia viwango vyako vya kurejesha kodi inapopatikana; viwango, ustahiki, mgao wa deni na thamani za mali zinaweza kutofautiana katika kesi yako.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Nyumba: weka makadirio ya bei ya soko mwishoni mwa mwaka. Hisa na mali za biashara zinazostahiki: weka thamani kabla ya punguzo la 2026, si thamani ya soko isipokuwa huo ndio msingi sahihi wa kodi.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Posho na kiwango cha juu cha serikali kinaongezeka maradufu tu kwa wenzi wa ndoa, wenzi waliosajiliwa au waishi wenza wanaohitimu hutathminiwa kwa pamoja ili kupata utajiri wao wote.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Hesabu ya manispaa hutumia kiwango kilichochaguliwa, ikibadilika kuwa 2026 upeo wa 0.35%. Baadhi ya manispaa zinaweza kutumia kiwango cha chini.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Unyeti hubadilisha tu thamani zilizoingizwa za nyumba za msingi na za upili. Ni kulinganisha, sio utabiri wa hesabu rasmi.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Je, posho ya kodi ya utajiri ya 2026 ni nini?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Kiwango cha kawaida ni NOK 1.9 milioni kwa mtu mmoja na NOK 3.8 milioni kwa wanandoa au wenzi wanaohitimu kutathminiwa kwa pamoja.","How is my primary home valued?":"Je, nyumba yangu ya msingi inathaminiwaje?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Kwa 2026, thamani ya mali inayokadiriwa ni 25% ya thamani ya soko hadi NOK 14 milioni, pamoja na 70% ya kiasi kilicho juu NOK 14 milioni.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Je, hii inatumika punguzo kwa nyumba ya pili?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Na. Jedwali la 2026 linazipa nyumba za upili punguzo la hesabu la 0%. Inatumia thamani ya soko iliyoingizwa kama makadirio; maadili rasmi yaliyotathminiwa yanaweza kutofautiana.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Kwa nini deni linalokatwa hubadilika wakati ninamiliki hisa au mali ya biashara?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Sheria za Norway hugawa deni kwa uwiano kwa thamani kamili za mali. Sehemu iliyogawiwa kwa mali iliyo na mapunguzo ya uthamini inapunguzwa kwa kiwango sawa cha punguzo.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Je, kiwango cha manispaa ni 0.35% kila wakati?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Na. 0.35% ndio upeo wa juu zaidi wa 2026 unaotumiwa na chaguo-msingi. Manispaa inaweza kuweka kiwango cha chini, ambacho unaweza kuingia.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Je, kikokotoo kinashughulikia kila mali au kesi ya kodi?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Na. Inakadiria nyumba, hisa, mali iliyochaguliwa ya biashara inayostahiki, pesa taslimu na jumla ya deni. Raslimali za kigeni, pensheni, umiliki tata, misamaha na sheria zingine maalum zinaweza kubadilisha tathmini yako.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Jenereta ya bili ya QR ya Uswizi","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Jenereta ya bili ya QR ya Uswizi — Kitengeneza Ankara cha QR Bila Malipo","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Unda na uangalie bili ya Uswizi ya QR ndani ya nchi. Thibitisha marejeleo ya IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR na SCOR; chapisha sehemu ya malipo ya A6 na risiti bila kupakia data ya ankara.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Unda hati ya malipo ya Uswisi ukitumia Msimbo wa QR wa Uswizi. Maelezo yako ya ankara yasalie katika kivinjari hiki; hakuna malipo yanayoanzishwa na hakuna rejista ya benki inayoulizwa.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Zana huunda data SITA ya Msimbo wa Malipo wa Uswizi (SPC) na hukagua sehemu zake, mchanganyiko wa akaunti/rejeleo, tarakimu za hundi za IBAN na vibambo vinavyotumika. Hutengeneza sehemu ya malipo na risiti ya kuchapishwa kwa saizi yao halisi inayohitajika.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"Mfano SITA: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, rejeleo la QRR lenye tarakimu 27 na anwani za mdai/mdaiwa zilizopangwa.","How it works":"Jinsi inavyofanya kazi","Frequently asked questions":"Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","Limits and accuracy":"Mipaka na usahihi","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Hii ni zana ya hati ya ndani, si huduma ya benki au uthibitishaji. Haiwezi kuthibitisha ni nani anayemiliki IBAN, ikiwa akaunti imefunguliwa, au kama malipo yatakubaliwa. Chapisha kwa 100% / Ukubwa halisi na upime mstari wa hundi wa 100 mm kabla ya kutumia agizo la malipo la karatasi.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Mkopo IBAN au QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Inalipwa kwa · mkopeshaji","Account holder / creditor name":"Mmiliki wa akaunti / jina la mdai","Street or P.O. box":"Mtaani au P.O. sanduku","Building number":"Nambari ya jengo","Postal code":"Msimbo wa posta","Town / city":"Mji / jiji\nMsimbo wa nchi wa","2-letter country code":"2","Amount (optional)":"Kiasi (hiari)","Currency":"Fedha","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Inalipwa na · mdaiwa wa hiari","Debtor name":"Jina la mdaiwa","Reference type":"Aina ya marejeleo","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR rejeleo · QR-IBAN pekee","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Marejeleo ya mdai · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Hakuna marejeleo yaliyopangwa · IBAN","Reference":"Rejea","Unstructured message":"Ujumbe usio na muundo","Billing information (optional)":"Maelezo ya bili (si lazima)","Create QR-bill":"Unda bili ya QR","Load SIX sample":"Pakia sampuli SITA","Clear form":"Futa fomu","Check QR payload":"Angalia upakiaji wa QR","Download payment data":"Pakua data ya malipo","Download QR SVG":"Pakua QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Chapisha / hifadhi kama PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Soma picha ya Msimbo wa QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Chagua PNG au JPEG","Read image locally":"Soma picha ndani ya nchi","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Bandika data ya malipo ya Msimbo wa QR wa Uswizi","Invoice details":"Maelezo ya ankara","QR-bill preview":"QR","Receipt":"Risiti","Payment part":"Sehemu ya malipo","Payable to":"Inalipwa kwa","Payable by":"Inalipwa na","Account":"Akaunti","Additional information":"Maelezo ya ziada","Currency / amount":"Fedha / kiasi","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Angalia kipimo cha kuchapisha · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Kiwango cha bili cha Uswizi cha QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-bili tayari. Maelezo yalisalia kwenye kifaa hiki.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Baadhi ya sehemu zinahitaji kuangaliwa. Kagua habari iliyoangaziwa.","Reading this image on your device…":"Kusoma picha hii kwenye kifaa chako...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Msimbo wa QR wa Uswizi umesomwa na kuangaliwa ndani ya nchi.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Hakuna msimbo wa QR unaosomeka uliopatikana kwenye picha hiyo.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Data ya Msimbo wa QR wa Uswizi ni halali kwa sehemu zinazotumika.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Data si malipo halali ya Msimbo wa QR wa Uswizi.","Form and preview cleared.":"Fomu na onyesho la kukagua limefutwa.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"Sampuli SITA imepakiwa. Badilisha maelezo yake ya sampuli kabla ya matumizi halisi.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Unda au usome bili halali ya QR kwanza.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Chagua PNG au JPEG ya 10 MiB au chini yake.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Kisomaji cha ndani cha QR hakikuweza kupakia. Unaweza kubandika data ya malipo badala yake.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Ni IBAN gani na michanganyiko ya marejeleo inaruhusiwa?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN hutumia marejeleo ya QRR. IBAN ya kawaida ya Uswizi hutumia SCOR au hakuna marejeleo iliyoundwa (NON). QRR ni ya ankara za CHF pekee.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Je, hii inakagua kuwa akaunti ipo au ni ya mkopeshaji?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Na. Hukagua umbizo na hundi ya IBAN pekee. Haiwasiliani na benki au sajili ya akaunti.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Je, ninaweza kuchapisha hii kwa kiwango chochote?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Kwa agizo la malipo ya karatasi, chapisha kwa 100% / Ukubwa halisi. Sehemu ya malipo lazima iwe A6 mlalo (148 × 105 mm); angalia mstari wa 100 mm na mtawala.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Je, zana hutuma data ya ankara popote?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Na. Usomaji wa kizazi na picha hufanyika kwenye kivinjari chako. Hakuna akaunti au huduma ya malipo inayotumika.","Grade Scale Generator":"Jenereta ya Kiwango cha Daraja","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Jenereta ya Mizani ya Daraja - Zana ya Bila Malipo ya Alama-hadi-Daraja","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Geuza pointi ziwe asilimia na alama ukitumia viwango vyako binafsi. Hakiki kipimo kizima, ukinakili au uhamishe, na uchapishe laha la kuweka alama.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Jenga kiwango cha uwazi cha kuweka alama kwa mtihani au mgawo. Weka pointi za juu na asilimia ya chini kwa kila daraja; kipimo hakichukui sheria ya shule au ya kitaifa ya upangaji wa alama.","Points earned":"Pointi zilizopatikana","Maximum points":"Alama za juu zaidi","Top grade label":"Lebo ya daraja la juu","Top grade starts at (%)":"Daraja la juu huanza (%)","Middle grade label":"Lebo ya daraja la kati","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Daraja la kati linaanzia (%)","Lowest grade label":"Lebo ya daraja la chini kabisa","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Daraja la chini kabisa huanzia (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Na upeo wa pointi 50, pointi 45 ni sawa na 90%. Viwango vyako maalum huamua lebo ya daraja.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Je, hii inatumia sera rasmi ya kuweka alama?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Na. Unaweka vizingiti. Mifumo ya upangaji madaraja hutofautiana kulingana na shule, kozi na nchi; thibitisha kiwango unachotarajiwa kutumia.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Je, ninaweza kuhamisha bendi za kuweka alama?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Ndiyo. Hamisha bendi zinazoonyeshwa kama faili ya CSV au uchapishe kipimo."},"ta":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"நோர்வே விடுமுறை ஊதிய கால்குலேட்டர்","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"நோர்வே விடுமுறை ஊதிய கால்குலேட்டர் — இலவச மொத்த மதிப்பீடு","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"உங்கள் விடுமுறை ஊதிய அடிப்படையில் நோர்வே விடுமுறை ஊதியத்தை மதிப்பிடவும். நிலையான விடுப்பு, ஐந்தாவது வாரம் மற்றும் 60 அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்ட வயதுடைய பணியாளர்களுக்கான பொதுவான கட்டணங்களை ஒப்பிடுக.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"உங்கள் பேஸ்லிப்பில் காட்டப்பட்டுள்ள feriepengegrunnlag ஐ உள்ளிடவும். உங்கள் வயது மற்றும் ஒப்புக்கொள்ளப்பட்ட விடுமுறை காலத்திற்கான பொதுவான நார்வேஜிய மொத்த விடுமுறை ஊதிய விகிதங்களை ஒப்பிடுக.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"விடுமுறை ஊதிய அடிப்படையில் (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"நான் விடுமுறை ஆண்டில் 60 அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்டவன்","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"எனது ஒப்பந்தத்தில் ஐந்தாவது விடுமுறை வாரமும் அடங்கும்","Estimated holiday pay":"மதிப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட விடுமுறை ஊதியம்","Rate used":"வீதம் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது","Basis used":"அடிப்படை பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது","Reset choices":"தேர்வுகளை மீட்டமைக்கவும்","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"மொத்த மதிப்பீடு மட்டுமே. விடுமுறை ஊதியம் என்பது வரிக்கு உட்பட்ட வருமானம்; வரி பிடித்தம் நபர் மற்றும் ஊதியம் அடிப்படையில் மாறுபடும்.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 அடிப்படையில், 10.2% எந்த ஊதிய மாற்றங்களுக்கும் முன் NOK 51,000 ஐ வழங்குகிறது.","Which rate should I use?":"நான் எந்த விகிதத்தைப் பயன்படுத்த வேண்டும்?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"மதிப்பீடு பொதுவான குறைந்தபட்ச விகிதங்களைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது: 10.2% அல்லது 12% ஐந்தாவது வாரத்துடன்; 60 அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்ட வயதுடைய ஊழியர்களுக்கு 12.5% அல்லது 14.3%. உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தம் மேலும் கொடுக்கலாம்.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"இது வரிக்குப் பிறகு செலுத்தப்பட்ட தொகையா?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"எண். இது ஒரு மொத்த மதிப்பீடு. விடுமுறை ஊதியம் என்பது வரிக்கு உட்பட்ட வருமானம்; நிறுத்தி வைப்பது உங்கள் சூழ்நிலைகள் மற்றும் ஊதியத்தைப் பொறுத்தது.","What belongs in the basis?":"அடிப்படையில் என்ன இருக்கிறது?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"உங்கள் பேஸ்லிப் அல்லது வருடாந்திர அறிக்கையில் feriepengegrunnlag ஐப் பயன்படுத்தவும். சில திருப்பிச் செலுத்துதல் மற்றும் பிற கொடுப்பனவுகள் விதிகளால் விலக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"நோர்வே வருமான வரி கால்குலேட்டர்","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"நோர்வே வரி கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 — இலவச சம்பளம் மற்றும் ஓய்வூதிய மதிப்பீடு","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"நிலையான சம்பளம் அல்லது முழு ஆண்டு முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியத்தின் மீதான 2026 நார்வேஜியன் வருமான வரியை மதிப்பிடவும். வருடாந்திர மற்றும் மாதாந்திர நிகர ஊதியம், வரி கூறுகள் மற்றும் இரண்டு காட்சிகளை ஒப்பிடவும்.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"நிலையான குடியிருப்பாளர் சம்பளம் அல்லது முழு ஆண்டு முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியத்திற்கான 2026 நார்வேஜியன் வருமான வரி மதிப்பீடு. முக்கிய வரிக் கூறுகளைப் பார்க்கவும் மற்றும் இரண்டு மொத்த வருமானக் காட்சிகளை ஒப்பிடவும்.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 நிலையான விலக்குகள், ஐந்து முற்போக்கான அடைப்பு-வரி பட்டைகள் மற்றும் தேசிய காப்பீட்டு பங்களிப்புகளுக்கு பொருந்தும். ஓய்வூதிய பயன்முறையில் ஒரு முழு ஆண்டுக்கான ஓய்வூதிய வரிக் கிரெடிட் அடங்கும், 100% தகுதியுள்ள முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம் அல்லது தகுதியான AFP. இது முழுவதுமாக இந்த உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 இன் சம்பளத்திற்கு, மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட வருடாந்திர வரி மற்றும் நிகர ஊதியத்தை மற்றொரு சம்பளம் அல்லது முழு ஆண்டு ஓய்வூதியத் தொகையுடன் ஒப்பிடவும்.","Tax year":"வரி ஆண்டு","Scenario":"காட்சி","Salary":"சம்பளம்","Full-year old-age pension":"முழு ஆண்டு முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம்","Gross annual income (NOK)":"மொத்த ஆண்டு வருமானம் (NOK)","Tax zone":"வரி மண்டலம்","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"தரநிலை விகிதம் (நோர்வேயின் பெரும்பகுதி)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"ஃபின்மார்க் / பட்டியலிடப்பட்ட நடவடிக்கைகள் மண்டல நகராட்சிகள்","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"ஓய்வூதிய மதிப்பீடு தகுதியான முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம் அல்லது அனைத்து 12 மாதங்களுக்கு 100% இல் AFP வேறு எந்த வருமானமும் இல்லாமல் கருதுகிறது.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"சம்பள மதிப்பீடு சாதாரண நார்வேஜியன் வரி குடியிருப்பு, வயது 17–69 மற்றும் வேறு எந்த வருமானமும் இல்லை.","Compare two scenarios":"இரண்டு காட்சிகளை ஒப்பிடுக","Scenario 1":"காட்சி 1","Scenario 2":"காட்சி 2","Calculate estimate":"மதிப்பீட்டைக் கணக்கிடுங்கள்","Estimated tax per year":"வருடத்திற்கு மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட வரி","Average tax per month":"மாதத்திற்கு சராசரி வரி","Estimated net per year":"ஆண்டுக்கு மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட நிகரம்","Average net per month":"மாதத்திற்கு சராசரி நிகரம்","Tax on ordinary income":"சாதாரண வருமானத்தின் மீதான வரி","Bracket tax":"அடைப்பு வரி","National insurance contribution":"தேசிய காப்பீட்டு பங்களிப்பு","Pension tax credit":"ஓய்வூதிய வரிக் கடன்","Estimated effective rate":"மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட செயல்திறன் விகிதம்","Standard deduction base":"தரநிலை கழித்தல் அடிப்படை","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"விகிதங்கள் மற்றும் வரம்புகள் 2026 வருவாய் ஆண்டிற்கானவை.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"மதிப்பீடு மட்டுமே, அதிகாரப்பூர்வ வரி கணக்கீடு அல்லது வரி அட்டை அல்ல. பிற வருமானம், விலக்குகள், வயது, குடியுரிமை, ஓய்வூதிய தரம் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட சூழ்நிலைகள் முடிவை மாற்றலாம்.","Reset values":"மதிப்புகளை மீட்டமைக்கவும்","Example":"எடுத்துக்காட்டு","How the estimate works":"மதிப்பீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"இது எனது சரியான வரி மசோதாவா அல்லது வரி-அட்டை பிடித்ததா?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"எண். இது நிலையான 2026 வருடாந்திர வரியை மதிப்பிடுகிறது. உங்கள் முழு வருமானம், விலக்குகள் மற்றும் சூழ்நிலைகள் காரணமாக ஒரு வரி அட்டை, இறுதி மதிப்பீடு மற்றும் நிறுத்தி வைப்பது வேறுபடலாம்.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"நான் இங்கே சம்பளம் மற்றும் ஓய்வூதியத்தை இணைக்கலாமா?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"இந்த பதிப்பு ஒரு நேரத்தில் ஒரு வருமான வகையை மதிப்பிடுகிறது. இது ஒரு கலப்பு சம்பளம் மற்றும் ஓய்வூதிய வழக்கை கணக்கிடவில்லை.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"ஓய்வூதிய முறை ஒவ்வொரு ஓய்வூதியத்தையும் உள்ளடக்குமா?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"எண். ஓய்வூதியக் கடன் தகுதியான முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியத்திற்காக மட்டுமே வடிவமைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது அல்லது ஆண்டு முழுவதும் 100% இல் எடுக்கப்பட்ட தகுதியான AFP. பகுதி-ஆண்டு அல்லது தரப்படுத்தப்பட்ட ஓய்வூதியம் மற்றும் பிற ஓய்வூதிய வகைகள் நோக்கத்திற்கு அப்பாற்பட்டவை.","What is the measures-zone option?":"அளவைகள்-மண்டல விருப்பம் என்றால் என்ன?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"இது வெளியிடப்பட்ட 18.5% சாதாரண-வருமான விகிதம் மற்றும் ஃபின்மார்க் மற்றும் பட்டியலிடப்பட்ட நகராட்சிகளுக்கு NOK 45,000 சிறப்பு விலக்குகளைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது. உங்கள் நகராட்சி தகுதியுடையதா என்பதை உறுதிப்படுத்தவும்.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"நோர்வே வெல்த் டேக்ஸ் கால்குலேட்டர்","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"நோர்வே வெல்த் டேக்ஸ் கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 — இலவச மதிப்பீடு","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"வீடுகள், பங்குகள், வணிகச் சொத்துக்கள், பணம் மற்றும் கடன் ஆகியவற்றிலிருந்து 2026 நார்வேஜியன் சொத்து வரி மதிப்பீடு. மாநில மற்றும் முனிசிபல் பிரிப்பு, மதிப்பீட்டு தள்ளுபடிகள் மற்றும் மதிப்பு உணர்திறன் வரம்பு ஆகியவற்றைப் பார்க்கவும்.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026க்கான தனிப்பட்ட நார்வேஜியன் சொத்து வரியை மதிப்பிடவும். வீடுகளுக்கான மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட சந்தை மதிப்புகள் மற்றும் பங்குகள் மற்றும் வணிக சொத்துகளுக்கான முன் தள்ளுபடி வரி அடிப்படைகளை உள்ளிடவும். மதிப்பீட்டு தள்ளுபடிகள், கடன் சரிசெய்தல் மற்றும் தனி மாநில மற்றும் நகராட்சி மதிப்பீடுகளைப் பார்க்கவும்.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"மதிப்பீடு 2026 மதிப்பீட்டு விதிகள் மற்றும் நீங்கள் குறைந்த விகிதத்தை உள்ளிடாத வரையில் அதிகபட்ச நகராட்சி விகிதம் பொருந்தும். தள்ளுபடிகளுக்கு முன் முழு சொத்து மதிப்புகளால் கடன் ஒதுக்கப்படுகிறது; தள்ளுபடி செய்யப்பட்ட பங்குகள் அல்லது வணிக சொத்துக்களுக்கு ஒதுக்கப்பட்ட கடன் அதே தள்ளுபடியால் குறைக்கப்படுகிறது. சொத்து மதிப்பீடுகள், தகுதி மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட வரி உண்மைகள் ஆகியவை அதிகாரப்பூர்வ முடிவை மாற்றலாம்.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"NOK 10 மில்லியன் சந்தை மதிப்பைக் கொண்ட ஒரு முதன்மை வீடு, கடன் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட கொடுப்பனவுக்கு முன், 2026 முதன்மை வீட்டு விதியின் கீழ் NOK 2.5 மில்லியன் மதிப்புடைய சொத்து மதிப்பைக் கொண்டுள்ளது.","2026 tax year":"2026 வரி ஆண்டு","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"முதன்மை வீடு மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட சந்தை மதிப்பு (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"இரண்டாம் நிலை வீடுகள் மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட சந்தை மதிப்பு (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"தள்ளுபடிக்கு முன் நிதிகளைப் பகிர்ந்து மற்றும் பங்குகள் (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"தள்ளுபடிக்கு முன் தகுதியான வணிக சொத்துக்கள் (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"வங்கி வைப்பு மற்றும் பிற சொத்துக்கள் (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"மொத்த கடன் (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"நாங்கள் செல்வத்திற்காக கூட்டாக வரி விதிக்கப்படுகிறோம்","Municipal rate (%)":"நகராட்சி விகிதம் (%)","Home-value comparison":"வீட்டு மதிப்பு ஒப்பீடு","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"மதிப்பு சொத்து வரி","Export CSV":"ஏற்றுமதி CSV","Print estimate":"அச்சு மதிப்பீடு","Assets before discounts":"தள்ளுபடிகளுக்கு முன் சொத்துக்கள்","Taxable asset value after discounts":"தள்ளுபடிகளுக்குப் பிறகு வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய சொத்து மதிப்பு","Debt reduction from discounts":"தள்ளுபடிகளில் இருந்து கடன் குறைப்பு","Deductible debt estimate":"கழிக்கத்தக்க கடன் மதிப்பீடு","Estimated net wealth":"மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட நிகர செல்வம்","Personal allowance":"தனிப்பட்ட கொடுப்பனவு","Taxable net wealth":"வரி விதிக்கப்படும் நிகர செல்வம்","Municipal wealth tax":"நகராட்சி சொத்து வரி","State wealth tax":"மாநில சொத்து வரி","State tax, first band":"மாநில வரி, முதல் பேண்ட்","State tax, upper band":"மாநில வரி, மேல் பட்டை","Estimated total wealth tax":"மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட மொத்த சொத்து வரி","Lower home-value estimate":"குறைந்த வீட்டு மதிப்பு மதிப்பீடு","Current-value estimate":"தற்போதைய மதிப்பு மதிப்பீடு","Higher home-value estimate":"அதிக வீட்டு மதிப்பு மதிப்பீடு","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 விதிகள் மற்றும் அனுமானங்கள்","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"மதிப்பீடு மட்டும். இது உத்தியோகபூர்வ வரி மதிப்பீடு அல்லது வரி ஆலோசனை அல்ல. கிடைக்கும் இடங்களில் உங்கள் வரி வருவாய் மதிப்புகளைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்; விகிதங்கள், தகுதி, கடன் ஒதுக்கீடு மற்றும் சொத்து மதிப்புகள் உங்கள் விஷயத்தில் வேறுபடலாம்.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"வீடுகள்: ஆண்டு இறுதியில் மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட சந்தை மதிப்பை உள்ளிடவும். பங்குகள் மற்றும் தகுதியான வணிகச் சொத்துகள்: 2026 தள்ளுபடிக்கு முந்தைய மதிப்பை உள்ளிடவும், அது சரியான வரி அடிப்படையாக இல்லாவிட்டால் சந்தை மதிப்பை அல்ல.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"மனைவிகள், பதிவுசெய்யப்பட்ட கூட்டாளர்கள் அல்லது தகுதிவாய்ந்த உடன் வாழ்பவர்கள் ஆகியோருக்கு மட்டுமே கொடுப்பனவு மற்றும் மாநில உச்ச வரம்பு இரட்டிப்பாகும்.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"முனிசிபல் கணக்கீடு தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட விகிதத்தைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது, இயல்புநிலை 2026 அதிகபட்சம் 0.35%. சில நகராட்சிகள் குறைந்த கட்டணத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தலாம்.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"முதன்மை மற்றும் இரண்டாம் நிலை வீடுகளின் உள்ளிட்ட மதிப்புகளை மட்டுமே உணர்திறன் மாற்றுகிறது. இது ஒரு ஒப்பீடு, அதிகாரப்பூர்வ மதிப்பீட்டின் கணிப்பு அல்ல.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 செல்வம்-வரி கொடுப்பனவு என்றால் என்ன?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"ஒரு நபருக்கான நிலையான வரம்பு NOK 1.9 மில்லியன் மற்றும் கணவன்/மனைவி அல்லது தகுதிபெறும் கூட்டாளர்களுக்கு NOK 3.8 மில்லியன் கூட்டாக மதிப்பிடப்படுகிறது.","How is my primary home valued?":"எனது முதன்மை வீட்டின் மதிப்பு எப்படி உள்ளது?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026க்கு, மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட செல்வ மதிப்பு NOK 14 மில்லியன் வரையிலான சந்தை மதிப்பில் 25% ஆகும், மேலும் NOK 14 மில்லியனுக்கும் அதிகமான தொகையில் 70% ஆகும்.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"இரண்டாம் நிலை வீட்டிற்கு இது தள்ளுபடியைப் பயன்படுத்துமா?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"எண். 2026 அட்டவணை இரண்டாம் நிலை வீடுகளுக்கு 0% மதிப்பீட்டு தள்ளுபடியை வழங்குகிறது. இது உள்ளிட்ட சந்தை மதிப்பை மதிப்பீடாகப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது; அதிகாரப்பூர்வ மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட மதிப்புகள் வேறுபடலாம்.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"நான் பங்குகள் அல்லது வணிகச் சொத்துக்களை வைத்திருக்கும் போது கழிக்கக்கூடிய கடன் ஏன் மாறுகிறது?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"நோர்வே விதிகள் முழு சொத்து மதிப்புகளின் விகிதாசாரப்படி கடனை ஒதுக்குகின்றன. மதிப்பீட்டுத் தள்ளுபடியுடன் சொத்துக்களுக்கு ஒதுக்கப்பட்ட பகுதி அதே தள்ளுபடி விகிதத்தால் குறைக்கப்படுகிறது.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"முனிசிபல் கட்டணம் எப்போதும் 0.35% ஆக உள்ளதா?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"எண். 0.35% என்பது இயல்பாகப் பயன்படுத்தப்படும் அதிகபட்ச 2026 ஆகும். ஒரு நகராட்சி குறைந்த கட்டணத்தை அமைக்கலாம், அதை நீங்கள் உள்ளிடலாம்.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"கால்குலேட்டர் ஒவ்வொரு சொத்து அல்லது வரி வழக்குகளையும் உள்ளடக்குமா?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"எண். இது வீடுகள், பங்குகள், தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட தகுதியான வணிக சொத்துக்கள், பணம் மற்றும் மொத்த கடன் ஆகியவற்றை மதிப்பிடுகிறது. வெளிநாட்டு சொத்துக்கள், ஓய்வூதியங்கள், சிக்கலான உரிமை, விலக்குகள் மற்றும் பிற சிறப்பு விதிகள் உங்கள் மதிப்பீட்டை மாற்றலாம்.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"சுவிஸ் QR-பில் ஜெனரேட்டர்","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"சுவிஸ் QR-பில் ஜெனரேட்டர் — இலவச QR இன்வாய்ஸ் மேக்கர்","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"உள்ளூரில் சுவிஸ் QR-பில் ஒன்றை உருவாக்கி சரிபார்க்கவும். IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR மற்றும் SCOR குறிப்புகளை சரிபார்க்கவும்; விலைப்பட்டியல் தரவைப் பதிவேற்றாமல் A6 கட்டணப் பகுதியையும் ரசீதையும் அச்சிடவும்.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"சுவிஸ் QR குறியீட்டைக் கொண்டு சுவிஸ் கட்டணச் சீட்டை உருவாக்கவும். உங்கள் விலைப்பட்டியல் விவரங்கள் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும்; எந்த கட்டணமும் தொடங்கப்படவில்லை மற்றும் எந்த வங்கி பதிவும் வினவப்படவில்லை.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"கருவி SIX சுவிஸ் பேமெண்ட்ஸ் கோட் (SPC) தரவை உருவாக்குகிறது மற்றும் அதன் புலங்கள், கணக்கு/குறிப்பு சேர்க்கை, IBAN காசோலை இலக்கங்கள் மற்றும் ஆதரிக்கப்படும் எழுத்துகளை சரிபார்க்கிறது. இது பணம் செலுத்தும் பகுதியையும் அச்சிடுவதற்கான ரசீதையும் அவற்றின் தேவையான அளவுகளில் வடிவமைக்கிறது.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"ஆறு எடுத்துக்காட்டு: ஒரு QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27-இலக்க QRR குறிப்பு மற்றும் கட்டமைக்கப்பட்ட கடன்/கடனாளி முகவரிகள்.","How it works":"இது எப்படி வேலை செய்கிறது","Frequently asked questions":"அடிக்கடி கேட்கப்படும் கேள்விகள்","Limits and accuracy":"வரம்புகள் மற்றும் துல்லியம்","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"இது ஒரு உள்ளூர் ஆவணக் கருவி, வங்கிச் சேவை அல்லது சான்றிதழ் அல்ல. IBAN ஐ யாருடையது, கணக்கு திறக்கப்பட்டுள்ளதா அல்லது பணம் செலுத்தப்படுமா என்பதை இது உறுதிப்படுத்த முடியாது. 100% / உண்மையான அளவில் அச்சிட்டு, காகித கட்டண ஆர்டரைப் பயன்படுத்தும் முன் 100 மிமீ செக் லைனை அளவிடவும்.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"கடன் வழங்குபவர் IBAN அல்லது QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"கடன் வழங்குபவருக்குச் செலுத்த வேண்டும்","Account holder / creditor name":"கணக்கு வைத்திருப்பவர் / கடனாளியின் பெயர்","Street or P.O. box":"தெரு அல்லது பி.ஓ. பெட்டி","Building number":"கட்டிட எண்","Postal code":"அஞ்சல் குறியீடு","Town / city":"டவுன் / நகரம்","2-letter country code":"2-எழுத்து நாட்டின் குறியீடு","Amount (optional)":"தொகை (விரும்பினால்)","Currency":"நாணயம்","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"விருப்பக் கடனாளி மூலம் செலுத்தப்படும்","Debtor name":"கடனாளியின் பெயர்","Reference type":"குறிப்பு வகை","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR குறிப்பு · QR-IBAN மட்டும்","Creditor reference · IBAN":"கடன் வழங்குபவர் குறிப்பு · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"கட்டமைக்கப்பட்ட குறிப்பு இல்லை · IBAN","Reference":"குறிப்பு","Unstructured message":"கட்டமைக்கப்படாத செய்தி","Billing information (optional)":"பில்லிங் தகவல் (விரும்பினால்)","Create QR-bill":"QR-பில் உருவாக்கவும்","Load SIX sample":"ஆறு மாதிரியை ஏற்றவும்","Clear form":"படிவம் அழி","Check QR payload":"QR பேலோடைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்","Download payment data":"கட்டணத் தரவைப் பதிவிறக்கவும்","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG ஐப் பதிவிறக்கவும்","Print / save as PDF":"PDF ஆக அச்சிட / சேமிக்கவும்","Read a QR Code image":"QR குறியீடு படத்தைப் படிக்கவும்","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG அல்லது JPEGஐத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்","Read image locally":"படத்தை உள்ளூரில் படிக்கவும்","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"சுவிஸ் QR குறியீடு கட்டணத் தரவை ஒட்டவும்","Invoice details":"இன்வாய்ஸ் விவரங்கள்","QR-bill preview":"QR-பில் முன்னோட்டம்","Receipt":"ரசீது","Payment part":"பணம் செலுத்தும் பகுதி","Payable to":"இவருக்குச் செலுத்த வேண்டும்","Payable by":"செலுத்தப்படும்","Account":"கணக்கு","Additional information":"கூடுதல் தகவல்","Currency / amount":"நாணயம் / தொகை","Print scale check · 100 mm":"அச்சு அளவு சரிபார்ப்பு · 100 மிமீ","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · சுவிஸ் QR-பில் தரநிலை","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-பில் தயார். இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் விவரங்கள் இருந்தன.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"சில புலங்களைச் சரிபார்க்க வேண்டும். முன்னிலைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட தகவலை மதிப்பாய்வு செய்யவும்.","Reading this image on your device…":"உங்கள் சாதனத்தில் இந்தப் படத்தைப் படிக்கிறது…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"சுவிஸ் QR குறியீடு உள்நாட்டில் படித்து சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"அந்தப் படத்தில் படிக்கக்கூடிய QR குறியீடு எதுவும் இல்லை.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"சுவிஸ் QR குறியீடு தரவு ஆதரிக்கப்படும் புலங்களுக்கு செல்லுபடியாகும்.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"தரவு செல்லுபடியாகும் ஸ்விஸ் QR குறியீடு கட்டண பேலோட் அல்ல.","Form and preview cleared.":"படிவம் மற்றும் முன்னோட்டம் அழிக்கப்பட்டது.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX மாதிரி ஏற்றப்பட்டது. உண்மையான பயன்பாட்டிற்கு முன் அதன் மாதிரி விவரங்களை மாற்றவும்.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"முதலில் சரியான QR-பில் ஒன்றை உருவாக்கவும் அல்லது படிக்கவும்.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB அல்லது அதற்கும் குறைவான PNG அல்லது JPEG ஐத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"உள்ளூர் QR ரீடரை ஏற்ற முடியவில்லை. அதற்குப் பதிலாக கட்டணத் தரவை ஒட்டலாம்.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"எந்த IBAN மற்றும் குறிப்பு சேர்க்கைகள் அனுமதிக்கப்படுகின்றன?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"ஒரு QR-IBAN ஒரு QRR குறிப்பைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது. ஒரு சாதாரண சுவிஸ் IBAN SCOR ஐப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது அல்லது கட்டமைக்கப்பட்ட குறிப்பு இல்லை (NON). QRR என்பது CHF இன்வாய்ஸ்களுக்கு மட்டுமே.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"கணக்கு இருக்கிறதா அல்லது கடன் கொடுத்தவருக்குச் சொந்தமானதா என்பதை இது சரிபார்க்கிறதா?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"எண். இது வடிவம் மற்றும் IBAN செக்சம் மட்டும் சரிபார்க்கிறது. இது வங்கி அல்லது கணக்கு பதிவேட்டை தொடர்பு கொள்ளாது.","Can I print this at any scale?":"இதை எந்த அளவிலும் அச்சிட முடியுமா?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"தாள் கட்டண ஆர்டருக்கு, 100% / உண்மையான அளவில் அச்சிடவும். கட்டணம் செலுத்தும் பகுதி A6 நிலப்பரப்பாக இருக்க வேண்டும் (148 × 105 மிமீ); 100 மிமீ வரியை ஆட்சியாளருடன் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"கருவி இன்வாய்ஸ் தரவை எங்கும் அனுப்புகிறதா?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"எண். உருவாக்கம் மற்றும் பட வாசிப்பு உங்கள் உலாவியில் நடக்கும். கணக்கு அல்லது கட்டணச் சேவை பயன்படுத்தப்படவில்லை.","Grade Scale Generator":"கிரேடு ஸ்கேல் ஜெனரேட்டர்","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"கிரேடு ஸ்கேல் ஜெனரேட்டர் — இலவச புள்ளிகள்-கிரேடு கருவி","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"உங்கள் சொந்த வரம்புகளுடன் புள்ளிகளை சதவீதங்கள் மற்றும் கிரேடுகளாக மாற்றவும். முழு அளவை முன்னோட்டமிடவும், அதை நகலெடுக்கவும் அல்லது ஏற்றுமதி செய்யவும் மற்றும் தரப்படுத்தல் தாளை அச்சிடவும்.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"தேர்வு அல்லது பணிக்கு ஒரு வெளிப்படையான கிரேடிங் அளவை உருவாக்கவும். ஒவ்வொரு தரத்திற்கும் அதிகபட்ச புள்ளிகள் மற்றும் குறைந்தபட்ச சதவீதத்தை அமைக்கவும்; ஸ்கேல் ஒரு பள்ளி அல்லது தேசிய தர நிர்ணய விதியை எடுத்துக்கொள்ளாது.","Points earned":"புள்ளிகள் பெற்றன","Maximum points":"அதிகபட்ச புள்ளிகள்","Top grade label":"டாப் கிரேடு லேபிள்","Top grade starts at (%)":"முதல் தரம் (%) இல் தொடங்குகிறது","Middle grade label":"மிடில் கிரேடு லேபிள்","Middle grade starts at (%)":"நடுத்தர தரம் (%) இல் தொடங்குகிறது","Lowest grade label":"குறைந்த தர லேபிள்","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"குறைந்த தரம் (%) இல் தொடங்குகிறது","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"50-புள்ளி அதிகபட்சம், 45 புள்ளிகள் 90%க்கு சமம். உங்கள் தனிப்பயன் வரம்புகள் கிரேடு லேபிளைத் தீர்மானிக்கும்.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"இது அதிகாரப்பூர்வ தரக் கொள்கையைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறதா?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"எண். நீங்கள் வரம்புகளை அமைக்கிறீர்கள். பள்ளி, படிப்பு மற்றும் நாடு வாரியாக தர நிர்ணய முறைகள் வேறுபடுகின்றன; நீங்கள் பயன்படுத்த எதிர்பார்க்கப்படும் அளவை உறுதிப்படுத்தவும்.","Can I export the grading bands?":"கிரேடிங் பேண்டுகளை நான் ஏற்றுமதி செய்யலாமா?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"ஆம். காட்டப்படும் பட்டைகளை CSV கோப்பாக ஏற்றுமதி செய்யவும் அல்லது அளவை அச்சிடவும்."},"te":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"నార్వే హాలిడే పే కాలిక్యులేటర్","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"నార్వే హాలిడే పే కాలిక్యులేటర్ — ఉచిత స్థూల అంచనా","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"మీ హాలిడే-పే ఆధారంగా నార్వేజియన్ సెలవు చెల్లింపును అంచనా వేయండి. ప్రామాణిక సెలవు, ఐదవ వారం మరియు 60 లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ వయస్సు గల ఉద్యోగుల కోసం సాధారణ రేట్లను సరిపోల్చండి.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"మీ పేస్లిప్‌లో చూపిన ఫెరిపెంగెగ్రున్‌లాగ్‌ను నమోదు చేయండి. మీ వయస్సు మరియు అంగీకరించిన సెలవు పొడవు కోసం సాధారణ నార్వేజియన్ స్థూల సెలవు-చెల్లింపు రేట్లను సరిపోల్చండి.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"హాలిడే-పే ప్రాతిపదిక (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"నేను సెలవు సంవత్సరంలో 60 లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ వయస్సు గలవాడిని","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"నా ఒప్పందంలో ఐదవ సెలవు వారం ఉంది","Estimated holiday pay":"అంచనా వేయబడిన సెలవు చెల్లింపు","Rate used":"రేటు ఉపయోగించబడింది","Basis used":"ఆధారం ఉపయోగించబడింది","Reset choices":"ఎంపికలను రీసెట్ చేయండి","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"స్థూల అంచనా మాత్రమే. సెలవు చెల్లింపు అనేది పన్ను పరిధిలోకి వచ్చే ఆదాయం; పన్ను విత్‌హోల్డింగ్ వ్యక్తి మరియు పేరోల్‌ను బట్టి మారవచ్చు.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 ఆధారంగా, 10.2% ఏదైనా పేరోల్ సర్దుబాట్లకు ముందు NOK 51,000ని అందిస్తుంది.","Which rate should I use?":"నేను ఏ రేటును ఉపయోగించాలి?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"అంచనా సాధారణ కనీస రేట్లను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది: 10.2% లేదా 12% ఐదవ వారంతో; 60 లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ వయస్సు గల ఉద్యోగుల కోసం 12.5% లేదా 14.3%. మీ ఒప్పందం మరింత ఇవ్వవచ్చు.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"పన్ను తర్వాత చెల్లించిన మొత్తం ఇదేనా?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"నం. ఇది స్థూల అంచనా. సెలవు చెల్లింపు అనేది పన్ను పరిధిలోకి వచ్చే ఆదాయం; నిలుపుదల మీ పరిస్థితులు మరియు పేరోల్‌పై ఆధారపడి ఉంటుంది.","What belongs in the basis?":"ఆధారంలో ఏమి ఉంది?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"మీ పేస్లిప్ లేదా వార్షిక స్టేట్‌మెంట్‌లో feriepengegrunnlagని ఉపయోగించండి. కొన్ని రీయింబర్స్‌మెంట్‌లు మరియు ఇతర చెల్లింపులు నిబంధనల ద్వారా మినహాయించబడ్డాయి.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"నార్వే ఆదాయపు పన్ను కాలిక్యులేటర్","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"నార్వే పన్ను కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 — ఉచిత జీతం & పెన్షన్ అంచనా","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"స్టాండర్డ్ జీతం లేదా పూర్తి-సంవత్సరం వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్‌పై 2026 నార్వేజియన్ ఆదాయపు పన్నును అంచనా వేయండి. వార్షిక మరియు నెలవారీ నికర చెల్లింపు, పన్ను భాగాలు చూడండి మరియు రెండు దృశ్యాలను సరిపోల్చండి.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"స్టాండర్డ్ రెసిడెంట్ జీతం లేదా పూర్తి-సంవత్సరం వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్ కోసం 2026 నార్వేజియన్ ఆదాయపు పన్నును అంచనా వేయండి. ప్రధాన పన్ను భాగాలను చూడండి మరియు రెండు స్థూల-ఆదాయ దృశ్యాలను సరిపోల్చండి.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 ప్రామాణిక తగ్గింపులు, ఐదు ప్రగతిశీల బ్రాకెట్-పన్ను బ్యాండ్‌లు మరియు జాతీయ బీమా సహకారాలను వర్తింపజేస్తుంది. పెన్షన్ మోడ్‌లో పూర్తి సంవత్సరానికి మాత్రమే పెన్షన్ పన్ను క్రెడిట్ ఉంటుంది, 100% అర్హత కలిగిన వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్ లేదా అర్హత కలిగిన AFP. ఇది పూర్తిగా ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 జీతం కోసం, అంచనా వేయబడిన వార్షిక పన్ను మరియు నికర చెల్లింపును మరొక జీతం లేదా పూర్తి-సంవత్సరపు పెన్షన్ మొత్తంతో సరిపోల్చండి.","Tax year":"పన్ను సంవత్సరం","Scenario":"దృష్టాంతం","Salary":"జీతం","Full-year old-age pension":"పూర్తి-సంవత్సరం వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్","Gross annual income (NOK)":"స్థూల వార్షిక ఆదాయం (NOK)","Tax zone":"పన్ను జోన్","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"ప్రామాణిక రేటు (నార్వేలో ఎక్కువ భాగం)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"ఫిన్మార్క్ / జాబితా చేయబడిన కొలతలు-జోన్ మునిసిపాలిటీలు","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"పెన్షన్ అంచనా అన్ని 12 నెలలకు 100% వద్ద ఇతర ఆదాయం లేకుండా వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్ లేదా AFPని పొందుతుంది.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"జీతం అంచనా సాధారణ నార్వేజియన్ పన్ను రెసిడెన్సీ, వయస్సు 17–69 మరియు ఇతర ఆదాయాలు లేవు.","Compare two scenarios":"రెండు దృశ్యాలను సరిపోల్చండి","Scenario 1":"దృష్టాంతం 1","Scenario 2":"దృష్టాంతం 2","Calculate estimate":"అంచనాను లెక్కించండి","Estimated tax per year":"సంవత్సరానికి అంచనా వేసిన పన్ను","Average tax per month":"నెలకు సగటు పన్ను","Estimated net per year":"సంవత్సరానికి అంచనా వేయబడిన నికర","Average net per month":"నెలకు సగటు నికర","Tax on ordinary income":"సాధారణ ఆదాయంపై పన్ను","Bracket tax":"బ్రాకెట్ పన్ను","National insurance contribution":"జాతీయ బీమా సహకారం","Pension tax credit":"పెన్షన్ పన్ను క్రెడిట్","Estimated effective rate":"అంచనా ప్రభావవంతమైన రేటు","Standard deduction base":"స్టాండర్డ్ డిడక్షన్ బేస్","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"రేట్లు మరియు థ్రెషోల్డ్‌లు 2026 ఆదాయ సంవత్సరానికి సంబంధించినవి.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"అంచనా మాత్రమే, అధికారిక పన్ను గణన లేదా పన్ను కార్డ్ కాదు. ఇతర ఆదాయం, తగ్గింపులు, వయస్సు, నివాసం, పెన్షన్ గ్రేడ్ మరియు వ్యక్తిగత పరిస్థితులు ఫలితాన్ని మార్చగలవు.","Reset values":"విలువలను రీసెట్ చేయండి","Example":"ఉదాహరణ","How the estimate works":"అంచనా ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"ఇది నా ఖచ్చితమైన పన్ను బిల్లు లేదా పన్ను-కార్డ్ విత్‌హోల్డింగ్?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"నం. ఇది ప్రామాణిక 2026 వార్షిక పన్నును అంచనా వేస్తుంది. మీ పూర్తి ఆదాయం, తగ్గింపులు మరియు పరిస్థితుల కారణంగా పన్ను కార్డ్, తుది అంచనా మరియు నిలిపివేత భిన్నంగా ఉండవచ్చు.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"నేను ఇక్కడ జీతం మరియు పెన్షన్‌లను కలపవచ్చా?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"ఈ సంస్కరణ ఒక సమయంలో ఒక ఆదాయ రకాన్ని అంచనా వేస్తుంది. ఇది మిశ్రమ జీతం మరియు పెన్షన్ కేసును లెక్కించదు.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"ప్రతి పెన్షన్‌ను పెన్షన్ మోడ్ కవర్ చేస్తుందా?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"నం. ఏడాది పొడవునా 100% వద్ద తీసుకున్న అర్హత కలిగిన వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షన్ లేదా అర్హత కలిగిన AFP కోసం మాత్రమే పెన్షన్ క్రెడిట్ రూపొందించబడింది. పాక్షిక-సంవత్సరం లేదా గ్రేడెడ్ పెన్షన్ మరియు ఇతర పెన్షన్ రకాలు పరిధికి వెలుపల ఉన్నాయి.","What is the measures-zone option?":"మెజర్స్-జోన్ ఎంపిక అంటే ఏమిటి?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"ఇది ప్రచురించబడిన 18.5% సాధారణ-ఆదాయ రేటు మరియు ఫిన్‌మార్క్ మరియు లిస్టెడ్ మునిసిపాలిటీలకు NOK 45,000 ప్రత్యేక తగ్గింపును వర్తిస్తుంది. మీ మున్సిపాలిటీకి అర్హత ఉందని నిర్ధారించండి.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"నార్వే సంపద పన్ను కాలిక్యులేటర్","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"నార్వే వెల్త్ ట్యాక్స్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 — ఉచిత అంచనా","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"ఇళ్లు, షేర్లు, వ్యాపార ఆస్తులు, నగదు మరియు రుణాల నుండి 2026 నార్వేజియన్ సంపద పన్నును అంచనా వేయండి. రాష్ట్ర మరియు పురపాలక విభజన, వాల్యుయేషన్ తగ్గింపులు మరియు విలువ సున్నితత్వ పరిధిని చూడండి.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026 కోసం వ్యక్తిగత నార్వేజియన్ సంపద పన్నును అంచనా వేయండి. గృహాల కోసం అంచనా వేయబడిన మార్కెట్ విలువలు మరియు షేర్లు మరియు వ్యాపార ఆస్తుల కోసం ప్రీ-డిస్కౌంట్ ట్యాక్స్ బేస్‌లను నమోదు చేయండి. మదింపు తగ్గింపులు, రుణ సర్దుబాటు మరియు ప్రత్యేక రాష్ట్ర మరియు పురపాలక అంచనాలను చూడండి.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"అంచనా 2026 వాల్యుయేషన్ నియమాలు మరియు మీరు తక్కువ రేటును నమోదు చేయనంత వరకు గరిష్ట పురపాలక ధరను వర్తింపజేస్తుంది. రాయితీలకు ముందు పూర్తి ఆస్తి విలువల ద్వారా రుణం కేటాయించబడుతుంది; రాయితీ షేర్లు లేదా వ్యాపార ఆస్తులకు కేటాయించిన రుణం అదే తగ్గింపుతో తగ్గించబడుతుంది. ఆస్తి మదింపులు, అర్హత మరియు వ్యక్తిగత పన్ను వాస్తవాలు అధికారిక ఫలితాన్ని మార్చగలవు.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"NOK 10 మిలియన్ మార్కెట్ విలువ కలిగిన ప్రాథమిక గృహం 2026 ప్రైమరీ-హోమ్ నియమం ప్రకారం రుణం మరియు వ్యక్తిగత భత్యానికి ముందు NOK 2.5 మిలియన్ల సంపద విలువను కలిగి ఉంటుంది.","2026 tax year":"2026 పన్ను సంవత్సరం","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"ప్రాథమిక ఇంటి అంచనా మార్కెట్ విలువ (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"సెకండరీ గృహాల అంచనా మార్కెట్ విలువ (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"తగ్గింపుకు ముందు నిధులను షేర్ చేయండి మరియు షేర్ చేయండి (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"తగ్గింపుకు ముందు అర్హత కలిగిన వ్యాపార ఆస్తులు (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"బ్యాంక్ డిపాజిట్లు మరియు ఇతర ఆస్తులు (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"మొత్తం రుణం (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"మేము సంపద కోసం ఉమ్మడిగా పన్ను విధించబడతాము","Municipal rate (%)":"మున్సిపల్ రేటు (%)","Home-value comparison":"హోమ్-విలువ పోలిక","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"సంపద పన్నును అంచనా వేయండి","Export CSV":"CSVని ఎగుమతి చేయండి","Print estimate":"ముద్రణ అంచనా","Assets before discounts":"తగ్గింపులకు ముందు ఆస్తులు","Taxable asset value after discounts":"తగ్గింపుల తర్వాత పన్ను విధించదగిన ఆస్తి విలువ","Debt reduction from discounts":"డిస్కౌంట్ల నుండి రుణ తగ్గింపు","Deductible debt estimate":"తగ్గించదగిన రుణ అంచనా","Estimated net wealth":"అంచనా వేయబడిన నికర సంపద","Personal allowance":"వ్యక్తిగత భత్యం","Taxable net wealth":"పన్ను విధించదగిన నికర సంపద","Municipal wealth tax":"మున్సిపల్ సంపద పన్ను","State wealth tax":"రాష్ట్ర సంపద పన్ను","State tax, first band":"రాష్ట్ర పన్ను, మొదటి బ్యాండ్","State tax, upper band":"రాష్ట్ర పన్ను, ఎగువ బ్యాండ్","Estimated total wealth tax":"అంచనా వేయబడిన మొత్తం సంపద పన్ను","Lower home-value estimate":"తక్కువ ఇంటి విలువ అంచనా","Current-value estimate":"ప్రస్తుత-విలువ అంచనా","Higher home-value estimate":"అధిక గృహ-విలువ అంచనా","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 నియమాలు మరియు అంచనాలు","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"అంచనా మాత్రమే. ఇది అధికారిక పన్ను అంచనా లేదా పన్ను సలహా కాదు. అందుబాటులో ఉన్న మీ పన్ను రిటర్న్ విలువలను ఉపయోగించండి; మీ విషయంలో రేట్లు, అర్హత, రుణ కేటాయింపు మరియు ఆస్తి విలువలు భిన్నంగా ఉండవచ్చు.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"హోమ్‌లు: సంవత్సరం చివరిలో అంచనా మార్కెట్ విలువను నమోదు చేయండి. షేర్లు మరియు అర్హత కలిగిన వ్యాపార ఆస్తులు: 2026 తగ్గింపు కంటే ముందు విలువను నమోదు చేయండి, అది సరైన పన్ను ఆధారం అయితే తప్ప మార్కెట్ విలువ కాదు.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"భత్యం మరియు రాష్ట్ర ఎగువ థ్రెషోల్డ్ భార్యాభర్తలు, నమోదిత భాగస్వాములు లేదా అర్హత కలిగిన సహజీవనానికి మాత్రమే వారి ఉమ్మడి సంపద కోసం సంయుక్తంగా అంచనా వేయబడుతుంది.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"పురపాలక గణన ఎంచుకున్న రేటును ఉపయోగిస్తుంది, 2026 గరిష్ట 0.35%కి డిఫాల్ట్ అవుతుంది. కొన్ని మునిసిపాలిటీలు తక్కువ రేటును ఉపయోగించవచ్చు.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"సున్నితత్వం ప్రాథమిక మరియు ద్వితీయ గృహాలలో నమోదు చేయబడిన విలువలను మాత్రమే మారుస్తుంది. ఇది ఒక పోలిక, అధికారిక మూల్యాంకనం యొక్క అంచనా కాదు.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 సంపద-పన్ను భత్యం అంటే ఏమిటి?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"ప్రామాణిక థ్రెషోల్డ్ ఒక వ్యక్తికి NOK 1.9 మిలియన్ మరియు జీవిత భాగస్వాములు లేదా అర్హతగల భాగస్వాముల కోసం NOK 3.8 మిలియన్ ఉమ్మడిగా అంచనా వేయబడింది.","How is my primary home valued?":"నా ప్రాథమిక ఇంటి విలువ ఎలా ఉంది?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026 కోసం, అంచనా సంపద విలువ NOK 14 మిలియన్ మార్కెట్ విలువలో 25%, అలాగే NOK 14 మిలియన్ కంటే ఎక్కువ మొత్తంలో 70%.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"ఇది ద్వితీయ గృహానికి తగ్గింపును వర్తింపజేస్తుందా?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"నం. 2026 పట్టిక సెకండరీ హోమ్‌లకు 0% వాల్యుయేషన్ తగ్గింపును అందిస్తుంది. ఇది నమోదు చేసిన మార్కెట్ విలువను అంచనాగా ఉపయోగిస్తుంది; అధికారిక అంచనా విలువలు మారవచ్చు.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"నేను షేర్లు లేదా వ్యాపార ఆస్తులను కలిగి ఉన్నప్పుడు మినహాయింపు రుణం ఎందుకు మారుతుంది?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"నార్వేజియన్ నియమాలు పూర్తి ఆస్తి విలువలతో దామాషా ప్రకారం రుణాన్ని కేటాయిస్తాయి. వాల్యుయేషన్ తగ్గింపులతో ఆస్తులకు కేటాయించిన భాగం అదే తగ్గింపు రేటుతో తగ్గించబడుతుంది.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"మునిసిపల్ రేటు ఎల్లప్పుడూ 0.35%గా ఉందా?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"నం. 0.35% అనేది డిఫాల్ట్‌గా ఉపయోగించబడే గరిష్ట 2026. మునిసిపాలిటీ తక్కువ రేటును సెట్ చేయవచ్చు, దానిని మీరు నమోదు చేయవచ్చు.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"కాలిక్యులేటర్ ప్రతి ఆస్తి లేదా పన్ను కేసును కవర్ చేస్తుందా?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"నం. ఇది గృహాలు, షేర్లు, ఎంచుకున్న అర్హత కలిగిన వ్యాపార ఆస్తులు, నగదు మరియు మొత్తం రుణాన్ని అంచనా వేస్తుంది. విదేశీ ఆస్తులు, పెన్షన్లు, కాంప్లెక్స్ యాజమాన్యం, మినహాయింపులు మరియు ఇతర ప్రత్యేక నియమాలు మీ అంచనాను మార్చవచ్చు.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"స్విస్ QR-బిల్ జనరేటర్","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"స్విస్ QR-బిల్ జనరేటర్ — ఉచిత QR ఇన్‌వాయిస్ మేకర్","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"స్విస్ QR-బిల్లును స్థానికంగా సృష్టించండి మరియు తనిఖీ చేయండి. IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR మరియు SCOR సూచనలను ధృవీకరించండి; ఇన్వాయిస్ డేటాను అప్‌లోడ్ చేయకుండా A6 చెల్లింపు భాగాన్ని మరియు రసీదుని ముద్రించండి.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"స్విస్ QR కోడ్‌తో స్విస్ చెల్లింపు స్లిప్‌ను సృష్టించండి. మీ ఇన్‌వాయిస్ వివరాలు ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి; చెల్లింపు ప్రారంభించబడలేదు మరియు బ్యాంక్ రిజిస్టర్ ప్రశ్నించబడదు.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"సాధనం SIX స్విస్ చెల్లింపుల కోడ్ (SPC) డేటాను రూపొందిస్తుంది మరియు దాని ఫీల్డ్‌లు, ఖాతా/రిఫరెన్స్ కలయిక, IBAN చెక్ అంకెలు మరియు మద్దతు ఉన్న అక్షరాలను తనిఖీ చేస్తుంది. ఇది అవసరమైన భౌతిక పరిమాణంలో ప్రింటింగ్ కోసం చెల్లింపు భాగం మరియు రసీదుని ఫార్మాట్ చేస్తుంది.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX ఉదాహరణ: ఒక QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27-అంకెల QRR సూచన మరియు నిర్మాణాత్మక రుణదాత/ఋణదారు చిరునామాలు.","How it works":"ఇది ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Frequently asked questions":"తరచుగా అడిగే ప్రశ్నలు","Limits and accuracy":"పరిమితులు మరియు ఖచ్చితత్వం","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"ఇది స్థానిక డాక్యుమెంట్ సాధనం, బ్యాంక్ సేవ లేదా ధృవీకరణ కాదు. ఇది IBANని ఎవరు కలిగి ఉన్నారో, ఖాతా తెరిచి ఉందా లేదా చెల్లింపు ఆమోదించబడుతుందా అని నిర్ధారించలేదు. 100% / వాస్తవ పరిమాణంలో ముద్రించండి మరియు కాగితం చెల్లింపు ఆర్డర్‌ను ఉపయోగించే ముందు 100 mm చెక్ లైన్‌ను కొలవండి.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"క్రెడిటర్ IBAN లేదా QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"రుణదాతకు చెల్లించాలి","Account holder / creditor name":"ఖాతా హోల్డర్ / రుణదాత పేరు","Street or P.O. box":"వీధి లేదా పి.ఓ. పెట్టె","Building number":"భవనం సంఖ్య","Postal code":"పోస్టల్ కోడ్","Town / city":"పట్టణం / నగరం","2-letter country code":"2-అక్షరాల దేశం కోడ్","Amount (optional)":"మొత్తం (ఐచ్ఛికం)","Currency":"కరెన్సీ","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"ఐచ్ఛిక రుణగ్రహీత ద్వారా చెల్లించబడుతుంది","Debtor name":"రుణదారు పేరు","Reference type":"రిఫరెన్స్ రకం","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR సూచన · QR-IBAN మాత్రమే","Creditor reference · IBAN":"క్రెడిటర్ సూచన · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"నిర్మాణాత్మక సూచన లేదు · IBAN","Reference":"సూచన","Unstructured message":"అనిర్మిత సందేశం","Billing information (optional)":"బిల్లింగ్ సమాచారం (ఐచ్ఛికం)","Create QR-bill":"QR-బిల్‌ని సృష్టించండి","Load SIX sample":"SIX నమూనాను లోడ్ చేయండి","Clear form":"ఫారమ్‌ను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Check QR payload":"QR పేలోడ్‌ని తనిఖీ చేయండి","Download payment data":"చెల్లింపు డేటాను డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి","Download QR SVG":"QR SVGని డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి","Print / save as PDF":"PDFగా ముద్రించండి / సేవ్ చేయండి","Read a QR Code image":"QR కోడ్ చిత్రాన్ని చదవండి","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG లేదా JPEGని ఎంచుకోండి","Read image locally":"చిత్రాన్ని స్థానికంగా చదవండి","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"స్విస్ QR కోడ్ చెల్లింపు డేటాను అతికించండి","Invoice details":"ఇన్‌వాయిస్ వివరాలు","QR-bill preview":"QR-బిల్ ప్రివ్యూ","Receipt":"రసీదు","Payment part":"చెల్లింపు భాగం","Payable to":"వీరికి చెల్లించాలి","Payable by":"చెల్లించదగినవారు","Account":"ఖాతా","Additional information":"అదనపు సమాచారం","Currency / amount":"కరెన్సీ / మొత్తం","Print scale check · 100 mm":"ప్రింట్ స్కేల్ చెక్ · 100 మిమీ","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · స్విస్ QR-బిల్ ప్రమాణం","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-బిల్ సిద్ధంగా ఉంది. ఈ పరికరంలో వివరాలు అలాగే ఉన్నాయి.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"కొన్ని ఫీల్డ్‌లను తనిఖీ చేయాలి. హైలైట్ చేసిన సమాచారాన్ని సమీక్షించండి.","Reading this image on your device…":"మీ పరికరంలో ఈ చిత్రాన్ని చదువుతోంది...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"స్విస్ QR కోడ్ స్థానికంగా చదవబడింది మరియు తనిఖీ చేయబడింది.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"ఆ చిత్రంలో చదవగలిగే QR కోడ్ కనుగొనబడలేదు.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"స్విస్ QR కోడ్ డేటా మద్దతు ఉన్న ఫీల్డ్‌లకు చెల్లుబాటు అవుతుంది.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"డేటా చెల్లుబాటు అయ్యే స్విస్ QR కోడ్ చెల్లింపు పేలోడ్ కాదు.","Form and preview cleared.":"ఫారమ్ మరియు ప్రివ్యూ క్లియర్ చేయబడ్డాయి.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX నమూనా లోడ్ చేయబడింది. నిజమైన ఉపయోగం ముందు దాని నమూనా వివరాలను భర్తీ చేయండి.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"ముందుగా చెల్లుబాటు అయ్యే QR-బిల్‌ని సృష్టించండి లేదా చదవండి.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB లేదా అంతకంటే తక్కువ PNG లేదా JPEGని ఎంచుకోండి.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"స్థానిక QR రీడర్ లోడ్ కాలేదు. బదులుగా మీరు చెల్లింపు డేటాను అతికించవచ్చు.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"ఏ IBAN మరియు సూచన కలయికలు అనుమతించబడతాయి?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN QRR సూచనను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది. ఒక సాధారణ స్విస్ IBAN SCORను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది లేదా నిర్మాణాత్మక సూచన లేదు (NON). QRR అనేది CHF ఇన్‌వాయిస్‌ల కోసం మాత్రమే.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"ఖాతా ఉనికిలో ఉందని లేదా రుణదాతకు చెందినదని ఇది తనిఖీ చేస్తుందా?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"నం. ఇది ఫార్మాట్ మరియు IBAN చెక్‌సమ్‌ను మాత్రమే తనిఖీ చేస్తుంది. ఇది బ్యాంక్ లేదా ఖాతా రిజిస్ట్రీని సంప్రదించదు.","Can I print this at any scale?":"నేను దీన్ని ఏ స్థాయిలోనైనా ముద్రించవచ్చా?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"కాగితపు చెల్లింపు ఆర్డర్ కోసం, 100% / వాస్తవ పరిమాణంలో ముద్రించండి. చెల్లింపు భాగం తప్పనిసరిగా A6 ల్యాండ్‌స్కేప్ (148 × 105 మిమీ) అయి ఉండాలి; 100 mm లైన్‌ను రూలర్‌తో తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"సాధనం ఇన్‌వాయిస్ డేటాను ఎక్కడికైనా పంపుతుందా?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"నం. మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో జనరేషన్ మరియు ఇమేజ్ రీడింగ్ జరుగుతుంది. ఖాతా లేదా చెల్లింపు సేవ ఉపయోగించబడదు.","Grade Scale Generator":"గ్రేడ్ స్కేల్ జనరేటర్","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"గ్రేడ్ స్కేల్ జనరేటర్ — ఉచిత పాయింట్ల నుండి గ్రేడ్ సాధనం","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"మీ స్వంత థ్రెషోల్డ్‌లతో పాయింట్లను శాతాలు మరియు గ్రేడ్‌లుగా మార్చండి. పూర్తి స్థాయిని ప్రివ్యూ చేయండి, కాపీ చేయండి లేదా ఎగుమతి చేయండి మరియు గ్రేడింగ్ షీట్‌ను ప్రింట్ చేయండి.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"పరీక్ష లేదా అసైన్‌మెంట్ కోసం పారదర్శక గ్రేడింగ్ స్కేల్‌ను రూపొందించండి. ప్రతి గ్రేడ్‌కు గరిష్ట పాయింట్లు మరియు కనిష్ట శాతాన్ని సెట్ చేయండి; స్కేల్ పాఠశాల లేదా జాతీయ గ్రేడింగ్ నియమాన్ని ఊహించదు.","Points earned":"పాయింట్లు సంపాదించారు","Maximum points":"గరిష్ట పాయింట్లు","Top grade label":"టాప్ గ్రేడ్ లేబుల్","Top grade starts at (%)":"అత్యున్నత గ్రేడ్ (%) వద్ద ప్రారంభమవుతుంది","Middle grade label":"మిడిల్ గ్రేడ్ లేబుల్","Middle grade starts at (%)":"మిడిల్ గ్రేడ్ (%) వద్ద ప్రారంభమవుతుంది","Lowest grade label":"తక్కువ గ్రేడ్ లేబుల్","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"తక్కువ గ్రేడ్ (%) వద్ద ప్రారంభమవుతుంది","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"50-పాయింట్ గరిష్టంగా, 45 పాయింట్లు 90%కి సమానం. మీ అనుకూల పరిమితులు గ్రేడ్ లేబుల్‌ని నిర్ణయిస్తాయి.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"ఇది అధికారిక గ్రేడింగ్ విధానాన్ని ఉపయోగిస్తుందా?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"నం. మీరు థ్రెషోల్డ్‌లను సెట్ చేసారు. పాఠశాల, కోర్సు మరియు దేశం వారీగా గ్రేడింగ్ వ్యవస్థలు విభిన్నంగా ఉంటాయి; మీరు ఉపయోగించాలనుకుంటున్న స్కేల్‌ని నిర్ధారించండి.","Can I export the grading bands?":"నేను గ్రేడింగ్ బ్యాండ్‌లను ఎగుమతి చేయవచ్చా?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"అవును. ప్రదర్శించబడిన బ్యాండ్‌లను CSV ఫైల్‌గా ఎగుమతి చేయండి లేదా స్కేల్‌ను ప్రింట్ చేయండి."},"th":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณการจ่ายวันหยุดนอร์เวย์","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"เครื่องคำนวณการจ่ายเงินช่วงวันหยุดของนอร์เวย์ - ประมาณการเบื้องต้นฟรี","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"ประมาณการค่าทำงานในวันหยุดของนอร์เวย์จากเกณฑ์การจ่ายในวันหยุดของคุณ เปรียบเทียบอัตราทั่วไปสำหรับการลามาตรฐาน สัปดาห์ที่ 5 และพนักงานอายุ 60 ขึ้นไป","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"กรอก feriepengegrunnlag ที่แสดงบนสลิปเงินเดือนของคุณ เปรียบเทียบอัตราการจ่ายรวมวันหยุดโดยรวมของนอร์เวย์สำหรับอายุของคุณและระยะเวลาวันหยุดที่ตกลงกัน","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"พื้นฐานการจ่ายวันหยุด (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"ฉันเป็น 60 ขึ้นไปในปีวันหยุด","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"ข้อตกลงของฉันรวมสัปดาห์วันหยุดที่ห้าด้วย","Estimated holiday pay":"ค่าชดเชยวันหยุดโดยประมาณ","Rate used":"อัตราที่ใช้","Basis used":"พื้นฐานที่ใช้","Reset choices":"รีเซ็ตตัวเลือก","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"ประมาณการทั้งหมดเท่านั้น การจ่ายเงินในวันหยุดเป็นรายได้ที่ต้องเสียภาษี การหักภาษี ณ ที่จ่ายอาจแตกต่างกันไปตามบุคคลและเงินเดือน","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"ด้วยพื้นฐาน NOK 500,000 10.2% จะให้ NOK 51,000 ก่อนที่จะมีการปรับปรุงเงินเดือนใดๆ","Which rate should I use?":"ควรใช้เรทไหน?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"การประมาณการใช้อัตราขั้นต่ำทั่วไป: 10.2% หรือ 12% ในสัปดาห์ที่ห้า 12.5% หรือ 14.3% สำหรับพนักงานที่มีอายุ 60 ขึ้นไป ข้อตกลงของคุณอาจให้มากกว่านี้","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"นี่คือจำนวนเงินที่ชำระหลังหักภาษีหรือไม่","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"No. นี่เป็นการประมาณการเบื้องต้น การจ่ายเงินในวันหยุดเป็นรายได้ที่ต้องเสียภาษี การหักภาษี ณ ที่จ่ายขึ้นอยู่กับสถานการณ์และเงินเดือนของคุณ","What belongs in the basis?":"มีพื้นฐานอะไรบ้าง?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"ใช้ feriepengegrunnlag บนสลิปเงินเดือนหรือใบแจ้งยอดประจำปีของคุณ การคืนเงินบางส่วนและการชำระเงินอื่น ๆ ไม่รวมอยู่ในกฎ","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณภาษีเงินได้ของนอร์เวย์","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"เครื่องคำนวณภาษีนอร์เวย์ 2026 - ประมาณการเงินเดือนและเงินบำนาญฟรี","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"ประมาณการ 2026 ภาษีเงินได้ของนอร์เวย์จากเงินเดือนมาตรฐานหรือเงินบำนาญวัยชราเต็มปี ดูองค์ประกอบภาษีรายปีและรายเดือน และเปรียบเทียบสองสถานการณ์","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"ประมาณการ 2026 ภาษีเงินได้ของนอร์เวย์สำหรับเงินเดือนผู้มีถิ่นที่อยู่มาตรฐานหรือเงินบำนาญชราภาพเต็มปี ดูองค์ประกอบภาษีหลักและเปรียบเทียบสถานการณ์รายได้รวมสองสถานการณ์","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"เครื่องคิดเลขใช้การหักเงินมาตรฐาน 2026 วงภาษีวงเล็บแบบก้าวหน้าห้าวง และเงินสมทบประกันแห่งชาติ โหมดเงินบำนาญจะรวมเครดิตภาษีเงินบำนาญสำหรับทั้งปีเท่านั้น, 100% ที่เข้าเกณฑ์เงินบำนาญวัยชราหรือ AFP ที่มีสิทธิ์ มันทำงานทั้งหมดในเบราว์เซอร์นี้","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"สำหรับเงินเดือน NOK 600,000 ให้เปรียบเทียบภาษีรายปีโดยประมาณและค่าจ้างสุทธิกับเงินเดือนอื่นหรือเงินบำนาญทั้งปี","Tax year":"ปีภาษี","Scenario":"สถานการณ์จำลอง","Salary":"เงินเดือน","Full-year old-age pension":"บำนาญชราภาพเต็มปี","Gross annual income (NOK)":"รายได้รวมต่อปี (NOK)","Tax zone":"เขตภาษี","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"อัตรามาตรฐาน (ส่วนใหญ่ของนอร์เวย์)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / ระบุเขตเทศบาลตามเขตมาตรการ","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"การประมาณการเงินบำนาญจะถือว่าเงินบำนาญวัยชราที่มีสิทธิ์หรือ AFP ที่ 100% สำหรับทุกเดือน 12 โดยไม่มีรายได้อื่น","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"การประมาณการเงินเดือนจะถือว่ามีถิ่นที่อยู่ทางภาษีนอร์เวย์ตามปกติ อายุ 17–69 และไม่มีรายได้อื่น","Compare two scenarios":"เปรียบเทียบสองสถานการณ์","Scenario 1":"สถานการณ์จำลอง 1","Scenario 2":"สถานการณ์จำลอง 2","Calculate estimate":"คำนวณประมาณการ","Estimated tax per year":"ภาษีโดยประมาณต่อปี","Average tax per month":"ภาษีเฉลี่ยต่อเดือน","Estimated net per year":"ประมาณการสุทธิต่อปี","Average net per month":"สุทธิเฉลี่ยต่อเดือน","Tax on ordinary income":"ภาษีจากรายได้ปกติ","Bracket tax":"วงเล็บภาษี","National insurance contribution":"เงินสมทบประกันสังคม","Pension tax credit":"เครดิตภาษีบำนาญ","Estimated effective rate":"อัตราประสิทธิผลโดยประมาณ","Standard deduction base":"ฐานหักมาตรฐาน","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"อัตราและเกณฑ์สำหรับปีรายได้ 2026","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"ประมาณการเท่านั้น ไม่ใช่การคำนวณภาษีหรือบัตรภาษีอย่างเป็นทางการ รายได้อื่นๆ การหักเงิน อายุ ถิ่นที่อยู่ ระดับบำนาญ และสถานการณ์ส่วนบุคคลสามารถเปลี่ยนแปลงผลลัพธ์ได้","Reset values":"รีเซ็ตค่า","Example":"ตัวอย่าง","How the estimate works":"การประมาณการทำงานอย่างไร","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"นี่คือใบกำกับภาษีหรือบัตรภาษีหัก ณ ที่จ่ายที่ถูกต้องของฉันใช่ไหม","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"No. ประมาณภาษีประจำปี 2026 มาตรฐาน บัตรภาษี การประเมินขั้นสุดท้าย และการหักภาษี ณ ที่จ่ายอาจแตกต่างกันเนื่องจากรายได้ทั้งหมด การหักเงิน และสถานการณ์ของคุณ","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"ขอรวมเงินเดือนและบำนาญที่นี่ได้ไหม?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"เวอร์ชันนี้ประมาณรายได้ครั้งละหนึ่งประเภท ไม่ได้คำนวณกรณีเงินเดือนและบำนาญแบบผสม","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"โหมดบำนาญครอบคลุมทุกบำนาญหรือไม่?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"No. เครดิตเงินบำนาญได้รับการจำลองเฉพาะสำหรับเงินบำนาญวัยชราที่มีคุณสมบัติเหมาะสมหรือ AFP ที่มีสิทธิ์ซึ่งได้รับที่ 100% ตลอดทั้งปี เงินบำนาญบางส่วนหรือแบบแบ่งเกรด และเงินบำนาญประเภทอื่นๆ อยู่นอกขอบเขต","What is the measures-zone option?":"ตัวเลือกโซนการวัดคืออะไร?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"ใช้อัตรารายได้ปกติ 18.5% ที่เผยแพร่และการหักลดหย่อนพิเศษ NOK 45,000 สำหรับ Finnmark และเทศบาลที่ระบุไว้ ยืนยันว่าเทศบาลของคุณมีคุณสมบัติครบถ้วน","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณภาษีความมั่งคั่งของนอร์เวย์","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"เครื่องคำนวณภาษีความมั่งคั่งของนอร์เวย์ 2026 — ประมาณการฟรี","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"ประมาณการ 2026 ภาษีความมั่งคั่งของนอร์เวย์จากบ้าน หุ้น ทรัพย์สินทางธุรกิจ เงินสด และหนี้ ดูการแบ่งแยกของรัฐและเทศบาล ส่วนลดการประเมินค่า และช่วงความอ่อนไหวของค่า","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"ประมาณการภาษีความมั่งคั่งส่วนบุคคลของนอร์เวย์สำหรับ 2026 ป้อนมูลค่าตลาดโดยประมาณสำหรับบ้านและฐานภาษีก่อนหักส่วนลดสำหรับหุ้นและสินทรัพย์ทางธุรกิจ ดูส่วนลดการประเมินมูลค่า การปรับหนี้ และการประมาณการแยกของรัฐและเทศบาล","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"การประมาณการจะใช้กฎการประเมินมูลค่า 2026 และอัตราเทศบาลสูงสุด เว้นแต่คุณจะป้อนอัตราที่ต่ำกว่า หนี้จะถูกปันส่วนตามมูลค่าสินทรัพย์ทั้งหมดก่อนส่วนลด หนี้ที่มอบหมายให้กับหุ้นลดราคาหรือสินทรัพย์ทางธุรกิจจะลดลงด้วยส่วนลดเดียวกัน การประเมินมูลค่าทรัพย์สิน คุณสมบัติ และข้อเท็จจริงด้านภาษีส่วนบุคคลสามารถเปลี่ยนแปลงผลลัพธ์อย่างเป็นทางการได้","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"บ้านหลักที่มีมูลค่าตลาด NOK 10 ล้าน มีมูลค่าทรัพย์สินโดยประมาณที่ NOK 2.5 ล้าน ภายใต้กฎบ้านหลัก 2026 ก่อนก่อหนี้และเบี้ยเลี้ยงส่วนบุคคล","2026 tax year":"2026 ปีภาษี","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"มูลค่าตลาดประเมินบ้านหลัก (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"บ้านเดี่ยว มูลค่าตลาดประมาณ (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"แบ่งปันและแบ่งปันกองทุนก่อนส่วนลด (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"ทรัพย์สินทางธุรกิจที่มีสิทธิ์ก่อนส่วนลด (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"เงินฝากธนาคารและทรัพย์สินอื่นๆ (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"หนี้รวม (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"เราร่วมกันเก็บภาษีเพื่อความมั่งคั่ง","Municipal rate (%)":"อัตราเทศบาล (%)","Home-value comparison":"การเปรียบเทียบมูลค่าบ้าน","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"ประมาณการภาษีความมั่งคั่ง","Export CSV":"ส่งออก CSV","Print estimate":"พิมพ์ประมาณการ","Assets before discounts":"สินทรัพย์ก่อนส่วนลด","Taxable asset value after discounts":"มูลค่าสินทรัพย์ที่ต้องเสียภาษีหลังหักส่วนลด","Debt reduction from discounts":"ลดหนี้จากส่วนลด","Deductible debt estimate":"ประมาณการหนี้ลดหย่อนภาษีได้","Estimated net wealth":"ประมาณการความมั่งคั่งสุทธิ","Personal allowance":"เบี้ยเลี้ยงส่วนตัว","Taxable net wealth":"ความมั่งคั่งสุทธิที่ต้องเสียภาษี","Municipal wealth tax":"ภาษีทรัพย์สินเทศบาล","State wealth tax":"ภาษีความมั่งคั่งของรัฐ","State tax, first band":"ภาษีของรัฐ แบนด์แรก","State tax, upper band":"ภาษีของรัฐ แบนด์บน","Estimated total wealth tax":"ประมาณการภาษีความมั่งคั่งทั้งหมด","Lower home-value estimate":"ประมาณการมูลค่าบ้านต่ำกว่า","Current-value estimate":"ค่าประมาณปัจจุบัน","Higher home-value estimate":"ราคาประเมินบ้านสูงขึ้น","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 กฎและสมมติฐาน","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"ประมาณการเท่านั้น นี่ไม่ใช่การประเมินภาษีอย่างเป็นทางการหรือคำแนะนำด้านภาษี ใช้มูลค่าการคืนภาษีของคุณหากมี อัตรา คุณสมบัติ การจัดสรรหนี้ และมูลค่าทรัพย์สินอาจแตกต่างกันในกรณีของคุณ","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"บ้าน: ระบุมูลค่าตลาดโดยประมาณ ณ สิ้นปี หุ้นและสินทรัพย์ทางธุรกิจที่มีสิทธิ์: ป้อนมูลค่าก่อนส่วนลด 2026 ไม่ใช่มูลค่าตลาด เว้นแต่จะเป็นเกณฑ์ภาษีที่ถูกต้อง","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"เบี้ยเลี้ยงและเกณฑ์สูงสุดของรัฐจะเพิ่มเป็นสองเท่าสำหรับคู่สมรส หุ้นส่วนที่ลงทะเบียน หรือผู้อยู่ร่วมกันที่มีคุณสมบัติตามที่กำหนด ซึ่งประเมินร่วมกันสำหรับความมั่งคั่งรวมกัน","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"การคำนวณเทศบาลใช้อัตราที่เลือก โดยค่าเริ่มต้นคือ 2026 สูงสุด 0.35% เทศบาลบางแห่งอาจใช้อัตราที่ต่ำกว่า","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"ความไวจะเปลี่ยนเฉพาะค่าที่ป้อนของบ้านหลักและรองเท่านั้น เป็นการเปรียบเทียบ ไม่ใช่การคาดการณ์การประเมินมูลค่าอย่างเป็นทางการ","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 เผื่อภาษีความมั่งคั่งคืออะไร","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"เกณฑ์มาตรฐานคือ NOK 1.9 ล้านสำหรับหนึ่งคน และ NOK 3.8 ล้านสำหรับคู่สมรสหรือหุ้นส่วนที่มีคุณสมบัติผ่านการประเมินร่วมกัน","How is my primary home valued?":"บ้านหลักของฉันมีมูลค่าอย่างไร?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"สำหรับ 2026 มูลค่าความมั่งคั่งโดยประมาณคือ 25% ของมูลค่าตลาดสูงถึง NOK 14 ล้าน บวกด้วย 70% ของจำนวนเงินที่สูงกว่า NOK 14 ล้าน","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"นี่เป็นส่วนลดสำหรับบ้านหลังที่สองหรือไม่?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"No. ตาราง 2026 ให้ส่วนลดการประเมินค่า 0% แก่บ้านหลังที่สอง ใช้มูลค่าตลาดที่ป้อนเป็นค่าประมาณ ค่าประเมินอย่างเป็นทางการอาจแตกต่างกัน","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"เหตุใดหนี้ที่หักลดหย่อนจึงเปลี่ยนแปลงเมื่อฉันเป็นเจ้าของหุ้นหรือสินทรัพย์ทางธุรกิจ","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"กฎของนอร์เวย์จัดสรรหนี้ตามสัดส่วนตามมูลค่าทรัพย์สินทั้งหมด ส่วนที่กำหนดให้สินทรัพย์ที่มีส่วนลดจากการตีราคาจะลดลงด้วยอัตราคิดลดเดียวกัน","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"อัตราเทศบาลเป็น 0.35% เสมอหรือไม่","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"No. 0.35% คือค่าสูงสุดของ 2026 ที่ใช้เป็นค่าเริ่มต้น เทศบาลอาจกำหนดอัตราที่ต่ำกว่าซึ่งคุณสามารถป้อนได้","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"เครื่องคิดเลขครอบคลุมทรัพย์สินหรือภาษีทุกกรณีหรือไม่?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"No. โดยจะประมาณการบ้าน หุ้น สินทรัพย์ทางธุรกิจที่ได้รับการคัดเลือก เงินสด และหนี้สินทั้งหมด สินทรัพย์ต่างประเทศ เงินบำนาญ ความเป็นเจ้าของที่ซับซ้อน การยกเว้น และกฎพิเศษอื่นๆ อาจเปลี่ยนแปลงการประเมินของคุณ","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"เครื่องสร้างบิล QR ของสวิส","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"เครื่องสร้างบิล QR ของสวิส - เครื่องสร้างใบแจ้งหนี้ QR ฟรี","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"สร้างและตรวจสอบใบเรียกเก็บเงิน QR ของสวิสในเครื่อง ตรวจสอบการอ้างอิง IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR และ SCOR พิมพ์ส่วนการชำระเงินและใบเสร็จรับเงิน A6 โดยไม่ต้องอัปโหลดข้อมูลใบแจ้งหนี้","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"สร้างสลิปการชำระเงินของสวิสด้วย Swiss QR Code รายละเอียดใบแจ้งหนี้ของคุณจะอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ไม่มีการชำระเงินและไม่มีการสอบถามทะเบียนธนาคาร","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"เครื่องมือสร้างข้อมูล SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) และตรวจสอบฟิลด์ บัญชี/ชุดข้อมูลอ้างอิง หมายเลขตรวจสอบ IBAN และอักขระที่รองรับ โดยจะจัดรูปแบบส่วนการชำระเงินและใบเสร็จรับเงินสำหรับการพิมพ์ตามขนาดทางกายภาพที่ต้องการ\nตัวอย่าง","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, การอ้างอิง QRR หลัก 27 และที่อยู่เจ้าหนี้/ลูกหนี้ที่มีโครงสร้าง","How it works":"มันทำงานอย่างไร","Frequently asked questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","Limits and accuracy":"ข้อจำกัดและความแม่นยำ","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"นี่คือเครื่องมือจัดทำเอกสารในท้องถิ่น ไม่ใช่บริการหรือการรับรองจากธนาคาร ไม่สามารถยืนยันได้ว่าใครเป็นเจ้าของ IBAN ไม่ว่าบัญชีจะเปิดอยู่หรือไม่ หรือการชำระเงินจะได้รับการยอมรับหรือไม่ พิมพ์ที่ 100% / ขนาดจริงและวัดเส้นตรวจสอบ 100 มม. ก่อนใช้คำสั่งชำระเงินกระดาษ","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"เจ้าหนี้ IBAN หรือ QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"จ่ายให้กับ · เจ้าหนี้","Account holder / creditor name":"ชื่อเจ้าของบัญชี/เจ้าหนี้","Street or P.O. box":"ถนนหรือตู้ไปรษณีย์ กล่อง","Building number":"เลขที่อาคาร","Postal code":"รหัสไปรษณีย์","Town / city":"เมือง/เมือง","2-letter country code":"2-รหัสประเทศที่เป็นตัวอักษร","Amount (optional)":"จำนวน (ไม่บังคับ)","Currency":"สกุลเงิน","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"ชำระโดย · ลูกหนี้ทางเลือก","Debtor name":"ชื่อลูกหนี้","Reference type":"ประเภทอ้างอิง","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"การอ้างอิง QR · QR-IBAN เท่านั้น","Creditor reference · IBAN":"ข้อมูลอ้างอิงเจ้าหนี้ · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"ไม่มีการอ้างอิงแบบมีโครงสร้าง · IBAN","Reference":"ข้อมูลอ้างอิง","Unstructured message":"ข้อความไม่มีโครงสร้าง","Billing information (optional)":"ข้อมูลการเรียกเก็บเงิน (ไม่บังคับ)","Create QR-bill":"สร้าง QR-bill","Load SIX sample":"โหลดตัวอย่าง SIX","Clear form":"ฟอร์มใส","Check QR payload":"ตรวจสอบเพย์โหลด QR","Download payment data":"ดาวน์โหลดข้อมูลการชำระเงิน","Download QR SVG":"ดาวน์โหลด QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"พิมพ์/บันทึกเป็น PDF","Read a QR Code image":"อ่านภาพ QR Code","Choose PNG or JPEG":"เลือก PNG หรือ JPEG","Read image locally":"อ่านภาพในเครื่อง","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"วางข้อมูลการชำระเงิน Swiss QR Code","Invoice details":"รายละเอียดใบแจ้งหนี้","QR-bill preview":"ตัวอย่างบิล QR","Receipt":"ใบเสร็จรับเงิน","Payment part":"ส่วนการชำระเงิน","Payable to":"สั่งจ่ายได้ที่","Payable by":"ชำระโดย","Account":"บัญชี","Additional information":"ข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม","Currency / amount":"สกุลเงิน/จำนวน","Print scale check · 100 mm":"ตรวจสอบขนาดการพิมพ์ · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · มาตรฐาน QR-bill ของสวิส","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-บิลพร้อมแล้ว รายละเอียดยังคงอยู่ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"บางฟิลด์จำเป็นต้องตรวจสอบ ตรวจสอบข้อมูลที่ไฮไลต์","Reading this image on your device…":"กำลังอ่านภาพนี้บนอุปกรณ์ของคุณ...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Swiss QR Code อ่านและตรวจสอบในเครื่อง","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"ไม่พบ QR Code ที่สามารถอ่านได้ในภาพนั้น","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"ข้อมูล Swiss QR Code ใช้ได้กับฟิลด์ที่รองรับ","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"ข้อมูลนี้ไม่ใช่เพย์โหลดการชำระเงินของ Swiss QR Code ที่ถูกต้อง","Form and preview cleared.":"ล้างแบบฟอร์มและตัวอย่างแล้ว","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"โหลดตัวอย่าง SIX แล้ว เปลี่ยนรายละเอียดตัวอย่างก่อนใช้งานจริง","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"สร้างหรืออ่าน QR-bill ที่ถูกต้องก่อน","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"เลือก PNG หรือ JPEG ของ 10 MiB หรือน้อยกว่า","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"ไม่สามารถโหลดเครื่องอ่าน QR ในเครื่องได้ คุณสามารถวางข้อมูลการชำระเงินแทนได้","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"IBAN และชุดค่าอ้างอิงใดที่ได้รับอนุญาต","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN ใช้การอ้างอิง QRR IBAN ของสวิสปกติใช้ SCOR หรือไม่มีการอ้างอิงแบบมีโครงสร้าง (NON) QRR ใช้สำหรับใบแจ้งหนี้ CHF เท่านั้น","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"สิ่งนี้จะตรวจสอบว่าบัญชีมีอยู่หรือเป็นของเจ้าหนี้หรือไม่?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"No. จะตรวจสอบรูปแบบและผลรวมตรวจสอบ IBAN เท่านั้น มันไม่ได้ติดต่อกับธนาคารหรือการลงทะเบียนบัญชี","Can I print this at any scale?":"ฉันสามารถพิมพ์ได้ทุกขนาดหรือไม่?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"สำหรับการสั่งชำระเงินกระดาษ ให้พิมพ์ที่ 100% / ขนาดจริง ส่วนการชำระเงินต้องเป็นแนวนอน A6 (148 × 105 mm) ตรวจสอบเส้น 100 มม. ด้วยไม้บรรทัด","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"เครื่องมือส่งข้อมูลใบแจ้งหนี้ไปที่ใดก็ได้หรือไม่?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"No. การสร้างและการอ่านรูปภาพเกิดขึ้นในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ ไม่มีการใช้บริการบัญชีหรือการชำระเงิน","Grade Scale Generator":"เครื่องกำเนิดสเกลเกรด","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"ตัวสร้างมาตราส่วนเกรด — เครื่องมือให้คะแนนต่อเกรดฟรี","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"เปลี่ยนคะแนนเป็นเปอร์เซ็นต์และเกรดตามเกณฑ์ของคุณเอง ดูตัวอย่างขนาดเต็ม คัดลอกหรือส่งออก และพิมพ์ใบให้คะแนน","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"สร้างระดับการให้คะแนนที่โปร่งใสสำหรับการสอบหรือการมอบหมายงาน กำหนดคะแนนสูงสุดและเปอร์เซ็นต์ขั้นต่ำสำหรับแต่ละเกรด มาตราส่วนไม่ถือว่าโรงเรียนหรือกฎการให้เกรดระดับชาติ","Points earned":"คะแนนที่ได้รับ","Maximum points":"คะแนนสูงสุด","Top grade label":"ป้ายเกรดดี","Top grade starts at (%)":"เกรดท็อปเริ่มต้นที่ (%)","Middle grade label":"ป้ายเกรดกลาง","Middle grade starts at (%)":"เกรดกลางเริ่มต้นที่ (%)","Lowest grade label":"ฉลากเกรดต่ำสุด","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"เกรดต่ำสุดเริ่มต้นที่ (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"ด้วยจุดสูงสุด 50 จุด 45 จะเท่ากับ 90% เกณฑ์ที่คุณกำหนดเองจะกำหนดป้ายกำกับเกรด","Does this use an official grading policy?":"สิ่งนี้ใช้นโยบายการให้เกรดอย่างเป็นทางการหรือไม่","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"No. คุณกำหนดเกณฑ์ ระบบการให้เกรดจะแตกต่างกันไปตามโรงเรียน หลักสูตร และประเทศ ยืนยันเครื่องชั่งที่คุณคาดว่าจะใช้","Can I export the grading bands?":"ฉันสามารถส่งออกแถบการจัดเกรดได้หรือไม่","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"ใช่ ส่งออกแถบที่แสดงเป็นไฟล์ CSV หรือพิมพ์มาตราส่วน"},"tl":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Kalkulador ng bayad sa bakasyon sa Norway","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Libreng Gross Estimate","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Tantyahin ang Norwegian holiday pay mula sa iyong holiday-pay na batayan. Ihambing ang mga karaniwang rate para sa karaniwang bakasyon, ikalimang linggo at mga empleyadong may edad na 60 o higit pa.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Ilagay ang feriepengegrunnlag na ipinapakita sa iyong payslip. Ikumpara ang karaniwang Norwegian na gross holiday-pay rate para sa iyong edad at napagkasunduang haba ng holiday.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Base sa holiday-pay (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Ako ay 60 o mas matanda sa taon ng kapaskuhan","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Kasama sa aking kasunduan ang ikalimang linggo ng holiday","Estimated holiday pay":"Tinantyang holiday pay","Rate used":"Nagamit na rate","Basis used":"Ginamit na batayan","Reset choices":"I-reset ang mga pagpipilian","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Gross na pagtatantya lang. Ang holiday pay ay nabubuwisan na kita; Ang pagpigil ng buwis ay maaaring mag-iba ayon sa tao at payroll.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Na may NOK 500,000 na batayan, binibigyan ng 10.2% ang NOK ng 51,000 bago ang anumang pagsasaayos ng payroll.","Which rate should I use?":"Aling rate ang dapat kong gamitin?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Gumagamit ang pagtatantya ng mga karaniwang minimum na rate: 10.2% o 12% na may ikalimang linggo; 12.5% o 14.3% para sa mga empleyadong may edad na 60 o higit pa. Ang iyong kasunduan ay maaaring magbigay ng higit pa.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Ito ba ang halagang binayaran pagkatapos ng buwis?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Hindi. Ito ay isang kabuuang pagtatantya. Ang holiday pay ay nabubuwisan na kita; ang pag-withhold ay depende sa iyong mga kalagayan at payroll.","What belongs in the basis?":"Ano ang kabilang sa batayan?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Gamitin ang feriepengegrunnlag sa iyong payslip o taunang statement. Ang ilang mga reimbursement at iba pang mga pagbabayad ay hindi kasama ng mga panuntunan.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Kalkulador ng buwis sa kita sa Norway","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Libreng Salary & Pension Estimate","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Tantyahin ang 2026 Norwegian income tax sa karaniwang suweldo o full-year old-age pension. Tingnan ang taunang at buwanang netong suweldo, mga bahagi ng buwis at paghambingin ang dalawang sitwasyon.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Tantyahin ang 2026 Norwegian income tax para sa karaniwang suweldo ng residente o isang buong taong gulang na pensiyon. Tingnan ang mga pangunahing bahagi ng buwis at paghambingin ang dalawang senaryo ng kabuuang kita.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Inilalapat ng calculator ang mga karaniwang pagbabawas ng 2026, ang limang progresibong bracket-tax band at mga kontribusyon sa pambansang insurance. Kasama sa pension mode ang pension tax credit para lamang sa isang buong taon, 100% na kwalipikadong pensiyon sa katandaan o karapat-dapat na AFP. Ito ay ganap na tumatakbo sa browser na ito.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Para sa suweldong NOK 600,000, ihambing ang tinantyang taunang buwis at netong suweldo sa isa pang suweldo o isang buong taong halaga ng pensiyon.","Tax year":"Taon ng buwis","Scenario":"Sitwasyon","Salary":"Suweldo","Full-year old-age pension":"Buong taong gulang na pensiyon","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Kabuuang taunang kita (NOK)","Tax zone":"Sona ng buwis","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Karaniwang rate (karamihan sa Norway)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / nakalistang measures-zone na munisipyo","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Ipinagpapalagay ng pagtatantya ng pensiyon ang karapat-dapat na old-age na pensiyon o AFP sa 100% para sa lahat ng 12 na buwan, na walang ibang kita.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Isinasaalang-alang ng pagtatantya ng suweldo ang ordinaryong Norwegian tax residency, edad 17–69 at walang ibang kita.","Compare two scenarios":"Ihambing ang dalawang senaryo","Scenario 1":"Sitwasyon 1","Scenario 2":"Sitwasyon 2","Calculate estimate":"Kalkulahin ang pagtatantya","Estimated tax per year":"Tinantyang buwis bawat taon","Average tax per month":"Average na buwis bawat buwan","Estimated net per year":"Tinantyang neto bawat taon","Average net per month":"Average net bawat buwan","Tax on ordinary income":"Buwis sa ordinaryong kita","Bracket tax":"Buwis ayon sa antas","National insurance contribution":"Pambansang kontribusyon sa insurance","Pension tax credit":"Kredito sa buwis sa pensiyon","Estimated effective rate":"Tinantyang epektibong rate","Standard deduction base":"Karaniwang deduction base","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Ang mga rate at threshold ay para sa taon ng kita na 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Tantyahin lamang, hindi isang opisyal na pagkalkula ng buwis o tax card. Maaaring baguhin ng ibang kita, mga kaltas, edad, paninirahan, grado ng pensiyon at mga personal na kalagayan ang resulta.","Reset values":"I-reset ang mga value","Example":"Halimbawa","How the estimate works":"Paano gumagana ang pagtatantya","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Ito ba ang aking eksaktong tax bill o tax-card withholding?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Hindi. Tinatantya nito ang karaniwang 2026 taunang buwis. Ang isang tax card, panghuling pagtatasa at pagpigil ay maaaring mag-iba dahil sa iyong buong kita, mga pagbabawas at mga pangyayari.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Pwede ko bang pagsamahin ang suweldo at pensiyon dito?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Tinatantya ng bersyong ito ang isang uri ng kita sa bawat pagkakataon. Hindi nito kinakalkula ang magkahalong salary-and-pension case.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Sakop ba ng pension mode ang bawat pensiyon?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Hindi. Ang kredito ng pensiyon ay namodelo lamang para sa isang kwalipikadong pensiyon sa katandaan o karapat-dapat na AFP na kinuha sa 100% sa buong taon. Ang partial-year o graded na pension at iba pang uri ng pension ay nasa labas ng saklaw.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Ano ang opsyon sa measures-zone?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Inilalapat nito ang na-publish na 18.5% ordinary-income rate at NOK 45,000 na espesyal na bawas para sa Finnmark at sa mga nakalistang munisipalidad. Kumpirmahin na ang iyong munisipyo ay kwalipikado.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Kalkulador ng buwis sa yaman sa Norway","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Libreng Tantya","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Tantyahin ang 2026 Norwegian wealth tax mula sa mga tahanan, share, asset ng negosyo, cash at utang. Tingnan ang paghahati ng estado at munisipyo, mga diskwento sa pagpapahalaga at isang hanay ng pagiging sensitibo sa halaga.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Tantyahin ang personal Norwegian wealth tax para sa 2026. Ilagay ang mga tinantyang halaga sa merkado para sa mga tahanan at mga base ng buwis bago ang diskwento para sa mga share at asset ng negosyo. Tingnan ang mga diskwento sa pagpapahalaga, pagsasaayos ng utang at magkahiwalay na pagtatantya ng estado at munisipyo.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Nalalapat ang pagtatantya ng mga panuntunan sa pagpapahalaga ng 2026 at ang pinakamataas na rate ng munisipyo maliban kung maglagay ka ng mas mababang rate. Ang utang ay inilalaan ng buong halaga ng asset bago ang mga diskwento; ang utang na itinalaga sa mga may diskwentong bahagi o mga asset ng negosyo ay nababawasan ng parehong diskwento. Maaaring baguhin ng mga pagtatasa ng ari-arian, pagiging karapat-dapat at personal na buwis ang opisyal na resulta.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Ang isang pangunahing tahanan na may NOK 10 milyong market value ay may tinantyang halaga ng kayamanan na NOK 2.5 milyon sa ilalim ng 2026 pangunahing-bahay na panuntunan, bago ang utang at ang personal na allowance.","2026 tax year":"2026 taon ng buwis","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Pangunahing home estimated market value (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Tinantyang halaga sa pamilihan (NOK) ng mga pangalawang tahanan","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Nagbabahagi at nagbabahagi ng mga pondo bago ang diskwento (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Mga karapat-dapat na asset ng negosyo bago ang diskwento (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Mga deposito sa bangko at iba pang asset (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Kabuuang utang (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Kami ay sama-samang binubuwisan para sa kayamanan","Municipal rate (%)":"Rate ng munisipyo (%)","Home-value comparison":"Paghahambing ng home-value","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Tantyahin ang buwis sa kayamanan","Export CSV":"I-export ang CSV","Print estimate":"I-print ang pagtatantya","Assets before discounts":"Mga asset bago ang mga diskwento","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Nabubuwisan na halaga ng asset pagkatapos ng mga diskwento","Debt reduction from discounts":"Pagbawas sa utang mula sa mga diskwento","Deductible debt estimate":"Mababawas na pagtatantya ng utang","Estimated net wealth":"Tinantyang netong yaman","Personal allowance":"Personal na allowance","Taxable net wealth":"Nabubuwisan netong kayamanan","Municipal wealth tax":"Buwis sa yaman ng munisipyo","State wealth tax":"Buwis sa yaman ng estado","State tax, first band":"Buwis ng estado, unang banda","State tax, upper band":"Buwis ng estado, upper band","Estimated total wealth tax":"Tinantyang kabuuang buwis sa kayamanan","Lower home-value estimate":"Mababang pagtatantya sa halaga ng bahay","Current-value estimate":"Kasalukuyang pagtatantya ng halaga","Higher home-value estimate":"Mas mataas na pagtatantya sa halaga ng bahay","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 na mga panuntunan at pagpapalagay","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Tantyahin lamang. Hindi ito isang opisyal na pagtatasa ng buwis o payo sa buwis. Gamitin ang iyong mga halaga ng pagbabalik ng buwis kung saan magagamit; Ang mga rate, pagiging karapat-dapat, paglalaan ng utang at mga halaga ng ari-arian ay maaaring mag-iba sa iyong kaso.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Mga Tahanan: ilagay ang tinantyang halaga sa pamilihan sa katapusan ng taon. Mga share at kwalipikadong asset ng negosyo: ilagay ang value bago ang 2026 na diskwento, hindi market value maliban kung iyon ang tamang batayan ng buwis.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Doble lang ang allowance at state upper threshold para sa mga mag-asawa, mga rehistradong kasosyo o mga kwalipikadong kasosyo na pinagsama-samang tinasa para sa kanilang pinagsamang kayamanan.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Ginagamit ng kalkulasyon ng munisipyo ang napiling rate, na nagde-default sa 2026 maximum na 0.35%. Maaaring gumamit ng mas mababang rate ang ilang munisipalidad.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Sensitivity ay nagbabago lamang sa mga inilagay na halaga ng pangunahin at pangalawang tahanan. Ito ay isang paghahambing, hindi isang hula ng isang opisyal na pagpapahalaga.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Ano ang 2026 wealth-tax allowance?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Ang karaniwang threshold ay NOK 1.9 milyon para sa isang tao at NOK 3.8 milyon para sa mag-asawa o kwalipikadong partner na sama-samang tinasa.","How is my primary home valued?":"Paano pinahahalagahan ang aking pangunahing tahanan?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Para sa 2026, ang tinantyang halaga ng kayamanan ay 25% ng market value hanggang NOK 14 milyon, kasama ang 70% ng halagang mas mataas sa NOK 14 milyon.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Naglalapat ba ito ng diskwento sa pangalawang tahanan?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Hindi. Ang talahanayan ng 2026 ay nagbibigay sa mga pangalawang tahanan ng 0% na diskwento sa pagpapahalaga. Ginagamit nito ang ipinasok na halaga sa pamilihan bilang pagtatantya; maaaring magkaiba ang mga opisyal na tinasang halaga.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Bakit nagbabago ang deductible na utang kapag nagmamay-ari ako ng mga share o asset ng negosyo?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Ang mga panuntunan sa Norway ay naglalaan ng utang nang proporsyonal ayon sa buong halaga ng asset. Ang bahaging itinalaga sa mga asset na may mga diskwento sa pagtatasa ay binabawasan ng parehong rate ng diskwento.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Lagi bang 0.35% ang municipal rate?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Hindi. Ang 0.35% ay ang 2026 maximum na ginagamit bilang default. Ang isang munisipalidad ay maaaring magtakda ng mas mababang rate, na maaari mong ipasok.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Sinasaklaw ba ng calculator ang bawat asset o tax case?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Hindi. Tinatantya nito ang mga tahanan, bahagi, napiling karapat-dapat na mga asset ng negosyo, cash at kabuuang utang. Ang mga dayuhang asset, mga pensiyon, kumplikadong pagmamay-ari, mga pagbubukod at iba pang mga espesyal na tuntunin ay maaaring magbago sa iyong pagtatasa.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Tagagawa ng Swiss QR invoice","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Swiss QR-bill Generator — Libreng QR Invoice Maker","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Lumikha at tingnan ang isang Swiss QR-bill nang lokal. Patunayan ang mga sanggunian ng IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR at SCOR; i-print ang bahagi ng pagbabayad at resibo ng A6 nang hindi nag-a-upload ng data ng invoice.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Gumawa ng Swiss payment slip gamit ang Swiss QR Code. Ang mga detalye ng iyong invoice ay mananatili sa browser na ito; walang bayad ang pinasimulan at walang bank register ang natatanong.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Binubuo ng tool ang SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) na data at sinusuri ang mga field, kumbinasyon ng account/reference, IBAN check digit at sinusuportahang character. Pino-format nito ang bahagi ng pagbabayad at resibo para sa pag-print sa kanilang kinakailangang pisikal na sukat.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX na halimbawa: isang QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, isang 27-digit na QRR reference at structured na mga address ng creditor/debtor.","How it works":"Paano ito gumagana","Frequently asked questions":"Mga madalas itanong","Limits and accuracy":"Mga limitasyon at katumpakan","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Ito ay isang lokal na tool sa dokumento, hindi isang serbisyo sa bangko o sertipikasyon. Hindi nito makumpirma kung sino ang nagmamay-ari ng IBAN, kung ang isang account ay bukas, o kung ang isang pagbabayad ay tatanggapin. Mag-print sa 100% / Aktwal na laki at sukatin ang linya ng tseke ng 100 mm bago gumamit ng order ng pagbabayad sa papel.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Creditor IBAN o QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Mababayaran sa · pinagkakautangan","Account holder / creditor name":"Pangalan ng may-ari ng account / pinagkakautangan","Street or P.O. box":"Kalye o P.O. kahon","Building number":"Numero ng gusali","Postal code":"Kodigo postal","Town / city":"Bayan / lungsod","2-letter country code":"2-letter na country code","Amount (optional)":"Halaga (opsyonal)","Currency":"Pera","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Babayaran ng · opsyonal na may utang","Debtor name":"Pangalan ng may utang","Reference type":"Uri ng sanggunian","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR reference · QR-IBAN lang","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Sanggunian ng Creditor · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Walang structured reference · IBAN","Reference":"Sanggunian","Unstructured message":"Hindi nakabalangkas na mensahe","Billing information (optional)":"Impormasyon sa pagsingil (opsyonal)","Create QR-bill":"Gumawa ng QR-bill","Load SIX sample":"Mag-load ng SIX na sample","Clear form":"I-clear ang form","Check QR payload":"Suriin ang QR payload","Download payment data":"I-download ang data ng pagbabayad","Download QR SVG":"I-download ang QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"I-print / i-save bilang PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Magbasa ng larawan ng QR Code","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Pumili ng PNG o JPEG","Read image locally":"Basahin ang larawan nang lokal","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"I-paste ang data ng pagbabayad ng Swiss QR Code","Invoice details":"Mga detalye ng invoice","QR-bill preview":"Preview ng QR-bill","Receipt":"Resibo","Payment part":"Bahagi ng pagbabayad","Payable to":"Mababayaran sa","Payable by":"Babayaran ng","Account":"Account","Additional information":"Karagdagang impormasyon","Currency / amount":"Currency / halaga","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Suriin ang sukat ng pag-print · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · pamantayang Swiss QR-bill","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"Handa na ang QR-bill. Nanatili ang mga detalye sa device na ito.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Kailangang suriin ng ilang field. Suriin ang naka-highlight na impormasyon.","Reading this image on your device…":"Binabasa ang larawang ito sa iyong device...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Swiss QR Code binasa at sinuri nang lokal.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Walang nababasang QR Code ang nakita sa larawang iyon.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Ang data ng Swiss QR Code ay wasto para sa mga sinusuportahang field.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Ang data ay hindi wastong Swiss QR Code payload ng pagbabayad.","Form and preview cleared.":"Na-clear ang form at preview.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ANIM na sample ang na-load. Palitan ang mga detalye ng sample nito bago ang tunay na paggamit.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Gumawa o magbasa muna ng valid QR-bill.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Pumili ng PNG o JPEG na 10 MiB o mas kaunti.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Hindi makapag-load ang lokal na QR reader. Maaari mong ilagay ang data ng pagbabayad sa halip.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Aling IBAN at mga reference na kumbinasyon ang pinapayagan?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"Ang isang QR-IBAN ay gumagamit ng isang QRR reference. Ang isang normal na Swiss IBAN ay gumagamit ng SCOR o walang structured reference (NON). Ang QRR ay para lamang sa mga CHF na invoice.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Tinasuri ba nito kung ang account ay umiiral o pagmamay-ari ng pinagkakautangan?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Hindi. Sinusuri nito ang format at IBAN checksum lamang. Hindi ito nakikipag-ugnayan sa isang bank o account registry.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Maaari ko bang i-print ito sa anumang sukat?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Para sa isang order ng pagbabayad sa papel, i-print sa 100% / Aktwal na laki. Ang bahagi ng pagbabayad ay dapat na A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); suriin ang linya ng 100 mm gamit ang isang ruler.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Nagpapadala ba ang tool ng data ng invoice kahit saan?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Hindi. Ang pagbuo at pagbabasa ng larawan ay nangyayari sa iyong browser. Walang account o serbisyo sa pagbabayad ang ginagamit.","Grade Scale Generator":"Tagabuo ng antas ng marka","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Grade Scale Generator — Libreng Points-to-Grade Tool","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Gawing porsyento at mga marka ang mga puntos gamit ang sarili mong mga limitasyon. Silipin ang buong sukat, kopyahin o i-export ito, at mag-print ng grading sheet.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Bumuo ng transparent na grading scale para sa isang pagsusulit o takdang-aralin. Itakda ang pinakamataas na puntos at ang pinakamababang porsyento para sa bawat grado; hindi ipinapalagay ng iskala ang tuntunin ng paaralan o pambansang pagmamarka.","Points earned":"Mga nakuhang puntos","Maximum points":"Maximum na puntos","Top grade label":"Label ng pinakamataas na marka","Top grade starts at (%)":"Magsisimula ang pinakamataas na grado sa (%)","Middle grade label":"Etiketa sa gitnang grado","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Nagsisimula ang gitnang baitang sa (%)","Lowest grade label":"Pinakamababang marka ng marka","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Nagsisimula ang pinakamababang grado sa (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Na may maximum na 50-point, ang 45 na puntos ay katumbas ng 90%. Ang iyong mga custom na threshold ang magpapasya sa label ng grado.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Gumagamit ba ito ng opisyal na patakaran sa pagmamarka?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Hindi. Itinakda mo ang mga limitasyon. Ang mga sistema ng pagmamarka ay naiiba ayon sa paaralan, kurso at bansa; kumpirmahin ang sukat na inaasahan mong gamitin.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Maaari ko bang i-export ang mga grading band?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Oo. I-export ang mga ipinapakitang banda bilang isang CSV file o i-print ang sukat."},"tr":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Norveç Tatil Ücreti Hesaplayıcı","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Norveç Tatil Ücreti Hesaplayıcı — Ücretsiz Brüt Tahmin","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Tatil ödemesi esasınıza göre Norveç tatil ücretini tahmin edin. Standart izin, beşinci hafta ve 60 veya üzeri yaştaki çalışanlar için ortak oranları karşılaştırın.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Maaş bordronuzda gösterilen feriepengegrunnlag'ı girin. Yaşınıza ve kararlaştırılan tatil uzunluğuna göre Norveç'teki ortak brüt tatil ücreti oranlarını karşılaştırın.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Tatil ödeme esası (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Tatil yılında 60 veya daha büyüğüm","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Sözleşmem beşinci tatil haftasını da içeriyor","Estimated holiday pay":"Tahmini tatil ücreti","Rate used":"Kullanılan oran","Basis used":"Kullanılan temel","Reset choices":"Seçenekleri sıfırla","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Yalnızca brüt tahmin. Tatil ücreti vergiye tabi gelirdir; Vergi stopajı kişiye ve maaş bordrosuna göre değişiklik gösterebilir.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 bazında, 10.2%, herhangi bir bordro ayarlamasından önce NOK 51,000 değerini verir.","Which rate should I use?":"Hangi oranı kullanmalıyım?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Tahmin ortak minimum oranları kullanıyor: beşinci haftayla birlikte %10.2 veya %12; 60 veya üzeri yaştaki çalışanlar için %12.5 veya %14.3. Anlaşmanız daha fazlasını verebilir.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Bu vergiden sonra ödenen tutar mı?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Hayır. Bu brüt bir tahmindir. Tatil ücreti vergiye tabi gelirdir; Stopaj sizin koşullarınıza ve bordronuza bağlıdır.","What belongs in the basis?":"Temelde neler var?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Maaş bordronuzda veya yıllık ekstrenizde feriepengegrunnlag'ı kullanın. Bazı geri ödemeler ve diğer ödemeler kuralların dışındadır.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Norveç Gelir Vergisi Hesaplayıcı","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Norveç Vergi Hesaplayıcı 2026 — Ücretsiz Maaş ve Emeklilik Tahmini","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Tahmini 2026 Standart maaş veya tam yıllık yaşlılık aylığı üzerinden Norveç gelir vergisi. Yıllık ve aylık net ücreti, vergi bileşenlerini görün ve iki senaryoyu karşılaştırın.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Tahmini 2026 Standart ikamet maaşı veya tam yıllık yaşlılık aylığı için Norveç gelir vergisi. Ana vergi bileşenlerini görün ve iki brüt gelir senaryosunu karşılaştırın.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Hesap makinesi, 2026 standart kesintileri, beş artan oranlı vergi dilimini ve ulusal sigorta katkılarını uygular. Emeklilik modu yalnızca tam yıl için, %100 nitelikli yaşlılık aylığı veya uygun AFP için emeklilik vergisi kredisini içerir. Tamamen bu tarayıcıda çalışır.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"600,000 NOK maaş için tahmini yıllık vergiyi ve net maaşı başka bir maaşla veya tam yıllık emeklilik tutarıyla karşılaştırın.","Tax year":"Vergi yılı","Scenario":"Senaryo","Salary":"Maaş","Full-year old-age pension":"Tam yıllık yaşlılık aylığı","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Brüt yıllık gelir (NOK)","Tax zone":"Vergi bölgesi","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Standart ücret (Norveç'in çoğu)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / listelenen önlem bölgesi belediyeleri","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Emeklilik tahmini, başka gelir olmaksızın tüm 12 aylar için uygun yaşlılık maaşı veya AFP'nin %100 seviyesinde olduğunu varsaymaktadır.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Maaş tahmini, normal Norveç vergi mukimliği, yaş 17–69 ve başka gelirin bulunmadığını varsaymaktadır.","Compare two scenarios":"İki senaryoyu karşılaştırın","Scenario 1":"Senaryo 1","Scenario 2":"Senaryo 2","Calculate estimate":"Tahmini hesapla","Estimated tax per year":"Yıllık tahmini vergi","Average tax per month":"Aylık ortalama vergi","Estimated net per year":"Yıllık tahmini net","Average net per month":"Aylık ortalama net","Tax on ordinary income":"Olağan gelir vergisi","Bracket tax":"Kademeli vergi","National insurance contribution":"Ulusal sigorta katkısı","Pension tax credit":"Emeklilik vergi kredisi","Estimated effective rate":"Tahmini efektif oran","Standard deduction base":"Standart kesinti tabanı","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Oranlar ve eşikler 2026 gelir yılı içindir.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Yalnızca tahmindir; resmi bir vergi hesaplaması veya vergi kartı değildir. Diğer gelirler, kesintiler, yaş, ikametgah, emeklilik derecesi ve kişisel koşullar sonucu değiştirebilir.","Reset values":"Değerleri sıfırla","Example":"Örnek","How the estimate works":"Tahmin nasıl çalışır?","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Bu benim vergi faturamın tamamı mı yoksa vergi kartı stopajım mı?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Hayır. Standart 2026 yıllık vergiyi tahmin ediyor. Vergi kartı, nihai değerlendirme ve stopaj, tam gelirinize, kesintilerinize ve koşullarınıza bağlı olarak farklılık gösterebilir.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Maaş ve emekli maaşını burada birleştirebilir miyim?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Bu sürüm aynı anda tek bir gelir türünü tahmin eder. Maaş-emekli maaşı karışımı bir durumu hesaplamaz.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Emeklilik modu her emekliliği kapsıyor mu?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Hayır. Emeklilik kredisi yalnızca yıl boyunca %100 oranında alınan nitelikli yaşlılık maaşı veya uygun AFP için modellenmiştir. Kısmi yıllık veya kademeli emeklilik ve diğer emeklilik türleri kapsam dışındadır.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Ölçü bölgesi seçeneği nedir?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Finnmark ve listelenen belediyeler için yayınlanan %18.5 normal gelir oranı ve NOK 45,000 özel kesinti uygulanır. Belediyenizin uygun olduğunu doğrulayın.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Norveç Varlık Vergisi Hesaplayıcı","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Norveç Varlık Vergisi Hesaplayıcı 2026 — Ücretsiz Tahmin","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Tahmini 2026 Evlerden, hisselerden, ticari varlıklardan, nakit paradan ve borçtan alınan Norveç servet vergisi. Eyalet ve belediye ayrımını, değerleme indirimlerini ve değer duyarlılığı aralığını görün.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026 için kişisel Norveç servet vergisini tahmin edin. Evler için tahmini piyasa değerlerini, hisseler ve ticari varlıklar için ise iskonto öncesi vergi matrahlarını girin. Değerleme indirimlerini, borç ayarlamasını ve ayrı eyalet ve belediye tahminlerini görün.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Daha düşük bir oran girmediğiniz sürece tahmin, 2026 değerleme kurallarını ve maksimum belediye oranını uygular. Borç, iskontolardan önceki tam varlık değerlerine göre dağıtılır; iskontolu hisselere veya ticari varlıklara devredilen borç aynı indirimle azaltılır. Mülk değerlemeleri, uygunluk ve kişisel vergi gerçekleri resmi sonucu değiştirebilir.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"10 milyon NOK piyasa değerine sahip bir birincil evin, borç ve kişisel ödenek hariç, 2026 birincil ev kuralı kapsamında tahmini servet değeri 2.5 milyon NOK'tur.","2026 tax year":"2026 vergi yılı","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Birincil evin tahmini piyasa değeri (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"İkincil evlerin tahmini piyasa değeri (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"İndirimden önce hisseler ve hisse fonları (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"İndirim öncesi uygun ticari varlıklar (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Banka mevduatları ve diğer varlıklar (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Toplam borç (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Zenginlik için ortaklaşa vergilendiriliyoruz","Municipal rate (%)":"Belediye oranı (%)","Home-value comparison":"Ev değeri karşılaştırması","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Servet vergisi tahmini","Export CSV":"CSV'yi Dışa Aktar","Print estimate":"Tahminleri yazdır","Assets before discounts":"İndirimlerden önceki varlıklar","Taxable asset value after discounts":"İndirimlerden sonra vergiye tabi varlık değeri","Debt reduction from discounts":"İndirimlerden borç azaltımı","Deductible debt estimate":"İndirilebilir borç tahmini","Estimated net wealth":"Tahmini net servet","Personal allowance":"Kişisel harçlık","Taxable net wealth":"Vergiye tabi net servet","Municipal wealth tax":"Belediye servet vergisi","State wealth tax":"Devlet servet vergisi","State tax, first band":"Devlet vergisi, birinci bant","State tax, upper band":"Devlet vergisi, üst bant","Estimated total wealth tax":"Tahmini toplam servet vergisi","Lower home-value estimate":"Daha düşük ev değeri tahmini","Current-value estimate":"Mevcut değer tahmini","Higher home-value estimate":"Daha yüksek ev değeri tahmini","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 kuralları ve varsayımları","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Yalnızca tahmin. Bu resmi bir vergi değerlendirmesi veya vergi tavsiyesi değildir. Mümkün olduğunda vergi beyannamesi değerlerinizi kullanın; Sizin durumunuzda oranlar, uygunluk, borç tahsisi ve mülk değerleri farklılık gösterebilir.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Evler: Yıl sonu tahmini piyasa değerini girin. Hisse senetleri ve uygun işletme varlıkları: Doğru vergi matrahı olmadığı sürece piyasa değerini değil, 2026 indirimden önceki değeri girin.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Ödenek ve devlet üst eşiği yalnızca toplam servetleri için müştereken değerlendirilen eşler, kayıtlı partnerler veya nitelikli birlikte yaşayanlar için iki katına çıkar.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Belediye hesaplaması, varsayılan olarak 2026 maksimum 0.35% olarak ayarlanan seçilen oranı kullanır. Bazı belediyeler daha düşük bir oran kullanabilir.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Hassasiyet yalnızca birincil ve ikincil evlerin girilen değerlerini değiştirir. Bu bir karşılaştırmadır, resmi bir değerleme tahmini değil.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 servet vergisi indirimi nedir?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Standart eşik, bir kişi için 1.9 milyon NOK ve ortak olarak değerlendirilen eşler veya nitelikli partnerler için 3.8 milyon NOK'tur.","How is my primary home valued?":"Birincil evimin değeri nasıl?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026 için tahmini servet değeri, 14 milyon NOK'a kadar piyasa değerinin %25'i artı 14 milyon NOK'un üzerindeki miktarın %70'idir.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Bu, ikinci bir eve indirim uyguluyor mu?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Hayır. 2026 tablosu, ikincil evlere %0 değerleme indirimi sağlar. Tahmin olarak girilen piyasa değerini kullanır; resmi olarak değerlendirilen değerler farklılık gösterebilir.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Hisse senetlerine veya ticari varlıklara sahip olduğumda vergiden düşülebilir borç neden değişiyor?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Norveç kuralları, borcu tam varlık değerlerine göre orantılı olarak dağıtıyor. Değerleme iskontolu varlıklara ayrılan kısım aynı iskonto oranı oranında azaltılır.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Belediyenin oranı her zaman %0.35 midir?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Hayır. 0.35%, varsayılan olarak kullanılan maksimum 2026'tir. Belediye sizin girebileceğiniz daha düşük bir oran belirleyebilir.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Hesap makinesi her varlık veya vergi durumunu kapsıyor mu?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Hayır. Evleri, hisseleri, seçilen uygun ticari varlıkları, nakit parayı ve toplam borcu tahmin eder. Yabancı varlıklar, emekli maaşları, karmaşık mülkiyet, muafiyetler ve diğer özel kurallar değerlendirmenizi değiştirebilir.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"İsviçre QR-fatura Oluşturucu","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"İsviçre QR-fatura Oluşturucu — Ücretsiz QR Fatura Oluşturucu","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Yerel olarak bir İsviçre QR faturası oluşturun ve kontrol edin. IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR ve SCOR referanslarını doğrulayın; A6 ödeme bölümünü ve makbuzunu fatura verilerini yüklemeden yazdırın.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"İsviçre QR Koduyla bir İsviçre ödeme makbuzu oluşturun. Fatura bilgileriniz bu tarayıcıda kalır; ödeme başlatılmaz ve banka kaydı sorgulanmaz.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Araç, SIX İsviçre Ödeme Kodu (SPC) verilerini oluşturur ve alanlarını, hesap/referans kombinasyonunu, IBAN kontrol rakamlarını ve desteklenen karakterleri kontrol eder. Ödeme kısmını ve makbuzunu gerekli fiziksel boyutlarda yazdırmak üzere formatlar.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX örneği: bir QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27 basamaklı QRR referansı ve yapılandırılmış alacaklı/borçlu adresleri.","How it works":"Nasıl çalışır?","Frequently asked questions":"Sıkça sorulan sorular","Limits and accuracy":"Sınırlar ve doğruluk","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Bu, yerel bir belge aracıdır; bir banka hizmeti veya sertifikasyonu değildir. IBAN'ın kime ait olduğunu, hesabın açık olup olmadığını veya ödeme kabul edilip edilmeyeceğini teyit edemez. 100% / Gerçek boyutta yazdırın ve kağıt ödeme emrini kullanmadan önce 100 mm kontrol çizgisini ölçün.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Alacaklı IBAN'ı veya QR-IBAN'ı","Payable to · creditor":"Alacaklıya ödenecek","Account holder / creditor name":"Hesap sahibinin / alacaklının adı","Street or P.O. box":"Sokak veya P.O. kutu","Building number":"Bina numarası","Postal code":"Posta kodu","Town / city":"Kasaba / şehir","2-letter country code":"2 harfli ülke kodu","Amount (optional)":"Tutar (isteğe bağlı)","Currency":"Para birimi","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Ödenecek kişi · isteğe bağlı borçlu","Debtor name":"Borçlu adı","Reference type":"Referans türü","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR referansı · Yalnızca QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Alacaklı referansı · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Yapılandırılmış referans yok · IBAN","Reference":"Referans","Unstructured message":"Yapılandırılmamış mesaj","Billing information (optional)":"Faturalandırma bilgileri (isteğe bağlı)","Create QR-bill":"QR faturası oluştur","Load SIX sample":"ALTI örneğini yükle","Clear form":"Formu temizle","Check QR payload":"QR yükünü kontrol edin","Download payment data":"Ödeme verilerini indir","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG'yi indirin","Print / save as PDF":"PDF olarak yazdır / kaydet","Read a QR Code image":"QR Kodu görselini okuyun","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG veya JPEG'i seçin","Read image locally":"Resmi yerel olarak oku","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"İsviçre QR Kodu ödeme verilerini yapıştırın","Invoice details":"Fatura ayrıntıları","QR-bill preview":"QR fatura önizlemesi","Receipt":"Makbuz","Payment part":"Ödeme bölümü","Payable to":"Şuraya ödenecek","Payable by":"Ödenecek tarih:","Account":"Hesap","Additional information":"Ek bilgi","Currency / amount":"Para birimi / tutar","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Baskı ölçeği kontrolü · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · İsviçre QR fatura standardı","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR faturası hazır. Ayrıntılar bu cihazda kaldı.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Bazı alanların kontrol edilmesi gerekiyor. Vurgulanan bilgileri inceleyin.","Reading this image on your device…":"Bu görsel cihazınızda okunuyor…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"İsviçre QR Kodu yerel olarak okundu ve kontrol edildi.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Bu görüntüde okunabilir QR Kodu bulunamadı.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"İsviçre QR Kodu verileri desteklenen alanlar için geçerlidir.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Veriler geçerli bir İsviçre QR Kodu ödeme yükü değil.","Form and preview cleared.":"Form ve önizleme temizlendi.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"SIX örneği yüklendi. Gerçek kullanımdan önce numune ayrıntılarını değiştirin.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Önce geçerli bir QR faturası oluşturun veya okuyun.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB veya daha düşük bir PNG veya JPEG seçin.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Yerel QR okuyucu yüklenemedi. Bunun yerine ödeme verilerini yapıştırabilirsiniz.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Hangi IBAN ve referans kombinasyonlarına izin veriliyor?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"QR-IBAN, bir QRR referansı kullanır. Normal bir İsviçre IBAN'ı SCOR kullanır veya yapılandırılmış referans içermez (NON). QRR yalnızca CHF faturaları içindir.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Bu, hesabın var olup olmadığını veya alacaklıya ait olup olmadığını kontrol ediyor mu?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Hayır. Yalnızca formatı ve IBAN sağlama toplamını kontrol eder. Bir banka veya hesap siciliyle iletişime geçmez.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Bunu herhangi bir ölçekte yazdırabilir miyim?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Kağıt ödeme emri için 100% / Gerçek boyutta yazdırın. Ödeme kısmı A6 yatay (148 × 105 mm) olmalıdır; 100 mm çizgisini bir cetvelle kontrol edin.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Araç fatura verilerini herhangi bir yere gönderiyor mu?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Hayır. Oluşturma ve görüntü okuma tarayıcınızda gerçekleşir. Hiçbir hesap veya ödeme hizmeti kullanılmamaktadır.","Grade Scale Generator":"Sınıf Ölçeği Oluşturucu","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Sınıf Ölçeği Oluşturucu — Ücretsiz Derecelendirme Puanı Aracı","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Kendi eşiklerinizle puanları yüzdelere ve notlara dönüştürün. Tam ölçeği önizleyin, kopyalayın veya dışa aktarın ve bir derecelendirme sayfası yazdırın.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Bir sınav veya ödev için şeffaf bir not ölçeği oluşturun. Her not için maksimum puanı ve minimum yüzdeyi ayarlayın; ölçek bir okul veya ulusal derecelendirme kuralını varsaymaz.","Points earned":"Kazanılan puanlar","Maximum points":"Maksimum puanlar","Top grade label":"Üst sınıf etiket","Top grade starts at (%)":"En üst sınıf (%)'dan başlıyor","Middle grade label":"Orta dereceli etiket","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Orta sınıf (%)'dan başlar","Lowest grade label":"En düşük dereceli etiket","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"En düşük kalite (%)'den başlar","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Maksimum 50 puanla 45 puan, %90'e eşittir. Özel eşikleriniz not etiketini belirler.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Bunda resmi bir derecelendirme politikası kullanılıyor mu?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Hayır. Eşikleri siz belirlersiniz. Not verme sistemleri okula, kursa ve ülkeye göre farklılık gösterir; Kullanmanız beklenen ölçeği onaylayın.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Sınıflandırma bantlarını dışa aktarabilir miyim?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Evet. Görüntülenen bantları CSV dosyası olarak dışa aktarın veya ölçeği yazdırın."},"uk":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Калькулятор оплати відпустки в Норвегії","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Калькулятор оплати відпустки в Норвегії — безкоштовна валова оцінка","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Оцініть оплату відпустки в Норвегії на підставі вашої відпустки. Порівняйте загальні тарифи для стандартної відпустки, п’ятого тижня та працівників віком 60 або старше.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Введіть feriepengegrunnlag, вказаний у вашій платіжній відомості. Порівняйте загальні норвезькі ставки валової оплати відпустки для вашого віку та узгодженої тривалості відпустки.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Оплата відпустки (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Я 60 або старше у святковий рік","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Моя угода включає п’ятий тиждень відпустки","Estimated holiday pay":"Розрахункова оплата відпустки","Rate used":"Використана ставка","Basis used":"Використана основа","Reset choices":"Скинути вибір","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Лише валовий кошторис. Оплата відпустки є оподатковуваним доходом; розмір податку може відрізнятися залежно від особи та фонду заробітної плати.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"На основі 500,000 норвезьких крон 10.2% дає 51,000 норвезьких крон до будь-яких коригувань заробітної плати.","Which rate should I use?":"Який тариф я маю використовувати?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Оцінка використовує загальні мінімальні ставки: 10.2% або 12% із п’ятим тижнем; 12.5% або 14.3% для працівників віком від 60. Ваша згода може дати більше.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Це сума, сплачена після оподаткування?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"№ Це груба оцінка. Оплата відпустки є оподатковуваним доходом; утримання залежить від ваших обставин і фонду заробітної плати.","What belongs in the basis?":"Що належить до основи?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Використовуйте feriepengegrunnlag у своїй платіжній відомості або річній виписці. Деякі компенсації та інші виплати виключені правилами.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Норвезький калькулятор податку на прибуток","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Норвезький податковий калькулятор 2026 — безкоштовна оцінка зарплати та пенсії","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Оцінка 2026 норвезького прибуткового податку на стандартну зарплату або пенсію за віком за повний рік. Перегляньте річну та місячну чисту зарплату, податкові компоненти та порівняйте два сценарії.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Оцінка 2026 норвезького прибуткового податку для стандартної зарплати резидента або пенсії за віком за повний рік. Перегляньте основні податкові компоненти та порівняйте два сценарії валового доходу.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Калькулятор застосовує стандартні відрахування 2026, п’ять прогресивних діапазонів оподаткування та внески національного страхування. Пенсійний режим включає пенсійний податковий кредит лише за повний рік, 100% відповідної пенсії за віком або відповідного AFP. Він повністю працює в цьому браузері.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Для зарплати 600,000 NOK порівняйте приблизний річний податок і чисту зарплату з іншою зарплатою або сумою пенсії за повний рік.","Tax year":"Податковий р","Scenario":"Сценарій","Salary":"Оклад","Full-year old-age pension":"Пенсія за вислугу років","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Валовий річний дохід (NOK)","Tax zone":"Податкова зона","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Стандартна ставка (більша частина Норвегії)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Фіннмарк / перераховані муніципалітети зони заходів","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Оцінка пенсії передбачає відповідну пенсію за віком або AFP у розмірі 100% за всі 12 місяців без будь-яких інших доходів.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Оцінка зарплати передбачає звичайне податкове резидентство Норвегії, вік 17–69 і відсутність іншого доходу.","Compare two scenarios":"Порівняйте два сценарії","Scenario 1":"Сценарій 1","Scenario 2":"Сценарій 2","Calculate estimate":"Розрахувати кошторис","Estimated tax per year":"Розрахунковий податок на рік","Average tax per month":"Середній податок за місяць","Estimated net per year":"Очікувана нетто на рік","Average net per month":"Середнє нетто за місяць","Tax on ordinary income":"Податок на звичайний прибуток","Bracket tax":"Податкова категорія","National insurance contribution":"Внесок загальнодержавного страхування","Pension tax credit":"Податковий пенсійний кредит","Estimated effective rate":"Розрахункова ефективна ставка","Standard deduction base":"Стандартна база відрахувань","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Ставки та порогові значення наведено для прибуткового року 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Лише оцінка, а не офіційний податковий розрахунок або податкова картка. Інші доходи, відрахування, вік, місце проживання, пенсійний рівень та особисті обставини можуть змінити результат.","Reset values":"Скинути значення","Example":"Приклад","How the estimate works":"Як працює кошторис","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Це моя точна податкова накладна чи утримання з податкової картки?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"№ Він оцінює стандартний річний податок 2026. Податкова картка, остаточна оцінка та утримання можуть відрізнятися в залежності від вашого повного доходу, відрахувань і обставин.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Чи можна тут суміщати зарплату та пенсію?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Ця версія оцінює один тип доходу за раз. Він не розраховує змішаний випадок заробітної плати та пенсії.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Чи охоплює пенсійний режим кожну пенсію?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"№ Пенсійний кредит моделюється лише для відповідної пенсії за віком або придатного AFP, який приймається на рівні 100% протягом року. Пенсія за неповний рік або ступеневу пенсію та інші типи пенсії не розглядаються.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Що таке параметр зони вимірювань?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Застосовується опублікована ставка звичайного доходу 18.5% і спеціальні відрахування NOK 45,000 для Фіннмарка та перерахованих муніципалітетів. Підтвердьте, що ваш муніципалітет відповідає вимогам.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Норвезький калькулятор податку на майно","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Норвезький калькулятор податку на майно 2026 — безкоштовна оцінка","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Оцінка 2026 норвезького податку на майно з будинків, акцій, бізнес-активів, готівки та боргів. Дивіться розподіл штату та муніципалітету, знижки на оцінку та діапазон чутливості вартості.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Оцініть особистий норвезький податок на багатство для 2026. Введіть приблизну ринкову вартість будинків і податкову базу до дисконтування для акцій і бізнес-активів. Перегляньте знижки на оцінку, коригування боргу та окремі державні та муніципальні кошториси.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Оцінка застосовує правила оцінки 2026 і максимальну муніципальну ставку, якщо ви не введете нижчу ставку. Борг розподіляється за повною вартістю активів до дисконту; заборгованість, віднесена до дисконтованих акцій або бізнес-активів, зменшується на той самий дисконт. Оцінка майна, правомочність і особисті податки можуть змінити офіційний результат.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Первинне житло з ринковою вартістю 10 мільйонів норвезьких крон має оціночну вартість багатства 2.5 мільйонів норвезьких крон згідно з правилом первинного житла 2026 без урахування боргів і персональних надбавок.","2026 tax year":"2026 податковий рік","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Ринкова вартість первинного будинку (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Очікувана ринкова вартість вторинних будинків (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Акції та пайові фонди до дисконту (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Відповідні бізнес-активи без знижки (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Банківські депозити та інші активи (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Загальний борг (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Ми спільно оподатковуємося податком на багатство","Municipal rate (%)":"Муніципальна ставка (%)","Home-value comparison":"Порівняння вартості житла","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Оцінка податку на майно","Export CSV":"Експорт CSV","Print estimate":"Друк кошторису","Assets before discounts":"Активи до уцінки","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Оподатковувана вартість без урахування знижок","Debt reduction from discounts":"Зменшення заборгованості за рахунок знижок","Deductible debt estimate":"Оцінка франшизи","Estimated net wealth":"Очікуване чисте багатство","Personal allowance":"Персональна надбавка","Taxable net wealth":"Оподатковуваний чистий капітал","Municipal wealth tax":"Муніципальний податок на майно","State wealth tax":"Державний податок на майно","State tax, first band":"Державне мито, перша група","State tax, upper band":"Державне мито, верхня смуга","Estimated total wealth tax":"Очікуваний загальний податок на майно","Lower home-value estimate":"Нижня оцінка вартості будинку","Current-value estimate":"Поточна оцінка","Higher home-value estimate":"Вища оцінка вартості будинку","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 правила та припущення","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Лише оцінка. Це не офіційна податкова оцінка чи податкова консультація. Використовуйте значення податкової декларації, якщо вони є; ставки, правомочність, розподіл боргу та вартість майна можуть відрізнятися у вашому випадку.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Будинки: введіть оціночну ринкову вартість на кінець року. Акції та придатні бізнес-активи: введіть вартість до дисконту 2026, а не ринкову вартість, якщо це не є правильною податковою базою.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Допомога та верхній поріг штату подвоюються лише для подружжя, зареєстрованих партнерів або відповідних співмешканців, які оцінюються спільно за сукупним статком.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Мініципальні розрахунки використовують вибрану ставку, за замовчуванням максимальне значення 2026 становить 0.35%. Деякі муніципалітети можуть використовувати нижчу ставку.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Чутливість змінює лише введені значення основного та додаткового будинків. Це порівняння, а не прогноз офіційної оцінки.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Що таке пільга з податку на багатство 2026?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Стандартний поріг становить 1.9 мільйонів норвезьких крон для однієї особи та 3.8 мільйонів норвезьких крон для подружжя або відповідних партнерів, які оцінюються спільно.","How is my primary home valued?":"Як оцінюється мій основний будинок?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Для 2026 оціночна вартість капіталу становить 25% від ринкової вартості до 14 мільйонів норвезьких крон плюс 70% від суми понад 14 мільйонів норвезьких крон.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Чи надається знижка на вторинний будинок?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"№ Таблиця 2026 надає вторинним будинкам знижку від оцінки 0%. Він використовує введену ринкову вартість як оцінку; офіційні оцінні значення можуть відрізнятися.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Чому борг, що підлягає вирахуванню, змінюється, коли я володію акціями чи бізнес-активами?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Правила Норвегії розподіляють борг пропорційно повній вартості активів. Частка, призначена активам зі знижками оцінки, зменшується на таку саму ставку дисконту.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Чи муніципальна ставка завжди 0.35%?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"№ 0.35% — це максимум 2026, який використовується за умовчанням. Муніципалітет може встановити нижчу ставку, яку ви можете ввести.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Чи охоплює калькулятор усі активи чи податки?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"№ Він оцінює будинки, акції, вибрані відповідні бізнес-активи, готівку та загальну заборгованість. Іноземні активи, пенсії, комплексна власність, винятки та інші спеціальні правила можуть змінити вашу оцінку.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Швейцарський QR-генератор купюр","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Генератор швейцарських QR-рахунків — безкоштовний інструмент для створення QR-рахунків","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Створіть і перевірте швейцарський QR-рахунок локально. Підтвердити посилання IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR і SCOR; роздрукувати платіжну частину A6 і квитанцію без завантаження даних рахунку-фактури.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Створіть швейцарську платіжну квитанцію зі швейцарським QR-кодом. Деталі вашого рахунку-фактури залишаються в цьому браузері; платіж не ініціюється, і банківський реєстр не запитується.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Інструмент створює дані SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) і перевіряє його поля, комбінацію рахунку/посилання, контрольні цифри IBAN і підтримувані символи. Він форматує платіжну частину та квитанцію для друку в необхідному фізичному розмірі.","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"ШІСТЬ прикладів: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, 27-цифрове посилання QRR і структуровані адреси кредитора/боржника.","How it works":"Як це працює","Frequently asked questions":"Часті запитання","Limits and accuracy":"Межі та точність","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Це інструмент для локальних документів, а не банківська послуга чи сертифікація. Він не може підтвердити, хто є власником IBAN, чи відкритий рахунок і чи буде прийнятий платіж. Друкуйте на 100% / фактичний розмір і виміряйте контрольну лінію 100 мм перед використанням паперового платіжного доручення.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"IBAN або QR-IBAN кредитора","Payable to · creditor":"Заборгованість перед · кредитором","Account holder / creditor name":"Ім’я власника рахунку/кредитора","Street or P.O. box":"Вулиця або п.о. коробка","Building number":"Номер буд","Postal code":"Поштовий індекс","Town / city":"Населений пункт","2-letter country code":"2-літерний код країни","Amount (optional)":"Сума (необов’язково)","Currency":"Валюта","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Заборгованість за · факультативним боржником","Debtor name":"Найменування боржника","Reference type":"Довідковий тип","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Довідка QR · Лише QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Довідка кредитора · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Немає структурованого посилання · IBAN","Reference":"Довід","Unstructured message":"Неструктуроване повідомлення","Billing information (optional)":"Платіжна інформація (необов’язково)","Create QR-bill":"Створити QR-рахунок","Load SIX sample":"Завантажити ШІСТИЙ зразок","Clear form":"Чиста форма","Check QR payload":"Перевірити корисне навантаження QR","Download payment data":"Завантажити платіжні дані","Download QR SVG":"Завантажити QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"Друк / збереження як PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Прочитайте зображення QR-коду","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Виберіть PNG або JPEG","Read image locally":"Локальне читання зображення","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Вставити платіжні дані швейцарського QR-коду","Invoice details":"Реквізити рахунку","QR-bill preview":"Попередній перегляд QR-купюри","Receipt":"Квитанція","Payment part":"Платіжна частина","Payable to":"Оплата до","Payable by":"Підлягає оплаті","Account":"Рахунок","Additional information":"Додаткова інформація","Currency / amount":"Валюта / сума","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Друк перевірки масштабу · 100 мм","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Швейцарський стандарт купюри QR","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-рахунок готовий. Деталі залишилися на цьому пристрої.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Деякі поля потребують перевірки. Перегляньте виділену інформацію.","Reading this image on your device…":"Читання цього зображення на вашому пристрої…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"QR-код Швейцарії зчитується та перевіряється локально.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"На цьому зображенні не знайдено читабельного QR-коду.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Дані швейцарського QR-коду дійсні для підтримуваних полів.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Дані не є дійсним платіжним навантаженням за QR-кодом Швейцарії.","Form and preview cleared.":"Форму та попередній перегляд очищено.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"ШІСТЬ зразків завантажено. Замініть деталі зразка перед реальним використанням.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Спочатку створіть або прочитайте дійсний QR-рахунок.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Виберіть PNG або JPEG розміром 10 МіБ або менше.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Не вдалося завантажити локальний QR-зчитувач. Натомість ви можете вставити платіжні дані.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Які комбінації IBAN і посилання дозволені?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"QR-IBAN використовує посилання QRR. Звичайний швейцарський IBAN використовує SCOR або відсутність структурованого посилання (NON). QRR призначений лише для рахунків у швейцарських франках.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Чи перевіряється, чи обліковий запис існує чи належить кредитору?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"№ Він перевіряє лише формат і контрольну суму IBAN. Він не зв’язується з банком чи реєстром рахунків.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Чи можу я надрукувати це в будь-якому масштабі?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Для паперового платіжного доручення надрукуйте 100% / Реальний розмір. Платіжна частина має бути A6 горизонтальною (148 × 105 мм); перевірте лінію 100 мм за допомогою лінійки.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Чи надсилає інструмент кудись дані рахунку?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"№ Генерація та читання зображень відбувається у вашому браузері. Не використовується обліковий запис або платіжний сервіс.","Grade Scale Generator":"Генератор шкали оцінок","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Генератор шкали оцінок — безкоштовний інструмент підрахунку балів до оцінок","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Перетворіть бали на відсотки та оцінки за допомогою власних порогів. Попередньо перегляньте повний масштаб, скопіюйте або експортуйте його та надрукуйте оціночний аркуш.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Створіть прозору шкалу оцінювання для іспиту чи завдання. Встановіть максимальну кількість балів і мінімальний відсоток для кожної оцінки; шкала не передбачає шкільного чи національного правила оцінювання.","Points earned":"Зароблені бали","Maximum points":"Максимум балів","Top grade label":"Етикетка вищого сорту","Top grade starts at (%)":"Вищий клас починається з (%)","Middle grade label":"Етикетка середнього сорту","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Середній клас починається з (%)","Lowest grade label":"Етикетка найнижчого ґатунку","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Найнижча оцінка починається з (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"З максимумом 50 балів, 45 балів дорівнює 90%. Ваші спеціальні порогові значення визначають мітку оцінки.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Чи використовується офіційна політика оцінювання?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"№ Ви встановлюєте пороги. Системи оцінювання відрізняються залежно від школи, курсу та країни; підтвердьте шкалу, яку ви плануєте використовувати.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Чи можу я експортувати смуги оцінки?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Так. Експортуйте відображені смуги як файл CSV або роздрукуйте масштаб."},"ur":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"ناروے ہالیڈے پے کیلکولیٹر","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"ناروے ہالیڈے پے کیلکولیٹر - مفت مجموعی تخمینہ","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"معیاری چھٹی، پانچویں ہفتے اور 60 یا اس سے زیادہ عمر کے ملازمین کے لیے عام شرحوں کا موازنہ کریں۔","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"اپنی پے سلپ پر دکھائے گئے فیریپینجیگرنلاگ درج کریں۔ اپنی عمر اور متفقہ تعطیل کی مدت کے لیے عام نارویجن چھٹیوں کی تنخواہوں کی شرحوں کا موازنہ کریں۔","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ کی بنیاد (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"میں چھٹی کے سال میں 60 یا اس سے بڑا ہوں","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"میرے معاہدے میں چھٹی کا پانچواں ہفتہ شامل ہے۔","Estimated holiday pay":"تخمینی تعطیل کی تنخواہ","Rate used":"استعمال شدہ شرح","Basis used":"بنیاد استعمال کیا گیا۔","Reset choices":"انتخابات کو دوبارہ ترتیب دیں۔","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"صرف مجموعی تخمینہ۔ چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ قابل ٹیکس آمدنی ہے؛ ٹیکس روکنا فرد اور تنخواہ کے لحاظ سے مختلف ہو سکتا ہے۔","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"NOK 500,000 کی بنیاد کے ساتھ، 10.2% کسی بھی پے رول ایڈجسٹمنٹ سے پہلے NOK 51,000 دیتا ہے۔","Which rate should I use?":"میں کون سا ریٹ استعمال کروں؟","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"تخمینہ عام کم از کم شرحوں کا استعمال کرتا ہے: 10.2% یا 12% پانچویں ہفتے کے ساتھ؛ 12.5% یا 14.3% 60 یا اس سے زیادہ عمر کے ملازمین کے لیے۔ آپ کا معاہدہ مزید دے سکتا ہے۔","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"کیا یہ ٹیکس کے بعد ادا کی گئی رقم ہے؟","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"No یہ ایک مجموعی تخمینہ ہے۔ چھٹیوں کی تنخواہ قابل ٹیکس آمدنی ہے؛ روکنا آپ کے حالات اور تنخواہ پر منحصر ہے۔","What belongs in the basis?":"بنیاد میں کیا ہے؟","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"اپنی پے سلپ یا سالانہ سٹیٹمنٹ پر feriepengegrunnlag استعمال کریں۔ کچھ معاوضے اور دیگر ادائیگیوں کو قواعد کے ذریعہ خارج کر دیا گیا ہے۔","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"ناروے انکم ٹیکس کیلکولیٹر","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"ناروے ٹیکس کیلکولیٹر 2026 - مفت تنخواہ اور پنشن کا تخمینہ","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"معیاری تنخواہ یا پورے سال کی عمر کی پنشن پر 2026 نارویجن انکم ٹیکس کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ سالانہ اور ماہانہ خالص تنخواہ، ٹیکس کے اجزاء دیکھیں اور دو منظرناموں کا موازنہ کریں۔","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"ایک معیاری رہائشی تنخواہ یا پورے سال کی عمر کی پنشن کے لیے 2026 نارویجن انکم ٹیکس کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ ٹیکس کے اہم اجزاء دیکھیں اور مجموعی آمدنی کے دو منظرناموں کا موازنہ کریں۔","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"کیلکولیٹر 2026 معیاری کٹوتیوں، پانچ ترقی پسند بریکٹ-ٹیکس بینڈز اور قومی بیمہ کی شراکت کا اطلاق کرتا ہے۔ پنشن موڈ میں صرف پورے سال کے لیے پنشن ٹیکس کریڈٹ شامل ہوتا ہے، 100% اہل بڑھاپا پنشن یا اہل AFP۔ یہ مکمل طور پر اس براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"NOK 600,000 کی تنخواہ کے لیے، تخمینہ شدہ سالانہ ٹیکس اور خالص تنخواہ کا کسی دوسری تنخواہ یا پورے سال کی پنشن کی رقم سے موازنہ کریں۔","Tax year":"ٹیکس سال","Scenario":"منظرنامہ","Salary":"تنخواہ","Full-year old-age pension":"پورے سال کی عمر کی پنشن","Gross annual income (NOK)":"مجموعی سالانہ آمدنی (NOK)","Tax zone":"ٹیکس زون","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"معیاری شرح (زیادہ تر ناروے)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / درج اقدامات زون میونسپلٹیز","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"پنشن کا تخمینہ تمام 12 مہینوں کے لیے 100% پر بڑھاپے کی پنشن یا AFP کو قبول کرتا ہے، بغیر کسی دوسری آمدنی کے۔","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"تنخواہ کا تخمینہ عام نارویجن ٹیکس ریزیڈنسی، عمر 17–69 اور کوئی دوسری آمدنی نہیں مانتا ہے۔","Compare two scenarios":"دو منظرناموں کا موازنہ کریں۔","Scenario 1":"منظر نامہ 1","Scenario 2":"منظر نامہ 2","Calculate estimate":"تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Estimated tax per year":"تخمینی ٹیکس فی سال","Average tax per month":"ہر ماہ اوسط ٹیکس","Estimated net per year":"تخمینہ خالص فی سال","Average net per month":"ہر ماہ اوسط خالص","Tax on ordinary income":"عام آمدنی پر ٹیکس","Bracket tax":"بریکٹ ٹیکس","National insurance contribution":"قومی بیمہ شراکت","Pension tax credit":"پنشن ٹیکس کریڈٹ","Estimated effective rate":"تخمینی موثر شرح","Standard deduction base":"معیاری کٹوتی کی بنیاد","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"شرحیں اور حدیں 2026 آمدنی کے سال کے لیے ہیں۔","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"صرف تخمینہ لگائیں، سرکاری ٹیکس حساب یا ٹیکس کارڈ نہیں۔ دیگر آمدنی، کٹوتیاں، عمر، رہائش، پنشن گریڈ اور ذاتی حالات نتیجہ بدل سکتے ہیں۔","Reset values":"اقدار کو دوبارہ ترتیب دیں۔","Example":"مثال","How the estimate works":"تخمینہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"کیا یہ میرا درست ٹیکس بل ہے یا ٹیکس کارڈ ودہولڈنگ؟","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"No یہ معیاری 2026 سالانہ ٹیکس کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے۔ آپ کی پوری آمدنی، کٹوتیوں اور حالات کی وجہ سے ٹیکس کارڈ، حتمی تشخیص اور روک تھام مختلف ہو سکتے ہیں۔","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"کیا میں یہاں تنخواہ اور پنشن کو اکٹھا کر سکتا ہوں؟","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"یہ ورژن ایک وقت میں ایک آمدنی کی قسم کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے۔ یہ مخلوط تنخواہ اور پنشن کیس کا حساب نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"کیا پنشن موڈ ہر پنشن کا احاطہ کرتا ہے؟","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"نہیں، پنشن کریڈٹ صرف ایک اہل بڑھاپے کی پنشن یا اہل AFP کے لیے وضع کیا گیا ہے جو پورے سال 100% پر لیا گیا ہے۔ جزوی سال یا درجہ بندی کی پنشن اور پنشن کی دیگر اقسام دائرہ کار سے باہر ہیں۔","What is the measures-zone option?":"اقدامات زون کا اختیار کیا ہے؟","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"یہ شائع شدہ 18.5% عام آمدنی کی شرح اور NOK 45,000 خصوصی کٹوتی Finnmark اور درج میونسپلٹیوں کے لیے لاگو کرتا ہے۔ تصدیق کریں کہ آپ کی میونسپلٹی اہل ہے۔","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"ناروے ویلتھ ٹیکس کیلکولیٹر","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"ناروے ویلتھ ٹیکس کیلکولیٹر 2026 — مفت تخمینہ","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"گھروں، حصص، کاروباری اثاثوں، نقد اور قرض سے 2026 نارویجن ویلتھ ٹیکس کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ ریاست اور میونسپل کی تقسیم، تشخیص میں چھوٹ اور قدر کی حساسیت کی حد دیکھیں۔","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"2026 کے لیے ذاتی نارویجن ویلتھ ٹیکس کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ گھروں کے لیے تخمینہ شدہ مارکیٹ ویلیوز اور حصص اور کاروباری اثاثوں کے لیے پری ڈسکاؤنٹ ٹیکس بیس درج کریں۔ تشخیص میں چھوٹ، قرض کی ایڈجسٹمنٹ اور الگ الگ ریاست اور میونسپل تخمینہ دیکھیں۔","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"تخمینہ 2026 قیمت کے اصولوں اور زیادہ سے زیادہ میونسپل ریٹ پر لاگو ہوتا ہے جب تک کہ آپ کم شرح درج نہ کریں۔ قرض چھوٹ سے پہلے مکمل اثاثہ کی قیمتوں کے ذریعہ مختص کیا جاتا ہے۔ رعایتی حصص یا کاروباری اثاثوں کو تفویض کردہ قرض کو اسی رعایت سے کم کیا جاتا ہے۔ جائیداد کی تشخیص، اہلیت اور ذاتی ٹیکس کے حقائق سرکاری نتیجہ کو تبدیل کر سکتے ہیں۔","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"NOK 10 ملین مارکیٹ ویلیو کے ساتھ ایک بنیادی گھر کی تخمینہ مالیت NOK 2.5 ملین ہے 2026 بنیادی گھر کے اصول کے تحت، قرض اور ذاتی الاؤنس سے پہلے۔","2026 tax year":"2026 ٹیکس سال","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"بنیادی گھر کی تخمینی مارکیٹ ویلیو (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"ثانوی گھروں کی تخمینہ مارکیٹ ویلیو (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"رعایت سے پہلے شیئرز اور شیئرز فنڈز (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"رعایت سے پہلے اہل کاروباری اثاثے (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"بینک ڈپازٹس اور دیگر اثاثے (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"کل قرض (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"دولت کے لیے ہم پر مشترکہ طور پر ٹیکس لگایا جاتا ہے۔","Municipal rate (%)":"میونسپل ریٹ (%)","Home-value comparison":"گھریلو قدر کا موازنہ","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"ویتھ ٹیکس کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Export CSV":"CSV برآمد کریں۔","Print estimate":"پرنٹ تخمینہ","Assets before discounts":"رعایت سے پہلے اثاثے۔","Taxable asset value after discounts":"رعایت کے بعد قابل ٹیکس اثاثہ کی قیمت","Debt reduction from discounts":"چھوٹ سے قرض میں کمی","Deductible debt estimate":"قابل کٹوتی قرض کا تخمینہ","Estimated net wealth":"تخمینہ شدہ خالص دولت","Personal allowance":"ذاتی الاؤنس","Taxable net wealth":"قابل ٹیکس خالص دولت","Municipal wealth tax":"میونسپل ویلتھ ٹیکس","State wealth tax":"ریاستی دولت ٹیکس","State tax, first band":"ریاستی ٹیکس، پہلا بینڈ","State tax, upper band":"ریاستی ٹیکس، اوپری بینڈ","Estimated total wealth tax":"تخمینی کل دولت ٹیکس","Lower home-value estimate":"گھر کی کم قیمت کا تخمینہ","Current-value estimate":"موجودہ قدر کا تخمینہ","Higher home-value estimate":"زیادہ گھر کی قیمت کا تخمینہ","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 اصول اور مفروضے۔","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"صرف اندازہ لگانا۔ یہ ٹیکس کی سرکاری تشخیص یا ٹیکس مشورہ نہیں ہے۔ جہاں دستیاب ہو اپنی ٹیکس ریٹرن ویلیوز استعمال کریں۔ آپ کے معاملے میں شرحیں، اہلیت، قرض کی تقسیم اور جائیداد کی قیمتیں مختلف ہو سکتی ہیں۔","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"گھر: سال کے آخر میں تخمینہ شدہ مارکیٹ ویلیو درج کریں۔ شیئرز اور اہل کاروباری اثاثے: 2026 ڈسکاؤنٹ سے پہلے ویلیو درج کریں، مارکیٹ ویلیو نہیں جب تک کہ ٹیکس کی درست بنیاد نہ ہو۔","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"الاؤنس اور ریاست کی اوپری حد صرف میاں بیوی، رجسٹرڈ شراکت داروں یا اہل ساتھیوں کے لیے دوگنا ہے جن کا مشترکہ طور پر ان کی مشترکہ دولت کا اندازہ لگایا گیا ہے۔","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"میونسپل کیلکولیشن میں منتخب شدہ شرح کا استعمال کیا جاتا ہے، 2026 زیادہ سے زیادہ 0.35% تک ڈیفالٹ ہوتا ہے۔ کچھ میونسپلٹی کم شرح استعمال کر سکتی ہیں۔","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"حساسیت صرف بنیادی اور ثانوی گھروں کی درج کردہ اقدار کو تبدیل کرتی ہے۔ یہ ایک موازنہ ہے، سرکاری تشخیص کی پیشین گوئی نہیں ہے۔","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 ویلتھ ٹیکس الاؤنس کیا ہے؟","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"معیاری حد ایک شخص کے لیے NOK 1.9 ملین اور شریک حیات یا اہل شراکت داروں کے لیے NOK 3.8 ملین ہے۔","How is my primary home valued?":"میرے بنیادی گھر کی قدر کیسی ہے؟","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"2026 کے لیے، تخمینی دولت کی قیمت NOK 14 ملین تک مارکیٹ ویلیو کا 25% ہے، نیز NOK 14 ملین سے زیادہ رقم کا 70% ہے۔","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"کیا اس سے ثانوی گھر پر رعایت لاگو ہوتی ہے؟","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"No 2026 ٹیبل ثانوی گھروں کو 0% قیمت کی رعایت دیتا ہے۔ یہ درج کردہ مارکیٹ ویلیو کو تخمینہ کے طور پر استعمال کرتا ہے۔ سرکاری تشخیص شدہ اقدار مختلف ہو سکتی ہیں۔","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"جب میں حصص یا کاروباری اثاثوں کا مالک ہوں تو قابل کٹوتی قرض کیوں بدل جاتا ہے؟","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"ناروے کے قوانین پورے اثاثوں کی قدروں کے مطابق قرض کو متناسب طور پر مختص کرتے ہیں۔ قیمتی رعایت کے ساتھ اثاثوں کو تفویض کردہ حصہ کو اسی رعایت کی شرح سے کم کیا جاتا ہے۔","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"کیا میونسپل ریٹ ہمیشہ 0.35% ہوتا ہے؟","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"No 0.35% 2026 زیادہ سے زیادہ ہے جو بطور ڈیفالٹ استعمال ہوتا ہے۔ میونسپلٹی کم شرح مقرر کر سکتی ہے، جسے آپ درج کر سکتے ہیں۔","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"کیا کیلکولیٹر ہر اثاثہ یا ٹیکس کیس کا احاطہ کرتا ہے؟","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"No یہ گھروں، حصص، منتخب کردہ اہل کاروباری اثاثوں، نقد رقم اور کل قرض کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے۔ غیر ملکی اثاثے، پنشن، پیچیدہ ملکیت، استثنیٰ اور دیگر خصوصی قواعد آپ کی تشخیص کو تبدیل کر سکتے ہیں۔","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"سوئس QR-بل جنریٹر","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"سوئس QR-بل جنریٹر - مفت QR انوائس میکر","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"مقامی طور پر سوئس QR-بل بنائیں اور چیک کریں۔ IBAN، QR-IBAN، QRR اور SCOR حوالہ جات کی توثیق کریں؛ A6 ادائیگی کے حصے اور رسید کو بغیر انوائس ڈیٹا اپ لوڈ کیے پرنٹ کریں۔","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"سوئس QR کوڈ کے ساتھ سوئس ادائیگی کی پرچی بنائیں۔ آپ کی رسید کی تفصیلات اس براؤزر میں رہتی ہیں۔ کوئی ادائیگی شروع نہیں کی جاتی ہے اور نہ ہی کسی بینک کے رجسٹر سے پوچھ گچھ کی جاتی ہے۔","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"یہ ٹول SIX سوئس پیمنٹ کوڈ (SPC) ڈیٹا بناتا ہے اور اس کے فیلڈز، اکاؤنٹ/ریفرنس کا مجموعہ، IBAN چیک ہندسوں اور معاون حروف کو چیک کرتا ہے۔ یہ ادائیگی کے حصے اور پرنٹنگ کی رسید کو ان کے مطلوبہ جسمانی سائز پر فارمیٹ کرتا ہے۔","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"چھ مثال: ایک QR-IBAN، CHF 50.00، ایک 27 ہندسوں کا QRR حوالہ اور منظم قرض دہندہ/قرضدار کے پتے۔","How it works":"یہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Frequently asked questions":"اکثر پوچھے گئے سوالات","Limits and accuracy":"حدود اور درستگی","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"یہ ایک مقامی دستاویز کا آلہ ہے، نہ کہ بینک سروس یا سرٹیفیکیشن۔ یہ اس بات کی تصدیق نہیں کر سکتا کہ IBAN کا مالک کون ہے، آیا اکاؤنٹ کھلا ہے، یا ادائیگی قبول کی جائے گی۔ 100% / اصل سائز پر پرنٹ کریں اور کاغذی ادائیگی کا آرڈر استعمال کرنے سے پہلے 100 mm چیک لائن کی پیمائش کریں۔","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"کریڈیٹر IBAN یا QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"قرض دہندہ کو قابل ادائیگی","Account holder / creditor name":"اکاؤنٹ ہولڈر / قرض دہندہ کا نام","Street or P.O. box":"Street or P.O. باکس","Building number":"عمارت نمبر","Postal code":"پوسٹل کوڈ","Town / city":"قصبہ/شہر","2-letter country code":"2-حروف والا ملک کا کوڈ","Amount (optional)":"رقم (اختیاری)","Currency":"کرنسی","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"قابل ادائیگی · اختیاری مقروض","Debtor name":"قرضدار کا نام","Reference type":"حوالہ کی قسم","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR حوالہ · صرف QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"کریڈیٹر کا حوالہ · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"کوئی ساختی حوالہ نہیں · IBAN","Reference":"حوالہ","Unstructured message":"غیر ساختہ پیغام","Billing information (optional)":"بلنگ کی معلومات (اختیاری)","Create QR-bill":"QR-بل بنائیں","Load SIX sample":"چھ نمونہ لوڈ کریں۔","Clear form":"کلیئر فارم","Check QR payload":"QR پے لوڈ چیک کریں۔","Download payment data":"ادائیگی کا ڈیٹا ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں۔","Download QR SVG":"QR SVG ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں۔","Print / save as PDF":"PDF کے بطور پرنٹ/محفوظ کریں۔","Read a QR Code image":"QR کوڈ کی تصویر پڑھیں","Choose PNG or JPEG":"PNG یا JPEG کا انتخاب کریں۔","Read image locally":"مقامی طور پر تصویر پڑھیں","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"سوئس QR کوڈ ادائیگی کا ڈیٹا پیسٹ کریں۔","Invoice details":"انوائس کی تفصیلات","QR-bill preview":"QR-بل کا پیش نظارہ","Receipt":"رسید","Payment part":"ادائیگی کا حصہ","Payable to":"قابل ادائیگی","Payable by":"بذریعہ قابل ادائیگی","Account":"اکاؤنٹ","Additional information":"اضافی معلومات","Currency / amount":"کرنسی / رقم","Print scale check · 100 mm":"پرنٹ اسکیل چیک · 100 ملی میٹر","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"6۔ سوئس QR-بل کا معیار","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR-بل تیار ہے۔ تفصیلات اس ڈیوائس پر موجود رہیں۔","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"کچھ فیلڈز کو چیک کرنے کی ضرورت ہے۔ نمایاں کردہ معلومات کا جائزہ لیں۔","Reading this image on your device…":"آپ کے آلے پر اس تصویر کو پڑھنا…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"سوئس QR کوڈ کو مقامی طور پر پڑھا اور چیک کیا گیا۔","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"اس تصویر میں کوئی پڑھنے کے قابل QR کوڈ نہیں ملا۔","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"سوئس QR کوڈ ڈیٹا معاون فیلڈز کے لیے درست ہے۔","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"ڈیٹا درست سوئس QR کوڈ ادائیگی پے لوڈ نہیں ہے۔","Form and preview cleared.":"فارم اور پیش نظارہ صاف ہو گیا۔","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"چھ نمونہ بھرا ہوا ہے۔ حقیقی استعمال سے پہلے اس کے نمونے کی تفصیلات کو تبدیل کریں۔","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"پہلے ایک درست QR-بل بنائیں یا پڑھیں۔","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"10 MiB یا اس سے کم کا PNG یا JPEG منتخب کریں۔","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"مقامی QR ریڈر لوڈ نہیں ہو سکا۔ اس کے بجائے آپ ادائیگی کا ڈیٹا چسپاں کر سکتے ہیں۔","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"کن IBAN اور حوالہ جات کے امتزاج کی اجازت ہے؟","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN ایک QRR حوالہ استعمال کرتا ہے۔ ایک عام سوئس IBAN SCOR یا کوئی ساختی حوالہ (NON) استعمال کرتا ہے۔ QRR صرف CHF رسیدوں کے لیے ہے۔","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"کیا یہ چیک کرتا ہے کہ اکاؤنٹ موجود ہے یا قرض دہندہ کا ہے؟","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"No یہ صرف فارمیٹ اور IBAN چیکسم کو چیک کرتا ہے۔ یہ کسی بینک یا اکاؤنٹ کی رجسٹری سے رابطہ نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Can I print this at any scale?":"کیا میں اسے کسی بھی پیمانے پر پرنٹ کر سکتا ہوں؟","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"کاغذی ادائیگی کے آرڈر کے لیے، 100% / اصل سائز پر پرنٹ کریں۔ ادائیگی کا حصہ A6 لینڈ اسکیپ ہونا چاہیے (148 × 105 mm)؛ ایک حکمران کے ساتھ 100 ملی میٹر لائن کو چیک کریں۔","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"کیا ٹول انوائس ڈیٹا کہیں بھی بھیجتا ہے؟","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"No جنریشن اور امیج ریڈنگ آپ کے براؤزر میں ہوتی ہے۔ کوئی اکاؤنٹ یا ادائیگی کی خدمت استعمال نہیں کی جاتی ہے۔","Grade Scale Generator":"گریڈ اسکیل جنریٹر","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"گریڈ اسکیل جنریٹر - مفت پوائنٹس ٹو گریڈ ٹول","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"اپنی اپنی حد کے ساتھ پوائنٹس کو فیصد اور گریڈ میں تبدیل کریں۔ پورے پیمانے کا جائزہ لیں، اسے کاپی کریں یا ایکسپورٹ کریں، اور گریڈنگ شیٹ پرنٹ کریں۔","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"کسی امتحان یا اسائنمنٹ کے لیے ایک شفاف گریڈنگ اسکیل بنائیں۔ ہر گریڈ کے لیے زیادہ سے زیادہ پوائنٹس اور کم از کم فیصد مقرر کریں۔ پیمانہ اسکول یا قومی درجہ بندی کا اصول نہیں مانتا۔","Points earned":"پوائنٹس حاصل ہوئے۔","Maximum points":"زیادہ سے زیادہ پوائنٹس","Top grade label":"ٹاپ گریڈ لیبل","Top grade starts at (%)":"ٹاپ گریڈ (%) سے شروع ہوتا ہے","Middle grade label":"درمیانی درجے کا لیبل","Middle grade starts at (%)":"مڈل گریڈ (%) سے شروع ہوتا ہے","Lowest grade label":"کم ترین گریڈ کا لیبل","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"کم ترین گریڈ (%) سے شروع ہوتا ہے","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"زیادہ سے زیادہ 50 پوائنٹ کے ساتھ، 45 پوائنٹس 90% کے برابر ہیں۔ آپ کی حسب ضرورت حدیں گریڈ لیبل کا فیصلہ کرتی ہیں۔","Does this use an official grading policy?":"کیا یہ سرکاری درجہ بندی کی پالیسی کا استعمال کرتا ہے؟","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"No آپ نے حدیں مقرر کیں۔ درجہ بندی کے نظام اسکول، کورس اور ملک کے لحاظ سے مختلف ہوتے ہیں۔ اس پیمانے کی تصدیق کریں جس کی آپ سے توقع کی جاتی ہے۔","Can I export the grading bands?":"کیا میں گریڈنگ بینڈ برآمد کر سکتا ہوں؟","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"ہاں۔ دکھائے گئے بینڈز کو بطور CSV فائل برآمد کریں یا اسکیل پرنٹ کریں۔"},"vi":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"Máy tính lương ngày lễ của Na Uy","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"Máy tính lương ngày lễ của Na Uy — Ước tính gộp miễn phí","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"Ước tính lương nghỉ lễ của Na Uy dựa trên cơ sở lương nghỉ lễ của bạn. So sánh mức lương phổ biến cho ngày nghỉ tiêu chuẩn, tuần thứ năm và nhân viên từ 60 trở lên.","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"Nhập feriepengegrunnlag hiển thị trên phiếu lương của bạn. So sánh tổng mức lương trả cho kỳ nghỉ lễ thông thường của Na Uy theo độ tuổi của bạn và thời gian nghỉ lễ đã thỏa thuận.","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"Cơ sở trả lương vào ngày lễ (NOK)","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"Tôi là 60 trở lên trong năm nghỉ lễ","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"Thỏa thuận của tôi bao gồm tuần nghỉ lễ thứ năm","Estimated holiday pay":"Mức lương kỳ nghỉ ước tính","Rate used":"Tỷ lệ sử dụng","Basis used":"Cơ sở được sử dụng","Reset choices":"Đặt lại các lựa chọn","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"Chỉ ước tính tổng. Tiền nghỉ lễ là thu nhập chịu thuế; khấu trừ thuế có thể khác nhau tùy theo người và bảng lương.","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"Với cơ sở NOK 500,000, 10.2% mang lại NOK 51,000 trước khi có bất kỳ điều chỉnh bảng lương nào.","Which rate should I use?":"Tôi nên sử dụng tỷ lệ nào?","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"Ước tính sử dụng tỷ lệ tối thiểu chung: 10.2% hoặc 12% với tuần thứ năm; 12.5% hoặc 14.3% dành cho nhân viên từ 60 trở lên. Thỏa thuận của bạn có thể cung cấp nhiều hơn.","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"Đây có phải là số tiền trả sau thuế không?","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"Không. Đây là một ước tính tổng thể. Tiền nghỉ lễ là thu nhập chịu thuế; việc khấu trừ phụ thuộc vào hoàn cảnh và bảng lương của bạn.","What belongs in the basis?":"Cơ sở thuộc về những gì?","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"Sử dụng feriepengegrunnlag trên phiếu lương hoặc bảng sao kê hàng năm của bạn. Một số khoản hoàn trả và các khoản thanh toán khác bị loại trừ bởi các quy tắc.","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"Máy tính thuế thu nhập của Na Uy","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"Máy tính thuế Na Uy 2026 — Ước tính lương và lương hưu miễn phí","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"Ước tính thuế thu nhập 2026 của Na Uy đối với mức lương tiêu chuẩn hoặc lương hưu trọn năm cho người già. Xem các thành phần thuế, lương ròng hàng năm và hàng tháng và so sánh hai kịch bản.","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"Ước tính 2026 thuế thu nhập của Na Uy đối với mức lương tiêu chuẩn của cư dân hoặc lương hưu trọn năm cho người già. Xem các thành phần thuế chính và so sánh hai kịch bản tổng thu nhập.","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"Máy tính áp dụng các khoản khấu trừ tiêu chuẩn 2026, năm khung thuế lũy tiến và đóng góp bảo hiểm quốc gia. Chế độ hưu trí chỉ bao gồm tín dụng thuế lương hưu cho lương hưu đủ điều kiện cả năm, 100% hoặc AFP đủ điều kiện. Nó chạy hoàn toàn trong trình duyệt này.","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"Đối với mức lương NOK 600,000, hãy so sánh thuế hàng năm ước tính và lương ròng với một mức lương khác hoặc số tiền lương hưu cả năm.","Tax year":"Năm tính thuế","Scenario":"Kịch bản","Salary":"Mức lương","Full-year old-age pension":"Lương hưu trọn năm","Gross annual income (NOK)":"Tổng thu nhập hàng năm (NOK)","Tax zone":"Khu vực thuế","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"Giá tiêu chuẩn (hầu hết Na Uy)","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"Finnmark / các đô thị thuộc khu vực biện pháp được liệt kê","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"Ước tính lương hưu giả định lương hưu đủ điều kiện hoặc AFP ở mức 100% cho tất cả các tháng 12, không có thu nhập khác.","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"Ước tính mức lương giả định nơi cư trú đóng thuế thông thường ở Na Uy, độ tuổi 17–69 và không có thu nhập nào khác.","Compare two scenarios":"So sánh hai kịch bản","Scenario 1":"Kịch bản 1","Scenario 2":"Kịch bản 2","Calculate estimate":"Tính toán ước tính","Estimated tax per year":"Thuế ước tính mỗi năm","Average tax per month":"Thuế trung bình mỗi tháng","Estimated net per year":"Số ròng ước tính mỗi năm","Average net per month":"Số tiền ròng trung bình mỗi tháng","Tax on ordinary income":"Thuế thu nhập thông thường","Bracket tax":"Khung thuế","National insurance contribution":"Đóng bảo hiểm quốc gia","Pension tax credit":"Tín dụng thuế hưu trí","Estimated effective rate":"Tỷ lệ hiệu quả ước tính","Standard deduction base":"Cơ sở khấu trừ tiêu chuẩn","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"Mức giá và ngưỡng dành cho năm thu nhập 2026.","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"Chỉ là ước tính, không phải là phép tính thuế hoặc thẻ thuế chính thức. Thu nhập khác, các khoản khấu trừ, tuổi tác, nơi cư trú, cấp lương hưu và hoàn cảnh cá nhân có thể thay đổi kết quả.","Reset values":"Đặt lại giá trị","Example":"Ví dụ","How the estimate works":"Cách hoạt động của ước tính","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"Đây có phải là hóa đơn thuế hoặc thẻ thuế khấu trừ chính xác của tôi không?","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"Không. Nó ước tính thuế hàng năm 2026 tiêu chuẩn. Thẻ thuế, đánh giá cuối cùng và khấu trừ thuế có thể khác nhau do toàn bộ thu nhập, các khoản khấu trừ và hoàn cảnh của bạn.","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"Tôi có thể kết hợp lương và lương hưu ở đây không?","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"Phiên bản này ước tính một loại thu nhập tại một thời điểm. Nó không tính toán trường hợp tiền lương và lương hưu hỗn hợp.","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"Chế độ lương hưu có bao gồm mọi khoản lương hưu không?","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"Không. Tín dụng lương hưu chỉ được mô hình hóa cho lương hưu đủ điều kiện hoặc AFP đủ điều kiện được lấy ở mức 100% trong suốt cả năm. Lương hưu một phần hoặc theo cấp bậc và các loại lương hưu khác nằm ngoài phạm vi.","What is the measures-zone option?":"Tùy chọn vùng đo là gì?","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"Nó ​​áp dụng tỷ lệ thu nhập bình thường 18.5% đã công bố và khoản khấu trừ đặc biệt NOK 45,000 cho Finnmark và các đô thị được liệt kê. Xác nhận rằng đô thị của bạn đủ điều kiện.","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"Máy tính thuế tài sản của Na Uy","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"Máy tính thuế tài sản của Na Uy 2026 — Ước tính miễn phí","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"Ước tính 2026 Thuế tài sản của Na Uy từ nhà, cổ phiếu, tài sản kinh doanh, tiền mặt và nợ. Xem sự phân chia của tiểu bang và thành phố, chiết khấu định giá và phạm vi độ nhạy giá trị.","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"Ước tính thuế tài sản cá nhân của Na Uy cho 2026. Nhập giá trị thị trường ước tính cho ngôi nhà và cơ sở tính thuế trước khi chiết khấu cho cổ phiếu và tài sản kinh doanh. Xem giảm giá định giá, điều chỉnh nợ và ước tính riêng của tiểu bang và thành phố.","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"Ước tính áp dụng các quy tắc định giá 2026 và tỷ lệ thành phố tối đa trừ khi bạn nhập tỷ lệ thấp hơn. Nợ được phân bổ theo toàn bộ giá trị tài sản trước khi chiết khấu; nợ được giao cho cổ phiếu chiết khấu hoặc tài sản kinh doanh được giảm theo cùng mức chiết khấu. Định giá tài sản, tính đủ điều kiện và thông tin thuế cá nhân có thể thay đổi kết quả chính thức.","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"Một ngôi nhà chính có giá trị thị trường 10 triệu NOK có giá trị tài sản ước tính là 2.5 triệu NOK theo quy tắc 2026 về ngôi nhà chính, trước nợ và trợ cấp cá nhân.","2026 tax year":"2026 năm tính thuế","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"Giá trị thị trường ước tính của nhà chính (NOK)","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"Giá trị thị trường ước tính của nhà thứ cấp (NOK)","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"Cổ phiếu và quỹ chia sẻ trước khi chiết khấu (NOK)","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"Tài sản kinh doanh đủ điều kiện trước khi chiết khấu (NOK)","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"Tiền gửi ngân hàng và các tài sản khác (NOK)","Total debt (NOK)":"Tổng nợ (NOK)","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"Chúng ta cùng bị đánh thuế tài sản","Municipal rate (%)":"Tỷ lệ đô thị (%)","Home-value comparison":"So sánh giá trị gia đình","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"Ước tính thuế tài sản","Export CSV":"Xuất CSV","Print estimate":"Ước tính in","Assets before discounts":"Tài sản trước chiết khấu","Taxable asset value after discounts":"Giá trị tài sản chịu thuế sau khi giảm giá","Debt reduction from discounts":"Giảm nợ từ chiết khấu","Deductible debt estimate":"Ước tính nợ được khấu trừ","Estimated net wealth":"Tài sản ròng ước tính","Personal allowance":"Trợ cấp cá nhân","Taxable net wealth":"Tài sản ròng chịu thuế","Municipal wealth tax":"Thuế tài sản thành phố","State wealth tax":"Thuế tài sản của tiểu bang","State tax, first band":"Thuế nhà nước, băng tần đầu tiên","State tax, upper band":"Thuế nhà nước, dải trên","Estimated total wealth tax":"Tổng thuế tài sản ước tính","Lower home-value estimate":"Ước tính giá trị căn nhà thấp hơn","Current-value estimate":"Ước tính giá trị hiện tại","Higher home-value estimate":"Ước tính giá trị căn nhà cao hơn","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 quy tắc và giả định","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"Chỉ ước tính. Đây không phải là đánh giá thuế chính thức hoặc tư vấn về thuế. Sử dụng giá trị khai thuế của bạn nếu có; tỷ lệ, tính đủ điều kiện, phân bổ nợ và giá trị tài sản có thể khác nhau trong trường hợp của bạn.","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"Nhà: nhập giá trị thị trường ước tính vào cuối năm. Cổ phiếu và tài sản kinh doanh đủ điều kiện: nhập giá trị trước chiết khấu 2026, không phải giá trị thị trường trừ khi đó là cơ sở thuế chính xác.","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"Mức trợ cấp và ngưỡng trên của tiểu bang chỉ tăng gấp đôi đối với vợ/chồng, bạn tình đã đăng ký hoặc những người sống chung đủ điều kiện được đánh giá chung về tổng tài sản của họ.","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"Tính toán của thành phố sử dụng tỷ lệ đã chọn, mặc định là 2026 tối đa là 0.35%. Một số thành phố có thể sử dụng tỷ lệ thấp hơn.","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"Độ nhạy chỉ thay đổi giá trị đã nhập của ngôi nhà chính và phụ. Đó là sự so sánh chứ không phải là dự đoán về mức định giá chính thức.","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"Trợ cấp thuế tài sản 2026 là gì?","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"Ngưỡng tiêu chuẩn là 1.9 triệu NOK cho một người và 3.8 triệu NOK cho vợ/chồng hoặc đối tác đủ điều kiện được đánh giá chung.","How is my primary home valued?":"Ngôi nhà chính của tôi được định giá như thế nào?","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"Đối với 2026, giá trị tài sản ước tính là 25% giá trị thị trường lên tới 14 triệu NOK, cộng với 70% của số tiền trên 14 triệu NOK.","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"Điều này có áp dụng giảm giá cho ngôi nhà thứ cấp không?","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"Không. Bảng 2026 mang đến cho các ngôi nhà thứ cấp mức chiết khấu định giá 0%. Nó sử dụng giá trị thị trường đã nhập làm ước tính; giá trị đánh giá chính thức có thể khác nhau.","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"Tại sao khoản nợ được khấu trừ thay đổi khi tôi sở hữu cổ phiếu hoặc tài sản kinh doanh?","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"Quy tắc của Na Uy phân bổ nợ tương ứng với toàn bộ giá trị tài sản. Phần được giao cho tài sản được chiết khấu khi định giá sẽ được giảm theo tỷ lệ chiết khấu tương tự.","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"Tỷ lệ thành phố có phải luôn là 0.35% không?","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"Không. 0.35% là 2026 tối đa được sử dụng theo mặc định. Một đô thị có thể đặt ra mức giá thấp hơn mà bạn có thể nhập.","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"Máy tính có bao gồm mọi trường hợp tài sản hoặc thuế không?","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"Không. Nó ước tính nhà cửa, cổ phiếu, tài sản kinh doanh đủ điều kiện được lựa chọn, tiền mặt và tổng nợ. Tài sản nước ngoài, lương hưu, quyền sở hữu phức hợp, miễn trừ và các quy định đặc biệt khác có thể thay đổi đánh giá của bạn.","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"Máy tạo hóa đơn QR Thụy Sĩ","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"Trình tạo hóa đơn QR Thụy Sĩ — Trình tạo hóa đơn QR miễn phí","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"Tạo và kiểm tra hóa đơn QR Thụy Sĩ tại địa phương. Xác thực các tham chiếu IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR và SCOR; in phần thanh toán và biên lai A6 mà không cần tải lên dữ liệu hóa đơn.","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"Tạo phiếu thanh toán Thụy Sĩ bằng Mã QR Thụy Sĩ. Chi tiết hóa đơn của bạn vẫn còn trong trình duyệt này; không có khoản thanh toán nào được bắt đầu và không có đăng ký ngân hàng nào được truy vấn.","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"Công cụ này xây dựng dữ liệu SÁU Mã thanh toán Thụy Sĩ (SPC) và kiểm tra các trường, kết hợp tài khoản/tham chiếu, chữ số kiểm tra IBAN và ký tự được hỗ trợ. Nó định dạng phần thanh toán và biên lai để in ở kích thước vật lý được yêu cầu.\nVí dụ","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX: QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, tham chiếu QRR 27 chữ số và địa chỉ bên nợ/bên nợ có cấu trúc.","How it works":"Cách thức hoạt động","Frequently asked questions":"Câu hỏi thường gặp","Limits and accuracy":"Giới hạn và độ chính xác","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"Đây là công cụ tài liệu địa phương, không phải dịch vụ ngân hàng hay chứng nhận. Nó không thể xác nhận ai sở hữu IBAN, liệu tài khoản có được mở hay không hoặc liệu khoản thanh toán có được chấp nhận hay không. In ở mức 100%/Kích thước thực tế và đo vạch kiểm tra 100 mm trước khi sử dụng lệnh thanh toán bằng giấy.","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"Bên cho vay IBAN hoặc QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"Phải trả cho · chủ nợ","Account holder / creditor name":"Tên chủ tài khoản/chủ nợ","Street or P.O. box":"Đường phố hoặc P.O. cái hộp","Building number":"Số tòa nhà","Postal code":"Mã bưu chính","Town / city":"Thị trấn / thành phố","2-letter country code":"2-mã quốc gia chữ cái","Amount (optional)":"Số lượng (tùy chọn)","Currency":"Tiền tệ","CHF":"CHF","EUR":"EUR","Payable by · optional debtor":"Người trả bởi · người nợ tùy chọn","Debtor name":"Tên bên nợ","Reference type":"Loại tham chiếu","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"Tham khảo QR · Chỉ QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"Tham khảo bên được chi trả · IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"Không có tham chiếu có cấu trúc · IBAN","Reference":"Tham khảo","Unstructured message":"Tin nhắn phi cấu trúc","Billing information (optional)":"Thông tin thanh toán (tùy chọn)","Create QR-bill":"Tạo hóa đơn QR","Load SIX sample":"Tải SIX mẫu","Clear form":"Hình thức rõ ràng","Check QR payload":"Kiểm tra tải trọng QR","Download payment data":"Tải xuống dữ liệu thanh toán","Download QR SVG":"Tải xuống QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"In / lưu dưới dạng PDF","Read a QR Code image":"Đọc hình ảnh Mã QR","Choose PNG or JPEG":"Chọn PNG hoặc JPEG","Read image locally":"Đọc hình ảnh cục bộ","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"Dán dữ liệu thanh toán Swiss QR Code","Invoice details":"Chi tiết hóa đơn","QR-bill preview":"xem trước hóa đơn QR","Receipt":"Biên lai","Payment part":"Phần thanh toán","Payable to":"Thanh toán cho","Payable by":"Thanh toán bởi","Account":"Tài khoản","Additional information":"Thông tin bổ sung","Currency / amount":"Tiền tệ / số tiền","Print scale check · 100 mm":"Kiểm tra tỷ lệ in · 100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"SIX · Tiêu chuẩn hóa đơn QR của Thụy Sĩ","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"Hóa đơn QR đã sẵn sàng. Thông tin chi tiết vẫn còn trên thiết bị này.","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"Một số trường cần kiểm tra. Xem lại thông tin được đánh dấu.","Reading this image on your device…":"Đọc hình ảnh này trên thiết bị của bạn…","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"Mã QR Thụy Sĩ được đọc và kiểm tra cục bộ.","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"Không tìm thấy Mã QR có thể đọc được trong hình ảnh đó.","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"Dữ liệu Swiss QR Code hợp lệ cho các trường được hỗ trợ.","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"Dữ liệu không phải là trọng tải thanh toán Mã QR Thụy Sĩ hợp lệ.","Form and preview cleared.":"Đã xóa biểu mẫu và bản xem trước.","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"Đã nạp SÁU mẫu. Thay thế các chi tiết mẫu của nó trước khi sử dụng thực tế.","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"Trước tiên hãy tạo hoặc đọc hóa đơn QR hợp lệ.","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"Chọn PNG hoặc JPEG từ 10 MiB trở xuống.","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"Trình đọc QR cục bộ không thể tải. Thay vào đó, bạn có thể dán dữ liệu thanh toán.","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"Những kết hợp IBAN và tham chiếu nào được phép?","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"QR-IBAN sử dụng tham chiếu QRR. IBAN Thụy Sĩ bình thường sử dụng SCOR hoặc không có tham chiếu có cấu trúc (NON). QRR chỉ dành cho hóa đơn CHF.","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"Điều này có kiểm tra xem tài khoản có tồn tại hay thuộc về chủ nợ không?","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"Không. Nó chỉ kiểm tra định dạng và tổng kiểm tra IBAN. Nó không liên hệ với ngân hàng hoặc cơ quan đăng ký tài khoản.","Can I print this at any scale?":"Tôi có thể in cái này ở mọi tỷ lệ không?","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"Đối với lệnh thanh toán bằng giấy, in với giá trị 100% / Kích thước thực tế. Phần thanh toán phải là A6 ngang (148 × 105 mm); kiểm tra đường mm 100 mm bằng thước kẻ.","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"Công cụ có gửi dữ liệu hóa đơn đến bất kỳ đâu không?","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"Không. Việc tạo và đọc hình ảnh diễn ra trong trình duyệt của bạn. Không có tài khoản hoặc dịch vụ thanh toán nào được sử dụng.","Grade Scale Generator":"Bộ tạo thang điểm","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"Trình tạo thang điểm — Công cụ tính điểm theo điểm miễn phí","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"Biến điểm thành tỷ lệ phần trăm và điểm số với ngưỡng của riêng bạn. Xem trước thang đo đầy đủ, sao chép hoặc xuất nó và in bảng chấm điểm.","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"Xây dựng thang điểm minh bạch cho bài kiểm tra hoặc bài tập. Đặt điểm tối đa và tỷ lệ phần trăm tối thiểu cho mỗi lớp; thang đo không giả định quy tắc chấm điểm của trường hoặc quốc gia.","Points earned":"Số điểm kiếm được","Maximum points":"Điểm tối đa","Top grade label":"Nhãn cao cấp","Top grade starts at (%)":"Cấp cao nhất bắt đầu từ (%)","Middle grade label":"Nhãn cấp trung","Middle grade starts at (%)":"Hạng trung học bắt đầu từ (%)","Lowest grade label":"Nhãn cấp thấp nhất","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"Cấp thấp nhất bắt đầu từ (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"Với điểm 50 tối đa, điểm 45 bằng 90%. Ngưỡng tùy chỉnh của bạn quyết định nhãn cấp.","Does this use an official grading policy?":"Điều này có áp dụng chính sách chấm điểm chính thức không?","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"Không. Bạn đặt ngưỡng. Hệ thống chấm điểm khác nhau tùy theo trường, khóa học và quốc gia; xác nhận quy mô bạn dự kiến ​​sẽ sử dụng.","Can I export the grading bands?":"Tôi có thể xuất dải phân loại không?","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"Có. Xuất các dải được hiển thị dưới dạng tệp CSV hoặc in thang đo."},"zh":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"挪威假期工资计算器","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"挪威假期工资计算器 — 免费总估算","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"根据您的假期工资估算挪威假期工资。比较标准休假、第五周和年龄为 60 或以上的员工的常见费率。","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"输入工资单上显示的 feriepengegrunnlag。根据您的年龄和约定的假期长度，比较挪威常见的假期工资总额。","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"假期工资基础（挪威克朗）","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"我在假期年满 60 或以上","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"我的协议包括第五周假期","Estimated holiday pay":"预计假期工资","Rate used":"使用率","Basis used":"使用依据","Reset choices":"重置选择","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"仅为粗略估计。假期工资属于应税收入；预扣税可能因个人和工资而异。","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"以 NOK 500,000 为基础，10.2% 在任何工资单调整之前给出 NOK 51,000。","Which rate should I use?":"我应该使用哪个速率？","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"该估算使用常见的最低费率：第五周的 10.2% 或 12%；对于年龄为 60 或以上的员工，为 12.5% 或 14.3%。你的协议可能会给予更多。","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"这是税后支付的金额吗？","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"编号这是一个粗略的估计。假期工资属于应税收入；预扣税取决于您的情况和工资。","What belongs in the basis?":"基础属于什么？","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"在您的工资单或年度报表上使用 feriepengegrunnlag。规则不包括一些报销和其他付款。","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"挪威所得税计算器","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"挪威税务计算器 2026 — 免费工资和养老金估算","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"估计 2026 挪威标准工资或全年养老金的所得税。查看年度和每月净工资、税收成分并比较两种情况。","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"估算标准居民工资或全年养老金的挪威所得税 2026。查看主要税收组成部分并比较两种总收入情景。","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"计算器适用 2026 标准扣除额、五个累进税级和国民保险缴款。养老金模式仅包括全年 100% 合格养老金或合格 AFP 的养老金税收抵免。它完全在这个浏览器中运行。","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"对于 NOK 600,000 的工资，将估计的年税和净工资与其他工资或全年养老金金额进行比较。","Tax year":"纳税年度","Scenario":"场景","Salary":"工资","Full-year old-age pension":"全年养老金","Gross annual income (NOK)":"年总收入（挪威克朗）","Tax zone":"税区","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"标准费率（挪威大部分地区）","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"芬马克/列出的措施区城市","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"养老金估算假设所有 12 个月的合格养老金或 AFP 均为 100%，没有其他收入。","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"薪资估算假设拥有普通挪威税务居民身份、年龄 17–69 并且没有其他收入。","Compare two scenarios":"比较两种场景","Scenario 1":"场景 1","Scenario 2":"场景 2","Calculate estimate":"计算估算","Estimated tax per year":"每年预计税费","Average tax per month":"每月平均税费","Estimated net per year":"估计每年净值","Average net per month":"每月平均净收入","Tax on ordinary income":"普通收入税","Bracket tax":"括号税","National insurance contribution":"国民保险缴费","Pension tax credit":"养老金税收抵免","Estimated effective rate":"预计有效率","Standard deduction base":"标准扣底座","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"税率和阈值适用于 2026 收入年度。","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"仅供估算，不是官方税款计算或税卡。其他收入、扣除额、年龄、居住地、养老金等级和个人情况可能会改变结果。","Reset values":"重置值","Example":"示例","How the estimate works":"估算如何进行","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"这是我的确切税单或税卡预扣税吗？","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"编号它估计标准 2026 年税。税卡、最终评估和预扣税可能会因您的全部收入、扣除额和情况而有所不同。","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"我可以在这里合并工资和养老金吗？","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"此版本一次估计一种收入类型。它不计算混合工资和养老金情况。","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"养老金模式是否涵盖所有养老金？","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"编号养老金抵免仅针对全年按 100% 领取的合格养老金或合格 AFP 进行建模。部分年金或分级养老金以及其他养老金类型不在范围内。","What is the measures-zone option?":"什么是测量区域选项？","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"适用于芬马克和所列城市公布的 18.5% 普通收入率和挪威克朗 45,000 特别扣除。确认您所在的城市符合资格。","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"挪威财富税计算器","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"挪威财富税计算器 2026 — 免费估算","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"估计 2026 挪威对房屋、股票、企业资产、现金和债务征收的财富税。查看州和市的划分、估值折扣和价值敏感度范围。","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"估计挪威个人财富税为 2026。输入房屋的估计市场价值以及股票和企业资产的贴现前税基。请参阅估值折扣、债务调整以及单独的州和市估计。","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"除非您输入较低的费率，否则估算值将应用 2026 估价规则和最高市政费率。债务按折现前的全部资产价值进行分配；分配给折扣股票或企业资产的债务也按相同的折扣减少。房产估价、资格和个人税务事实可能会改变官方结果。","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"根据 2026 主要住房规则，市场价值为 10 百万挪威克朗的主要住房的估计财富价值为 2.5 百万挪威克朗（扣除债务和个人津贴）。","2026 tax year":"2026 纳税年度","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"主要住宅估计市场价值（挪威克朗）","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"二手房估计市场价值（挪威克朗）","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"折扣前的股票和共享资金（挪威克朗）","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"折扣前的合格企业资产（挪威克朗）","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"银行存款和其他资产（挪威克朗）","Total debt (NOK)":"债务总额（挪威克朗）","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"我们共同对财富征税","Municipal rate (%)":"市政费率 (%)","Home-value comparison":"首页价值对比","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"预估财富税","Export CSV":"导出 CSV","Print estimate":"打印预估","Assets before discounts":"折扣前的资产","Taxable asset value after discounts":"折扣后的应税资产价值","Debt reduction from discounts":"折扣减少债务","Deductible debt estimate":"可抵扣债务估算","Estimated net wealth":"估计净财富","Personal allowance":"个人津贴","Taxable net wealth":"应税净财富","Municipal wealth tax":"市政财富税","State wealth tax":"国家财富税","State tax, first band":"州税，第一频段","State tax, upper band":"州税，上限","Estimated total wealth tax":"预计财富税总额","Lower home-value estimate":"较低的房屋价值估算","Current-value estimate":"当前值估计","Higher home-value estimate":"更高的房屋价值估算","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 规则和假设","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"仅供估计。这不是官方税务评估或税务建议。尽可能使用您的纳税申报表值；利率、资格、债务分配和财产价值可能因您的情况而异。","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"房屋：输入年底的估计市场价值。股票和符合条件的企业资产：输入 2026 折扣之前的价值，而不是市场价值，除非这是正确的计税基础。","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"仅针对配偶、注册伴侣或共同评估其总财富的合格同居者，津贴和州上限门槛加倍。","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"市政计算使用选定的费率，默认为 2026 最大值 0.35%。一些城市可能使用较低的费率。","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"灵敏度仅更改主要和次要住宅的输入值。这是一个比较，而不是对官方估值的预测。","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 财富税津贴是多少？","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"一人的标准门槛为 1.9 百万挪威克朗，配偶或共同评估的合格伴侣的标准门槛为 3.8 挪威克朗。","How is my primary home valued?":"我的主要住宅如何估价？","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"对于2026，估计财富价值为市值不超过14百万挪威克朗的25%，加上14百万挪威克朗以上金额的70%。","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"这对二手房有折扣吗？","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"编号2026 表为二手房提供了 0% 的估值折扣。它使用输入的市场价值作为估计值；官方评估值可能有所不同。","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"为什么当我拥有股票或企业资产时，可扣除债务会发生变化？","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"挪威规则按总资产价值按比例分配债务。分配给有评估折扣的资产的部分按相同的折扣率减少。","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"市政费率是否始终为 0.35%？","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"编号0.35% 是默认使用的 2026 最大值。市政府可能会设置较低的费率，您可以输入该费率。","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"计算器是否涵盖所有资产或税务案例？","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"编号它估算房屋、股票、选定的合格企业资产、现金和总债务。外国资产、养老金、复杂所有权、豁免和其他特殊规则可能会改变您的评估。","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"瑞士二维码账单生成器","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"瑞士二维码账单生成器 — 免费二维码发票制作工具","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"在本地创建并检查瑞士 QR 账单。验证 IBAN、QR-IBAN、QRR 和 SCOR 参考；打印 A6 付款部分和收据，无需上传发票数据。","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"使用瑞士二维码创建瑞士付款单。您的发票详细信息保留在此浏览器中；不发起付款，也不查询银行登记册。","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"该工具构建六种瑞士支付代码 (SPC) 数据并检查其字段、帐户/参考组合、IBAN 校验位和支持的字符。它格式化付款部分和收据，以便按照所需的物理尺寸进行打印。","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX 示例：QR-IBAN、CHF 50.00、27 数字 QRR 参考和结构化债权人/债务人地址。","How it works":"工作原理","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题解答","Limits and accuracy":"限值和精度","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"这是本地文档工具，不是银行服务或认证。它无法确认谁拥有 IBAN、帐户是否已开立或是否会接受付款。在使用纸质付款订单之前，按 100%/实际尺寸打印并测量 100 毫米检查线。","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"贷方 IBAN 或 QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"应付给·债权人","Account holder / creditor name":"账户持有人/债权人姓名","Street or P.O. box":"街道或邮政信箱盒子","Building number":"楼号","Postal code":"邮政编码","Town / city":"城镇/城市","2-letter country code":"2-字母国家代码","Amount (optional)":"数量（可选）","Currency":"货币","CHF":"瑞士法郎","EUR":"欧元","Payable by · optional debtor":"由·可选债务人支付","Debtor name":"债务人姓名","Reference type":"参考型","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR 参考·仅限 QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"贷方参考·IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"无结构化参考·IBAN","Reference":"参考","Unstructured message":"非结构化消息","Billing information (optional)":"账单信息（可选）","Create QR-bill":"创建二维码账单","Load SIX sample":"加载六个样品","Clear form":"透明形式","Check QR payload":"检查 QR 有效负载","Download payment data":"下载支付数据","Download QR SVG":"下载 QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"打印/另存为 PDF","Read a QR Code image":"读取二维码图像","Choose PNG or JPEG":"选择 PNG 或 JPEG","Read image locally":"本地读取图像","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"粘贴瑞士二维码支付数据","Invoice details":"发票详细信息","QR-bill preview":"二维码账单预览","Receipt":"收据","Payment part":"支付部分","Payable to":"付款人","Payable by":"付款人","Account":"账户","Additional information":"附加信息","Currency / amount":"货币/金额","Print scale check · 100 mm":"打印比例检查·100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"六·瑞士QR票据标准","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR 账单已准备就绪。详细信息保留在该设备上。","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"某些字段需要检查。查看突出显示的信息。","Reading this image on your device…":"在您的设备上读取此图像...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"瑞士二维码在本地读取和检查。","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"在该图像中找不到可读的 QR 代码。","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"瑞士 QR 码数据对支持的字段有效。","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"数据不是有效的瑞士二维码支付负载。","Form and preview cleared.":"表单和预览已清除。","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"已加载六个样本。在实际使用之前替换其示例详细信息。","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"首先创建或读取有效的 QR 帐单。","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"选择 10 MiB 或更少的 PNG 或 JPEG。","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"本地 QR 阅读器无法加载。您可以改为粘贴付款数据。","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"允许哪些 IBAN 和参考组合？","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN 使用 QRR 参考。普通的瑞士 IBAN 使用 SCOR 或无结构化参考 (NON)。 QRR 仅适用于瑞士法郎发票。","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"这是否检查该帐户是否存在或属于债权人？","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"编号它仅检查格式和 IBAN 校验和。它不联系银行或帐户注册机构。","Can I print this at any scale?":"我可以以任何比例打印它吗？","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"对于纸质付款订单，按 100%/实际尺寸打印。付款部分必须为A6横向（148×105毫米）；用尺子检查100毫米线。","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"该工具是否将发票数据发送到任何地方？","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"编号生成和图像读取发生在您的浏览器中。不使用任何帐户或支付服务。","Grade Scale Generator":"等级尺发生器","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"等级尺生成器 — 免费的点到等级工具","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"使用您自己的阈值将分数转换为百分比和等级。预览全尺寸、复制或导出并打印分级表。","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"为考试或作业构建透明的评分标准。设置每个等级的最高分和最低百分比；该量表不采用学校或国家评分规则。","Points earned":"获得的积分","Maximum points":"最大点数","Top grade label":"高档标签","Top grade starts at (%)":"顶级品位起价(%)","Middle grade label":"中档标签","Middle grade starts at (%)":"中级起价(%)","Lowest grade label":"最低等级标签","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"最低等级起始于 (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"最大 50 点，45 点等于 90%。您的自定义阈值决定等级标签。","Does this use an official grading policy?":"这是否使用官方分级政策？","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"编号您设置阈值。评分系统因学校、课程和国家而异；确认您预计使用的秤。","Can I export the grading bands?":"我可以导出分级波段吗？","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"是的。将显示的条带导出为 CSV 文件或打印比例。"},"zh_tw":{"Norway Holiday Pay Calculator":"挪威假期工資計算器","Norway Holiday Pay Calculator — Free Gross Estimate":"挪威假期薪資計算器 — 免費總估算","Estimate Norwegian holiday pay from your holiday-pay basis. Compare common rates for standard leave, a fifth week and employees aged 60 or over.":"根據您的假期工資估算挪威假期工資。比較標準休假、第五週和年齡為 60 或以上的員工的常見費率。","Enter the feriepengegrunnlag shown on your payslip. Compare common Norwegian gross holiday-pay rates for your age and agreed holiday length.":"輸入薪資單上顯示的 feriepengegrunnlag。根據您的年齡和約定的假期長度，比較挪威常見的假期工資總額。","Holiday-pay basis (NOK)":"假期工資基礎（挪威克朗）","I am 60 or older in the holiday year":"我在假期年滿 60 或以上","My agreement includes a fifth holiday week":"我的協議包括第五週假期","Estimated holiday pay":"預計假期工資","Rate used":"使用率","Basis used":"使用依據","Reset choices":"重設選擇","Gross estimate only. Holiday pay is taxable income; tax withholding can vary by person and payroll.":"僅為粗略估計。假期工資屬於應稅收入；預扣稅可能因個人和工資而異。","With a NOK 500,000 basis, 10.2% gives NOK 51,000 before any payroll adjustments.":"以 NOK 500,000 為基礎，10.2% 在任何薪資調整之前給出 NOK 51,000。","Which rate should I use?":"我該使用哪個速率？","The estimate uses common minimum rates: 10.2% or 12% with a fifth week; 12.5% or 14.3% for employees aged 60 or over. Your agreement may give more.":"此估算使用常見的最低費率：第五週的 10.2% 或 12%；對於年齡為 60 或以上的員工，為 12.5% 或 14.3%。你的協議可能會給予更多。","Is this the amount paid after tax?":"這是稅後支付的金額嗎？","No. This is a gross estimate. Holiday pay is taxable income; withholding depends on your circumstances and payroll.":"編號這是一個粗略的估計。假期工資屬於應稅收入；預扣稅取決於您的情況和工資。","What belongs in the basis?":"基礎屬於什麼？","Use the feriepengegrunnlag on your payslip or annual statement. Some reimbursements and other payments are excluded by the rules.":"在您的薪資單或年度報表上使用 feriepengegrunnlag。規則不包括一些報銷和其他付款。","Norway Income Tax Calculator":"挪威所得稅計算器","Norway Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Salary & Pension Estimate":"挪威稅務計算器 2026 — 免費薪資和退休金估算","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax on standard salary or full-year old-age pension. See annual and monthly net pay, tax components and compare two scenarios.":"估計 2026 挪威標準工資或全年退休金的所得稅。查看年度和每月淨工資、稅收成分並比較兩種情況。","Estimate 2026 Norwegian income tax for a standard resident salary or a full-year old-age pension. See the main tax components and compare two gross-income scenarios.":"估算標準居民薪資或全年退休金的挪威所得稅 2026。查看主要稅收組成部分並比較兩種總收入情境。","The calculator applies 2026 standard deductions, the five progressive bracket-tax bands and national insurance contributions. Pension mode includes the pension tax credit only for a full-year, 100% qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP. It runs entirely in this browser.":"計算器適用 2026 標準扣除額、五個累進稅級和國民保險繳款。退休金模式僅包括全年 100% 合格退休金或合格 AFP 的退休金稅收抵免。它完全在這個瀏覽器中運行。","For a salary of NOK 600,000, compare the estimated yearly tax and net pay with another salary or a full-year pension amount.":"對於 NOK 600,000 的工資，將估計的年稅和淨工資與其他工資或全年退休金金額進行比較。","Tax year":"課稅年度","Scenario":"場景","Salary":"工資","Full-year old-age pension":"全年退休金","Gross annual income (NOK)":"年總收入（挪威克朗）","Tax zone":"稅區","Standard rate (most of Norway)":"標準費率（挪威大部分地區）","Finnmark / listed measures-zone municipalities":"芬馬克/列出的措施區城市","Pension estimate assumes eligible old-age pension or AFP at 100% for all 12 months, with no other income.":"退休金估計假設所有 12 個月的合格退休金或 AFP 均為 100%，沒有其他收入。","Salary estimate assumes ordinary Norwegian tax residency, age 17–69 and no other income.":"薪資估計假設擁有普通挪威稅務居民身分、年齡 17–69 且沒有其他收入。","Compare two scenarios":"比較兩種場景","Scenario 1":"場景 1","Scenario 2":"場景 2","Calculate estimate":"計算估算","Estimated tax per year":"每年預計稅費","Average tax per month":"每月平均稅費","Estimated net per year":"估計每年淨值","Average net per month":"每月平均淨收入","Tax on ordinary income":"普通所得稅","Bracket tax":"括號稅","National insurance contribution":"國民保險繳費","Pension tax credit":"退休金稅收抵免","Estimated effective rate":"預計有效率","Standard deduction base":"標準扣底座","Rates and thresholds are for the 2026 income year.":"稅率和門檻適用於 2026 收入年度。","Estimate only, not an official tax calculation or tax card. Other income, deductions, age, residency, pension grade and personal circumstances can change the result.":"僅供估算，不是官方稅金計算或稅卡。其他收入、扣除額、年齡、居住地、退休金等級和個人情況可能會改變結果。","Reset values":"重設值","Example":"範例","How the estimate works":"估算如何進行","Is this my exact tax bill or tax-card withholding?":"這是我的確切稅單或稅卡預扣稅嗎？","No. It estimates standard 2026 annual tax. A tax card, final assessment and withholding can differ because of your full income, deductions and circumstances.":"編號它估計標準 2026 年稅。稅卡、最終評估和預扣稅可能會因您的全部收入、扣除額和情況而有所不同。","Can I combine salary and pension here?":"我可以在這裡合併薪水和退休金嗎？","This version estimates one income type at a time. It does not calculate a mixed salary-and-pension case.":"此版本一次估算一種收入類型。它不計算混合工資和退休金情況。","Does pension mode cover every pension?":"退休金模式是否涵蓋所有退休金？","No. The pension credit is modeled only for a qualifying old-age pension or eligible AFP taken at 100% throughout the year. Partial-year or graded pension and other pension types are outside scope.":"編號退休金抵免僅針對全年按 100% 領取的合格退休金或合格 AFP 進行建模。部分年金或分級退休金以及其他退休金類型不在範圍內。","What is the measures-zone option?":"什麼是測量區域選項？","It applies the published 18.5% ordinary-income rate and NOK 45,000 special deduction for Finnmark and the listed municipalities. Confirm that your municipality qualifies.":"適用於芬馬克和所列城市公佈的 18.5% 普通收入率和挪威克朗 45,000 特別扣除。確認您所在的城市符合資格。","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator":"挪威財富稅計算器","Norway Wealth Tax Calculator 2026 — Free Estimate":"挪威財富稅計算器 2026 — 免費估算","Estimate 2026 Norwegian wealth tax from homes, shares, business assets, cash and debt. See the state and municipal split, valuation discounts and a value sensitivity range.":"估計 2026 挪威對房屋、股票、企業資產、現金和債務徵收的財富稅。查看州和市的劃分、估值折扣和價值敏感度範圍。","Estimate personal Norwegian wealth tax for 2026. Enter estimated market values for homes and pre-discount tax bases for shares and business assets. See valuation discounts, debt adjustment and separate state and municipal estimates.":"估計挪威個人財富稅為 2026。輸入房屋的估計市場價值以及股票和企業資產的折現前稅基。請參閱估值折扣、債務調整以及單獨的州和市估計。","The estimate applies 2026 valuation rules and the maximum municipal rate unless you enter a lower rate. Debt is allocated by full asset values before discounts; debt assigned to discounted shares or business assets is reduced by the same discount. Property valuations, eligibility and personal tax facts can change the official result.":"除非您輸入較低的費率，否則估算值將套用 2026 估價規則和最高市政費率。債務以折現前的全部資產價值進行分配；分配給折扣股票或企業資產的債務也以相同的折扣減少。房產估價、資格和個人稅務事實可能會改變官方結果。","A primary home with a NOK 10 million market value has an estimated wealth value of NOK 2.5 million under the 2026 primary-home rule, before debt and the personal allowance.":"根據 2026 主要住房規則，市場價值為 10 百萬挪威克朗的主要住房的估計財富價值為 2.5 百萬挪威克朗（扣除債務和個人津貼）。","2026 tax year":"2026 課稅年度","Primary home estimated market value (NOK)":"主要住宅估計市場價值（挪威克朗）","Secondary homes estimated market value (NOK)":"二手房估計市場價值（挪威克朗）","Shares and share funds before discount (NOK)":"折扣前的股票和共享資金（挪威克朗）","Eligible business assets before discount (NOK)":"折扣前的合格企業資產（挪威克朗）","Bank deposits and other assets (NOK)":"銀行存款及其他資產（挪威克朗）","Total debt (NOK)":"債務總額（挪威克朗）","We are jointly taxed for wealth":"我們共同對財富徵稅","Municipal rate (%)":"市政費率 (%)","Home-value comparison":"首頁價值對比","±5%":"±5%","±10%":"±10%","±20%":"±20%","Estimate wealth tax":"預估財富稅","Export CSV":"匯出 CSV","Print estimate":"列印預估","Assets before discounts":"折扣前的資產","Taxable asset value after discounts":"折扣後的應稅資產價值","Debt reduction from discounts":"折扣減少債務","Deductible debt estimate":"可抵扣債務估算","Estimated net wealth":"估計淨財富","Personal allowance":"個人津貼","Taxable net wealth":"應稅淨財富","Municipal wealth tax":"市政財富稅","State wealth tax":"國家財富稅","State tax, first band":"州稅，第一頻段","State tax, upper band":"州稅，上限","Estimated total wealth tax":"預計財富稅總額","Lower home-value estimate":"較低的房屋價值估算","Current-value estimate":"當前值估計","Higher home-value estimate":"更高的房屋價值估算","2026 rules and assumptions":"2026 規則與假設","Estimate only. This is not an official tax assessment or tax advice. Use your tax return values where available; rates, eligibility, debt allocation and property values may differ in your case.":"僅供估計。這不是官方稅務評估或稅務建議。盡可能使用您的報稅表值；利率、資格、債務分配和財產價值可能因您的情況而異。","Homes: enter estimated market value at year end. Shares and eligible business assets: enter the value before the 2026 discount, not market value unless that is the correct tax basis.":"房屋：輸入年底的估計市場價值。股票和符合條件的企業資產：輸入 2026 折扣之前的價值，而不是市場價值，除非這是正確的稅基礎。","The allowance and state upper threshold double only for spouses, registered partners or qualifying cohabitants assessed jointly for their combined wealth.":"僅針對配偶、註冊伴侶或共同評估其總財富的合格同居者，津貼和州上限門檻加倍。","The municipal calculation uses the selected rate, defaulting to the 2026 maximum of 0.35%. Some municipalities may use a lower rate.":"市政計算使用選定的費率，預設為 2026 最大值 0.35%。一些城市可能使用較低的費率。","Sensitivity changes only the entered values of primary and secondary homes. It is a comparison, not a prediction of an official valuation.":"靈敏度僅變更主要和次要住宅的輸入值。這是一個比較，而不是對官方估值的預測。","What is the 2026 wealth-tax allowance?":"2026 財富稅津貼是多少？","The standard threshold is NOK 1.9 million for one person and NOK 3.8 million for spouses or qualifying partners assessed jointly.":"一人的標準門檻為 1.9 百萬挪威克朗，配偶或共同評估的合格伴侶的標準門檻為 3.8 挪威克朗。","How is my primary home valued?":"我的主要住宅如何估價？","For 2026, the estimated wealth value is 25% of market value up to NOK 14 million, plus 70% of the amount above NOK 14 million.":"對於2026，估計財富價值為市值不超過14百萬挪威克朗的25%，加上14百萬挪威克朗以上金額的70%。","Does this apply a discount to a secondary home?":"這對二手房有折扣嗎？","No. The 2026 table gives secondary homes a 0% valuation discount. It uses the entered market value as the estimate; official assessed values can differ.":"編號2026 表為二手房提供了 0% 的估價折扣。它使用輸入的市場價值作為估計值；官方評估值可能有所不同。","Why does deductible debt change when I own shares or business assets?":"為什麼當我擁有股票或企業資產時，可扣除債務會改變？","Norwegian rules allocate debt proportionally by full asset values. The portion assigned to assets with valuation discounts is reduced by the same discount rate.":"挪威規則以總資產價值按比例分配債務。分配給有評估折扣的資產的部分以相同的折扣率減少。","Is the municipal rate always 0.35%?":"市政費率是否始終為 0.35%？","No. 0.35% is the 2026 maximum used by default. A municipality may set a lower rate, which you can enter.":"編號0.35% 是預設使用的 2026 最大值。市政府可能會設定較低的費率，您可以輸入該費率。","Does the calculator cover every asset or tax case?":"計算器是否涵蓋所有資產或稅務案件？","No. It estimates homes, shares, selected eligible business assets, cash and total debt. Foreign assets, pensions, complex ownership, exemptions and other special rules may change your assessment.":"編號它估算房屋、股票、選定的合格企業資產、現金和總債務。外國資產、退休金、複雜所有權、豁免和其他特殊規則可能會改變您的評估。","Swiss QR-bill Generator":"瑞士二維碼帳單產生器","Swiss QR-bill Generator — Free QR Invoice Maker":"瑞士二維碼帳單產生器 — 免費二維碼發票製作工具","Create and check a Swiss QR-bill locally. Validate IBAN, QR-IBAN, QRR and SCOR references; print the A6 payment part and receipt without uploading invoice data.":"在本地建立並檢查瑞士 QR 帳單。驗證 IBAN、QR-IBAN、QRR 和 SCOR 參考；列印 A6 付款部分和收據，無需上傳發票資料。","Create a Swiss payment slip with a Swiss QR Code. Your invoice details stay in this browser; no payment is initiated and no bank register is queried.":"使用瑞士二維碼建立瑞士付款單。您的發票詳細資料保留在此瀏覽器中；不發起付款，也不查詢銀行登記冊。","The tool builds the SIX Swiss Payments Code (SPC) data and checks its fields, account/reference combination, IBAN check digits and supported characters. It formats the payment part and receipt for printing at their required physical size.":"此工具建立六種瑞士支付代碼 (SPC) 資料並檢查其欄位、帳戶/參考組合、IBAN 校驗位和支援的字元。它格式化付款部分和收據，以便按照所需的實體尺寸進行列印。","SIX example: a QR-IBAN, CHF 50.00, a 27-digit QRR reference and structured creditor/debtor addresses.":"SIX 範例：QR-IBAN、CHF 50.00、27 數位 QRR 參考和結構化債權人/債務人地址。","How it works":"工作原理","Frequently asked questions":"常見問題解答","Limits and accuracy":"限值與精確度","This is a local document tool, not a bank service or certification. It cannot confirm who owns an IBAN, whether an account is open, or whether a payment will be accepted. Print at 100% / Actual size and measure the 100 mm check line before using a paper payment order.":"這是本機文件工具，不是銀行服務或認證。它無法確認誰擁有 IBAN、帳戶是否已開立或是否會接受付款。在使用紙本付款訂單之前，請按 100%/實際尺寸列印並測量 100 毫米檢查線。","Creditor IBAN or QR-IBAN":"貸方 IBAN 或 QR-IBAN","Payable to · creditor":"應付給·債權人","Account holder / creditor name":"帳戶持有人/債權人姓名","Street or P.O. box":"街道或郵政信箱盒子","Building number":"樓號","Postal code":"郵遞區號","Town / city":"城鎮/城市","2-letter country code":"2-字母國家代碼","Amount (optional)":"數量（可選）","Currency":"貨幣","CHF":"瑞士法郎","EUR":"歐元","Payable by · optional debtor":"由·可選債務人支付","Debtor name":"債務人姓名","Reference type":"參考型","QR reference · QR-IBAN only":"QR 參考·僅限 QR-IBAN","Creditor reference · IBAN":"貸款人參考·IBAN","No structured reference · IBAN":"無結構化參考·IBAN","Reference":"參考","Unstructured message":"非結構化訊息","Billing information (optional)":"帳單資訊（可選）","Create QR-bill":"建立二維碼帳單","Load SIX sample":"加載六個樣品","Clear form":"透明形式","Check QR payload":"檢查 QR 有效負載","Download payment data":"下載支付數據","Download QR SVG":"下載 QR SVG","Print / save as PDF":"列印/另存為 PDF","Read a QR Code image":"讀取二維碼影像","Choose PNG or JPEG":"選擇 PNG 或 JPEG","Read image locally":"本機讀取影像","Paste Swiss QR Code payment data":"貼上瑞士二維碼支付數據","Invoice details":"發票詳細信息","QR-bill preview":"二維碼帳單預覽","Receipt":"收據","Payment part":"支付部分","Payable to":"付款人","Payable by":"付款人","Account":"帳戶","Additional information":"附加資訊","Currency / amount":"貨幣/金額","Print scale check · 100 mm":"列印比例檢查·100 mm","SIX · Swiss QR-bill standard":"六·瑞士QR票據標準","QR-bill ready. Details stayed on this device.":"QR 帳單已準備就緒。詳細資訊保留在該設備上。","Some fields need checking. Review the highlighted information.":"某些欄位需要檢查。查看突出顯示的資訊。","Reading this image on your device…":"在您的裝置上讀取此影像...","Swiss QR Code read and checked locally.":"瑞士二維碼在本地讀取和檢查。","No readable QR Code was found in that image.":"在該影像中找不到可讀取的 QR 程式碼。","Swiss QR Code data is valid for the supported fields.":"瑞士 QR 碼資料對支援的欄位有效。","The data is not a valid Swiss QR Code payment payload.":"資料不是有效的瑞士二維碼支付負載。","Form and preview cleared.":"表單和預覽已清除。","SIX sample loaded. Replace its sample details before real use.":"已載入六個樣本。在實際使用之前替換其範例詳細資訊。","Create or read a valid QR-bill first.":"首先建立或讀取有效的 QR 帳單。","Choose a PNG or JPEG of 10 MiB or less.":"選擇 10 MiB 或更少的 PNG 或 JPEG。","The local QR reader could not load. You can paste the payment data instead.":"本機 QR 讀取器無法載入。您可以改為貼上付款資料。","Which IBAN and reference combinations are allowed?":"允許哪些 IBAN 和參考組合？","A QR-IBAN uses a QRR reference. A normal Swiss IBAN uses SCOR or no structured reference (NON). QRR is for CHF invoices only.":"A QR-IBAN 使用 QRR 參考。普通的瑞士 IBAN 使用 SCOR 或無結構化參考 (NON)。 QRR 僅適用於瑞士法郎發票。","Does this check that the account exists or belongs to the creditor?":"這是否檢查該帳戶是否存在或屬於債權人？","No. It checks the format and IBAN checksum only. It does not contact a bank or account registry.":"編號它只檢查格式和 IBAN 校驗和。它不聯繫銀行或帳戶註冊機構。","Can I print this at any scale?":"我可以以任何比例列印它嗎？","For a paper payment order, print at 100% / Actual size. The payment part must be A6 landscape (148 × 105 mm); check the 100 mm line with a ruler.":"對於紙本付款訂單，以 100%/實際尺寸列印。付款部分必須為A6橫向（148×105毫米）；用尺檢查100毫米線。","Does the tool send invoice data anywhere?":"該工具是否將發票資料傳送到任何地方？","No. Generation and image reading happen in your browser. No account or payment service is used.":"編號產生和影像讀取發生在您的瀏覽器中。不使用任何帳戶或支付服務。","Grade Scale Generator":"等級尺產生器","Grade Scale Generator — Free Points-to-Grade Tool":"等級尺產生器 — 免費的點到等級工具","Turn points into percentages and grades with your own thresholds. Preview the full scale, copy or export it, and print a grading sheet.":"使用您自己的閾值將分數轉換為百分比和等級。預覽全尺寸、複製或匯出並列印分級表。","Build a transparent grading scale for an exam or assignment. Set the maximum points and the minimum percentage for each grade; the scale does not assume a school or national grading rule.":"為考試或作業建立透明的評分標準。設定每個等級的最高分和最低百分比；量表不採用學校或國家評分規則。","Points earned":"所得的積分","Maximum points":"最大點數","Top grade label":"高級標籤","Top grade starts at (%)":"頂級品位起價(%)","Middle grade label":"中階標籤","Middle grade starts at (%)":"中級起價(%)","Lowest grade label":"最低等級標籤","Lowest grade starts at (%)":"最低等級起始於 (%)","With a 50-point maximum, 45 points equals 90%. Your custom thresholds decide the grade label.":"最大 50 點，45 點等於 90%。您的自訂閾值決定等級標籤。","Does this use an official grading policy?":"這是否使用官方分級政策？","No. You set the thresholds. Grading systems differ by school, course and country; confirm the scale you are expected to use.":"編號您設定閾值。評分系統因學校、課程和國家而異；確認您預計使用的秤。","Can I export the grading bands?":"我可以匯出分級波段嗎？","Yes. Export the displayed bands as a CSV file or print the scale.":"是的。將顯示的條帶匯出為 CSV 檔案或列印比例。"}});
